L[414]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also awarded for a quest in Loch Modan.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|innkeepers} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. It is also often found on humanoid foes of levels 13-25, most plentifully in southern Silverpine Forest and the Barrens."}
L[422]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also awarded for a quest in Wetlands.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|innkeepers} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. It is also sometimes found on townsfolk and militia and Syndicate rogues of Hillsbrad Foothills."}
L[537]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found on almost all of the wild beasts there.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nThe place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} It is found on almost all of the strange creatures."}
L[555]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {B|carrion birds} A good share of the carrion birds carry it.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the carrion birds in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|carrion birds}"}
L[556]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Look to the south-east of the loch country of Loch Modan. The other place to look is the haunted Deadwind Pass. {B|carrion birds} Perhaps one in four of the carrion birds has one about them.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the haunted Deadwind Pass. {Z|Deadwind Pass} Look to the middle of the haunted Deadwind Pass. Perhaps one in four of the wild beasts there has one about them."}
L[647]="{W|8} {Q|4.0} {L|5}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Within the sands of Silithus, they keep to the west. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the sands of Silithus, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[710]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is given in thanks by those in the fallow farmland of Westfall whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[711]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|cloth & leather armor merchants} {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Merchants in the blighted glades of Tirisfal and the red desert of Durotar stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land."}
L[714]={A="{A|2} {L|0}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="{A|2} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|cloth & leather armor merchants} {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Merchants in the blighted glades of Tirisfal and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land."}
L[718]={A="{A|3} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|mail armor merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{A|3} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|mail armor merchants} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the savannah of the Barrens stock it."}
L[719]={A="{A|1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is given in thanks by those in the snowfields of Dun Morogh whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[720]="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 24-31, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[723]={A="{I|Goretusk Liver}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {B|boars} Perhaps one in four of the boars has one about them.",H="{I|Goretusk Liver}\nIt is carried by the boars, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|boars}"}
L[724]={A="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} Its making calls for Goretusk Liver and Mild Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 50) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest in Westfall.",H="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} Its making calls for Goretusk Liver and Mild Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 50) can attempt it. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[725]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {P|gnolls} The gnolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[727]={A="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. Chests and strongboxes in the woods of Elwynn hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. Chests and strongboxes in the red desert of Durotar hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
L[728]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Westfall Stew. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 75) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. It is also awarded for a quest in Westfall.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Westfall Stew. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 75) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[729]={A="{I|Stringy Vulture Meat}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {B|carrion birds} Perhaps one in four of the carrion birds has one about them.",H="{I|Stringy Vulture Meat}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Look to the south-east of the mesas of Thousand Needles. {B|carrion birds} It is found on almost all of the carrion birds."}
L[730]={A="{I|Murloc Eye}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {P|murlocs} Perhaps one in four of the murlocs has one about them.",H="{I|Murloc Eye}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Within the grey woods of Silverpine, they keep to the north-east. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them."}
L[731]={A="{I|Goretusk Snout}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {B|boars} A good share of the boars carry it.",H="{I|Goretusk Snout}\nIt is carried by the boars, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|boars}"}
L[732]={A="{I|Okra}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {P|mechanical constructs} A good share of the mechanical constructs carry it.",H="{I|Okra}\nOur correspondents report it among the mechanical constructs in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|mechanical constructs}"}
L[733]={A="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Stringy Vulture Meat, Murloc Eye and Goretusk Snout. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 75. It is also awarded for a quest in Westfall.",H="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Stringy Vulture Meat, Murloc Eye and Goretusk Snout. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 75. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[737]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the west of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. It is taken from The Holy Spring in the jungles of Stranglethorn."
L[738]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} Within the sodden Swamp of Sorrows, they keep to the north-east. It is taken from a Sack of Barley in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows."
L[739]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} Within the desert of Tanaris, they keep to the north-east. It is taken from a Sack of Corn in the desert of Tanaris."
L[740]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} It is the south of the Hinterlands that rewards the search. It is taken from a Sack of Rye in the Hinterlands."
L[742]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Within the rainforest of Feralas, they keep to the south. The elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[743]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} Within the smoking Searing Gorge, they keep to the heart of the land. It is taken from The Charred Oak in the smoking Searing Gorge."
L[744]={A="{J|12} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is given in thanks by those in the fallow farmland of Westfall whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{J|12} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[750]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the middle of the woods of Elwynn. It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {B|wolves} The wolves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is carried by the wolves, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|wolves}"}
L[752]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the middle of the woods of Elwynn. {P|Defias brigands} The Defias brigands there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the Defias brigands, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Defias brigands}"}
L[753]={A="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Look to the middle of the marshes of the Wetlands. {P|Dragonmaw orcs} One of the Dragonmaw orcs in many hundreds carries it.",H="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is carried by the Dragonmaw orcs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Dragonmaw orcs}"}
L[754]="{W|7} {Q|3.1} {L|4}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 42-50 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[756]={A="{W|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is the north of the marshes of the Wetlands that rewards the search. {P|Dark Iron dwarves} It is a rare find among the Dark Iron dwarves; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is carried by the Dark Iron dwarves, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Dark Iron dwarves}"}
L[763]={A="{A|2} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, they keep to the east. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="{A|2} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[765]={A="{I|Silverleaf}\nHerbalists know it from the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the woods of Elwynn. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the boughs of Teldrassil. It is also commonly carried by cultists of levels 11-54, most plentifully in Ashenvale.",H="{I|Silverleaf}\nHerbalists know it from the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is also commonly carried by cultists of levels 15-54, most plentifully in Ashenvale."}
L[766]={A="{W|4} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|4} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is found as readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[767]={A="{W|10} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|10} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is found as readily in the plains of Mulgore. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[768]={A="{W|0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. It turns up on the raiders and tribesmen there now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{W|0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} The other place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[769]={A="{I|Chunk of Boar Meat}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Within the woods of Elwynn, they keep to the south. It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {B|boars} It is found on almost all of the boars.",H="{I|Chunk of Boar Meat}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} Within the red desert of Durotar, they keep to the north. {B|boars} Nearly every one of the boars carries one."}
L[770]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} {B|crocolisks} It is found on almost all of the crocolisks."
L[771]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} The other place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {B|boars} Perhaps one in four of the boars has one about them.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is the north of the red desert of Durotar that rewards the search. {B|boars} Perhaps one in four of the boars has one about them."}
L[772]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is the south of the woods of Elwynn that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[773]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is the south of the woods of Elwynn that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[774]={A="{I|Malachite}\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one. It is also found inside containers such as Bloated Smallfish and Sack of Gems.",H="{I|Malachite}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it. It is also found inside containers such as Bloated Smallfish and Sack of Gems."}
L[776]="{W|15} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nIt comes out of Razorfen Kraul. {D|Razorfen Kraul} {P|quilboar} It is the quilboar of Razorfen Kraul who have it about them."
L[777]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Within the woods of Elwynn, they keep to the south-east. {B|wolves} It turns up on the wolves now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIt is carried by the wolves, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|wolves}"}
L[779]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the south-east of the woods of Elwynn. {P|murlocs} Perhaps one in four of the murlocs has one about them.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the north of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them."}
L[780]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|38}\nThe place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is the south-east of the woods of Elwynn that rewards the search. {P|murlocs} The murlocs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|38}\nOur correspondents report it among the murlocs in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|murlocs}"}
L[781]={A="{W|4} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} {P|gnolls} One of the gnolls in a score or so carries it.",H="{W|4} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[782]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} {P|gnolls} The gnolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nOur correspondents report it among the gnolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|gnolls}"}
L[783]={A="{I|Light Hide}\nIt is a skinner's find, chiefly in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is cut from the beasts there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience.",H="{I|Light Hide}\nIt is a skinner's find, chiefly in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It is cut from the beasts there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience."}
L[785]={A="{I|Mageroyal}\nHerbalists know it from the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. Herbalists gather it in the fallow farmland of Westfall, where it grows thickest. It is also sold by merchants in Stormwind City, southern Elwynn Forest and elsewhere (limited stock).",H="{I|Mageroyal}\nHerbalists know it from the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the herbalists who bring it in in the savannah of the Barrens. It is also sold by merchants in central Stonetalon Mountains, central Thousand Needles and elsewhere (limited stock)."}
L[787]={A="{K|5}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also prepared by cooks (Cooking 1).",H="{K|5}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|innkeepers} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also prepared by cooks (Cooking 1)."}
L[789]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[790]={A="{W|0} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|0} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."}
L[791]={A="{W|10} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{W|10} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the south of the savannah of the Barrens. One of the strange creatures in a score or so carries it."}
L[792]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|clothiers} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also often found on townsfolk and militia of western Hillsbrad Foothills.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|cloth armor merchants} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. It is also often found on townsfolk and militia of western Hillsbrad Foothills."}
