L[795]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|clothiers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also often found on townsfolk and militia of western Hillsbrad Foothills.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|cloth armor merchants} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. It is also often found on townsfolk and militia of western Hillsbrad Foothills."}
L[796]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leather armor merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leather armor merchants} {Z|Undercity} A merchant in the Undercity stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land."}
