L[804]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in Blackfathom Deeps. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[805]={A="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it.",H="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it."}
L[809]="{W|7} {Q|4.0} {L|4}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 47-54, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[810]="{W|4} {Q|4.0} {L|4}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 51-58 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[811]="{W|0} {Q|4.1} {L|5}\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is the west of the sands of Silithus that rewards the search. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the sands of Silithus, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[812]="{W|10} {Q|4.1} {L|4}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 51-58 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[814]={A="{I|Flask of Oil}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. {P|mechanical constructs} A good share of the mechanical constructs carry it.",H="{I|Flask of Oil}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. It is found as readily in the Deadmines. {P|Venture Company workers} A good share of the Venture Company workers carry it."}
L[816]={A="{W|15} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {P|mechanical constructs} Only occasionally does one of the mechanical constructs carry it.",H="{W|15} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the mechanical constructs in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|mechanical constructs}"}
L[818]={A="{I|Tigerseye}\nIt is found inside A Small Container of Gems, and nowhere else in particular.",H="{I|Tigerseye}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It turns up on the wild beasts there now and then, perhaps once in twenty. It is also found inside containers such as A Small Container of Gems and Sack of Gems."}
L[820]={A="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the east. {P|mechanical constructs} Only occasionally does one of the mechanical constructs carry it.",H="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the mechanical constructs in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|mechanical constructs}"}
L[821]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Look to the west of the fallow farmland of Westfall. {P|gnolls} Only occasionally does one of the gnolls carry it.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[826]={A="{W|0} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Look to the south of the fallow farmland of Westfall. {P|gnolls} Only occasionally does one of the gnolls carry it.",H="{W|0} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the gnolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|gnolls}"}
L[827]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the south of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. {P|Defias brigands} It is a rare find among the Defias brigands; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the Defias brigands in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|Defias brigands}"}
L[828]={A="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[829]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {P|Defias brigands} The Defias brigands there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the Defias brigands, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Defias brigands}"}
