L[856]={A="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[857]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nLockboxes are the strongboxes of travellers who did not survive to open them, carried off by whatever killed them. Only a rogue's picks or an engineer's seaforium will open one, and this is among what they hold."
L[858]={A="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Minor Healing Potion and Briarthorn. An alchemist of middling skill (around 55) can attempt it. It is also sold by food and drink vendors in southern Elwynn Forest, Stormwind City and elsewhere (limited stock).",H="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Minor Healing Potion and Briarthorn. An alchemist of middling skill (around 55) can attempt it. It is also commonly carried by humanoid foes of levels 12-20, most plentifully in the Barrens and Silverpine Forest."}
L[859]={A="{J|4}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is given in thanks by those in the loch country of Loch Modan whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{J|4}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[860]={A="{A|1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is given in thanks by those in the loch country of Loch Modan whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[862]="{J|11} {Q|3.1} {L|4}\nIts source is Zul'Farrak, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Zul'Farrak} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[863]="{W|0} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[864]="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[865]="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[866]="{W|10} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is found as readily in the desert of Tanaris. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
L[867]="{A|2} {C|52} {Q|4.1} {L|3}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 40-46 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[868]="{W|4} {Q|4.1} {L|3}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 40-46, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[869]="{W|7} {Q|4.1} {L|3}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 39-44 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
