L[1013]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the north-west of the red hills around Lake Everstill. {P|gnolls} The gnolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Look to the south of the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {P|gnolls} The gnolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[1015]={A="{I|Lean Wolf Flank}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the dark woods of Duskwood. {B|wolves} It is found on almost all of the wolves.",H="{I|Lean Wolf Flank}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} {B|wolves} Nearly every one of the wolves carries one."}
L[1017]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} This one is worked from Lean Wolf Flank and Stormwind Seasoning Herbs. A cook of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest in Duskwood.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} This one is worked from Lean Wolf Flank and Stormwind Seasoning Herbs. A cook of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[1019]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} {P|Defias brigands} The Defias brigands there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the Defias brigands, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Defias brigands}"}
L[1041]="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|mount vendors}"
L[1074]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the Arathi Highlands. {B|spiders} A good share of the spiders carry it."
L[1075]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill that rewards the search. {P|gnolls} The gnolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1076]="{J|11} {C|0} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt comes out of the Stockade. {D|The Stockade} {P|Defias brigands} Within, it is the Defias brigands who carry it."
L[1077]={A="{J|11} {C|0} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Look to the south-west of the dark woods of Duskwood. {P|Defias brigands} Only occasionally does one of the Defias brigands carry it.",H="{J|11} {C|0} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is carried by the Defias brigands, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Defias brigands}"}
L[1080]={A="{I|Tough Condor Meat}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} {B|carrion birds} A good share of the carrion birds carry it.",H="{I|Tough Condor Meat}\nOur correspondents report it among the carrion birds in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|carrion birds}"}
L[1081]="{I|Crisp Spider Meat}\nThe place to look is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {B|spiders} It is found on almost all of the spiders."
L[1082]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} This one is worked from Crisp Spider Meat and Tough Condor Meat. A cook of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest in Redridge Mountains.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} This one is worked from Crisp Spider Meat and Tough Condor Meat. A cook of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[1113]="{K|5}\nIt is conjured by mages out of nothing, as they conjure bread and water, and vanishes when its maker is long gone."
L[1114]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is conjured by mages out of nothing, as they conjure bread and water, and vanishes when its maker is long gone."
L[1116]="{J|11} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is given in thanks by those in the ancient forest of Ashenvale whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[1121]={A="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the south of the savannah of the Barrens. The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[1127]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} The folk of the dark woods of Duskwood have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1129]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Within the dark woods of Duskwood, they keep to the north-west. The restless dead there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the restless dead in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
