L[1132]={A="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land."}
