L[1175]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is the south of the woods of Elwynn that rewards the search. It turns up on the raiders and tribesmen there now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[1177]={A="{K|7}\nIts source is Uldaman, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Uldaman} The rank and file of Uldaman have it about them. It is also awarded for a quest in Elwynn Forest.",H="{K|7}\nIts source is Uldaman, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Uldaman} The rank and file of Uldaman have it about them. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[1178]={A="{K|10}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The folk of the woods of Elwynn have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{K|10}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1179]="Ice cold milk, from the cows of Elwynn and Mulgore, sold by every innkeeper and drink vendor and the first drink of every new adventurer.\nIt can be had at every inn."
L[1180]={A="{K|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|arcane goods vendors} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the city of Stormwind stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also awarded for a quest in Westfall.",H="{K|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Undercity} Merchants in the Undercity and the woods of Elwynn stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[1181]={A="{K|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|arcane goods vendors} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the city of Stormwind stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also found inside containers such as Ahn'Qiraj War Effort Supplies and Message in a Bottle.",H="{K|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Undercity} Merchants in the Undercity and the woods of Elwynn stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also found inside containers such as Ahn'Qiraj War Effort Supplies and Message in a Bottle."}
L[1182]={A="{A|3} {Q|1.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is given in thanks by those in the woods of Elwynn whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|3} {Q|1.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1183]={A="{A|1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The folk of the woods of Elwynn have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1187]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nHunters find it most readily in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Look to the north-west of the dark woods of Duskwood. Nearly every one of the restless dead carries one.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[1189]={A="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Look to the south-east of the fallow farmland of Westfall. {P|gnolls} It is a rare find among the gnolls; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1190]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the south-east. {P|gnolls} Only occasionally does one of the gnolls carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the gnolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1191]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is given in thanks by those in the woods of Elwynn whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1194]={A="{W|8} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|weapon smiths} {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the woods of Elwynn stock it.",H="{W|8} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|weapons merchants} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it."}
L[1196]={A="{W|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|weapon merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{W|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|weapons merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[1197]={A="{W|5} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|weapon merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{W|5} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|weapons merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[1198]={A="{W|8} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|weapon merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{W|8} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|weapons merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[1200]={A="{A|6} {L|0}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="{A|6} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Merchants in the blighted glades of Tirisfal and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land."}
L[1201]={A="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|armorer & shield crafters} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the boughs of Teldrassil stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land.",H="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
L[1202]={A="{A|6} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Darkshore} Merchants in the stormy coast of Darkshore and the dwarven city of Ironforge stock it. The shop is in the west of the land.",H="{A|6} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|mail armor merchants} {Z|Undercity} Merchants in the Undercity and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the east of the land."}
L[1203]="{A|6} {C|11} {Q|3.1} {L|4}\nThe place to look is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} The other place to look is the Blasted Lands. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the fallen coast of Azshara, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[1204]="{A|6} {Q|4.0} {L|3}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 39-44 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[1205]={A="{K|5}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also awarded for a quest in Ashenvale.",H="{K|5}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also commonly carried by humanoid foes of levels 20-30, most plentifully in Ashenvale and Hillsbrad Foothills."}
L[1206]={A="{I|Moss Agate}\nIt is found inside A Small Container of Gems, and nowhere else in particular.",H="{I|Moss Agate}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty. It is also found inside containers such as A Small Container of Gems and Sack of Gems."}
L[1207]="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[1210]={A="{I|Shadowgem}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. It turns up on the raiders and tribesmen there now and then, perhaps once in twenty. It is also found inside containers such as A Small Container of Gems and Sack of Gems.",H="{I|Shadowgem}\nIt is found inside A Small Container of Gems, and nowhere else in particular."}
L[1211]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is the south-west of the red hills around Lake Everstill that rewards the search. {P|gnolls} It is a rare find among the gnolls; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the gnolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1212]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} {P|gnolls} Perhaps one in four of the gnolls has one about them.",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nHunters find it most readily in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Look to the south of the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {P|gnolls} One of the gnolls in a score or so carries it."}
L[1213]={A="{A|2} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Within the red hills around Lake Everstill, they keep to the south-west. {P|gnolls} It is a rare find among the gnolls; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|2} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the gnolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1214]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Within the red hills around Lake Everstill, they keep to the north-west. {P|gnolls} Only occasionally does one of the gnolls carry it.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1215]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is the south-east of the loch country of Loch Modan that rewards the search. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[1217]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[1218]={A="{W|5} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is the north-west of the red hills around Lake Everstill that rewards the search. {P|gnolls} Only occasionally does one of the gnolls carry it.",H="{W|5} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1219]={A="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the south-west of the red hills around Lake Everstill. {P|gnolls} Only occasionally does one of the gnolls carry it.",H="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1220]={A="{W|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Within the red hills around Lake Everstill, they keep to the north-west. {P|gnolls} One of the gnolls in a score or so carries it.",H="{W|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Within the ash plains of the Burning Steppes, they keep to the south. {P|gnolls} One of the gnolls in a score or so carries it."}
L[1221]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the south of the red hills around Lake Everstill. {P|whelps} The whelps there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the whelps, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|whelps}"}
L[1251]="{K|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|129} Its making calls for Linen Cloth."
L[1254]="{J|23}\nIt is created by warlocks from the stuff of the Nether, and lasts only so long as its maker does."
L[1256]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the south of the woods of Elwynn. {P|murlocs} The murlocs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is carried by the murlocs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|murlocs}"}
L[1260]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[1261]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill. {P|Blackrock orcs} The Blackrock orcs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is carried by the Blackrock orcs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Blackrock orcs}"}
L[1262]={A="{K|6}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The folk of the fallow farmland of Westfall have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{K|6}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1263]="{W|1} {Q|4.0} {L|5}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 57-61, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[1264]="{W|5} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Stockade. {D|The Stockade} Those who have a stake in the Stockade give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[1265]="{W|7} {Q|3.0} {L|3}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 35-42 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[1270]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} The folk of the red hills around Lake Everstill have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1273]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} The folk of the marshes of the Wetlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1274]={A="{I|Hops}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {P|mechanical constructs} A good share of the mechanical constructs carry it.",H="{I|Hops}\nIt is carried by the mechanical constructs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|mechanical constructs}"}
L[1275]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} The folk of the red hills around Lake Everstill have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1276]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is given in thanks by those in the red hills around Lake Everstill whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1280]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Within the Alterac Mountains, they keep to the north. {P|Syndicate rogues} It is a rare find among the Syndicate rogues; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[1282]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} It is given in thanks by those in the dark woods of Duskwood whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1287]={A="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Within the red hills around Lake Everstill, they keep to the south-west. {B|spiders} Only occasionally does one of the spiders carry it.",H="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the spiders in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|spiders}"}
L[1288]="{I|Large Venom Sac}\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {B|spiders} One of the spiders in a score or so carries it."
L[1292]="{W|0} {Q|3.0} {L|1} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} {P|orcs} Within, it is the orcs who carry it."
L[1296]={A="{W|4} {C|34} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill. {P|Blackrock orcs} It turns up on the Blackrock orcs now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{W|4} {C|34} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the Blackrock orcs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Blackrock orcs}"}
L[1297]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} {P|Dark Iron dwarves} It is a rare find among the Dark Iron dwarves and trolls; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[1299]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill that rewards the search. {P|Blackrock orcs} Only occasionally does one of the Blackrock orcs carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the Blackrock orcs in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|Blackrock orcs}"}
L[1300]={A="{W|10} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill that rewards the search. {P|Blackrock orcs} It is a rare find among the Blackrock orcs; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|10} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the Blackrock orcs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Blackrock orcs}"}
