L[1306]="{A|2} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} The folk of the Stonetalon Mountains have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[1307]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} {P|gnolls} It is found on almost all of the gnolls.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1309]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Within the red hills around Lake Everstill, the caches keep to the heart of the land. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the red hills around Lake Everstill: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nChests and strongboxes hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
L[1310]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is given in thanks by those in the red hills around Lake Everstill whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1314]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Nearly every one of the restless dead carries one.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[1315]="{J|2} {Q|4.1} {L|4}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 47-54 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[1317]="{W|10} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Stockade. {D|The Stockade} Those who have a stake in the Stockade give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[1318]="{W|1} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} The rank and file of Shadowfang Keep have it about them."
L[1319]={A="{J|11} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is given in thanks by those in the red hills around Lake Everstill whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{J|11} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1322]={A="{K|7}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} The folk of the red hills around Lake Everstill have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{K|7}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1326]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} The folk of the red hills around Lake Everstill have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1349]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} It is the south-west of the dark woods of Duskwood that rewards the search. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the dark woods of Duskwood: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nChests and strongboxes hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
L[1351]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the south-east of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
L[1355]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them."}
L[1357]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {P|murlocs} It is a rare find among the murlocs; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nOur correspondents report it among the murlocs in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|murlocs}"}
L[1359]={A="{A|2}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The folk of the woods of Elwynn have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|2}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1360]={A="{A|3} {C|11}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is given in thanks by those in the woods of Elwynn whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|3} {C|11}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1364]={A="{A|2} {Q|0.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|2} {Q|0.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is found as readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[1366]={A="{A|2} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|2} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is found as readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
