L[1381]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the south. {P|Defias brigands} The Defias brigands there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the Defias brigands, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Defias brigands}"}
