L[1384]={A="{W|7} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the quilboar, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it. {P|quilboar}",H="{W|7} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Within the plains of Mulgore, they keep to the south. {P|quilboar} It is a rare find among the quilboar; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[1387]={A="{W|8} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Perhaps one in four of the restless dead has one about them.",H="{W|8} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[1388]={A="{W|10} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the quilboar, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it. {P|quilboar}",H="{W|10} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is the south-east of the plains of Mulgore that rewards the search. {P|quilboar} It is a rare find among the quilboar; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[1391]={A="{W|10} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Look to the south-east of the fallow farmland of Westfall. {P|gnolls} It is a rare find among the gnolls; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|10} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1394]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Look to the north-west of the fallow farmland of Westfall. {P|murlocs} It turns up on the murlocs now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the murlocs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|murlocs}"}
L[1395]="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nIt is issued to new adventurers as they set out, and most are glad to be rid of it by the second town."
L[1396]="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nIt is issued to new adventurers as they set out, and most are glad to be rid of it by the second town."
L[1401]={A="{K|6}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the west. {P|gnolls} A good share of the gnolls carry it.",H="{K|6}\nOur correspondents report it among the gnolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1404]="{J|12} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is the south-west of the Arathi Highlands that rewards the search. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there."
L[1405]={A="{W|10} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the south-west of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. {P|murlocs} Only occasionally does one of the murlocs carry it.",H="{W|10} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the murlocs in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|murlocs}"}
