L[1411]={A="{W|10} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{W|10} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
