L[1440]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Within the red hills around Lake Everstill, they keep to the north-west. {P|gnolls} It is a rare find among the gnolls; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Within the ash plains of the Burning Steppes, they keep to the south. {P|gnolls} It is a rare find among the gnolls; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[1443]="{J|2} {Q|4.0} {L|5}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 57-61 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[1445]={A="{A|3} {C|34} {Q|1.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is found as readily in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {P|Blackrock orcs} It turns up on the Blackrock orcs now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{A|3} {C|34} {Q|1.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} It is the south-east of the ash plains of the Burning Steppes that rewards the search. {P|Blackrock orcs} One of the Blackrock orcs in a score or so carries it."}
L[1446]={A="{A|3} {C|34} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} {P|Blackrock orcs} Only occasionally does one of the Blackrock orcs carry it.",H="{A|3} {C|34} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the Blackrock orcs in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|Blackrock orcs}"}
L[1447]="{J|11} {Q|4.1} {L|4}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 42-50 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[1448]={A="{A|3} {C|34} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} {P|Blackrock orcs} One of the Blackrock orcs in a score or so carries it.",H="{A|3} {C|34} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the Blackrock orcs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Blackrock orcs}"}
L[1449]={A="{J|11} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} The folk of the loch country of Loch Modan have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{J|11} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1454]="{W|0} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nIts source is Blackfathom Deeps, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} The rank and file of Blackfathom Deeps have it about them."
L[1455]={A="{W|1} {C|34} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} The other place to look is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {P|Blackrock orcs} It turns up on the Blackrock orcs now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{W|1} {C|34} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Look to the south-east of the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {P|Blackrock orcs} Only occasionally does one of the Blackrock orcs carry it."}
L[1457]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Within the red hills around Lake Everstill, they keep to the east. {P|gnolls} It is a rare find among the gnolls; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the gnolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1458]={A="{W|5} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill that rewards the search. {P|gnolls} Only occasionally does one of the gnolls carry it.",H="{W|5} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1459]={A="{W|0} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill. {P|gnolls} It is a rare find among the gnolls; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|0} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1460]={A="{W|8} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill. {P|gnolls} Only occasionally does one of the gnolls carry it.",H="{W|8} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the gnolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1461]={A="{W|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill that rewards the search. {P|gnolls} Only occasionally does one of the gnolls carry it.",H="{W|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1462]={A="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Within the red hills around Lake Everstill, they keep to the east. {P|gnolls} Only occasionally does one of the gnolls carry it.",H="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the gnolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1464]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {B|carrion birds} Nearly every one of the carrion birds carries one."
L[1465]="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[1467]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a catch of Lake Everstill in Redridge Mountains. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Anglers pull it from Lake Everstill in Redridge Mountains.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nAnglers pull it from the waters of Azeroth, though our correspondents disagree on which."}
L[1468]={A="{I|Murloc Fin}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {P|murlocs} It is found on almost all of the murlocs.",H="{I|Murloc Fin}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the west of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is found as readily in Blackfathom Deeps. {P|murlocs} Perhaps one in four of the murlocs has one about them."}
L[1469]={A="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the middle of the red hills around Lake Everstill. {P|murlocs} Only occasionally does one of the murlocs carry it.",H="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the murlocs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|murlocs}"}
L[1470]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them. {C|38}\nIts source is Blackfathom Deeps, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[1473]={A="{W|10} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Within the red hills around Lake Everstill, they keep to the east. {P|murlocs} Only occasionally does one of the murlocs carry it.",H="{W|10} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the murlocs in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|murlocs}"}
L[1475]={A="{I|Small Venom Sac}\nThe place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} The other place to look is the dark woods of Duskwood. {B|spiders} It turns up on the spiders now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{I|Small Venom Sac}\nThe place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} {B|spiders} It turns up on the spiders now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[1476]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} {B|spiders} Nearly every one of the spiders carries one.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} {B|spiders} Nearly every one of the spiders carries one."}
L[1477]="{K|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {Z|Desolace} Merchants in the grey wastes of Desolace and the woods of Elwynn stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also found inside containers such as Ahn'Qiraj War Effort Supplies and Box of Spells."
L[1478]={A="{K|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the Arathi Highlands stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also found inside containers such as Ahn'Qiraj War Effort Supplies and Message in a Bottle.",H="{K|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Undercity} Merchants in the Undercity and the mists of Dustwallow Marsh stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also found inside containers such as Ahn'Qiraj War Effort Supplies and Message in a Bottle."}
L[1479]={A="{A|1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is given in thanks by those in the fallow farmland of Westfall whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1480]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is given in thanks by those in the fallow farmland of Westfall whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[1481]="{W|0} {Q|3.0} {L|1}\nIt comes out of Blackfathom Deeps. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} The rank and file of Blackfathom Deeps have it about them."
L[1482]="Shadowfang is the sword that gave the keep its name, a blade of Silverpine's barons forged with shadow in the steel so that it bites the spirit as well as the flesh.\nThe worgen lords of Shadowfang Keep hold it, and the Sons of Arugal are loath to part with it."
L[1483]="{W|4} {Q|3.0} {L|1}\nIt comes out of Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} The rank and file of Shadowfang Keep have it about them."
L[1484]="{W|10} {Q|3.0} {L|1}\nIt comes out of Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} The rank and file of Shadowfang Keep have it about them."
L[1485]="{W|6} {Q|0.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the west of the farmland of Hillsbrad. {P|townsfolk and militia} One of the townsfolk and militia in a score or so carries it."
L[1486]="{A|1} {Q|3.0} {L|1}\nIt comes out of Blackfathom Deeps. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} The rank and file of Blackfathom Deeps have it about them."
L[1487]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is conjured by mages out of nothing, as they conjure bread and water, and vanishes when its maker is long gone."
L[1488]="{A|3} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nIts source is Razorfen Kraul, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Razorfen Kraul} {P|quilboar} It is the quilboar of Razorfen Kraul who have it about them."
L[1489]="{A|2} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nIt comes out of Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[1490]="{J|12} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Temple of Atal'Hakkar. {D|Sunken Temple} Those who have a stake in the Temple of Atal'Hakkar give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[1491]="{J|11} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nIts source is Blackfathom Deeps, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} The rank and file of Blackfathom Deeps have it about them."
L[1493]={A="{W|7} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Within the mesas of Thousand Needles, they keep to the north-west. {P|centaur} It is a very rare find among the centaur, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{W|7} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Within the mesas of Thousand Needles, they keep to the north-west. It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {P|centaur} It is a very rare find among the centaur, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[1495]="{A|1} {Q|0.1} {L|0}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 10-16, and no two finders agree where to look."
