L[1516]={A="{W|0} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it.",H="{W|0} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. The other place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it."}
L[1519]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the north-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. {P|trolls} The trolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[1520]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it. {C|8}\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north of the jungles of Stranglethorn. The other place to look is the Hinterlands. {P|trolls} A good share of the trolls carry it."
L[1521]="{W|1} {C|35} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north of the jungles of Stranglethorn. {P|trolls} Only occasionally does one of the trolls carry it."
L[1522]="{W|6} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn. {P|trolls} Only occasionally does one of the trolls carry it."
