L[1524]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the middle of the jungles of Stranglethorn. {P|trolls} The trolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[1527]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from a Bale of Hay."
L[1528]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is taken from Sack of Oats in the fallow farmland of Westfall.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from Sack of Oats."}
L[1529]="{I|Jade}\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the south-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad. {P|murlocs} A good share of the murlocs carry it. It is also awarded for a quest in Badlands."
L[1532]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, they keep to the north-west. {P|trolls} The trolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[1537]={A="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The folk of the fallow farmland of Westfall have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
