L[1811]={A="{W|8} {Q|0.0} {L|1}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} Chests and strongboxes in the stormy coast of Darkshore hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="{W|8} {Q|0.0} {L|1}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the savannah of the Barrens: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
