L[1845]={A="{A|3} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|mail armor merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{A|3} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|heavy armor merchants} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the Undercity stock it."}
