L[1849]={A="{A|2} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leather armor merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{A|2} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leather armor merchants} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land."}
L[1850]={A="{A|2} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leather armor merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{A|2} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leather armor merchants} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land."}
L[1852]={A="{A|3} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|mail armor merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{A|3} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|mail armor merchants} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the savannah of the Barrens stock it."}
L[1853]={A="{A|3} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|mail armor merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{A|3} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|mail armor merchants} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the savannah of the Barrens stock it."}
L[1875]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the south. The restless dead there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[1893]="{W|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Deadmines. {D|The Deadmines} Those who have a stake in the Deadmines give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[1894]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the south. The restless dead there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the restless dead in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[1913]={A="{W|4} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the south of the woods of Elwynn. A good share of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|4} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[1917]={A="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the south-west of the woods of Elwynn. A good share of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[1923]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Within the dark woods of Duskwood, they keep to the south-east. It is taken from an Ambassador's Locker in the dark woods of Duskwood.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is taken from an Ambassador's Locker."}
L[1925]={A="{W|7} {C|0} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the south of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the Deadmines. {P|Defias brigands} It turns up on the Defias brigands now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{W|7} {C|0} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt comes out of the Deadmines. {D|The Deadmines} {P|Defias brigands} Within, it is the Defias brigands who carry it."}
L[1926]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the south. {P|Defias brigands} Only occasionally does one of the Defias brigands carry it.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the Defias brigands, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Defias brigands}"}
L[1927]={A="{W|0} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the south. {P|Defias brigands} It is a rare find among the Defias brigands; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|0} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the Defias brigands in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|Defias brigands}"}
L[1928]={A="{W|10} {C|0} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Look to the south of the fallow farmland of Westfall. {P|Defias brigands} It turns up on the Defias brigands now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{W|10} {C|0} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the Defias brigands, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Defias brigands}"}
L[1929]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt comes out of the Deadmines. {D|The Deadmines} {P|Defias brigands} Within, it is the Defias brigands who carry it."
