L[1931]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Within the woods of Elwynn, they keep to the south-west. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
