L[1935]="{W|15} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} The rank and file of Shadowfang Keep have it about them."
L[1936]="{W|15} {C|3} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt comes out of the Deadmines. {D|The Deadmines} {P|goblins} It is the goblins of the Deadmines who have it about them."
L[1937]="{W|7} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts source is the Deadmines, and nowhere in the open world. {D|The Deadmines} {P|mechanical constructs} Within, it is the mechanical constructs who carry it."
L[1938]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Look to the south-east of the loch country of Loch Modan. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
