L[1942]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Duskwood} A merchant in the dark woods of Duskwood stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
