L[1946]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Look to the south-east of the dark woods of Duskwood. {P|ghouls} The ghouls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the ghouls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|ghouls}"}
L[1951]="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt comes out of the Deadmines. {D|The Deadmines} {P|Defias brigands} Within, it is the Defias brigands who carry it."
L[1955]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Look to the middle of the marshes of the Wetlands. {P|Dragonmaw orcs} Only occasionally does one of the Dragonmaw orcs carry it.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIt is carried by the Dragonmaw orcs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Dragonmaw orcs}"}
L[1958]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Look to the south of the fallow farmland of Westfall. It turns up on the restless dead now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[1959]={A="{W|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the south. {P|skeletons} It turns up on the skeletons now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{W|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the skeletons in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|skeletons}"}
L[1962]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill. {P|gnolls} One of the gnolls in a score or so carries it.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the gnolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|gnolls}"}
L[1965]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is the west of the snowfields of Dun Morogh that rewards the search. {B|wolves} A good share of the wolves carry it.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the wolves in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|wolves}"}
L[1968]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|35}\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn. The other place to look is the dark woods of Duskwood. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|35}\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[1970]={A="{K|13}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is given in thanks by those in the red hills around Lake Everstill whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{K|13}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is given in thanks by those in the ancient forest of Ashenvale whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
L[1972]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} {P|Defias brigands} One of the Defias brigands in a score or so carries it.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nOur correspondents report it among the Defias brigands in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|Defias brigands}"}
L[1973]="The Orb of Deception is a Highborne artefact that lays a glamour over its holder, so that an orc appears a human, a tauren a night elf, a dwarf a troll, and so on across the old enmities. The glamour fools the eye and nothing else.\nIt turns up in the hoards of the great foes and the chests of the deep places across both continents, with no one owner."
L[1974]="{A|1} {Q|3.0} {L|1}\nIt comes out of Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} The rank and file of Shadowfang Keep have it about them."
L[1975]="{W|8} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nIts source is Razorfen Kraul, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Razorfen Kraul} {P|quilboar} Within, it is the quilboar who carry it."
L[1976]="{W|5} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nIt comes out of Razorfen Kraul. {D|Razorfen Kraul} {P|quilboar} Within, it is the quilboar who carry it."
L[1978]="{A|2} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nIts source is Razorfen Kraul, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Razorfen Kraul} {P|quilboar} It is the quilboar and boars of Razorfen Kraul who have it about them."
L[1979]="{A|6} {Q|4.0} {L|4}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 47-54 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[1980]="{J|11} {Q|4.0} {L|3}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 40-46 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[1981]="{A|3} {Q|4.0} {L|3}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 41-47, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[1982]="{W|8} {Q|4.1} {L|3}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 41-47, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[1986]="{W|8} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, they keep to the north. {P|trolls} Only occasionally does one of the trolls carry it."
L[1988]="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[1990]="{W|5} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[1991]="{W|5} {C|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the north-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. {P|Venture Company workers} It is a rare find among the Venture Company workers; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[1992]="{J|23} {Q|3.1} {L|3}\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It is the Scarlet Crusaders of the Scarlet Monastery who have it about them."
L[1993]="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThe place to look is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Within the Arathi Highlands, they keep to the south-west. The other place to look is the Alterac Mountains. {P|ogres} It is a rare find among the ogres; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[1994]="{W|0} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nThe place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} The other place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[1996]="{J|11} {C|8} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn. {P|trolls} Only occasionally does one of the trolls carry it."
L[1997]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn. {P|trolls} It is a rare find among the trolls; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[1998]="{W|10} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, they keep to the north-west. {P|trolls} It is a rare find among the trolls; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[2000]={A="{W|8} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} The folk of the dark woods of Duskwood have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{W|8} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2005]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|8}\nIt is found in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is taken from a Moon Over the Vale in the jungles of Stranglethorn."
L[2006]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|8}\nIt is found in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the north-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. It is taken from a Gri'lek the Wanderer in the jungles of Stranglethorn."
L[2007]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|8}\nIt is found in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is taken from a Fall of Gurubashi in the jungles of Stranglethorn."
L[2008]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|8}\nIt is found in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the north-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. It is taken from The Emperor's Tomb in the jungles of Stranglethorn."
L[2011]="{W|7} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 23-29, and no two finders agree where to look."
