L[2035]={A="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the south of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. A good share of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."}
