L[2046]={A="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the north-west. {P|murlocs} It is a rare find among the murlocs; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the murlocs in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|murlocs}"}
L[2047]={A="{W|0} {Q|1.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is given in thanks by those in the snowfields of Dun Morogh whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{W|0} {Q|1.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2048]={A="{W|4} {Q|1.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is given in thanks by those in the snowfields of Dun Morogh whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{W|4} {Q|1.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2054]={A="{W|0} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is the south-west of the snowfields of Dun Morogh that rewards the search. {P|bandits} Only occasionally does one of the bandits carry it.",H="{W|0} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the bandits in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|bandits}"}
L[2057]={A="{W|7} {C|0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the middle of the woods of Elwynn. {P|Defias brigands} It is a rare find among the Defias brigands; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|7} {C|0} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the Defias brigands, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Defias brigands}"}
L[2058]={A="{W|5} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} It is the south-east of the ash plains of the Burning Steppes that rewards the search. The other place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them.",H="{W|5} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} It is the south-east of the ash plains of the Burning Steppes that rewards the search. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them."}
L[2059]="{A|1} {Q|3.0} {L|1}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 20-27, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[2064]={A="{W|4} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is the east of the snowfields of Dun Morogh that rewards the search. {P|troggs} It turns up on the troggs now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{W|4} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the troggs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|troggs}"}
L[2065]={A="{W|7} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Look to the east of the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {P|troggs} One of the troggs in a score or so carries it.",H="{W|7} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the troggs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|troggs}"}
L[2066]={A="{W|0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is the east of the snowfields of Dun Morogh that rewards the search. {P|troggs} It turns up on the troggs now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{W|0} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the troggs in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|troggs}"}
L[2067]={A="{W|10} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Look to the east of the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {P|troggs} It turns up on the troggs now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{W|10} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the troggs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|troggs}"}
L[2069]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, they keep to the heart of the land. {B|bears} A good share of the bears carry it.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the bears, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|bears}"}
L[2070]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also often found on Defias brigands of Elwynn Forest.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|innkeepers} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. It is also often found on Scarlet Crusaders of Tirisfal Glades."}
L[2072]={A="{W|10} {C|4} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Within the Stonetalon Mountains, they keep to the north. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|10} {C|4} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the south. It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
L[2073]={A="{W|0} {C|4} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|0} {C|4} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[2074]="{W|7} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Deadmines. {D|The Deadmines} Those who have a stake in the Deadmines give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[2075]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. One of the wild beasts there in a score or so carries it."}
L[2077]="{W|10} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[2078]={A="{W|7} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|7} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[2079]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[2080]="{W|0} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[2082]={A="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is given in thanks by those in the stormy coast of Darkshore whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2084]={A="{W|8} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is the north of the marshes of the Wetlands that rewards the search. {P|Dark Iron dwarves} Only occasionally does one of the Dark Iron dwarves carry it.",H="{W|8} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIt is carried by the Dark Iron dwarves, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Dark Iron dwarves}"}
L[2085]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {P|ghouls} Nearly every one of the ghouls carries one.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nOur correspondents report it among the ghouls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|ghouls}"}
L[2087]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the north. {B|crabs} It is a rare find among the crabs; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the crabs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|crabs}"}
L[2088]={A="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the north-west. {B|crabs} It is a rare find among the crabs; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the crabs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|crabs}"}
L[2089]="{W|15} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Deadmines. {D|The Deadmines} Those who have a stake in the Deadmines give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[2091]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {P|earth elementals} A good share of the earth elementals carry it.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Within the blighted glades of Tirisfal, they keep to the heart of the land. It is found as readily in the red desert of Durotar. {P|townsfolk and militia} It turns up on the townsfolk and militia now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[2092]="{W|15} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is issued to new adventurers as they set out, and most are glad to be rid of it by the second town."
L[2098]="{W|3} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 23-29 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2099]="{W|3} {C|4} {Q|4.1} {L|5}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 55-60 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
