L[2136]="{K|6}\nIt is conjured by mages out of nothing, as they conjure bread and water, and vanishes when its maker is long gone."
L[2137]={A="{W|15} {Q|1.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{W|15} {Q|1.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} The folk of the plains of Mulgore have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[2138]={A="{W|15} {Q|0.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{W|15} {Q|0.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is found as readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
