L[2163]="{W|15} {Q|4.0} {L|4}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 49-56 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2164]="{W|15} {Q|4.0} {L|3}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 41-47, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[2165]={A="{A|1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is given in thanks by those in the fallow farmland of Westfall whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2166]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the south. It is a rare find among the restless dead; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the restless dead in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[2167]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Look to the south of the fallow farmland of Westfall. Only occasionally does one of the restless dead carry it.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[2168]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the south of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. Only occasionally does one of the restless dead carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the restless dead in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[2169]="{W|15} {L|1}\nIts source is the Deadmines, and nowhere in the open world. {D|The Deadmines} {P|mechanical constructs} It is the mechanical constructs of the Deadmines who have it about them."
L[2172]={A="{A|3}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} The folk of the snowfields of Dun Morogh have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|3}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2173]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The folk of the blighted glades of Tirisfal have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[2175]={A="{W|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill that rewards the search. {P|gnolls} Only occasionally does one of the gnolls carry it.",H="{W|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the gnolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|gnolls}"}
