L[2241]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Within the loch country of Loch Modan, they keep to the south-east. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[2243]="The Hand of Edward the Odd is a mace named for an eccentric mage of old Lordaeron, who wished for a weapon that would let him cast as he struck. It does.\nIt is a rare world drop, found in the hoards of the great foes across both continents."
L[2244]="The Krol Blade is a sword of the old world's wars, its hilt worked in a style no living smith claims, that turns up in the hoards of the great foes across Azeroth.\nIt has no one home; it is a rare prize of the middle dungeons and the chests of the deep places."
L[2245]="{A|3} {Q|4.0} {L|5}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 55-60 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2246]="{J|11} {Q|4.1} {L|5}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 55-60 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2249]={A="{A|6}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The folk of the woods of Elwynn have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|6}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2251]="{I|Gooey Spider Leg}\nHunters find it most readily in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is found as readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {B|spiders} Nearly every one of the spiders carries one."
L[2254]={A="{W|5} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is the east of the snowfields of Dun Morogh that rewards the search. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them.",H="{W|5} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[2256]={A="{W|4} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{W|4} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the south of the savannah of the Barrens. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[2257]={A="{W|10} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} {P|trolls} One of the trolls in a score or so carries it.",H="{W|10} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the trolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|trolls}"}
L[2258]={A="{W|7} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} {P|trolls} One of the trolls in a score or so carries it.",H="{W|7} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the trolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|trolls}"}
L[2259]={A="{W|4} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} {P|trolls} It turns up on the trolls now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{W|4} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the trolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|trolls}"}
L[2260]={A="{W|0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is the west of the snowfields of Dun Morogh that rewards the search. {P|trolls} One of the trolls in a score or so carries it.",H="{W|0} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the trolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|trolls}"}
L[2262]="{J|11} {Q|3.0} {L|3}\nIts source is the Scarlet Monastery, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It is the Scarlet Crusaders of the Scarlet Monastery who have it about them."
L[2263]={A="{W|7} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} The folk of the marshes of the Wetlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{W|7} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2264]="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nIt comes out of Razorfen Kraul. {D|Razorfen Kraul} {P|quilboar} It is the quilboar and bats of Razorfen Kraul who have it about them."
L[2265]={A="{W|0} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} {P|troggs} One of the troggs in a score or so carries it.",H="{W|0} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the troggs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|troggs}"}
L[2266]={A="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} {P|troggs} It is a rare find among the troggs; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the troggs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|troggs}"}
L[2268]={A="{W|7} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is the south-west of the loch country of Loch Modan that rewards the search. {P|troggs} It is a rare find among the troggs; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|7} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the troggs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|troggs}"}
L[2271]="{W|10} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nIts source is Blackfathom Deeps, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[2274]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is the north of the loch country of Loch Modan that rewards the search. {P|Dark Iron dwarves} Only occasionally does one of the Dark Iron dwarves carry it.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the Dark Iron dwarves, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Dark Iron dwarves}"}
L[2276]="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|3}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 33-39 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2277]="{A|1} {C|24} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 31-37, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[2278]="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 26-34 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2280]="{W|10} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIt comes out of the Stockade. {D|The Stockade} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[2281]={A="{W|0} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Within the loch country of Loch Modan, they keep to the north-west. It turns up on the raiders and tribesmen there now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{W|0} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[2282]={A="{W|7} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Within the loch country of Loch Modan, they keep to the north-west. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|7} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[2283]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Within the loch country of Loch Modan, they keep to the north-west. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[2284]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Look to the north-west of the loch country of Loch Modan. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[2287]={A="{K|5}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also sometimes found on humanoid foes of levels 11-20, most plentifully in Loch Modan and south-eastern Stonetalon Mountains.",H="{K|5}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also often found on humanoid foes of levels 12-20, most plentifully in the Barrens and south-eastern Stonetalon Mountains."}
L[2288]="{K|6}\nIt is conjured by mages out of nothing, as they conjure bread and water, and vanishes when its maker is long gone."
L[2289]="{K|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {Z|Desolace} Merchants in the grey wastes of Desolace and the woods of Elwynn stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also found inside containers such as Ahn'Qiraj War Effort Supplies and Box of Spells."
L[2290]={A="{K|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the Arathi Highlands stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also sometimes found on humanoid foes of levels 26-35, most plentifully in Desolace and Arathi Highlands.",H="{K|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Undercity} Merchants in the Undercity and the mesas of Thousand Needles stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also sometimes found on humanoid foes of levels 26-35, most plentifully in Desolace and Arathi Highlands."}
L[2291]="{W|1} {Q|4.1} {L|4}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 45-52 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2292]="{A|1} {C|24} {Q|3.0} {L|1}\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} The rank and file of Shadowfang Keep have it about them."
L[2295]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Within the Blasted Lands, they keep to the heart of the land. The other place to look is Razorfen Kraul. {B|boars} A good share of the boars carry it."
L[2296]={A="{I|Great Goretusk Snout}\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} The other place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {B|boars} A good share of the boars carry it.",H="{I|Great Goretusk Snout}\nIt is carried by the boars, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|boars}"}
L[2299]="{W|1} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 29-36 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2300]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Light Leather and Coarse Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 40) can attempt it."
L[2302]="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Light Leather and Coarse Thread."
L[2303]="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Light Leather and Coarse Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 15) can attempt it."
L[2304]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Light Leather. It is also often found on the humanoid foes of Uldaman."
L[2305]="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Light Leather and Coarse Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 30) can attempt it."
L[2306]="{A|2} {Q|0.1} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Light Leather and Coarse Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 35) can attempt it."
L[2307]="{A|2} {L|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Light Leather and Coarse Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 90."
L[2308]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Light Leather and Fine Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 85) can attempt it."
L[2309]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Light Leather and Coarse Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 55) can attempt it."
L[2310]="{A|1} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Light Leather and Coarse Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 60."
L[2311]="{A|2} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Light Leather, Coarse Thread and Bleach. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 60) can attempt it."
L[2312]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Cured Light Hide, Light Leather and Coarse Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 75) can attempt it."
L[2313]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Medium Leather and Coarse Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it. It is also often found on the humanoid foes of Uldaman."
L[2314]="{A|2} {L|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Medium Leather, Cured Light Hide and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 120."
L[2315]="{A|2} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Medium Leather, Fine Thread and Gray Dye. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 100."
L[2316]="{A|1} {L|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Medium Leather, Fine Thread and Gray Dye. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 110) can attempt it."
L[2317]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Medium Leather, Fine Thread and Gray Dye. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it."
L[2318]={A="{I|Light Leather}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Ruined Leather Scraps. It is also skinned from beasts of levels 7-24 in Darkshore and Ashenvale.",H="{I|Light Leather}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Ruined Leather Scraps. It is also skinned from beasts of levels 6-23 in the northern Barrens."}
L[2319]={A="{I|Medium Leather}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Light Leather. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it. It is also skinned from beasts of levels 21-34 in Ashenvale and Thousand Needles.",H="{I|Medium Leather}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Light Leather. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it. It is also skinned from beasts of levels 20-35 in Ashenvale and the Barrens."}
L[2320]={A="{I|Coarse Thread}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{I|Coarse Thread}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[2321]={A="{I|Fine Thread}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{I|Fine Thread}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[2324]={A="{I|Bleach}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{I|Bleach}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[2325]={A="{I|Black Dye}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{I|Black Dye}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[2326]={A="{A|1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is given in thanks by those in the snowfields of Dun Morogh whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2327]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Look to the north of the fallow farmland of Westfall. {P|mechanical constructs} It is a rare find among the mechanical constructs; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the mechanical constructs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|mechanical constructs}"}
L[2361]="{W|5} {L|0}\nIt is issued to new adventurers as they set out, and most are glad to be rid of it by the second town."
L[2362]="{A|6} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nIt is issued to new adventurers as they set out, and most are glad to be rid of it by the second town."
L[2364]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|light armor merchants} {Z|Durotar} Merchants in the red desert of Durotar and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it."}
