L[2378]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} {P|skeletons} The skeletons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the skeletons in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|skeletons}"}
