L[2445]={A="{A|6} {Q|1.1} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|shield merchants} {Z|Redridge Mountains} Merchants in the red hills around Lake Everstill and the city of Stormwind stock it. The shop is in the west of the land.",H="{A|6} {Q|1.1} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|mail armor merchants} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the savannah of the Barrens stock it. The shop is in the south of the land."}
