L[2447]={A="{I|Peacebloom}\nHerbalists know it from the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. Herbalists gather it in the boughs of Teldrassil, where it grows thickest. It is also sold by an alchemy supplier in Stormwind City (limited stock).",H="{I|Peacebloom}\nHerbalists know it from the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is found as readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. Herbalists gather it in the savannah of the Barrens, where it grows thickest. It is also sold by reagent vendors in central Tirisfal Glades and the northern Barrens (limited stock)."}
L[2448]={A="{A|6} {L|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|mail armor merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{A|6} {L|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|heavy armor merchants} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the plains of Mulgore stock it."}
L[2449]={A="{I|Earthroot}\nHerbalists know it from the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. Herbalists gather it in the boughs of Teldrassil, where it grows thickest. It is also sold by merchants in Stormwind City, southern Elwynn Forest and elsewhere (limited stock).",H="{I|Earthroot}\nHerbalists know it from the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is found as readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. Herbalists gather it in the savannah of the Barrens, where it grows thickest. It is also sold by merchants in central Stonetalon Mountains, central Thousand Needles and elsewhere (limited stock)."}
L[2450]={A="{I|Briarthorn}\nHerbalists know it from the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. Herbalists gather it in the fallow farmland of Westfall, where it grows thickest. It is also sometimes found on elementals of levels 18-54, most plentifully in Ashenvale and Un'Goro Crater.",H="{I|Briarthorn}\nHerbalists know it from the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is found as readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. Herbalists gather it in the savannah of the Barrens, where it grows thickest. It is also sometimes found on elementals of levels 18-54, most plentifully in Ashenvale and Un'Goro Crater."}
L[2451]={A="{A|6} {L|4}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|shield merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{A|6} {L|4}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|heavy armor merchants} {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} Merchants in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows and the plains of Mulgore stock it."}
L[2452]={A="{I|Swiftthistle}\nHerbalists know it from the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is also often found on a variety of creatures of levels 19-54, most plentifully in Ashenvale and Un'Goro Crater.",H="{I|Swiftthistle}\nHerbalists know it from the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The other place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the savannah of the Barrens. It is also often found on a variety of creatures of levels 19-54, most plentifully in Ashenvale and Un'Goro Crater."}
L[2453]={A="{I|Bruiseweed}\nHerbalists know it from the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Herbalists gather it in the Stonetalon Mountains, where it grows thickest. It is also sold by merchants in Stormwind City, southern Elwynn Forest and elsewhere (limited stock).",H="{I|Bruiseweed}\nHerbalists know it from the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The other place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. Herbalists gather it in the savannah of the Barrens, where it grows thickest. It is also sold by merchants in central Stonetalon Mountains, central Thousand Needles and elsewhere (limited stock)."}
L[2454]={A="{K|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Earthroot, Silverleaf and Empty Vial. It is also awarded for a quest in Elwynn Forest.",H="{K|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Earthroot, Silverleaf and Empty Vial. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[2455]={A="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Mageroyal, Silverleaf and Empty Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 25) can attempt it. It is also sold by arcane goods vendors in the central Barrens and south-eastern Elwynn Forest (limited stock).",H="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Mageroyal, Silverleaf and Empty Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 25) can attempt it. It is also commonly carried by centaur of levels 13-25, most plentifully in the Barrens and central Thousand Needles."}
L[2456]={A="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Mageroyal, Peacebloom and Empty Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 40. It is also awarded for completing a quest.",H="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Mageroyal, Peacebloom and Empty Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 40. It is also awarded for a quest in the Barrens."}
L[2457]={A="{K|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Swiftthistle, Silverleaf and Empty Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 50. It is also awarded for completing a quest.",H="{K|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Swiftthistle, Silverleaf and Empty Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 50. It is also awarded for a quest in the Barrens."}
L[2458]={A="{K|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Earthroot, Peacebloom and Empty Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 50) can attempt it. It is also awarded for completing a quest.",H="{K|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Earthroot, Peacebloom and Empty Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 50) can attempt it. It is also awarded by quests in Silverpine Forest and the Barrens."}
L[2459]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Swiftthistle, Briarthorn and Empty Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 60) can attempt it. It is also commonly carried by the humanoid foes of Uldaman."
L[2460]="{K|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Earthroot, Mageroyal and Empty Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 70) can attempt it."
