L[2536]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} {P|troggs} The troggs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} Within the Badlands, they keep to the north. {P|troggs} The troggs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[2545]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is given in thanks by those in the marshes of the Wetlands whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2546]={A="{A|3} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, they keep to the west. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="{A|3} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[2547]={A="{A|3}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is given in thanks by those in the snowfields of Dun Morogh whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|3}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2549]="{W|10} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nIts source is Razorfen Kraul, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Razorfen Kraul} {P|quilboar} It is the quilboar of Razorfen Kraul who have it about them."
L[2553]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Elixir of Minor Agility. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 50) can follow it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 6-19, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[2555]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Swiftness Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 60 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 7-19 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2561]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Within the loch country of Loch Modan, they keep to the north-east. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[2562]={A="{J|23} {C|1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is given in thanks by those in the red hills around Lake Everstill whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{J|23} {C|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2564]="{A|2} {C|6} {Q|3.0} {L|4}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Within the fallen coast of Azshara, they keep to the south. The other place to look is Onyxia's Lair. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the fallen coast of Azshara, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[2565]="{J|23} {C|23} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 31-37, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[2566]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill that rewards the search. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[2567]="{W|15} {Q|3.0} {L|1}\nIt comes out of Blackfathom Deeps. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[2568]="{A|1} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Linen Cloth and Coarse Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 10."
L[2569]="{A|1} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Linen Cloth, Coarse Thread and Light Leather. A tailor of middling skill (around 65) can attempt it."
L[2570]="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Linen Cloth and Coarse Thread."
L[2571]={A="{A|1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The folk of the boughs of Teldrassil have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2572]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Linen Cloth, Coarse Thread and Red Dye. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 40."
L[2575]={A="{J|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Linen Cloth, Coarse Thread and Red Dye. A tailor of middling skill (around 40) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest in Elwynn Forest.",H="{J|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Linen Cloth, Coarse Thread and Red Dye. A tailor of middling skill (around 40) can attempt it. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[2576]="{J|4} {Q|1.1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Linen Cloth, Coarse Thread and Bleach. A tailor of middling skill (around 1) can attempt it."
L[2577]="{J|4} {Q|1.1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Linen Cloth, Coarse Thread and Blue Dye. A tailor of middling skill (around 40) can attempt it."
L[2578]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Linen Cloth, Light Leather and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 70."
L[2579]="{J|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Linen Cloth, Fine Thread and Green Dye. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 70."
L[2580]="{A|1} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Linen Cloth and Coarse Thread. A tailor of middling skill (around 60) can attempt it."
L[2581]="{K|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|129} Its making calls for Linen Cloth. It is first attempted at a First Aid skill of about 40."
L[2582]="{A|1} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Woolen Cloth, Fine Thread and Green Dye. A tailor of middling skill (around 85) can attempt it."
L[2583]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Woolen Cloth, Fine Thread and Light Leather. A tailor of middling skill (around 95) can attempt it."
L[2584]="{A|1} {L|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Woolen Cloth and Fine Thread. A tailor of middling skill (around 75) can attempt it."
L[2585]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Woolen Cloth, Fine Thread and Gray Dye. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 105."
L[2587]="{J|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Woolen Cloth, Fine Thread and Gray Dye. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 100."
L[2589]={A="{I|Linen Cloth}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there.",H="{I|Linen Cloth}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is found as readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there."}
L[2590]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the south-west of the woods of Elwynn. {B|spiders} It is found on almost all of the spiders.",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIt is carried by the spiders, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|spiders}"}
L[2591]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is the east of the snowfields of Dun Morogh that rewards the search. {P|troggs} Perhaps one in four of the troggs has one about them.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIt is carried by the troggs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|troggs}"}
L[2592]="{I|Wool Cloth}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them."
L[2593]={A="{K|2}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also commonly carried by humanoid foes of western Dustwallow Marsh.",H="{K|2}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. It is also commonly carried by humanoid foes of the southern Barrens and western Dustwallow Marsh."}
L[2594]={A="{K|6}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also commonly carried by humanoid foes of western Dustwallow Marsh.",H="{K|6}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. It is also commonly carried by humanoid foes of the southern Barrens and western Dustwallow Marsh."}
L[2595]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also commonly carried by humanoid foes of western Dustwallow Marsh.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. It is also commonly carried by humanoid foes of the southern Barrens and western Dustwallow Marsh."}
L[2596]={A="{K|6}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also commonly carried by humanoid foes of western Dustwallow Marsh.",H="{K|6}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. It is also commonly carried by humanoid foes of the southern Barrens and western Dustwallow Marsh."}
L[2598]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Red Linen Robe. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 40 of a tailor who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the woods of Elwynn. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Red Linen Robe. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 40 of a tailor who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[2601]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Gray Woolen Robe. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 105 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 16-29 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2604]={A="{I|Red Dye}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{I|Red Dye}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[2605]={A="{I|Green Dye}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{I|Green Dye}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[2606]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} {B|spiders} The spiders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is carried by the spiders, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|spiders}"}
L[2607]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is the north-east of the loch country of Loch Modan that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[2608]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} {B|sea creatures} Nearly every one of the sea creatures carries one.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. The other place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. Nearly every one of the wild beasts there carries one."}
L[2611]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Look to the north of the marshes of the Wetlands. {P|gnolls} The gnolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[2612]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the boughs of Teldrassil stock it.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|cloth armor merchants} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land."}
