L[2620]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the south of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. It is a rare find among the demons; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[2621]="{A|1} {C|24} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} Look to the north of the Badlands. {P|Dark Iron dwarves} Only occasionally does one of the Dark Iron dwarves carry it."
L[2622]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is the south-east of the Arathi Highlands that rewards the search. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there."
L[2623]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Look to the west of the Arathi Highlands. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[2624]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} It is the south-west of the Badlands that rewards the search. {P|ogres} It is a very rare find among the ogres, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[2629]={A="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nHunters find it most readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Look to the north-west of the marshes of the Wetlands. The restless dead there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[2632]={A="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[2633]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north of the jungles of Stranglethorn. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them."
L[2634]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, the caches keep to the north. Chests and strongboxes in the jungles of Stranglethorn hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[2635]={A="{A|3} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|3} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[2636]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Within the loch country of Loch Modan, they keep to the south-east. {P|troggs} The troggs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the troggs in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|troggs}"}
L[2640]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Within the loch country of Loch Modan, they keep to the north-west. It is taken from Miners' League Crates in the loch country of Loch Modan.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from Miners' League Crates."}
L[2642]="{A|3} {Q|0.1} {L|0}\nIt is found inside a Battered Chest, and nowhere else in particular."
L[2643]="{A|3} {Q|0.1} {L|0}\nIt is found inside a Battered Chest, and nowhere else in particular."
L[2644]="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nIt is found inside a Battered Chest, and nowhere else in particular."
