L[2657]={A="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The other place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[2658]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is the west of the marshes of the Wetlands that rewards the search. It is taken from an Ancient Relic in the marshes of the Wetlands.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is taken from an Ancient Relic."}
L[2659]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is the west of the marshes of the Wetlands that rewards the search. It is taken from an Ancient Relic in the marshes of the Wetlands.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from an Ancient Relic."}
