L[2661]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the west. It is taken from a Loose Soil in the marshes of the Wetlands.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from a Loose Soil."}
L[2662]="A quiver or ammunition pouch, the leatherworkers' product for the hunters.\nIts source is Blackrock Depths, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Depths} The rank and file of Blackrock Depths have it about them."
L[2663]="A quiver or ammunition pouch, the leatherworkers' product for the hunters.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[2665]={A="{I|Stormwind Seasoning Herbs}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|herbalism suppliers} {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land.",H="{I|Stormwind Seasoning Herbs}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
L[2667]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Look to the middle of the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is taken from a MacGrann's Meat Locker in the snowfields of Dun Morogh.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from a MacGrann's Meat Locker."}
L[2671]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, they keep to the heart of the land. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[2672]={A="{I|Stringy Wolf Meat}\nThe place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} {B|wolves} Nearly every one of the wolves carries one.",H="{I|Stringy Wolf Meat}\nThe place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is found as readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {B|wolves} It is found on almost all of the wolves."}
L[2673]={A="{I|Coyote Meat}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the north of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. {B|wolves} Nearly every one of the wolves carries one.",H="{I|Coyote Meat}\nOur correspondents report it among the wolves in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|wolves}"}
L[2674]={A="{I|Crawler Meat}\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {B|crabs} Nearly every one of the crabs carries one.",H="{I|Crawler Meat}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is the north-west of the ancient forest of Ashenvale that rewards the search. It is found as readily in Blackfathom Deeps. {B|crabs} Nearly every one of the crabs carries one."}
L[2675]={A="{I|Crawler Claw}\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {B|crabs} Nearly every one of the crabs carries one.",H="{I|Crawler Claw}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is the north-west of the ancient forest of Ashenvale that rewards the search. It is found as readily in Blackfathom Deeps. {B|crabs} Nearly every one of the crabs carries one."}
L[2676]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, they keep to the heart of the land. {P|trolls} The trolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest. It is also taken from Shimmerweed Basket in central Dun Morogh.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the trolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|trolls} It is also taken from Shimmerweed Basket."}
L[2677]={A="{I|Boar Ribs}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. {B|boars} Perhaps one in four of the boars has one about them.",H="{I|Boar Ribs}\nIts source is Razorfen Kraul, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Razorfen Kraul} {B|boars} It is the boars of Razorfen Kraul who have it about them."}
L[2678]={A="{I|Mild Spices}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{I|Mild Spices}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[2679]="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} Its making calls for Stringy Wolf Meat."
L[2680]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} This one is worked from Stringy Wolf Meat and Mild Spices. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 10."
L[2681]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} This one is worked from Chunk of Boar Meat."
L[2682]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Crawler Claw and Mild Spices. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 85."
L[2683]="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} This one is worked from Crawler Meat and Mild Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 75) can attempt it."
L[2684]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} This one is worked from Coyote Meat. A cook of middling skill (around 50) can attempt it."
L[2685]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Boar Ribs and Hot Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 110) can attempt it."
L[2686]={A="{K|6}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|innkeepers} {Z|Dun Morogh} Merchants in the snowfields of Dun Morogh and the loch country of Loch Modan stock it.",H="{K|6}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
L[2687]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} This one is worked from Boar Ribs and Mild Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 80) can attempt it."
L[2690]={A="{A|3} {Q|1.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is given in thanks by those in the woods of Elwynn whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|3} {Q|1.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2691]={A="{A|3}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The folk of the woods of Elwynn have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|3}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2692]={A="{I|Hot Spices}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{I|Hot Spices}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[2694]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is given in thanks by those in the savannah of the Barrens whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
L[2697]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Goretusk Liver Pie. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 50) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. It is also awarded for a quest in Westfall.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Goretusk Liver Pie. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 50) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2698]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Cooked Crab Claw. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 85) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Cooked Crab Claw. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 85) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Within the grey woods of Silverpine, they keep to the west. The other place to look is the poisoned forest of Felwood. It is a rare find among the wild beasts there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[2699]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Redridge Goulash. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 100) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. It is also awarded for a quest in Redridge Mountains.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Redridge Goulash. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 100) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2700]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Succulent Pork Ribs. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 110 of a cook who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Succulent Pork Ribs. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 110 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
L[2701]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Seasoned Wolf Kabob. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 100) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. It is also awarded for a quest in Duskwood.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Seasoned Wolf Kabob. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 100) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2702]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|46}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} {P|murlocs} The murlocs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest. It is also awarded for a quest in Duskwood.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|46}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is the south-west of the Arathi Highlands that rewards the search. {P|murlocs} The murlocs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[2713]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Within the loch country of Loch Modan, they keep to the south. {B|bears} The bears there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nOur correspondents report it among the bears in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|bears}"}
L[2721]="{A|1} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 29-36 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2723]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also commonly carried by humanoid foes of western Dustwallow Marsh.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. It is also commonly carried by humanoid foes of the southern Barrens and western Dustwallow Marsh."}
L[2725]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
L[2728]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[2730]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} One of the raiders and tribesmen there in a score or so carries it."
L[2732]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} {P|trolls} One of the trolls in a score or so carries it."
L[2734]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
