L[2858]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} It is the west of the Western Plaguelands that rewards the search. {P|felhounds} The felhounds there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is the east of the blighted glades of Tirisfal that rewards the search. {P|felhounds} The felhounds there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[2859]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Look to the west of the Alterac Mountains. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Look to the north-east of the grey woods of Silverpine. It is found as readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
