L[2879]="{J|23} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 19-26, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[2880]={A="{I|Weak Flux}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also commonly carried by Dalaran wizards of north-western Hillsbrad Foothills.",H="{I|Weak Flux}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also commonly carried by Dalaran wizards of north-western Hillsbrad Foothills and south-eastern Silverpine Forest."}
L[2881]={A="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Runed Copper Breastplate. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 80 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it.",H="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Runed Copper Breastplate. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 80 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Only occasionally does one of the wild beasts there carry it."}
L[2882]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Silvered Bronze Shoulders. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 125) can follow it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 16-29 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2883]={A="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Deadly Bronze Poniard. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 125) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Deadly Bronze Poniard. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 125) can follow it.\nLockboxes are the strongboxes of travellers who did not survive to open them, carried off by whatever killed them. Only a rogue's picks or an engineer's seaforium will open one, and this is among what they hold."}
L[2885]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Within the blighted glades of Tirisfal, they keep to the south-west. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[2886]={A="{I|Crag Boar Rib}\nThe place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} {B|boars} Nearly every one of the boars carries one.",H="{I|Crag Boar Rib}\nOur correspondents report it among the boars in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|boars}"}
L[2888]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Crag Boar Rib and Rhapsody Malt. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 25. It is also awarded for completing a quest."
L[2889]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Beer Basted Boar Ribs. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 25) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. It is also awarded for completing a quest.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Beer Basted Boar Ribs. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 25) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2892]="{K|9}\nIt is made, not found. {T|40} Its making calls for Deathweed and Leaded Vial. A rogue of middling skill (around 130) can attempt it. It is also sold by a reagent vendor."
L[2893]="{K|9}\nIt is made, not found. {T|40} Its making calls for Deathweed and Leaded Vial. A rogue of middling skill (around 170) can attempt it. It is also sold by a reagent vendor."
L[2894]="Rhapsody Malt is a Dun Morogh malt beer of the dwarven brewers, sold by the barkeeps of Khaz Modan and Stormwind and, in friendlier times, Southshore.\nIt can be had from the barkeeps of the Alliance's inns."
L[2898]={A="{A|3} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} {B|bears} It turns up on the bears now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{A|3} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the bears, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|bears}"}
L[2900]={A="{A|6} {Q|1.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is given in thanks by those in the snowfields of Dun Morogh whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|6} {Q|1.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2901]="The mining pick, sold by every trade goods and mining supplier, is the one tool of the miner.\nIt can be had in every settlement with a mine nearby."
L[2902]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} It is given in thanks by those in the dark woods of Duskwood whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2903]={A="{W|2} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is given in thanks by those in the loch country of Loch Modan whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{W|2} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2904]={A="{W|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is given in thanks by those in the loch country of Loch Modan whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{W|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2905]={A="{A|1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is given in thanks by those in the snowfields of Dun Morogh whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2906]="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Stockade. {D|The Stockade} Those who have a stake in the Stockade give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[2907]={A="{W|1} {C|4} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} The folk of the loch country of Loch Modan have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{W|1} {C|4} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2908]={A="{W|15} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} The folk of the loch country of Loch Modan have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{W|15} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2909]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt comes out of the Stockade. {D|The Stockade} {P|Defias brigands} It is the Defias brigands of the Stockade who have it about them."
L[2910]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} The folk of the red hills around Lake Everstill have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2911]="{A|1} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 19-26, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[2912]="{W|15} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 29-36, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[2913]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} The folk of the marshes of the Wetlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2915]="{W|5} {Q|4.1} {L|4}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 49-56 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2916]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is given in thanks by those in the marshes of the Wetlands whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2917]={A="{J|11} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is given in thanks by those in the marshes of the Wetlands whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{J|11} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2924]={A="{I|Crocolisk Meat}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the north-west. It is found as readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. {B|crocolisks} It is found on almost all of the crocolisks.",H="{I|Crocolisk Meat}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north-east. It is found as readily in the red desert of Durotar. {B|crocolisks} It is found on almost all of the crocolisks."}
L[2925]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} {B|crocolisks} The crocolisks there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north-east of the savannah of the Barrens. The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. {B|crocolisks} The crocolisks there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[2926]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt comes out of the Stockade. {D|The Stockade} The rank and file of the Stockade have it about them."
L[2928]={A="{I|Dust of Decay}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also often found on humanoid foes of southern Silithus.",H="{I|Dust of Decay}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also often found on humanoid foes of southern Silithus."}
L[2930]={A="{I|Essence of Pain}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also found inside containers such as Heavy Junkbox and Sturdy Junkbox.",H="{I|Essence of Pain}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|poison vendors} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also found inside containers such as Heavy Junkbox and Sturdy Junkbox."}
L[2933]={A="{J|11} {Q|3.1} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the city of Stormwind. {Z|Stormwind City} It is given in thanks by those in the city of Stormwind whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{J|11} {Q|3.1} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2934]={A="{I|Ruined Leather Scraps}\nIt is a skinner's find, chiefly in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} The other place to look is the woods of Elwynn. It is cut from the beasts there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience.",H="{I|Ruined Leather Scraps}\nIt is a skinner's find, chiefly in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. It is cut from the beasts there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience."}
L[2939]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Within the loch country of Loch Modan, they keep to the heart of the land. {B|crocolisks} The crocolisks there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the crocolisks in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|crocolisks}"}
L[2940]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {B|bears} Perhaps one in four of the bears has one about them."
L[2941]="{W|15} {Q|3.1} {L|2} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is the Stockade, and nowhere in the open world. {D|The Stockade} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[2942]="{W|13} {Q|3.1} {L|2} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is the Stockade, and nowhere in the open world. {D|The Stockade} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[2943]={A="{J|23} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} The folk of the marshes of the Wetlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{J|23} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2946]={A="{W|16} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{W|16} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[2947]={A="{W|16} {L|0}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{W|16} {L|0}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[2949]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is given in thanks by those in the marshes of the Wetlands whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
