L[2951]="{J|11} {Q|3.0} {L|3}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 33-39 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2953]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} The folk of the dark woods of Duskwood have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2954]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} It is given in thanks by those in the dark woods of Duskwood whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[2955]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, they keep to the south-west. {P|pirates} It is a very rare find among the pirates, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[2957]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 6-14 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[2958]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the woods of Elwynn: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is found as readily in the plains of Mulgore. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the red desert of Durotar: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[2959]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."}
L[2960]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."}
L[2961]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 6-14, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[2962]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. Chests and strongboxes in the woods of Elwynn hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. Chests and strongboxes in the red desert of Durotar hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
L[2963]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."}
