L[2969]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
