L[2976]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
