L[2979]={A="{A|3} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|3} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is found as readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them."}
