L[2991]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[2992]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[2996]="{I|Bolt of Linen Cloth}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Linen Cloth. It is also sometimes found on centaur of central Thousand Needles."
L[2997]="{I|Bolt of Woolen Cloth}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Wool Cloth. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 75. It is also sometimes found on naga of levels 19-33, most plentifully in north-western Ashenvale."
L[2998]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the west of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. Chests and strongboxes in the fallow farmland of Westfall hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[3000]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is the east of the woods of Elwynn that rewards the search. {B|spiders} Perhaps one in four of the spiders has one about them.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the spiders, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|spiders}"}
L[3008]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, they keep to the heart of the land. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[3010]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {B|crabs} It is found on almost all of the crabs.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is the north-west of the ancient forest of Ashenvale that rewards the search. The other place to look is the fallen coast of Azshara. {B|crabs} It is found on almost all of the crabs."}
L[3011]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThe place to look is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Look to the west of the Alterac Mountains. It is found as readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one."
L[3012]={A="{K|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|arcane goods vendors} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the city of Stormwind stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also found inside containers such as Ahn'Qiraj War Effort Supplies and Message in a Bottle.",H="{K|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Undercity} Merchants in the Undercity and the mesas of Thousand Needles stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also found inside containers such as Ahn'Qiraj War Effort Supplies and Message in a Bottle."}
L[3013]={A="{K|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|arcane goods vendors} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the city of Stormwind stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also sometimes found on humanoid foes of levels 6-15, most plentifully in Teldrassil and Elwynn Forest.",H="{K|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Undercity} Merchants in the Undercity and the woods of Elwynn stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also found inside containers such as Ahn'Qiraj War Effort Supplies and Message in a Bottle."}
L[3014]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} {P|Blackrock orcs} The Blackrock orcs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} It is the south-east of the ash plains of the Burning Steppes that rewards the search. {P|Blackrock orcs} The Blackrock orcs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[3018]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} {B|wolves} It is found on almost all of the wolves.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the wolves in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|wolves}"}
L[3019]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the south. It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[3020]="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the Arathi Highlands. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."
L[3021]="{W|2} {Q|3.0} {L|1}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 20-27 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[3022]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the north-west. {P|murlocs} It is a rare find among the murlocs; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the murlocs in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|murlocs}"}
L[3023]={A="{W|3} {Q|1.1} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|gun smiths} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{W|3} {Q|1.1} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[3024]={A="{W|3} {Q|1.1} {L|2}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|gun smiths} {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the marshes of the Wetlands stock it.",H="{W|3} {Q|1.1} {L|2}\nThis is a thing one buys. Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[3025]={A="{W|3} {L|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|gun smiths} {Z|Tanaris} Merchants in the desert of Tanaris and the snows of Winterspring stock it. The shop is in the north of the land.",H="{W|3} {L|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the desert of Tanaris stock it. The shop is in the south of the land."}
L[3026]={A="{W|2} {Q|1.0} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|bowyers} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{W|2} {Q|1.0} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|bowyers} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[3027]={A="{W|2} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|bowyers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{W|2} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|bowyers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[3030]={A="Ammunition for the hunters' bows and guns, sold by every bowyer and gunsmith and made by the engineers.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="Ammunition for the hunters' bows and guns, sold by every bowyer and gunsmith and made by the engineers.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[3033]={A="Ammunition for the hunters' bows and guns, sold by every bowyer and gunsmith and made by the engineers.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="Ammunition for the hunters' bows and guns, sold by every bowyer and gunsmith and made by the engineers.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[3034]="Ammunition for the hunters' bows and guns, sold by every bowyer and gunsmith and made by the engineers.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} Its making calls for Heavy Blasting Powder and Iron Bar."
L[3036]={A="{W|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{W|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[3037]="{W|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[3039]={A="{W|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."}
L[3040]={A="{W|3} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|3} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3041]={A="{W|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{W|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The folk of the savannah of the Barrens have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[3042]="{W|3} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the Arathi Highlands. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[3045]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} It is the north of the Stonetalon Mountains that rewards the search. The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the south of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. The other place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
L[3047]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Look to the north of the Stonetalon Mountains. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the south of the savannah of the Barrens. It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
