L[3053]="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the south-east of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. The other place to look is the Arathi Highlands. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
