L[3056]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Look to the north of the Stonetalon Mountains. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the south of the savannah of the Barrens. It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
L[3057]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3058]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3065]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."}
L[3066]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3067]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Look to the north of the Stonetalon Mountains. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the south of the savannah of the Barrens. It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
L[3069]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} It is the north of the Stonetalon Mountains that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the south of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
L[3070]={A="{A|1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is given in thanks by those in the woods of Elwynn whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3071]={A="{W|0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{W|0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The folk of the blighted glades of Tirisfal have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[3072]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the east. {P|whelps} One of the whelps in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nOur correspondents report it among the whelps in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|whelps}"}
L[3073]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is the east of the marshes of the Wetlands that rewards the search. {P|whelps} Only occasionally does one of the whelps carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is carried by the whelps, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|whelps}"}
L[3074]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is the east of the marshes of the Wetlands that rewards the search. {P|whelps} Only occasionally does one of the whelps carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the whelps, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|whelps}"}
L[3075]="{A|1} {Q|4.0} {L|4}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 51-58 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[3076]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the east. {P|whelps} One of the whelps in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the whelps in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|whelps}"}
L[3078]="{W|2} {C|40} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts source is Blackfathom Deeps, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[3079]={A="{W|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given only by the Horde's questgivers, in thanks for errands a traveller of the Alliance cannot run.",H="{W|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is given in thanks by those in the plains of Mulgore whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
L[3080]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The folk of the blighted glades of Tirisfal have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[3082]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the north of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. The restless dead there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[3083]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, they keep to the west. {P|leper gnomes} The leper gnomes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the leper gnomes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|leper gnomes}"}
L[3084]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, they keep to the west. {P|leper gnomes} The leper gnomes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nOur correspondents report it among the leper gnomes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|leper gnomes}"}
L[3087]={A="{K|6}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} The folk of the snowfields of Dun Morogh have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{K|6}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
