L[3107]={A="{W|16} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{W|16} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
