L[3163]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the skeletons, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it. {P|skeletons}",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is the north of the blighted glades of Tirisfal that rewards the search. {P|skeletons} The skeletons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[3164]={A="{I|Discolored Worg Heart}\nIt is carried by the wolves, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it. {B|wolves}",H="{I|Discolored Worg Heart}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} {B|wolves} Nearly every one of the wolves carries one."}
