L[3181]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} The other place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. {B|crocolisks} It is found on almost all of the crocolisks.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIts source is the Wailing Caverns, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Wailing Caverns} {B|crocolisks} It is the crocolisks of the Wailing Caverns who have it about them."}
L[3182]="{I|Spider's Silk}\nHunters find it most readily in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {B|spiders} A good share of the spiders carry it."
L[3183]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, they keep to the north-east. {B|bears} The bears there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the bears in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|bears}"}
L[3184]={A="{W|15} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{W|15} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[3185]="{W|10} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[3186]="{W|7} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[3187]="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[3188]={A="{W|8} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the north. A good share of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|8} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[3189]={A="{W|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. It is a very rare find among the wild beasts there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[3190]={A="{W|5} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is found as readily in the woods of Elwynn. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|5} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is found as readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."}
L[3191]="{W|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} The rank and file of Shadowfang Keep have it about them."
L[3192]={A="{W|8} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it.",H="{W|8} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. One of the wild beasts there in a score or so carries it."}
L[3193]={A="{W|5} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} {P|orcs} Within, it is the orcs who carry it.",H="{W|5} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {P|orcs} A good share of the orcs carry it."}
L[3194]="{W|5} {Q|3.0} {L|1}\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[3195]={A="{W|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3196]={A="{W|8} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|8} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3197]="{W|8} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[3198]={A="{W|5} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|5} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3199]={A="{W|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3200]="{A|2} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 8-10 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[3201]="{W|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[3202]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3203]="{W|5} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 24-31, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[3204]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the south-east of the farmland of Hillsbrad. {P|gnolls} Only occasionally does one of the gnolls carry it."
L[3205]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[3206]="{W|8} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[3207]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3208]="{W|5} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nThe place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} The other place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[3209]={A="{W|8} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is given in thanks by those in the marshes of the Wetlands whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{W|8} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3210]="{W|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[3211]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3212]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Look to the north of the Stonetalon Mountains. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the south of the savannah of the Barrens. It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
L[3213]={A="{A|3} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|3} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[3214]={A="{A|3} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|3} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it."}
L[3216]={A="{A|1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is given in thanks by those in the snowfields of Dun Morogh whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3217]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is given in thanks by those in the loch country of Loch Modan whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3218]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Within the grey woods of Silverpine, they keep to the south. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[3220]={A="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Bear Meat, Boar Intestines and Spider Ichor. A cook of middling skill (around 60) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest in Loch Modan.",H="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Bear Meat, Boar Intestines and Spider Ichor. A cook of middling skill (around 60) can attempt it. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[3223]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, they keep to the west. A good share of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[3224]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Look to the west of the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {B|wolves} It is found on almost all of the wolves.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the wolves, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|wolves}"}
L[3225]={A="{W|15} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Look to the middle of the snowfields of Dun Morogh. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them.",H="{W|15} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[3227]={A="{W|10} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} {B|wolves} Perhaps one in four of the wolves has one about them.",H="{W|10} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the wolves in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|wolves}"}
L[3228]="{A|3} {Q|3.0} {L|2} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Stockade. {D|The Stockade} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[3229]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is the north of the red hills around Lake Everstill that rewards the search. {B|spiders} A good share of the spiders carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the spiders in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|spiders}"}
L[3230]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt comes out of Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[3231]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Within the ash plains of the Burning Steppes, they keep to the south-east. It is found as readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Within the ash plains of the Burning Steppes, they keep to the south-east. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one."}
L[3233]={A="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is the east of the woods of Elwynn that rewards the search. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[3235]={A="{J|11} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{J|11} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} It is given in thanks by those in the grey woods of Silverpine whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
L[3236]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the zombies in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|zombies}",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Look to the north-east of the grey woods of Silverpine. {P|zombies} The zombies there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[3239]="{R|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Rough Stone and Linen Cloth."
L[3240]={A="{R|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Coarse Stone and Wool Cloth. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 65. It is also awarded for completing a quest.",H="{R|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Coarse Stone and Wool Cloth. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 65. It is also awarded for a quest in Silverpine Forest."}
L[3241]="{R|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Heavy Stone and Wool Cloth. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 125) can attempt it."
L[3248]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} It is given in thanks by those in the dark woods of Duskwood whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3251]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} The folk of the grey woods of Silverpine have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[3253]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is carried by the bears, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it. {B|bears}",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} It is the north of the grey woods of Silverpine that rewards the search. {B|bears} The bears there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
