L[3255]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is taken from a Berard's Bookshelf.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Look to the south of the grey woods of Silverpine. It is taken from a Berard's Bookshelf in the grey woods of Silverpine."}
L[3256]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Within the Alterac Mountains, they keep to the west. The elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Within the grey woods of Silverpine, they keep to the north-east. The elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
