L[3264]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nOur correspondents report it among the bats in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|bats}",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is the south-west of the blighted glades of Tirisfal that rewards the search. {B|bats} The bats there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[3265]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the wolves in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|wolves}",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is the west of the blighted glades of Tirisfal that rewards the search. {B|wolves} The wolves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[3266]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|1}\nIt is carried by the Scarlet Crusaders, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it. {P|Scarlet Crusaders}",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the south-west of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {P|Scarlet Crusaders} The Scarlet Crusaders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[3267]={A="{W|7} {C|10}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{W|7} {C|10}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The folk of the blighted glades of Tirisfal have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[3268]={A="{W|15} {C|10}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{W|15} {C|10}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is given in thanks by those in the blighted glades of Tirisfal whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
