L[3279]={A="{A|3} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{A|3} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. Only occasionally does one of the wild beasts there carry it."}
L[3280]="{A|3} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 8-11 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[3281]={A="{A|3} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|3} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. It is found as readily in the plains of Mulgore. Only occasionally does one of the wild beasts there carry it."}
L[3282]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. One of the wild beasts there in a score or so carries it."}
L[3283]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It turns up on the wild beasts there now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[3284]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. Only occasionally does one of the wild beasts there carry it."}
L[3285]={A="{A|2} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|2} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is the north of the plains of Mulgore that rewards the search. The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. It is a rare find among the wild beasts there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
