L[3297]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|19}\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Within the boughs of Teldrassil, they keep to the heart of the land. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|19}\nOur correspondents report it among the demons in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[3299]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {B|wolves} It is found on almost all of the wolves.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} The other place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {B|wolves} Perhaps one in four of the wolves has one about them."}
L[3300]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} {B|wolves} A good share of the wolves carry it. It is also awarded for a quest in Elwynn Forest.",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is found as readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {B|wolves} Nearly every one of the wolves carries one. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[3301]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the dark woods of Duskwood. {B|wolves} Nearly every one of the wolves carries one.",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} {B|hyenas} Nearly every one of the hyenas carries one."}
L[3302]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
