L[3324]="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} Those who have a stake in Shadowfang Keep give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[3325]={A="{W|1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="{W|1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the north of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in a score or so carries it."}
L[3327]={A="{W|10} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the murlocs in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|murlocs}",H="{W|10} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Within the blighted glades of Tirisfal, they keep to the north. {P|murlocs} It turns up on the murlocs now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[3328]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the spiders in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|spiders}",H="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is the east of the blighted glades of Tirisfal that rewards the search. {B|spiders} One of the spiders in a score or so carries it."}
L[3329]={A="{W|4} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="{W|4} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the north of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. One of the restless dead in a score or so carries it."}
L[3330]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the north of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is a rare find among the restless dead; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3331]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the soldiers and mercenaries, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it. {P|soldiers and mercenaries}",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Within the blighted glades of Tirisfal, they keep to the north-east. {P|soldiers and mercenaries} It turns up on the soldiers and mercenaries now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[3332]={A="{A|3} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the soldiers and mercenaries in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|soldiers and mercenaries}",H="{A|3} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the south of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {P|soldiers and mercenaries} One of the soldiers and mercenaries in a score or so carries it."}
L[3334]={A="{W|5} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the townsfolk and militia in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|townsfolk and militia}",H="{W|5} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Within the blighted glades of Tirisfal, they keep to the west. {P|townsfolk and militia} A good share of the townsfolk and militia carry it."}
L[3335]={A="{W|10} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="{W|10} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Within the blighted glades of Tirisfal, they keep to the west. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in a score or so carries it."}
L[3336]="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the south-east of the farmland of Hillsbrad. {P|murlocs} It is a rare find among the murlocs; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[3337]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Look to the middle of the marshes of the Wetlands. {P|bandits} The bandits and Dragonmaw orcs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the bandits and Dragonmaw orcs in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|bandits}"}
L[3340]={A="{I|Incendicite Ore}\nMiners know it from the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, the veins keep to the heart of the land. It comes out of the incendicite mineral veins in the marshes of the Wetlands, under the miner's pick.",H="{I|Incendicite Ore}\nMiners strike it in the incendicite mineral veins."}
L[3341]="{A|3} {C|35} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is the west of the Arathi Highlands that rewards the search. {P|ogres} One of the ogres in many hundreds carries it."
L[3342]={A="{J|4} {Q|1.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is given in thanks by those in the fallow farmland of Westfall whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{J|4} {Q|1.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3343]={A="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The folk of the fallow farmland of Westfall have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3344]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is given in thanks by those in the fallow farmland of Westfall whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3345]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThe place to look is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is the south-west of the Arathi Highlands that rewards the search. {P|Syndicate rogues} Only occasionally does one of the Syndicate rogues carry it."
L[3348]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the north-west. {B|crocolisks} The crocolisks there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nOur correspondents report it among the crocolisks in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|crocolisks}"}
L[3349]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is the north of the marshes of the Wetlands that rewards the search. {P|oozes and slimes} The oozes and slimes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the oozes and slimes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|oozes and slimes}"}
L[3352]={A="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is given in thanks by those in the marshes of the Wetlands whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3354]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|47}\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the north-west. {P|Dalaran wizards} The Dalaran wizards there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|47}\nThe place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Within the grey woods of Silverpine, they keep to the south. {P|Dalaran wizards} The Dalaran wizards there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[3355]={A="{I|Wild Steelbloom}\nHerbalists know it from the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. Herbalists gather it in the jungles of Stranglethorn, where it grows thickest. It is also sold by merchants in Stormwind City, southern Elwynn Forest and elsewhere (limited stock).",H="{I|Wild Steelbloom}\nHerbalists know it from the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. Herbalists gather it in the jungles of Stranglethorn, where it grows thickest. It is also sold by merchants in central Stonetalon Mountains, central Thousand Needles and elsewhere (limited stock)."}
L[3356]={A="{I|Kingsblood}\nHerbalists know it from the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the north of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is also sold by merchants in Stormwind City, southern Elwynn Forest and elsewhere (limited stock).",H="{I|Kingsblood}\nHerbalists know it from the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the north of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is also sold by merchants in central Stonetalon Mountains, central Thousand Needles and elsewhere (limited stock)."}
L[3357]={A="{I|Liferoot}\nHerbalists know it from the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is found as readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is also sold by merchants in Stormwind City, southern Elwynn Forest and elsewhere (limited stock).",H="{I|Liferoot}\nHerbalists know it from the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is found as readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is also sold by merchants in central Stonetalon Mountains, central Thousand Needles and elsewhere (limited stock)."}
L[3358]="{I|Khadgar's Whisker}\nHerbalists know it from the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} The other place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is also sold by a Darkmoon Faire vendor in western Mulgore (limited stock)."
L[3360]="{J|23} {Q|1.0} {L|2}\nIt is found on almost all of the restless dead."
L[3363]={A="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is found as readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[3365]={A="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} The other place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[3369]={A="{I|Grave Moss}\nHerbalists know it from the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the dark woods of Duskwood. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the grey wastes of Desolace.",H="{I|Grave Moss}\nHerbalists know it from the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the Scarlet Monastery. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the grey wastes of Desolace."}
L[3370]="{A|1} {Q|0.1} {L|0}\nIt is found inside a Battered Chest, and nowhere else in particular."
L[3371]={A="{I|Empty Vial}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{I|Empty Vial}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[3372]={A="{I|Leaded Vial}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{I|Leaded Vial}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[3373]="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nIt is found inside a Battered Chest, and nowhere else in particular."
L[3374]="{A|1} {Q|0.1} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 10-16 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[3375]="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 10-16 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[3376]="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|1}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 15-21, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[3377]="{A|1} {Q|0.1} {L|1}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 15-21, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[3378]="{A|1} {Q|0.1} {L|1}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 20-26, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[3379]="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|1}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 20-26, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[3380]="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|2}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 25-40 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[3381]="{A|1} {Q|0.1} {L|2}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 25-40, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[3382]={A="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Peacebloom, Earthroot and Empty Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 15. It is also awarded for completing a quest.",H="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Peacebloom, Earthroot and Empty Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 15. It is also awarded for a quest in Tirisfal Glades."}
L[3383]="{K|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Mageroyal, Briarthorn and Empty Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 90) can attempt it."
L[3384]="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Mageroyal, Wild Steelbloom and Empty Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 110) can attempt it."
L[3385]={A="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Mageroyal, Stranglekelp and Empty Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 120. It is also sold by merchants in Duskwood, Stormwind City and elsewhere (limited stock).",H="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Mageroyal, Stranglekelp and Empty Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 120. It is also sold by merchants in Duskwood, central Stonetalon Mountains and elsewhere (limited stock)."}
L[3386]="{K|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Large Venom Sac, Bruiseweed and Leaded Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 120) can attempt it."
L[3387]="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Blindweed, Ghost Mushroom and Crystal Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 250."
L[3388]="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Bruiseweed, Briarthorn and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 125."
L[3389]="{K|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Wild Steelbloom, Stranglekelp and Leaded Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 130) can attempt it."
L[3390]="{K|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Wild Steelbloom, Swiftthistle and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 140."
L[3391]="{K|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Earthroot, Kingsblood and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 150."
L[3392]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Look to the middle of the marshes of the Wetlands. A good share of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[3393]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Minor Magic Resistance Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 110 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 16-29, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[3394]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Elixir of Poison Resistance. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 120) can follow it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 16-29, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[3395]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Limited Invulnerability Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 250 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 42-55, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[3396]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Elixir of Lesser Agility. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 140) can follow it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 21-34, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[3397]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} {B|crocolisks} The crocolisks there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the crocolisks, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|crocolisks}"}
L[3399]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {B|carrion birds} A good share of the carrion birds carry it.",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Within the mesas of Thousand Needles, they keep to the south-east. {B|carrion birds} A good share of the carrion birds carry it."}
L[3400]="{W|7} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Stockade. {D|The Stockade} Those who have a stake in the Stockade give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[3401]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} The other place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. {B|crocolisks} Nearly every one of the crocolisks carries one.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIts source is the Wailing Caverns, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Wailing Caverns} {B|crocolisks} It is the crocolisks of the Wailing Caverns who have it about them."}
L[3402]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nThe place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {B|hyenas} It is found on almost all of the hyenas."
L[3403]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Within the Blasted Lands, they keep to the heart of the land. It is found as readily in Razorfen Kraul. {B|boars} It is found on almost all of the boars."
L[3404]="{I|Buzzard Wing}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {B|carrion birds} Nearly every one of the carrion birds carries one."
L[3405]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Within the boughs of Teldrassil, the caches keep to the heart of the land. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the boughs of Teldrassil: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[3406]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Within the boughs of Teldrassil, the caches keep to the heart of the land. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the boughs of Teldrassil: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[3407]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is the south of the boughs of Teldrassil that rewards the search. Chests and strongboxes in the boughs of Teldrassil hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[3408]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Look to the middle of the boughs of Teldrassil. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the boughs of Teldrassil: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[3409]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} {B|great cats} The great cats there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the great cats in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|great cats}"}
L[3411]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} {B|owls} The owls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nOur correspondents report it among the owls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|owls}"}
L[3412]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} {B|spiders} The spiders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is carried by the spiders, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|spiders}"}
L[3413]="{W|15} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nIt comes out of Blackfathom Deeps. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} The rank and file of Blackfathom Deeps have it about them."
L[3414]="{W|4} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nIts source is Blackfathom Deeps, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} The rank and file of Blackfathom Deeps have it about them."
L[3415]="{W|10} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nIts source is Blackfathom Deeps, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[3416]="{A|3} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nIt comes out of Blackfathom Deeps. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[3417]="{W|8} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nIt comes out of Blackfathom Deeps. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[3418]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|19}\nIt is found in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Look to the south of the boughs of Teldrassil. It is taken from a Fel Cone in the boughs of Teldrassil.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|19}\nIt is taken from a Fel Cone."}
