L[3426]={A="{J|4} {Q|1.1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|clothiers} {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it.",H="{J|4} {Q|1.1}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
