L[3429]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the east of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
L[3430]="{W|3} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[3431]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} The folk of the red hills around Lake Everstill have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3434]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is given in thanks by those in the blighted glades of Tirisfal whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
