L[3463]="{W|16} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is given in thanks by those in the grey wastes of Desolace whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[3464]="Ammunition for the hunters' bows and guns, sold by every bowyer and gunsmith and made by the engineers.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The folk of the grey wastes of Desolace have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[3465]="Ammunition for the hunters' bows and guns, sold by every bowyer and gunsmith and made by the engineers.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The folk of the grey wastes of Desolace have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[3466]={A="{I|Strong Flux}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also commonly carried by Dalaran wizards of north-western Hillsbrad Foothills.",H="{I|Strong Flux}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also commonly carried by Dalaran wizards of north-western Hillsbrad Foothills and south-eastern Silverpine Forest."}
L[3467]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the east of the farmland of Hillsbrad. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3469]="{A|3} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Copper Bar. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 20."
L[3470]="{R|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Rough Stone. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 25."
L[3471]="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} This one is worked from Copper Bar, Malachite and Rough Grinding Stone. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 35) can attempt it."
L[3472]="{A|3} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} Its making calls for Copper Bar and Rough Grinding Stone. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 40) can attempt it."
