L[3485]="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Iron Bar, Small Lustrous Pearl and Coarse Grinding Stone. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 150) can attempt it."
