L[3499]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the east of the farmland of Hillsbrad. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
