L[3505]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Within the Alterac Mountains, they keep to the north. {P|Syndicate rogues} The Syndicate rogues there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3509]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the south of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. {P|murlocs} The murlocs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3510]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the south-west. {P|murlocs} The murlocs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
