L[3514]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Look to the north-west of the dark woods of Duskwood. The restless dead there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[3515]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the north-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. {P|spellcasters} The spellcasters there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the north-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. {P|spellcasters} The spellcasters there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[3516]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the city of Stormwind. {Z|Stormwind City} Look to the north-east of the city of Stormwind. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[3517]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the south-east. It is found as readily in the Arathi Highlands. It is taken from a Keg of Shindigger Stout in the farmland of Hillsbrad."
L[3530]="{K|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|129} Its making calls for Wool Cloth. A field medic of middling skill (around 80) can attempt it."
L[3531]="{K|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|129} Its making calls for Wool Cloth. It is first attempted at a First Aid skill of about 115."
L[3550]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Within the Alterac Mountains, they keep to the heart of the land. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3551]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Within the Alterac Mountains, they keep to the heart of the land. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3552]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Look to the middle of the Alterac Mountains. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3553]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Look to the west of the Alterac Mountains. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3554]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} It is the west of the Alterac Mountains that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3555]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} The folk of the red hills around Lake Everstill have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
