L[3563]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Look to the north of the loch country of Loch Modan. {B|crocolisks} It is found on almost all of the crocolisks.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the crocolisks, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|crocolisks}"}
