L[3608]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Mighty Iron Hammer. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 145) can follow it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 21-34, and no two finders agree where to look."
