L[3626]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Within the Alterac Mountains, they keep to the north. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3627]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, they keep to the east. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[3628]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt comes out of the Stockade. {D|The Stockade} The rank and file of the Stockade have it about them."
L[3629]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Look to the north-east of the dark woods of Duskwood. The restless dead there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[3630]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt comes out of the Stockade. {D|The Stockade} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[3631]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the west of the red hills around Lake Everstill. {B|boars} The boars there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is carried by the boars, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|boars}"}
L[3632]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the north-east of the red hills around Lake Everstill. {P|soldiers and mercenaries} The soldiers and mercenaries there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the soldiers and mercenaries in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|soldiers and mercenaries}"}
L[3633]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[3634]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Look to the middle of the grey woods of Silverpine. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[3635]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the restless dead in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Within the blighted glades of Tirisfal, they keep to the north. The restless dead there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[3637]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts source is the Deadmines, and nowhere in the open world. {D|The Deadmines} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[3638]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is the west of the marshes of the Wetlands that rewards the search. {B|raptors} The raptors there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the raptors in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|raptors}"}
L[3639]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the north-east. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[3640]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt comes out of the Stockade. {D|The Stockade} The rank and file of the Stockade have it about them."
L[3641]="{A|1} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 8-10 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[3642]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Within the boughs of Teldrassil, they keep to the west. The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Within the plains of Mulgore, they keep to the north. The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. It is a rare find among the wild beasts there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3643]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is found as readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. A good share of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."}
L[3644]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the wild beasts there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3645]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[3647]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3649]={A="{A|6} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|6} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. Only occasionally does one of the wild beasts there carry it."}
L[3650]={A="{A|6} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|6} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Look to the north of the plains of Mulgore. It is found as readily in the red desert of Durotar. It is a rare find among the wild beasts there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3651]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
