L[3653]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[3654]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[3655]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[3656]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Look to the north of the Stonetalon Mountains. The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the south of the savannah of the Barrens. The other place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
L[3657]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the west. It is taken from a Hillsbrad Town Registry in the farmland of Hillsbrad."
L[3658]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Within the Alterac Mountains, they keep to the heart of the land. {P|ogres} The ogres there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3659]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Within the Alterac Mountains, they keep to the heart of the land. It is taken from a Weathered Bookcase in the Alterac Mountains."
L[3661]="{W|10} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIt is issued to new adventurers as they set out, and most are glad to be rid of it by the second town."
L[3662]="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} Its making calls for Crocolisk Meat and Mild Spices. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 80."
L[3663]={A="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} Its making calls for Murloc Fin and Hot Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 90) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest in Redridge Mountains.",H="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} Its making calls for Murloc Fin and Hot Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 90) can attempt it. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[3664]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Tender Crocolisk Meat and Hot Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 120) can attempt it."
L[3665]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} This one is worked from Raptor Egg and Hot Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 130) can attempt it."
L[3666]="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} Its making calls for Gooey Spider Leg and Hot Spices. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 110."
L[3667]="{I|Tender Crocolisk Meat}\nThe place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} {B|crocolisks} Nearly every one of the crocolisks carries one."
L[3668]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there."
L[3669]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nThe place to look is Maraudon. {D|Maraudon} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. Nearly every one of the wild beasts there carries one. It is also found inside containers such as Un'Goro Tested Sample and Corrupt Tested Sample."
L[3670]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nHunters find it most readily in the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} Within the Hinterlands, they keep to the heart of the land. It is found as readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {P|oozes and slimes} It is found on almost all of the oozes and slimes. It is also found inside containers such as Corrupt Tested Sample and Un'Goro Tested Sample."
L[3671]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the heart of the land. It is found as readily in the Hinterlands. {P|oozes and slimes} Perhaps one in four of the oozes and slimes has one about them. It is also found inside containers such as Corrupt Tested Sample and Un'Goro Tested Sample."
L[3672]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} It is the north of the Alterac Mountains that rewards the search. {P|naga} The naga there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3673]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nThe place to look is the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} Look to the middle of the Hinterlands. It is found as readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {P|oozes and slimes} Nearly every one of the oozes and slimes carries one. It is also found inside containers such as Un'Goro Tested Sample and Corrupt Tested Sample."
L[3674]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} Within the Hinterlands, they keep to the heart of the land. It is found as readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {P|oozes and slimes} Nearly every one of the oozes and slimes carries one. It is also found inside containers such as Un'Goro Tested Sample and Corrupt Tested Sample."
L[3676]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is Maraudon. {D|Maraudon} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. It is found on almost all of the wild beasts there. It is also found inside containers such as Corrupt Tested Sample and Un'Goro Tested Sample."
L[3678]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Crocolisk Steak. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 80) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. It is also awarded for a quest in Loch Modan.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Crocolisk Steak. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 80) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3679]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Blood Sausage. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 60) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. It is also awarded for a quest in Loch Modan.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Blood Sausage. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 60) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3680]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Murloc Fin Soup. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 90) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. It is also awarded for a quest in Redridge Mountains.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Murloc Fin Soup. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 90) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3681]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Crocolisk Gumbo. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 120 of a cook who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. It is also awarded for a quest in Wetlands.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Crocolisk Gumbo. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 120 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3682]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Curiously Tasty Omelet. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 130) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. It is also awarded for a quest in Wetlands.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Curiously Tasty Omelet. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 130) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the Arathi Highlands stock it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[3683]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Gooey Spider Cake. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 110) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. It is also awarded for a quest in Duskwood.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Gooey Spider Cake. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 110) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[3684]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Look to the west of the Alterac Mountains. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3685]={A="{I|Raptor Egg}\nThe place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} The other place to look is the Arathi Highlands. {B|raptors} It is found on almost all of the raptors.",H="{I|Raptor Egg}\nThe place to look is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} {B|raptors} It is found on almost all of the raptors."}
L[3688]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the north-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. The other place to look is the Alterac Mountains. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3689]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the north-west. It is found as readily in the Alterac Mountains. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3690]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the north-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad. The other place to look is the Alterac Mountains. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3691]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the north-west. It is found as readily in the Alterac Mountains. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3692]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The townsfolk and militia and Syndicate rogues there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3693]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the south-east of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. The other place to look is the Arathi Highlands. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3702]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {B|bears} A good share of the bears carry it."
L[3703]={A="{K|6}\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the north. The other place to look is the Alterac Mountains. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="{K|6}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|innkeepers} {Z|Alterac Mountains} Merchants in the Alterac Mountains and the farmland of Hillsbrad stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. It is also commonly carried by humanoid foes of northern Hillsbrad Foothills and southern Alterac Mountains."}
L[3704]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nHunters find it most readily in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Within the Alterac Mountains, they keep to the east. It is found as readily in the Western Plaguelands. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3706]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} It is the north of the Alterac Mountains that rewards the search. Chests and strongboxes in the Alterac Mountains hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[3708]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Look to the south of the Alterac Mountains. The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3711]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the north-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad. The other place to look is the Alterac Mountains. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one."
L[3712]="{I|Turtle Meat}\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Look to the north of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {B|turtles} It is found on almost all of the turtles."
L[3713]={A="{I|Soothing Spices}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{I|Soothing Spices}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[3714]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Look to the south-west of the Alterac Mountains. The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {P|Dalaran wizards} The Dalaran wizards there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3715]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Within the Alterac Mountains, they keep to the south-west. It is found as readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. The elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3716]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|38}\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the south-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. {P|murlocs} The murlocs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3719]="{A|1} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Heavy Leather and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 150."
L[3720]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} It is the south-west of the Alterac Mountains that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3722]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Within the red hills around Lake Everstill, they keep to the east. Perhaps one in four of the demons has one about them.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the demons in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[3723]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill. Perhaps one in four of the demons has one about them.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIt is carried by the demons, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[3724]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill. Perhaps one in four of the demons has one about them.",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIt is carried by the demons, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[3725]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nThe place to look is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill that rewards the search. A good share of the demons carry it.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the demons in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[3726]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} This one is worked from Big Bear Meat and Hot Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 110) can attempt it."
L[3727]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Lion Meat and Hot Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 125) can attempt it."
L[3728]="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} Its making calls for Lion Meat and Soothing Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 150) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest in Hillsbrad Foothills."
L[3729]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} This one is worked from Turtle Meat and Soothing Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 175) can attempt it. It is also awarded by quests in Hillsbrad Foothills."
L[3730]="{I|Big Bear Meat}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {B|bears} It is found on almost all of the bears."
L[3731]="{I|Lion Meat}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The other place to look is the Alterac Mountains. {B|great cats} It is found on almost all of the great cats."
L[3732]="{A|1} {Q|1.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The folk of the farmland of Hillsbrad have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[3733]="{A|3} {C|7} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The folk of the farmland of Hillsbrad have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[3734]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Big Bear Steak. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 110) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Ashenvale} Merchants in the ancient forest of Ashenvale and the grey wastes of Desolace stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also awarded for a quest in Hillsbrad Foothills.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Big Bear Steak. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 110) can follow it.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is given in thanks by those in the farmland of Hillsbrad whose troubles an adventurer takes on. It is also sold by a merchant in southern Desolace (limited stock)."}
L[3735]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Hot Lion Chops. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 125 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The folk of the farmland of Hillsbrad have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks. It is also sold by a merchant in central Desolace (limited stock).",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Hot Lion Chops. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 125 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|The Barrens} Merchants in the savannah of the Barrens and the grey wastes of Desolace stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also awarded for a quest in Hillsbrad Foothills."}
L[3736]="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Tasty Lion Steak. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 150 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The folk of the farmland of Hillsbrad have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[3737]="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Soothing Turtle Bisque. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The folk of the farmland of Hillsbrad have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[3739]="{J|11} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is given in thanks by those in the farmland of Hillsbrad whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[3740]={A="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
