L[3766]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers. {C|28}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Within the Alterac Mountains, the caches keep to the south-west. It is found as readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the Alterac Mountains: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
L[3767]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Within the Alterac Mountains, the caches keep to the south-west. The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. Chests and strongboxes in the Alterac Mountains hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
