L[3770]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also sometimes found on humanoid foes of levels 21-29, most plentifully in north-western Thousand Needles and Wetlands.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also sometimes found on humanoid foes of levels 23-29, most plentifully in north-western Thousand Needles and Ashenvale."}
L[3771]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also sometimes found on humanoid foes of levels 30-40, most plentifully in Desolace and north-western Stranglethorn Vale.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also sometimes found on humanoid foes of levels 30-40, most plentifully in Desolace and north-western Stranglethorn Vale."}
L[3772]="{K|6}\nIt is conjured by mages out of nothing, as they conjure bread and water, and vanishes when its maker is long gone."
L[3775]="{K|9}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|40} Its making calls for Essence of Pain and Empty Vial. A rogue of middling skill (around 1) can attempt it. It is also sold by a reagent vendor."
L[3776]="{K|9}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|40} This one is worked from Essence of Agony and Crystal Vial. Only a rogue of real accomplishment (skill around 230) can attempt it. It is also sold by a cool guy."
L[3777]={A="{R|12}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{R|12}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[3778]="{W|2} {Q|0.1} {L|2}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the Scarlet Monastery: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
L[3779]="{W|1} {Q|0.1} {L|2}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. Chests and strongboxes in the Scarlet Monastery hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[3780]="{W|3} {Q|0.1} {L|2}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. Chests and strongboxes in the Scarlet Monastery hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[3781]="{W|8} {Q|0.1} {L|2}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. Chests and strongboxes in the Scarlet Monastery hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[3782]="{W|5} {Q|0.1} {L|2}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the Scarlet Monastery: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
L[3783]="{W|7} {Q|0.1} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[3784]="{W|10} {Q|0.0} {L|3}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[3785]="{W|0} {Q|0.1} {L|3}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 31-40, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[3786]="{W|15} {Q|0.0} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[3787]="{W|4} {Q|0.0} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[3792]="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[3793]="{A|1} {Q|0.1} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it."
L[3794]="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|3}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 31-40 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
