L[3816]="{A|6} {Q|0.1} {L|3}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 31-40 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[3817]="{A|6} {Q|0.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[3818]="{I|Fadeleaf}\nHerbalists know it from the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. Herbalists gather it in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, where it grows thickest. It is also commonly carried by murlocs of levels 30-54, most plentifully in southern Hillsbrad Foothills and northern Un'Goro Crater."
L[3819]="{I|Wintersbite}\nHerbalists know it from the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Within the Alterac Mountains, the plants keep to the heart of the land. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the Alterac Mountains."
L[3820]={A="{I|Stranglekelp}\nHerbalists know it from the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} The other place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. Herbalists gather it in the jungles of Stranglethorn, where it grows thickest. It is also sometimes found on elementals of levels 43-59, most plentifully in Un'Goro Crater and Dire Maul.",H="{I|Stranglekelp}\nHerbalists know it from the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Herbalists gather it in the jungles of Stranglethorn, where it grows thickest. It is also sometimes found on elementals of levels 42-59, most plentifully in Un'Goro Crater and Dire Maul."}
L[3821]="{I|Goldthorn}\nHerbalists know it from the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, the plants keep to the north. It is found as readily in the rainforest of Feralas. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the jungles of Stranglethorn."
L[3822]="{W|8} {C|17} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is given in thanks by those in the farmland of Hillsbrad whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[3823]="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Fadeleaf, Wild Steelbloom and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 165."
L[3824]="{K|7}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Fadeleaf, Grave Moss and Leaded Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 165) can attempt it."
L[3825]="{K|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Wild Steelbloom, Goldthorn and Leaded Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 175) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest in Dustwallow Marsh."
L[3826]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Liferoot, Bruiseweed and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 180."
L[3827]="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Stranglekelp, Kingsblood and Leaded Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 160) can attempt it. It is also fished from waters across Azeroth, most readily from Stonemaul Ruins in Dustwallow Marsh."
L[3828]="{K|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Khadgar's Whisker, Fadeleaf and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 195."
L[3829]="{K|7}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Khadgar's Whisker, Wintersbite and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 200. It is also found inside containers such as Cenarion Circle Cache and Sturdy Junkbox."
L[3830]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Elixir of Fortitude. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 175 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 27-38 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[3831]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Mighty Troll's Blood Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 180 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 32-45, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[3832]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Elixir of Detect Lesser Invisibility. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 195 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 32-45 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
