L[3871]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Golden Scale Shoulders. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 175 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the south. {P|murlocs} Nearly every one of the murlocs carries one."
