L[3880]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north of the jungles of Stranglethorn. {B|great cats} The great cats there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3882]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nThe place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is the south-east of the loch country of Loch Modan that rewards the search. {B|carrion birds} Perhaps one in four of the carrion birds has one about them.",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nOur correspondents report it among the carrion birds in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|carrion birds}"}
L[3889]={A="{A|1} {L|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|cloth armor merchants} {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the jungles of Stranglethorn stock it. The shop is in the south of the land.",H="{A|1} {L|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|cloth & leather armor merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[3890]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|leather armor merchants} {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the boughs of Teldrassil stock it. The shop is in the south of the land.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|cloth & leather armor merchants} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the jungles of Stranglethorn stock it. The shop is in the east of the land."}
L[3891]={A="{A|3} {L|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|mail armor merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{A|3} {L|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|heavy armor merchants} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the plains of Mulgore stock it."}
