L[3902]={A="{W|10} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the south of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else.",H="{W|10} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
