L[3914]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is found as readily in the Arathi Highlands. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the jungles of Stranglethorn: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
