L[3920]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|29}\nIt is found in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the south-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is taken from Bloodsail Charts in the jungles of Stranglethorn."
