L[3924]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the west of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. The restless dead there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3925]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the west of the jungles of Stranglethorn. The restless dead there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
