L[3927]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also sometimes found on pirates of eastern Tanaris and south-western Stranglethorn Vale.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|innkeepers} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. It is also sometimes found on pirates of eastern Tanaris and south-western Stranglethorn Vale."}
L[3928]={A="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Sungrass, Khadgar's Whisker and Crystal Vial. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 215) can attempt it. It is also sold by alchemy suppliers in northern Winterspring, western Feralas and elsewhere (limited stock).",H="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Sungrass, Khadgar's Whisker and Crystal Vial. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 215) can attempt it. It is also sold by alchemy suppliers in central Swamp of Sorrows, northern Winterspring and elsewhere (limited stock)."}
L[3930]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north of the jungles of Stranglethorn. {P|trolls} The trolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3931]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Look to the east of the Stonetalon Mountains. {B|spiders} A good share of the spiders carry it."
L[3932]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, they keep to the south-west. The giants there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3935]="{W|7} {Q|1.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} The giants there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[3936]="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is found as readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[3937]="{A|1} {Q|0.1} {L|4}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is found as readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
