L[3943]="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|3}\nIt is found inside an Ironbound Locked Chest, and nowhere else in particular."
L[3944]="{A|1} {Q|0.1} {L|4}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 51-61, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[3945]="{A|1} {Q|0.1} {L|4}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} The other place to look is Stratholme. Chests and strongboxes in Blackrock Spire hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
