L[4036]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} It is the north of the Stonetalon Mountains that rewards the search. The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the south of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. The other place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
