L[4213]="A book.\nHunters find it most readily in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Look to the south of the Blasted Lands. {P|greater demons} It is a rare find among the greater demons; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[4231]="{R|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Light Hide and Salt. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 35."
L[4232]={A="{I|Medium Hide}\nSkinners know it from the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. It is cut from the beasts there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience.",H="{I|Medium Hide}\nSkinners know it from the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is cut from the beasts there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience."}
L[4233]="{R|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Medium Hide and Salt. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it."
L[4234]={A="{I|Heavy Leather}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Medium Leather. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 150) can attempt it. It is also skinned from beasts of levels 30-44 in Dustwallow Marsh and northern Stranglethorn Vale.",H="{I|Heavy Leather}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Medium Leather. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 150) can attempt it. It is also skinned from beasts of levels 31-44 in Dustwallow Marsh and northern Stranglethorn Vale."}
L[4235]="{I|Heavy Hide}\nSkinners know it from the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is found as readily in the desert of Tanaris. Skinners take it from the carcasses of the beasts there."
