L[4260]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Heavy Leather, Cured Heavy Hide and Silken Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 195."
L[4261]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the townsfolk and militia, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it. {P|townsfolk and militia}",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the middle of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {P|townsfolk and militia} It is found on almost all of the townsfolk and militia."}
L[4262]="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Cured Heavy Hide, Iridescent Pearl and Jade. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 185."
L[4263]={A="{A|6} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the Scarlet Crusaders in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|Scarlet Crusaders}",H="{A|6} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Within the blighted glades of Tirisfal, they keep to the north-east. {P|Scarlet Crusaders} One of the Scarlet Crusaders in a score or so carries it."}
L[4264]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Heavy Leather, Cured Heavy Hide and Coarse Gorilla Hair. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 200."
L[4265]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Heavy Leather and Fine Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 150) can attempt it. It is also often found on the humanoid foes of Uldaman."
L[4278]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nMiners know it from the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Within the Arathi Highlands, the veins keep to the north-east. Miners strike it in the bloodstone deposits in the Arathi Highlands."
L[4289]={A="{I|Salt}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{I|Salt}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[4290]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {P|earth elementals} Only occasionally does one of the earth elementals carry it.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the earth elementals, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|earth elementals}"}
L[4291]={A="{I|Silken Thread}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{I|Silken Thread}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[4292]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Green Woolen Bag. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 95 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 12-25 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[4293]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Hillman's Leather Vest. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 100 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Hillman's Leather Vest. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 100 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is a very rare find among the wild beasts there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[4294]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Hillman's Belt. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 120) can follow it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 16-29, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[4296]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Dark Leather Shoulders. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 140 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[4297]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Barbaric Gloves. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 150 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 21-34 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[4298]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Guardian Belt. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 170) can follow it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 28-37, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[4299]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Guardian Armor. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 26-39, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[4300]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Guardian Leather Bracers. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 195) can follow it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 32-45, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[4301]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Barbaric Belt. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 200) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."
L[4302]={A="{W|15} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="{W|15} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is the west of the blighted glades of Tirisfal that rewards the search. A good share of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."}
L[4303]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Within the blighted glades of Tirisfal, they keep to the north-east. A good share of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."}
L[4304]="{I|Thick Leather}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Heavy Leather. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 180. It is also skinned from beasts of levels 40-55 in Tanaris and Feralas."
L[4305]="{I|Bolt of Silk Cloth}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Silk Cloth. A tailor of middling skill (around 125) can attempt it. It is also found inside containers such as Iron Bound Trunk and Ironbound Locked Chest."
L[4306]="{I|Silk Cloth}\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is found as readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them. It is also found inside containers such as Hoard of the Black Dragonflight and Mysterious Lockbox."
