L[4337]="{I|Thick Spider's Silk}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} {B|spiders} Perhaps one in four of the spiders has one about them."
L[4338]="{I|Mageweave Cloth}\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is found as readily in the desert of Tanaris. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one. It is also awarded for a quest in Desolace."
