L[4355]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Icy Cloak. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 200) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} A merchant in the farmland of Hillsbrad stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Icy Cloak. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 200) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Merchants in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh and the savannah of the Barrens stock it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[4356]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Star Belt. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 200) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {P|Scarlet Crusaders} One of the Scarlet Crusaders and trolls in many hundreds carries it."
L[4357]="{I|Rough Blasting Powder}\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} This one is worked from Rough Stone. It is also sold by engineering suppliers in most settlements (limited stock)."
L[4358]="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} Its making calls for Rough Blasting Powder and Linen Cloth."
L[4359]={A="{I|Handful of Copper Bolts}\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} Its making calls for Copper Bar. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 30. It is also sometimes found on mechanical constructs of Westfall.",H="{I|Handful of Copper Bolts}\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} Its making calls for Copper Bar. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 30. It is also sometimes found on goblins of the Deadmines and eastern Stonetalon Mountains."}
