L[4402]="{I|Small Flame Sac}\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is the south of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh that rewards the search. {P|whelps} Perhaps one in four of the whelps has one about them."
