L[4408]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Mechanical Squirrel Box. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 75) can follow it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 6-19 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[4409]={A="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Small Seaforium Charge. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 100 of an engineer who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the north-west of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {B|stags} Only occasionally does one of the stags carry it.",H="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Small Seaforium Charge. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 100 of an engineer who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the north-west of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {B|stags} Only occasionally does one of the stags carry it."}
L[4410]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Shadow Goggles. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 120 of an engineer who attempts it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 16-29, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[4411]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Flame Deflector. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 125) can follow it.\nIt comes out of Gnomeregan. {D|Gnomeregan} {P|mechanical constructs} Within, it is the mechanical constructs who carry it."
L[4412]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Moonsight Rifle. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 145) can follow it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 21-34, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[4413]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Discombobulator Ray. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 160) can follow it.\nIts source is Gnomeregan, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Gnomeregan} {P|mechanical constructs} Within, it is the mechanical constructs who carry it."
L[4414]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Portable Bronze Mortar. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 165) can follow it.\nIt is found inside a Reinforced Locked Chest, and nowhere else in particular."
L[4415]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Craftsman's Monocle. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 185 of an engineer who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} The other place to look is the Scarlet Monastery. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it."
L[4416]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Goblin Land Mine. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 195 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 32-45 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[4417]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Large Seaforium Charge. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 200 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 32-45 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[4419]="{K|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|Darkmoon Faire vendors} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also found inside containers such as Box of Spells and Ahn'Qiraj War Effort Supplies."
L[4421]="{K|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|merchants} {Z|Desolace} Merchants in the grey wastes of Desolace and the woods of Elwynn stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also sometimes found on humanoid foes of levels 37-45, most plentifully in Feralas and Stranglethorn Vale."
L[4422]={A="{K|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is found as readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. Nearly every one of the creatures of the region carries one. It is also sold by a Darkmoon Faire vendor in western Mulgore (limited stock).",H="{K|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|Darkmoon Faire vendors} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also sometimes found on humanoid foes of levels 42-51, most plentifully in Feralas and Tanaris."}
L[4424]="{K|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|merchants} {Z|Desolace} Merchants in the grey wastes of Desolace and the woods of Elwynn stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also found inside containers such as Box of Spells and Ahn'Qiraj War Effort Supplies."
L[4425]="{K|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|Darkmoon Faire vendors} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also found inside containers such as Ahn'Qiraj War Effort Supplies and Cenarion Circle Cache."
L[4426]="{K|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|Darkmoon Faire vendors} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also found inside containers such as Ahn'Qiraj War Effort Supplies and Box of Spells."
L[4428]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is found as readily in the dark woods of Duskwood. {B|spiders} Perhaps one in four of the spiders has one about them.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {B|spiders} Perhaps one in four of the spiders has one about them."}
L[4430]="{J|2} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The folk of the farmland of Hillsbrad have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[4433]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Look to the south of the Arathi Highlands. It is taken from a Waterlogged Letter in the Arathi Highlands."
L[4434]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the north. {P|mechanical constructs} Perhaps one in four of the mechanical constructs has one about them.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the mechanical constructs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|mechanical constructs}"}
L[4435]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Within the Arathi Highlands, they keep to the north-east. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4436]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the north-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. {P|Dalaran wizards} It is found on almost all of the Dalaran wizards.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the north-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. The other place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. {P|Dalaran wizards} Nearly every one of the Dalaran wizards carries one."}
L[4437]={A="{W|10} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the north-west. {P|Dalaran wizards} Perhaps one in four of the Dalaran wizards has one about them.",H="{W|10} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the north-west. The other place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. {P|Dalaran wizards} A good share of the Dalaran wizards carry it."}
L[4438]="{A|3} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nIts source is Razorfen Kraul, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Razorfen Kraul} {P|quilboar} Within, it is the quilboar who carry it."
L[4439]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the zombies in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|zombies}",H="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} It is the north-east of the grey woods of Silverpine that rewards the search. {P|zombies} Perhaps one in four of the zombies has one about them."}
L[4440]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Look to the south-west of the Arathi Highlands. {P|Syndicate rogues} The Syndicate rogues there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4443]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Undercity. {Z|Undercity} The folk of the Undercity have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[4444]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Look to the middle of the marshes of the Wetlands. {B|spiders} Nearly every one of the spiders carries one.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the spiders, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|spiders}"}
L[4445]={A="{W|0} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="{W|0} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Look to the north-east of the grey woods of Silverpine. A good share of the restless dead carry it."}
L[4446]={A="{W|15} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is the north-east of the red hills around Lake Everstill that rewards the search. A good share of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|15} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[4447]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Within the red hills around Lake Everstill, they keep to the north-east. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[4448]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Look to the east of the dark woods of Duskwood. {B|spiders} Nearly every one of the spiders carries one.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is carried by the spiders, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|spiders}"}
L[4449]={A="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} It is the east of the dark woods of Duskwood that rewards the search. {B|spiders} Nearly every one of the spiders carries one.",H="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is carried by the spiders, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|spiders}"}
L[4450]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Look to the west of the Arathi Highlands. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4454]={A="{W|15} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {B|carrion birds} A good share of the carrion birds carry it.",H="{W|15} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nIt is carried by the carrion birds, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|carrion birds}"}
L[4455]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Raptor Hide, Heavy Leather and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 165."
L[4456]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Raptor Hide, Heavy Leather and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 165."
L[4457]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} This one is worked from Buzzard Wing and Hot Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 175) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest in Badlands."
L[4458]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|11}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is the west of the Arathi Highlands that rewards the search. {P|orcs} The orcs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4459]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} It is the south-west of the sodden Swamp of Sorrows that rewards the search. {P|whelps} It turns up on the whelps now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[4460]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the south. It is found as readily in the Badlands. {P|whelps} It is found on almost all of the whelps."
L[4461]="{I|Raptor Hide}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is found as readily in the Arathi Highlands. {B|raptors} It is found on almost all of the raptors."
L[4462]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Look to the north-west of the dark woods of Duskwood. Nearly every one of the restless dead carries one.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[4463]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is the north-east of the marshes of the Wetlands that rewards the search. {B|raptors} A good share of the raptors carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nOur correspondents report it among the raptors in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|raptors}"}
L[4464]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Within the dark woods of Duskwood, they keep to the north-west. Nearly every one of the restless dead carries one.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nOur correspondents report it among the restless dead in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[4465]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Look to the north-west of the dark woods of Duskwood. Nearly every one of the restless dead carries one.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nOur correspondents report it among the restless dead in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[4466]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Look to the west of the Arathi Highlands. {P|trolls} The trolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
