L[4496]={A="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also sometimes found on a variety of creatures of levels 3-11, most plentifully in Teldrassil and Dun Morogh.",H="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also sometimes found on a variety of creatures of levels 3-10, most plentifully in Tirisfal Glades and Mulgore."}
L[4497]={A="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
