L[4551]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Look to the south-west of the Arathi Highlands. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4552]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. {P|earth elementals} It is found on almost all of the earth elementals."
L[4553]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nThe place to look is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} The other place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {P|earth elementals} A good share of the earth elementals carry it."
L[4554]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} It is found as readily in the Badlands. {P|earth elementals} Perhaps one in four of the earth elementals and gargoyles has one about them."
L[4555]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nThe place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the north. The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {B|turtles} It is found on almost all of the turtles."
L[4556]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nThe place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is the north of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh that rewards the search. The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {B|turtles} Nearly every one of the turtles carries one."
L[4557]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Look to the middle of the snows of Winterspring. The other place to look is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {P|whelps} It turns up on the whelps now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[4558]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} Within the jungle crater of Un'Goro, they keep to the north-east. {B|gorillas} A good share of the gorillas carry it."
L[4560]={A="{W|7} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{W|7} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Within the plains of Mulgore, they keep to the north. {B|carrion birds} One of the carrion birds in a score or so carries it."}
L[4561]="{W|0} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 6-14 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[4562]={A="{W|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the woods of Elwynn: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="{W|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is found as readily in the plains of Mulgore. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the red desert of Durotar: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[4563]={A="{W|4} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|4} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is the north of the plains of Mulgore that rewards the search. The other place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[4564]={A="{W|5} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it.",H="{W|5} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. One of the wild beasts there in a score or so carries it."}
L[4565]="{W|15} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants}"
L[4566]={A="{W|10} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{W|10} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. It turns up on the wild beasts there now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[4567]={A="{W|8} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|8} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
