L[4580]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nHunters find it most readily in the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, they keep to the north. The other place to look is Zul'Gurub. {B|great cats} Nearly every one of the great cats carries one."
L[4581]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nHunters find it most readily in the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Look to the north of the snows of Winterspring. The other place to look is Zul'Gurub. {B|great cats} Perhaps one in four of the great cats has one about them."
