L[4584]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nThe place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. {B|hyenas} Perhaps one in four of the hyenas and felhounds has one about them."
