L[4586]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} {B|raptors} A good share of the raptors carry it.",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {B|raptors} A good share of the raptors carry it."}
L[4587]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} It is the south-east of the jungle crater of Un'Goro that rewards the search. {B|raptors} Perhaps one in four of the raptors has one about them."
L[4588]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nThe place to look is the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} It is the east of the jungle crater of Un'Goro that rewards the search. {B|raptors} A good share of the raptors carry it."
L[4589]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} It is the west of the fallen coast of Azshara that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the Hinterlands. {B|hippogryphs} Nearly every one of the hippogryphs carries one."
L[4590]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nThe place to look is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} A good share of the wild beasts there carry it."
L[4591]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nHunters find it most readily in the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} Within the Hinterlands, they keep to the west. Nearly every one of the wild beasts there carries one."
L[4592]={A="{K|5}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also prepared by cooks (Cooking 50).",H="{K|5}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|innkeepers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also prepared by cooks (Cooking 50)."}
L[4593]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also prepared by cooks (Cooking 100).",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|innkeepers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also prepared by cooks (Cooking 100)."}
L[4594]={A="{K|5}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also prepared by cooks (Cooking 175).",H="{K|5}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|innkeepers} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also prepared by cooks (Cooking 175)."}
L[4595]="{K|6}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} A merchant in the jungles of Stranglethorn stocks it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. It is also often found on the humanoid foes of Dire Maul."
L[4596]={A="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Discolored Worg Heart, Peacebloom and Empty Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 50) can attempt it. It is also awarded for completing a quest.",H="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Discolored Worg Heart, Peacebloom and Empty Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 50) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest in Silverpine Forest."}
L[4597]={A="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Discolored Healing Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 50) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Discolored Healing Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 50) can follow it.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} The folk of the grey woods of Silverpine have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[4598]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} The folk of the jungles of Stranglethorn have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[4599]={A="{K|5}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also sometimes found on ogres and gnolls of levels 41-51, most plentifully in Feralas and Tanaris.",H="{K|5}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also sometimes found on ogres and gnolls of levels 41-51, most plentifully in Feralas and Tanaris."}
L[4600]={A="{K|6}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the Hinterlands stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land.",H="{K|6}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} A merchant in the jungles of Stranglethorn stocks it. The shop is in the south-west of the land."}
L[4601]={A="{K|5}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also sometimes found on humanoid foes of levels 42-48, most plentifully in Searing Gorge and southern Swamp of Sorrows.",H="{K|5}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also sometimes found on humanoid foes of levels 42-48, most plentifully in Searing Gorge and southern Swamp of Sorrows."}
L[4602]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also sometimes found on furbolg of levels 44-51, most plentifully in northern Azshara.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|smokywood pastures} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also sometimes found on furbolg of levels 44-51, most plentifully in northern Azshara."}
L[4603]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nAnglers know it from the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is fished from Beezil's Wreck in Dustwallow Marsh by anyone with a pole and the patience. It is also sometimes found on naga of levels 41-50, most plentifully in western Feralas and central Azshara."
L[4604]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} Merchants in the Eastern Plaguelands and the dark woods of Duskwood stock it. It is also commonly carried by the carnivorous plants of Wailing Caverns.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also commonly carried by carnivorous plants and zombies of Tirisfal Glades and Wailing Caverns."}
L[4605]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} Merchants in the Eastern Plaguelands and the dark woods of Duskwood stock it. It is also often found on the carnivorous plants of Wailing Caverns.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also often found on carnivorous plants of Wailing Caverns and northern Silverpine Forest."}
L[4606]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|smokywood pastures} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also often found on carnivorous plants of levels 19-52, most plentifully in Un'Goro Crater and Ashenvale.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also often found on carnivorous plants of levels 19-52, most plentifully in Un'Goro Crater and Ashenvale."}
L[4607]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|smokywood pastures} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also often found on carnivorous plants of levels 27-53, most plentifully in Un'Goro Crater.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also often found on carnivorous plants of levels 27-52, most plentifully in Un'Goro Crater."}
L[4608]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|smokywood pastures} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also often found on a variety of creatures of Dire Maul and Un'Goro Crater.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also often found on a variety of creatures of Dire Maul and Un'Goro Crater."}
L[4609]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Barbecued Buzzard Wing. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 175 of a cook who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Arathi Highlands} Merchants in the Arathi Highlands and the grey wastes of Desolace stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also awarded for a quest in Badlands.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Barbecued Buzzard Wing. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 175 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} The folk of the Badlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks. It is also sold by a merchant in southern Desolace (limited stock)."}
L[4610]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is the south-west of the loch country of Loch Modan that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the Badlands. It is taken from a Carved Stone Urn in the loch country of Loch Modan.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} It is the north of the Badlands that rewards the search. It is taken from a Carved Stone Urn in the Badlands."}
L[4611]="{I|Blue Pearl}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, the caches keep to the north-west. Chests and strongboxes in the jungles of Stranglethorn hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[4612]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} Within the Badlands, they keep to the east. {P|whelps} The whelps there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4613]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} Within the Badlands, they keep to the heart of the land. {B|carrion birds} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."
L[4614]="{J|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in a score or so carries it."
L[4615]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found on almost all of the dragonkin."
L[4616]="{W|14}\nHunters find it most readily in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} Within the Badlands, they keep to the north. {P|Dark Iron dwarves} The Dark Iron dwarves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4621]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} Look to the north of the Badlands. The elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4623]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Mithril Ore, Goldthorn and Leaded Vial. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 215) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest in Badlands."
L[4624]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Lesser Stoneshield Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 215) can follow it.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} It is given in thanks by those in the Badlands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[4625]="{I|Firebloom}\nHerbalists know it from the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is found as readily in the smoking Searing Gorge. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the desert of Tanaris."
L[4626]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} Look to the west of the Badlands. {P|earth elementals} The earth elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4627]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} {P|earth elementals} The earth elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4628]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} Within the Badlands, they keep to the south-west. The other place to look is the smoking Searing Gorge. {P|earth elementals} The earth elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4629]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} It is the north-east of the Badlands that rewards the search. Chests and strongboxes in the Badlands hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[4630]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} {P|ogres} The ogres there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4631]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} Look to the north of the Badlands. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the Badlands: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
L[4632]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Look to the middle of the mesas of Thousand Needles. The other place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Look to the middle of the mesas of Thousand Needles. The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[4633]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the south-east of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is found as readily in the mesas of Thousand Needles. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[4634]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[4635]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} Within the Badlands, they keep to the north. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4636]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is a rare find among the wild beasts there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[4637]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in a score or so carries it."
L[4638]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is found as readily in Maraudon. {P|insects} Only occasionally does one of the insects carry it."
L[4639]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Look to the north of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {P|murlocs} One of the murlocs in a score or so carries it.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Look to the north of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {P|murlocs} It turns up on the murlocs now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[4640]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} It is the south-west of the Badlands that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4641]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is the north of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the east of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[4643]="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} Those who have a stake in the Scarlet Monastery give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[4644]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the middle of the jungles of Stranglethorn. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4645]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found on almost all of the dragonkin."
L[4646]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Look to the west of the Alterac Mountains. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[4652]="{A|6} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} The folk of the Badlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[4653]="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} It is given in thanks by those in the Badlands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[4655]="{I|Giant Clam Meat}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the jungles of Stranglethorn: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
L[4656]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThe place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the east of the woods of Elwynn. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one. It is also awarded by quests in Westfall and Elwynn Forest.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[4658]="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 8-10, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[4659]="{A|3} {L|0}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 8-10, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[4660]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the south. It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[4661]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Look to the north of the Stonetalon Mountains. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the south of the savannah of the Barrens. It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
L[4662]="{A|1} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 8-10 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[4663]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[4665]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."}
