L[4668]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is the west of the boughs of Teldrassil that rewards the search. The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is the north of the plains of Mulgore that rewards the search. The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. Only occasionally does one of the wild beasts there carry it."}
