L[4739]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is carried by the plainstriders, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it. {B|plainstriders}",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Within the plains of Mulgore, they keep to the south. {B|plainstriders} The plainstriders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[4740]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the plainstriders in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|plainstriders}",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Within the plains of Mulgore, they keep to the south. {B|plainstriders} The plainstriders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[4741]="{A|3} {C|11} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} The folk of the Arathi Highlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
