L[4801]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Look to the east of the grey wastes of Desolace. {B|wolves} The wolves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Look to the middle of the plains of Mulgore. {B|wolves} The wolves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[4802]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the east of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. {B|great cats} The great cats there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Look to the middle of the plains of Mulgore. {B|great cats} The great cats there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[4803]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Within the grey wastes of Desolace, they keep to the east. {B|wolves} The wolves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} {B|wolves} The wolves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[4804]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the east of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. {B|wolves} The wolves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} {B|wolves} The wolves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[4805]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Look to the east of the grey wastes of Desolace. {B|great cats} The great cats there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Look to the middle of the plains of Mulgore. {B|great cats} The great cats there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[4806]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the east of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. {B|plainstriders} The plainstriders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the plains of Mulgore. {B|plainstriders} The plainstriders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[4807]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Look to the south-east of the grey wastes of Desolace. {B|carrion birds} The carrion birds there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} {B|carrion birds} The carrion birds there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[4808]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from a Well Stone.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is taken from a Well Stone in the plains of Mulgore."}
L[4809]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the south-east of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. It is taken from an Ambercorn in the grey wastes of Desolace.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is taken from an Ambercorn in the plains of Mulgore."}
L[4810]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Look to the middle of the Alterac Mountains. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there."
L[4813]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {B|great cats} A good share of the great cats carry it.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Look to the north of the plains of Mulgore. It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {B|great cats} Perhaps one in four of the great cats has one about them."}
L[4814]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {B|great cats} Nearly every one of the great cats carries one.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is the north of the plains of Mulgore that rewards the search. {B|great cats} It is found on almost all of the great cats."}
