L[4851]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from a Dirt-stained Map.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Within the plains of Mulgore, they keep to the south-east. It is taken from a Dirt-stained Map in the plains of Mulgore."}
L[4852]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} Its making calls for Blue Pearl, Heavy Blasting Powder and Silk Cloth. An engineer of middling skill (around 185) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest in Badlands."
L[4854]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the beasts in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is the north-west of the plains of Mulgore that rewards the search. Nearly every one of the wild beasts there carries one."}
L[4859]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} Within the red desert of Durotar, they keep to the heart of the land. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[4860]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, they keep to the north. Nearly every one of the wild beasts there carries one."
L[4861]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the plainstriders in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|plainstriders}",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Look to the middle of the plains of Mulgore. {B|plainstriders} Nearly every one of the plainstriders carries one."}
L[4862]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the scorpids, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it. {B|scorpids}",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is the south of the red desert of Durotar that rewards the search. {B|scorpids} The scorpids there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[4863]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|2}\nIt is taken from a Gnomish Toolbox.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|2}\nIt is found in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is the east of the red desert of Durotar that rewards the search. It is taken from a Gnomish Toolbox in the red desert of Durotar."}
L[4864]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from an Imprisoned Darkspear.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the east of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. It is taken from an Imprisoned Darkspear in the savannah of the Barrens."}
L[4865]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is the south-west of the snowfields of Dun Morogh that rewards the search. The other place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {B|wolves} Nearly every one of the wolves and bears carries one.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. Nearly every one of the wild beasts there carries one."}
