L[4984]="The Skull of Impending Doom is a cursed skull that fills its bearer with such dread that they run faster than they have ever run, at the cost of their strength and their health draining with every step.\nIt is among the rewards the Argent Dawn's and the frontier's questgivers offer for grim errands."
L[4986]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is given in thanks by those in the red desert of Durotar whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
