L[4998]={A="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[4999]={A="{J|11} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Within the Stonetalon Mountains, they keep to the north. The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{J|11} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the south. The other place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
L[5001]={A="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Look to the north of the Stonetalon Mountains. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the south of the savannah of the Barrens. It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
L[5002]="{J|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the mesas of Thousand Needles. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[5003]="{J|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[5006]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the south. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[5007]="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the mesas of Thousand Needles. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[5009]="{J|11} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[5011]="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is found as readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
L[5012]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is taken from a Laden Mushroom.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. It is taken from a Laden Mushroom in the savannah of the Barrens."}
L[5016]="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} The folk of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[5017]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the west. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the south. The other place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[5018]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the west. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the south. It is found as readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[5019]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the west. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the south. The other place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[5020]={A="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other. {C|36}\nOur correspondents report it among the centaur in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|centaur}",H="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other. {C|36}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. {P|centaur} One of the centaur in a score or so carries it."}
