L[5023]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the middle of the savannah of the Barrens. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
