L[5029]="{J|2} {C|40} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the south-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one."
L[5030]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|36}\nOur correspondents report it among the centaur in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|centaur}",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|36}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. {P|centaur} The centaur there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[5038]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is the west of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh that rewards the search. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the south of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. Chests and strongboxes in the savannah of the Barrens hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
L[5040]="{W|15} {Q|1.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is the south-east of the Arathi Highlands that rewards the search. {P|trolls} The trolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5042]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[5048]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Merchants in the Stonetalon Mountains and the red hills around Lake Everstill stock it.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Durotar} Merchants in the red desert of Durotar and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the north of the land."}
L[5050]={A="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[5051]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Look to the west of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. It is found on almost all of the critters.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the south of the savannah of the Barrens. The other place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. Nearly every one of the critters carries one."}
L[5052]={A="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the west. Nearly every one of the critters carries one.",H="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the south. It is found as readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. It is found on almost all of the critters."}
L[5055]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Look to the south-east of the Stonetalon Mountains. {B|raptors} The raptors there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. {B|raptors} The raptors there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[5056]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHerbalists know it from the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is the herbalists who bring it in in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHerbalists know it from the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the herbalists who bring it in in the savannah of the Barrens."}
L[5057]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The folk of the fallow farmland of Westfall have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks. It is also taken from Ripe Watermelon.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is taken from a Ripe Watermelon."}
L[5058]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|21}\nIt is taken from a Silithid Mound.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|21}\nIt is found in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the south of the savannah of the Barrens. It is taken from a Silithid Mound in the savannah of the Barrens."}
L[5060]={A="{I|Thieves' Tools}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also taken from Standard Issue Tools.",H="{I|Thieves' Tools}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|poison vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also taken from Standard Issue Tools."}
