L[5075]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nMiners know it from the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Within the ancient forest of Ashenvale, the veins keep to the south-east. It comes out of the tin veins in the ancient forest of Ashenvale, under the miner's pick. It is also commonly carried by quilboar of north-western Dustwallow Marsh.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nMiners know it from the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Miners strike it in the tin veins in the savannah of the Barrens. It is also commonly carried by quilboar of the central Barrens."}
