L[5081]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Thin Kodo Leather, Light Leather and Coarse Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 40) can attempt it."
L[5082]={A="{I|Thin Kodo Leather}\nIt is carried by the kodo beasts, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it. {B|kodo beasts}",H="{I|Thin Kodo Leather}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {B|kodo beasts} It is found on almost all of the kodo beasts."}
L[5083]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Kodo Hide Bag. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 40 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Kodo Hide Bag. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 40 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the mesa city of Thunder Bluff. {Z|Thunder Bluff} It is given in thanks by those in the mesa city of Thunder Bluff whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
