L[5110]={A="{A|1} {C|47} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the north-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. {P|Dalaran wizards} Only occasionally does one of the Dalaran wizards carry it.",H="{A|1} {C|47} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} It is the south of the grey woods of Silverpine that rewards the search. The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {P|Dalaran wizards} It is a rare find among the Dalaran wizards; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
