L[5118]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nOur correspondents report it among the zhevra in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|zhevra}",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. {B|zhevra} It is found on almost all of the zhevra."}
