L[5138]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the insects in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|insects}",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the south. {P|insects} Nearly every one of the insects carries one."}
L[5140]={A="{I|Flash Powder}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also found inside containers such as Heavy Junkbox and Sturdy Junkbox.",H="{I|Flash Powder}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|poison vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also found inside containers such as Heavy Junkbox and Sturdy Junkbox."}
