L[5218]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The folk of the boughs of Teldrassil have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[5220]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is the south of the boughs of Teldrassil that rewards the search. {P|furbolg} The furbolg there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the furbolg in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|furbolg}"}
L[5221]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Within the boughs of Teldrassil, they keep to the heart of the land. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nOur correspondents report it among the demons in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[5232]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is created by warlocks from the stuff of the Nether, and lasts only so long as its maker does."
L[5233]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the west. {B|raptors} The raptors there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the raptors in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|raptors}"}
L[5234]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the heart of the land. It is taken from a Flagongut's Fossil in the marshes of the Wetlands.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from a Flagongut's Fossil."}
L[5236]={A="{W|19} {Q|1.1} {L|2}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the dwarven city of Ironforge stock it. The shop is in the south of the land.",H="{W|19} {Q|1.1} {L|2}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Undercity} Merchants in the Undercity and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the north-east of the land."}
L[5237]="{K|9}\nIt is made, not found. {T|40} Its making calls for Dust of Decay, Essence of Pain and Empty Vial. It is first attempted at a Poisons skill of about 100. It is also sold by a reagent vendor."
L[5238]={A="{W|19} {Q|1.0} {L|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the dwarven city of Ironforge stock it. The shop is in the south of the land.",H="{W|19} {Q|1.0} {L|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Undercity} Merchants in the Undercity and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the north-east of the land."}
L[5239]={A="{W|19} {Q|1.1} {L|4}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the dwarven city of Ironforge stock it. The shop is in the south of the land.",H="{W|19} {Q|1.1} {L|4}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Undercity} Merchants in the Undercity and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the north-east of the land."}
L[5240]={A="{W|19} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The folk of the fallow farmland of Westfall have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{W|19} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[5241]={A="{W|19} {C|4} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is given in thanks by those in the loch country of Loch Modan whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{W|19} {C|4} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[5242]={A="{W|19} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{W|19} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} It is given in thanks by those in the grey woods of Silverpine whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
L[5243]="{W|19} {Q|3.0} {L|1} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} {P|dragons} It is the dragons of the Wailing Caverns who have it about them."
L[5244]={A="{W|19} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} It is given in thanks by those in the dark woods of Duskwood whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{W|19} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[5245]="{W|19} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Look to the south-west of the Alterac Mountains. It is found as readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {P|Dalaran wizards} Only occasionally does one of the Dalaran wizards carry it."
L[5246]={A="{W|19} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} The folk of the marshes of the Wetlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{W|19} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[5247]="{W|19} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} The folk of the Arathi Highlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[5248]="{W|19} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} The folk of the Badlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[5249]="{W|19} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} The folk of the Alterac Mountains have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[5250]="{W|19} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The folk of the farmland of Hillsbrad have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[5251]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is given in thanks by those in the stormy coast of Darkshore whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[5252]={A="{W|19} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{W|19} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} It is given in thanks by those in the grey woods of Silverpine whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
L[5253]="{W|19} {C|3} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} The folk of the jungles of Stranglethorn have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[5254]="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|1}\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} The rank and file of Shadowfang Keep have it about them."
L[5256]="{W|4} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is the west of the Arathi Highlands that rewards the search. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them."
L[5257]="{A|1} {Q|3.0} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is the south-east of the Arathi Highlands that rewards the search. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in a score or so carries it."
L[5263]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIt is found in the ruins of Dire Maul. {Z|Dire Maul} It is taken from A Dusty Tome in the ruins of Dire Maul."
L[5266]="{J|11} {Q|3.0} {L|4}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is the west of the sands of Silithus that rewards the search. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the sands of Silithus, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[5267]="{W|15} {C|1} {Q|3.0} {L|5}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is the west of the sands of Silithus that rewards the search. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the sands of Silithus, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[5268]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop. {C|21}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the north-west. It is found as readily in the desert of Tanaris. {B|scorpids} It is found on almost all of the scorpids.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop. {C|21}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the south. {B|scorpids} Nearly every one of the scorpids carries one."}
L[5269]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers. {C|21}\nHunters find it most readily in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is the north of the desert of Tanaris that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {P|insects} Nearly every one of the insects and scorpids carries one.",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers. {C|21}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the south of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. {B|scorpids} Nearly every one of the scorpids carries one."}
L[5270]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} It is the north of the poisoned forest of Felwood that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is taken from a Death Cap in the poisoned forest of Felwood.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} It is the north of the poisoned forest of Felwood that rewards the search. It is taken from a Death Cap in the poisoned forest of Felwood."}
L[5271]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} Look to the north of the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is taken from a Scaber Stalk in the stormy coast of Darkshore.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} Look to the north of the poisoned forest of Felwood. It is taken from a Scaber Stalk in the poisoned forest of Felwood."}
