L[5329]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIt is found in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} Within the stormy coast of Darkshore, they keep to the north. It is taken from a Cat Figurine in the stormy coast of Darkshore.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. It is also taken from Cat Figurine."}
L[5332]="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\n{B|great cats} Nearly every one of the great cats carries one."
L[5334]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[5335]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is given in thanks by those in the savannah of the Barrens whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
L[5336]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is the north of the stormy coast of Darkshore that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
