L[5348]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is the north of the stormy coast of Darkshore that rewards the search. {P|cultists} The cultists there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the cultists in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|cultists}"}
L[5349]="{K|5}\nIt is conjured by mages out of nothing, as they conjure bread and water, and vanishes when its maker is long gone."
