L[5359]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Look to the west of the mesas of Thousand Needles. Chests and strongboxes in the mesas of Thousand Needles hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[5360]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|32}\nHunters find it most readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} Within the stormy coast of Darkshore, they keep to the heart of the land. The restless dead there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|32}\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[5361]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nPickpockets know it from the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the south-east of the woods of Elwynn. {P|murlocs} Rogues lift it from the pockets of the murlocs there, who seldom notice.",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nPickpockets know it from the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the north of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {P|murlocs} Rogues lift it from the pockets of the murlocs there, who seldom notice."}
L[5362]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nPickpockets know it from the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Look to the west of the Western Plaguelands. Rogues lift it from the pockets of the restless dead there, who seldom notice.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nPickpockets know it from the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} {P|zombies} Rogues lift it from the pockets of the zombies there, who seldom notice."}
