L[5373]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nPickpockets know it from the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Within the ancient forest of Ashenvale, they keep to the south-east. It is found as readily in the mesas of Thousand Needles. Rogues lift it from the pockets of the humanoid foes there, who seldom notice."
L[5374]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the south-east of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. {P|Defias brigands} Perhaps one in four of the Defias brigands has one about them. It is also found inside containers such as Heavy Bronze Lockbox and Battered Junkbox.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nLockboxes are the strongboxes of travellers who did not survive to open them, carried off by whatever killed them. Only a rogue's picks or an engineer's seaforium will open one, and this is among what they hold."}
