L[5488]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Crispy Lizard Tail. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 100 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Crispy Lizard Tail. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 100 of a cook who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|The Barrens} A merchant in the savannah of the Barrens stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land."}
L[5489]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Lean Venison. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 110 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Ashenvale} Merchants in the ancient forest of Ashenvale and the grey wastes of Desolace stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Lean Venison. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 110 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {Z|Desolace} A merchant in the grey wastes of Desolace stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
