L[5494]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the south-west of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is taken from a Stardust Covered Bush in the ancient forest of Ashenvale."
L[5498]={A="{I|Small Lustrous Pearl}\nIt is found inside A Small Container of Gems, and nowhere else in particular.",H="{I|Small Lustrous Pearl}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the middle of the savannah of the Barrens. It turns up on the raiders and tribesmen there now and then, perhaps once in twenty. It is also found inside containers such as A Small Container of Gems and Sack of Gems."}
L[5500]="{I|Iridescent Pearl}\nIt is found inside A Small Container of Gems, and nowhere else in particular."
L[5503]={A="{I|Clam Meat}\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {P|murlocs} It turns up on the murlocs and crabs now and then, perhaps once in twenty. It is also found inside containers such as Small Barnacled Clam and Battered Junkbox.",H="{I|Clam Meat}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is the north-west of the ancient forest of Ashenvale that rewards the search. The other place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. It turns up on the raiders and tribesmen there now and then, perhaps once in twenty. It is also found inside containers such as Small Barnacled Clam and Battered Junkbox."}
