L[5624]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Within the Arathi Highlands, they keep to the west. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
