L[5631]="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Sharp Claw, Briarthorn and Empty Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 60) can attempt it."
L[5632]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Delicate Feather, Kingsblood and Leaded Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 125) can attempt it."
L[5633]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Large Fang, Kingsblood and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 175."
L[5634]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Blackmouth Oil, Stranglekelp and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 150."
L[5635]={A="{I|Sharp Claw}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. Perhaps one in four of the wild beasts there has one about them.",H="{I|Sharp Claw}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Perhaps one in four of the wild beasts there has one about them."}
L[5636]="{I|Delicate Feather}\nThe place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, they keep to the north. The other place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in a score or so carries it."
L[5637]="{I|Large Fang}\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. One of the wild beasts there in a score or so carries it."
L[5640]={A="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Rage Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 60) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Westfall} Merchants in the fallow farmland of Westfall and the loch country of Loch Modan stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Rage Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 60) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Westfall} Merchants in the fallow farmland of Westfall and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[5642]={A="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Free Action Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 150) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the night elf city of Darnassus stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Free Action Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 150) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[5643]={A="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Great Rage Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 175 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the night elf city of Darnassus stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Great Rage Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 175 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|reagent vendors} {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[5654]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is made, not found. {T|40} Its making calls for Large Venom Sac and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Poisons skill of about 120."
L[5655]={A="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|horse breeders} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the marshes of the Wetlands stock it. The shop is in the south-east of the land.",H="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is bought, not hunted."}
L[5656]={A="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|horse breeders} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the marshes of the Wetlands stock it. The shop is in the south-east of the land.",H="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is bought, not hunted."}
L[5659]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Within the Stonetalon Mountains, they keep to the south-west. {P|fire elementals} The fire elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5663]="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|mount vendors}"
L[5664]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} It is the south-west of the Stonetalon Mountains that rewards the search. {P|treants and bog beasts} The treants and bog beasts there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5665]={A="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land."}
L[5668]={A="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land."}
L[5669]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {P|earth elementals} The earth elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the earth elementals in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|earth elementals}"}
L[5675]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} It is the south-west of the Stonetalon Mountains that rewards the search. {B|basilisks} The basilisks there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5681]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Within the Stonetalon Mountains, they keep to the north-west. The strange creatures there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5686]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Within the ancient forest of Ashenvale, they keep to the east. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5689]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} It is the north-west of the Stonetalon Mountains that rewards the search. Chests and strongboxes in the Stonetalon Mountains hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[5690]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} It is the north-west of the Stonetalon Mountains that rewards the search. Chests and strongboxes in the Stonetalon Mountains hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[5691]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Within the Stonetalon Mountains, the caches keep to the north-west. Chests and strongboxes in the Stonetalon Mountains hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[5692]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found inside a Covert Ops Pack, and nowhere else in particular."
L[5693]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found inside a Covert Ops Pack, and nowhere else in particular."
L[5694]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found inside a Covert Ops Pack, and nowhere else in particular."
L[5695]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found inside a Covert Ops Pack, and nowhere else in particular."
L[5717]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|31}\nIt is found in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Within the Stonetalon Mountains, they keep to the east. It is taken from Venture Co. Documents in the Stonetalon Mountains."
L[5718]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|31}\nIt is found in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Look to the east of the Stonetalon Mountains. It is taken from Venture Co. Engineering Plans in the Stonetalon Mountains."
L[5734]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Look to the east of the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|Venture Company workers} The Venture Company workers there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5736]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} It is the east of the Stonetalon Mountains that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5737]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found inside a Covert Ops Pack, and nowhere else in particular."
L[5739]="{A|2} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Heavy Leather, Fine Thread and Iron Buckle. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 190."
L[5740]={A="{K|10}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|holiday fireworks vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also taken from Red Rocket in Scarlet Monastery and Gnomeregan.",H="{K|10}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|holiday fireworks vendors} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the marshes of the Wetlands stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. It is also taken from Red Rocket in Scarlet Monastery and Gnomeregan."}
L[5741]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the south-east of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {P|infernals} Nearly every one of the infernals carries one."
L[5744]={A="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the east of the woods of Elwynn. A good share of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[5749]={A="{W|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is the south of the marshes of the Wetlands that rewards the search. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them.",H="{W|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[5750]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is the south of the marshes of the Wetlands that rewards the search. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[5751]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Look to the north of the Stonetalon Mountains. {B|wyverns} Nearly every one of the wyverns carries one."
L[5752]="{W|15} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Within the Stonetalon Mountains, they keep to the north. {B|wyverns} Perhaps one in four of the wyverns has one about them."
L[5753]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the middle of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there."
L[5754]="{J|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the middle of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there."
L[5755]="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north of the jungles of Stranglethorn. {P|mechanical constructs} It is a rare find among the mechanical constructs; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[5756]="{W|15} {Q|3.1} {L|3}\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} Within, it is the Scarlet Crusaders who carry it."
L[5757]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is given in thanks by those in the stormy coast of Darkshore whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[5758]="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|14}\nHunters find it most readily in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} It is found as readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in a score or so carries it."
L[5759]="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|13}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is Zul'Gurub. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[5760]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts source is Naxxramas, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Naxxramas} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[5761]={A="{W|5}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is given in thanks by those in the snowfields of Dun Morogh whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{W|5}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[5762]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Linen Cloth, Fine Thread and Red Dye. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 70."
L[5763]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Woolen Cloth, Red Dye and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 115."
L[5764]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Heavy Leather and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 175."
L[5765]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Black Dye and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 185."
L[5766]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Fine Thread and Spider's Silk. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 135."
L[5767]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, they keep to the heart of the land. {P|trolls} One of the trolls in a score or so carries it.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the trolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|trolls}"}
L[5770]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Fine Thread and Spider's Silk. A tailor of middling skill (around 150) can attempt it."
L[5771]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Red Linen Bag. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 70 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Westfall} Merchants in the fallow farmland of Westfall and the stormy coast of Darkshore stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Red Linen Bag. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 70 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[5772]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Red Woolen Bag. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 115 of a tailor who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Redridge Mountains} Merchants in the red hills around Lake Everstill and the marshes of the Wetlands stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Red Woolen Bag. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 115 of a tailor who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|The Barrens} Merchants in the savannah of the Barrens and the plains of Mulgore stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[5773]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Robes of Arcana. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 150) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is the north of the stormy coast of Darkshore that rewards the search. The other place to look is the dark woods of Duskwood. {P|cultists} Only occasionally does one of the cultists carry it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Robes of Arcana. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 150) can follow it.\nOur correspondents report it among the cultists in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|cultists}"}
L[5774]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Green Silk Pack. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 175 of a tailor who attempts it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 26-39, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[5775]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Black Silk Pack. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 185) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Look to the middle of the Alterac Mountains. {P|Syndicate rogues} Only occasionally does one of the Syndicate rogues carry it."
L[5776]={A="{W|10}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{W|10}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} The folk of the plains of Mulgore have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[5777]={A="{W|1} {Q|1.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{W|1} {Q|1.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} The folk of the plains of Mulgore have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[5778]={A="{W|10}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{W|10}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is given in thanks by those in the red desert of Durotar whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
L[5779]={A="{W|8} {C|10} {Q|1.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{W|8} {C|10} {Q|1.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The folk of the blighted glades of Tirisfal have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[5780]="{A|2} {C|38} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Slimy Murloc Scale, Light Leather and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 90."
L[5781]="{A|2} {C|38} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Slimy Murloc Scale, Cured Light Hide and Light Leather. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 95) can attempt it."
L[5782]="{A|2} {C|38} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Thick Murloc Scale, Cured Heavy Hide and Heavy Leather. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 170."
L[5783]="{A|2} {C|38} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Thick Murloc Scale, Cured Heavy Hide and Heavy Leather. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 190."
L[5784]={A="{I|Slimy Murloc Scale}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Look to the west of the fallow farmland of Westfall. The other place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. {P|murlocs} A good share of the murlocs carry it.",H="{I|Slimy Murloc Scale}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Look to the north-east of the grey woods of Silverpine. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them."}
L[5785]="{I|Thick Murloc Scale}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Look to the north of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {P|murlocs} Perhaps one in four of the murlocs has one about them."
L[5786]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Murloc Scale Belt. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 90 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Westfall} Merchants in the fallow farmland of Westfall and the stormy coast of Darkshore stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Murloc Scale Belt. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 90 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Silverpine Forest} A merchant in the grey woods of Silverpine stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[5787]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Murloc Scale Breastplate. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 95 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Westfall} Merchants in the fallow farmland of Westfall and the stormy coast of Darkshore stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Murloc Scale Breastplate. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 95 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Silverpine Forest} A merchant in the grey woods of Silverpine stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[5788]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Thick Murloc Armor. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 170 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Merchants in the farmland of Hillsbrad and the jungles of Stranglethorn stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Thick Murloc Armor. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 170 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Alterac Mountains} Merchants in the Alterac Mountains and the farmland of Hillsbrad stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[5789]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Murloc Scale Bracers. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 190) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Merchants in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh and the jungles of Stranglethorn stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Murloc Scale Bracers. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 190) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} A merchant in the jungles of Stranglethorn stocks it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[5791]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} It is the north-west of the mesas of Thousand Needles that rewards the search. It is taken from a Henrig Lonebrow's Journal in the mesas of Thousand Needles.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} It is the north-west of the mesas of Thousand Needles that rewards the search. The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. It is taken from a Henrig Lonebrow's Journal in the mesas of Thousand Needles."}
L[5792]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt comes out of Razorfen Kraul. {D|Razorfen Kraul} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[5793]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt comes out of Razorfen Kraul. {D|Razorfen Kraul} The rank and file of Razorfen Kraul have it about them."
L[5794]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Look to the south-east of the mesas of Thousand Needles. {B|scorpids} The scorpids there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5795]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Within the mesas of Thousand Needles, they keep to the south-east. {B|turtles} The turtles there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5796]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn. {P|murlocs} The murlocs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5797]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} It is found as readily in Uldaman. {P|troggs} The troggs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5798]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} It is the south-east of the mesas of Thousand Needles that rewards the search. It is taken from a Rocket Car Rubble in the mesas of Thousand Needles."
L[5801]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts source is Razorfen Kraul, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Razorfen Kraul} {B|bats} Within, it is the bats who carry it."
