L[5805]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It is the Scarlet Crusaders of the Scarlet Monastery who have it about them.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} The other place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {P|Scarlet Crusaders} The Scarlet Crusaders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
