L[5811]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the north of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the Alterac Mountains. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
