L[5815]="{W|5} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is given in thanks by those in the ancient forest of Ashenvale whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[5816]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The folk of the ancient forest of Ashenvale have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[5817]="{W|2} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is given in thanks by those in the ancient forest of Ashenvale whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
