L[5819]="{A|3} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nIts source is the Scarlet Monastery, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It is the Scarlet Crusaders of the Scarlet Monastery who have it about them."
L[5820]="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The folk of the ancient forest of Ashenvale have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[5824]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in Uldaman. {D|Uldaman} It is taken from a Tablet of Will in Uldaman."
L[5825]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt comes out of Razorfen Kraul. {D|Razorfen Kraul} {P|quilboar} It is the quilboar of Razorfen Kraul who have it about them."
L[5829]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Look to the south of the rainforest of Feralas. It is found as readily in the desert of Tanaris. {B|carrion birds} A good share of the carrion birds carry it."
L[5830]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Look to the north of the Arathi Highlands. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5831]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Within the Arathi Highlands, they keep to the heart of the land. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5832]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Within the Arathi Highlands, they keep to the heart of the land. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5833]="{I|Indurium Ore}\nMiners know it from Uldaman. {D|Uldaman} Miners strike it in the indurium mineral veins in Uldaman."
L[5834]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is the south of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh that rewards the search. It is taken from a Mok'Morokk's Snuff in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh."
L[5835]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Look to the south of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. It is taken from a Mok'Morokk's Grog in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh."
L[5836]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is the south-west of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh that rewards the search. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the south of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the savannah of the Barrens: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[5837]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} It is the north-west of the mesas of Thousand Needles that rewards the search. {B|hyenas} The hyenas there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} It is the north-west of the mesas of Thousand Needles that rewards the search. The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {B|hyenas} The hyenas there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[5839]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} Look to the north of the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[5840]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the south. {P|whelps} The whelps there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5841]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the south. {P|whelps} The whelps there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5842]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5843]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there."
L[5844]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Look to the west of the mesas of Thousand Needles. The elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5847]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the north. {P|murlocs} The murlocs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5848]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} It is the south-east of the mesas of Thousand Needles that rewards the search. {B|carrion birds} The carrion birds there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5851]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the north of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5852]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, the caches keep to the north. Chests and strongboxes in the jungles of Stranglethorn hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[5853]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|21}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Look to the south-east of the mesas of Thousand Needles. {P|insects} The insects there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
