L[5858]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|3}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} The folk of the mesas of Thousand Needles have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
