L[5864]={A="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Dun Morogh} A merchant in the snowfields of Dun Morogh stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land.",H="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
