L[5947]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|0}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Look to the south-west of the dark woods of Duskwood. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the dark woods of Duskwood: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|0}\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[5951]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. The folk of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[5952]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is Blackfathom Deeps. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {P|naga} The naga there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[5956]="The blacksmith's hammer, sold by every blacksmithing supplier and trade goods merchant, and the one tool without which no smith can work at the anvil.\nIt can be had in every settlement with a forge."
L[5957]="{A|2} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Light Leather and Coarse Thread."
L[5958]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Medium Leather, Bolt of Woolen Cloth and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 105."
L[5959]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} {B|spiders} Perhaps one in four of the spiders has one about them."
L[5961]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Medium Leather, Gray Dye and Fine Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 115) can attempt it."
L[5962]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Heavy Leather, Bolt of Silk Cloth and Fine Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 160) can attempt it."
L[5963]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Heavy Leather, Fine Thread and Moss Agate. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 170) can attempt it."
L[5964]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Heavy Leather, Cured Heavy Hide and Fine Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 175) can attempt it."
L[5965]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Heavy Leather, Bolt of Silk Cloth and Silken Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 185."
L[5966]="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Heavy Leather, Cured Heavy Hide and Silken Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 190."
L[5967]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the south of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[5969]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Look to the south of the grey woods of Silverpine. It is found on almost all of the restless dead."}
L[5970]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt comes out of the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[5971]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} {B|carrion birds} Nearly every one of the carrion birds carries one.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nOur correspondents report it among the carrion birds in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|carrion birds}"}
L[5972]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Fine Leather Pants. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 105) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Fine Leather Pants. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 105) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[5973]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Barbaric Leggings. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 170) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Arathi Highlands} Merchants in the Arathi Highlands and the ancient forest of Ashenvale stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Barbaric Leggings. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 170) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Arathi Highlands} Merchants in the Arathi Highlands and the mesas of Thousand Needles stock it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[5974]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Guardian Cloak. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 185 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 31-45, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[5975]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the zombies in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|zombies}",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Within the grey woods of Silverpine, they keep to the north-east. {P|zombies} Nearly every one of the zombies carries one."}
L[5976]="The guild tabard is the badge of a guild, bought from the guild masters of the capitals and worked with the guild's own device and colours.\nIt is sold by the guild masters of Stormwind, Ironforge, Darnassus, Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff and the Undercity to any member of a guild."
L[5996]={A="{K|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Stranglekelp, Blackmouth Oil and Empty Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 90. It is also awarded for a quest in Darkshore.",H="{K|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Stranglekelp, Blackmouth Oil and Empty Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 90. It is also awarded for completing a quest."}
L[5997]="{K|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Silverleaf and Empty Vial."
L[6037]="{I|Truesilver Bar}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Mithril Bar. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 225."
L[6038]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} This one is worked from Giant Clam Meat and Hot Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 175) can attempt it."
L[6039]="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Giant Clam Scorcho. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} A merchant in the jungles of Stranglethorn stocks it. The shop is in the south-west of the land."
L[6040]="{A|3} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} This one is worked from Steel Bar and Heavy Grinding Stone. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 185."
L[6041]="{R|11}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Steel Bar, Heavy Grinding Stone and Heavy Leather. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 190."
L[6042]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Iron Bar and Coarse Grinding Stone. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 150) can attempt it."
L[6043]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Iron Bar, Coarse Grinding Stone and Lesser Moonstone. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 165."
L[6044]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Iron Shield Spike. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 150) can follow it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 21-35 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[6045]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Iron Counterweight. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 165 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 27-39 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[6046]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Steel Weapon Chain. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 190) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} The other place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[6047]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Golden Scale Coif. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 190 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|blacksmithing suppliers} {Z|Tanaris} A merchant in the desert of Tanaris stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[6048]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Grave Moss, Kingsblood and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 135."
L[6049]="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Small Flame Sac, Fire Oil and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 165."
L[6050]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Wintersbite, Goldthorn and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 190."
L[6051]="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Bruiseweed, Swiftthistle and Empty Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 100."
L[6052]="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Liferoot, Stranglekelp and Leaded Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 190) can attempt it."
L[6053]={A="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Holy Protection Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 100 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Loch Modan} Merchants in the loch country of Loch Modan and the dark woods of Duskwood stock it. The shop is in the south-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Holy Protection Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 100 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Duskwood} Merchants in the dark woods of Duskwood and the savannah of the Barrens stock it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[6054]={A="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Shadow Protection Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 135) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Ashenvale} A merchant in the ancient forest of Ashenvale stocks it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Shadow Protection Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 135) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Alterac Mountains} Merchants in the Alterac Mountains and the farmland of Hillsbrad stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[6055]={A="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Fire Protection Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 165 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} A merchant in the farmland of Hillsbrad stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Fire Protection Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 165 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} A merchant in the Stonetalon Mountains stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[6056]={A="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Frost Protection Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 190 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Arathi Highlands} Merchants in the Arathi Highlands and the jungles of Stranglethorn stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Frost Protection Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 190 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} A merchant in the jungles of Stranglethorn stocks it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[6057]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Nature Protection Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 190) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the desert of Tanaris stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[6058]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is given in thanks by those in the boughs of Teldrassil whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6059]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is given in thanks by those in the plains of Mulgore whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
L[6060]={A="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{A|1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The folk of the blighted glades of Tirisfal have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[6061]={A="{A|3} {Q|1.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The folk of the boughs of Teldrassil have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|3} {Q|1.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6062]={A="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{A|1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is given in thanks by those in the red desert of Durotar whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
L[6063]={A="{A|3}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{A|3}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is given in thanks by those in the blighted glades of Tirisfal whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
L[6065]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} The elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6066]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the east of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6067]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|36}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} {P|centaur} The centaur there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6068]={A="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Shadow Oil. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 165) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Duskwood} A merchant in the dark woods of Duskwood stocks it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Shadow Oil. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 165) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Duskwood} Merchants in the dark woods of Duskwood and the mesas of Thousand Needles stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[6069]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the south-east of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. It is taken from a Sack of Meat in the grey wastes of Desolace."
L[6070]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The folk of the woods of Elwynn have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6071]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} Look to the north of the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. It is taken from Draenethyst Crystals in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows."
L[6072]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Look to the south-east of the grey wastes of Desolace. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6073]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the south of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. The other place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6074]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Look to the west of the grey wastes of Desolace. {P|centaur} The centaur there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6076]={A="{A|1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is given in thanks by those in the woods of Elwynn whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6077]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nNearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one."
L[6078]={A="{A|6}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The folk of the woods of Elwynn have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|6}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6079]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the east of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. {P|centaur} The centaur there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6080]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} {B|great cats} The great cats there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6081]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} Look to the north-west of the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {P|treants and bog beasts} The treants and bog beasts there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6082]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Look to the north of the grey wastes of Desolace. The giants there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6083]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Within the grey wastes of Desolace, they keep to the south. It is taken from Tear of Theradras in the grey wastes of Desolace."
L[6084]={A="{A|3} {C|11} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The folk of the woods of Elwynn have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|3} {C|11} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given only by the Alliance's questgivers, in thanks for errands a traveller of the Horde cannot run."}
L[6085]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The folk of the woods of Elwynn have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given only by the Alliance's questgivers, in thanks for errands a traveller of the Horde cannot run."}
L[6087]="{A|3} {Q|3.0} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Deadmines. {D|The Deadmines} Those who have a stake in the Deadmines give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[6092]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is given in thanks by those in the red hills around Lake Everstill whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6093]={A="{W|5} {C|7} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is given in thanks by those in the red hills around Lake Everstill whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{W|5} {C|7} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6094]="{W|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Deadmines. {D|The Deadmines} Those who have a stake in the Deadmines give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
