L[6147]={A="{A|2} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Within the woods of Elwynn, they keep to the south. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="{A|2} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[6148]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is the east of the woods of Elwynn that rewards the search. {B|spiders} Nearly every one of the spiders carries one.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the spiders, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|spiders}"}
L[6149]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Khadgar's Whisker, Goldthorn and Leaded Vial. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 205) can attempt it. It is also commonly carried by a variety of creatures of levels 42-55, most plentifully in north-western Eastern Plaguelands and Feralas."
L[6150]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nPickpockets know it from the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} {P|Defias brigands} Rogues lift it from the pockets of the Defias brigands there, who seldom notice.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nPickpockets know it from the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} Rogues lift it from the pockets of the Scarlet Crusaders there, who seldom notice."}
L[6166]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} {B|wolves} The wolves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6168]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} {B|crocolisks} The crocolisks there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6169]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} {B|crocolisks} The crocolisks there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6170]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} Within the sodden Swamp of Sorrows, the caches keep to the north-east. Chests and strongboxes in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[6171]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is given in thanks by those in the snowfields of Dun Morogh whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6172]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
L[6173]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} The folk of the snowfields of Dun Morogh have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6175]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|41}\nIt is found in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} Look to the east of the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. It is taken from an Atal'ai Artifact in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows."
L[6176]={A="{A|6} {C|4}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is given in thanks by those in the snowfields of Dun Morogh whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|6} {C|4}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6177]={A="{A|3} {Q|1.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is given in thanks by those in the snowfields of Dun Morogh whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|3} {Q|1.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6179]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the west. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[6180]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the north of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[6181]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|41}\nThe place to look is the Temple of Atal'Hakkar. {D|Sunken Temple} The other place to look is the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {P|trolls} The trolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6184]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} {B|crabs} The crabs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6185]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} The folk of the snowfields of Dun Morogh have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6186]={A="{W|8} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is given in thanks by those in the loch country of Loch Modan whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{W|8} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6187]={A="{A|6} {C|4} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is given in thanks by those in the loch country of Loch Modan whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|6} {C|4} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6188]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} The folk of the loch country of Loch Modan have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6189]={A="{A|3} {Q|1.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is given in thanks by those in the loch country of Loch Modan whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|3} {Q|1.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6190]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} It is the north-east of the sodden Swamp of Sorrows that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
