L[6194]={A="{W|0} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} The folk of the marshes of the Wetlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{W|0} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
