L[6196]="{W|4} {Q|0.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} It is the north of the sodden Swamp of Sorrows that rewards the search. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one."
L[6197]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Look to the north of the loch country of Loch Modan. {B|crocolisks} A good share of the crocolisks carry it.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the crocolisks in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|crocolisks}"}
L[6198]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the north-east. {B|raptors} Nearly every one of the raptors carries one.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nOur correspondents report it among the raptors in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|raptors}"}
L[6199]={A="{J|11} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the heart of the land. {B|spiders} A good share of the spiders carry it.",H="{J|11} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the spiders in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|spiders}"}
L[6200]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the heart of the land. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[6201]={A="{A|2} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the south-west of the woods of Elwynn. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there.",H="{A|2} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[6202]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[6203]={A="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} A good share of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[6204]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Look to the north of the dark woods of Duskwood. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[6205]={A="{W|5} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Look to the north of the fallow farmland of Westfall. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them.",H="{W|5} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[6206]={A="{W|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the north of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there.",H="{W|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[6211]={A="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Elixir of Ogre's Strength. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 150) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} It is the south of the dark woods of Duskwood that rewards the search. The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in a score or so carries it.",H="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Elixir of Ogre's Strength. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 150) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {P|gnolls} One of the gnolls in a score or so carries it."}
L[6212]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt comes out of the Temple of Atal'Hakkar. {D|Sunken Temple} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[6214]="{W|5} {Q|1.1} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Copper Bar, Weak Flux and Light Leather. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 65."
L[6215]={A="{W|10} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The folk of the woods of Elwynn have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{W|10} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given only by the Alliance's questgivers, in thanks for errands a traveller of the Horde cannot run."}
L[6217]={A="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[6218]="The runed copper rod is the enchanter's first rod, a copper rod from the blacksmith enchanted with strange dust and lesser magic essence, without which no enchantment can be laid.\nEnchanters make it themselves from a copper rod bought from any trade goods merchant."
L[6219]="{W|14} {Q|1.1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} Its making calls for Copper Bar. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 50."
L[6220]="{W|15} {Q|3.1} {L|2} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} {P|spellcasters} Within, it is the spellcasters who carry it."
L[6223]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} The folk of the dark woods of Duskwood have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6226]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt comes out of Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} {P|orcs} It is the orcs of Shadowfang Keep who have it about them."
L[6238]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Linen Cloth and Coarse Thread. A tailor of middling skill (around 30) can attempt it."
L[6239]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Linen Cloth, Coarse Thread and Red Dye. A tailor of middling skill (around 55) can attempt it."
L[6240]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Linen Cloth, Coarse Thread and Blue Dye. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 55."
L[6241]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Linen Cloth, Coarse Thread and Bleach. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 30."
L[6242]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Linen Cloth, Coarse Thread and Blue Dye. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 70."
L[6243]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Woolen Cloth, Fine Thread and Green Dye. A tailor of middling skill (around 90) can attempt it."
L[6245]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Look to the north-west of the grey wastes of Desolace. {P|naga} The naga there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6246]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Look to the north-east of the grey wastes of Desolace. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6247]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Within the grey wastes of Desolace, they keep to the north-east. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6248]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} {B|scorpids} The scorpids there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6249]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} {B|kodo beasts} The kodo beasts there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6250]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Look to the south of the grey wastes of Desolace. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6251]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the south of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6252]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the south of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6256]="A plain fishing pole, the first and only weapon of the angler, sold by every fishing supplier and general goods merchant on the coasts and lakes of Azeroth.\nIt can be had in every settlement with water nearby."
L[6257]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} {B|carrion birds} The carrion birds there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6258]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is the east of the rainforest of Feralas that rewards the search. {B|bears} The bears there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6259]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} {B|gorillas} The gorillas there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6260]={A="{I|Blue Dye}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{I|Blue Dye}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
