L[6264]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Woolen Cloth, Fine Thread and Red Dye. A tailor of middling skill (around 115) can attempt it."
L[6265]="{I|Soul Shard}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|cool guys}"
L[6266]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It turns up on the wild beasts there now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[6267]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. It turns up on the wild beasts there now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[6268]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. It turns up on the wild beasts there now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[6269]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. One of the wild beasts there in a score or so carries it."}
L[6270]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Blue Linen Vest. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 55) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the stormy coast of Darkshore stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Blue Linen Vest. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 55) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the blighted glades of Tirisfal stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[6271]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Red Linen Vest. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 55 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 6-19 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[6272]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Blue Linen Robe. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 70 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the savannah of the Barrens stock it. The shop is in the south-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Blue Linen Robe. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 70 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|The Barrens} Merchants in the savannah of the Barrens and the grey woods of Silverpine stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[6274]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Blue Overalls. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 100 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Westfall} Merchants in the fallow farmland of Westfall and the city of Stormwind stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Blue Overalls. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 100 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Alterac Mountains} Merchants in the Alterac Mountains and the farmland of Hillsbrad stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[6275]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Greater Adept's Robe. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 115 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Wetlands} Merchants in the marshes of the Wetlands and the loch country of Loch Modan stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Greater Adept's Robe. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 115 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Undercity} Merchants in the Undercity and the savannah of the Barrens stock it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[6281]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the skeletons, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it. {P|skeletons}",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is the west of the blighted glades of Tirisfal that rewards the search. {P|skeletons} The skeletons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[6282]="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The folk of the farmland of Hillsbrad have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[6283]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} It is taken from The Book of Ur in Shadowfang Keep."
L[6285]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nChests and strongboxes hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the south of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. Chests and strongboxes in the blighted glades of Tirisfal hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
L[6288]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|41}\nIt is found in the Temple of Atal'Hakkar. {D|Sunken Temple} It is taken from an Atal'ai Tablet in the Temple of Atal'Hakkar."
L[6289]={A="{K|5}\nIt is a catch of Aldrassil in Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is found as readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. It is fished from Aldrassil in Teldrassil by anyone with a pole and the patience. It is also sometimes found on murlocs of Westfall and Darkshore.",H="{K|5}\nIt is a catch of Southern Barrens in the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is found as readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. It is fished from Southern Barrens in the Barrens by anyone with a pole and the patience. It is also sometimes found on humanoid foes of north-eastern Silverpine Forest."}
L[6290]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} This one is worked from Raw Brilliant Smallfish. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 1."
L[6291]={A="{K|5}\nAnglers know it from the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the woods of Elwynn. It is fished from Fel Rock in Teldrassil by anyone with a pole and the patience.",H="{K|5}\nAnglers know it from the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. It is fished from Valley of Trials in Durotar by anyone with a pole and the patience."}
L[6292]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of Jerod's Landing in Elwynn Forest. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the Alterac Mountains. Anglers pull it from Jerod's Landing in Elwynn Forest.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of Dandred's Fold in Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. Anglers pull it from Dandred's Fold in Alterac Mountains."}
L[6293]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nThe place to look is the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Look to the west of the Western Plaguelands. {B|bats} A good share of the bats carry it.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the east of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {B|bats} A good share of the bats carry it."}
L[6294]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of Sandsorrow Watch in Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is found as readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. Anglers pull it from Sandsorrow Watch in Tanaris.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of Sandsorrow Watch in Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is found as readily in the Alterac Mountains. Anglers pull it from Sandsorrow Watch in Tanaris."}
L[6295]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nAnglers know it from the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is fished from Wellspring River in Teldrassil by anyone with a pole and the patience.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nAnglers know it from the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. It is fished from Stonebull Lake in Mulgore by anyone with a pole and the patience."}
L[6296]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nHunters find it most readily in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Look to the west of the Western Plaguelands. {B|bats} Perhaps one in four of the bats has one about them.",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the east of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {B|bats} Perhaps one in four of the bats has one about them."}
L[6297]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nAnglers know it from the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} The other place to look is Blackrock Mountain. Anglers pull it from the waters of the smoking Searing Gorge."
L[6298]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIt comes out of Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} {B|bats} Within, it is the bats who carry it."
L[6299]={A="{K|5}\nIt comes out of Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} The great prizes of Zul'Gurub are kept by Hakkar the Soulflayer and his high priests, and this is one of them. It is also fished from Ruins of Mathystra in Darkshore and Blackfathom Deeps.",H="{K|5}\nIt comes out of Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} The great prizes of Zul'Gurub are kept by Hakkar the Soulflayer and his high priests, and this is one of them. It is also fished from Blackfathom Deeps and the Shining Strand in Silverpine Forest."}
L[6300]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} The other place to look is the sands of Silithus. {P|insects} Perhaps one in four of the insects has one about them."
L[6301]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIt is a catch of O'Breen's Camp in Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is found as readily in Blackfathom Deeps. It is fished from O'Breen's Camp in Arathi Highlands by anyone with a pole and the patience.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIt is a catch of Stillwater Pond in Tirisfal Glades. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is found as readily in the Arathi Highlands. It is fished from Stillwater Pond in Tirisfal Glades by anyone with a pole and the patience."}
L[6302]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nThe place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} The other place to look is the sands of Silithus. {P|insects} Nearly every one of the insects carries one."
L[6303]={A="{K|5}\nIt is a catch of the Veiled Sea in Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is fished from the Veiled Sea in Teldrassil by anyone with a pole and the patience. It is also sometimes found on murlocs of south-eastern Elwynn Forest.",H="{K|5}\nIt is a catch of the Skittering Dark in Silverpine Forest. {Z|Silverpine Forest} The other place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is fished from the Skittering Dark in Silverpine Forest by anyone with a pole and the patience. It is also often found on humanoid foes of northern Tirisfal Glades and Durotar."}
L[6304]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIt is found inside a Message in a Bottle, and nowhere else in particular."
L[6305]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIt is found inside a Message in a Bottle, and nowhere else in particular."
L[6306]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIt is found inside a Message in a Bottle, and nowhere else in particular."
L[6307]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of the waters of the Veiled Sea. The other place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. Anglers pull it from the waters of the Veiled Sea.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of the waters of the Veiled Sea. It is fished from the waters of the Veiled Sea by anyone with a pole and the patience."}
L[6308]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nAnglers know it from the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is fished from Render's Valley in Redridge Mountains by anyone with a pole and the patience. It is also often found on humanoid foes of levels 20-31, most plentifully in north-western Ashenvale and Hillsbrad Foothills.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nAnglers know it from the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. It is fished from Kal'ai Ruins in Stranglethorn Vale by anyone with a pole and the patience. It is also often found on humanoid foes of levels 19-32, most plentifully in north-western Ashenvale and Hillsbrad Foothills."}
L[6309]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of Mystral Lake in Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the Deadmines. Anglers pull it from Mystral Lake in Ashenvale.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of Dreadmist Peak in the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Anglers pull it from Dreadmist Peak in the Barrens."}
L[6310]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of the Dragonmurk in Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is found as readily in the Arathi Highlands. It is fished from the Dragonmurk in Dustwallow Marsh by anyone with a pole and the patience."
L[6311]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of Mirkfallon Lake in Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} The other place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. It is fished from Mirkfallon Lake in Stonetalon Mountains by anyone with a pole and the patience."
L[6312]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Look to the south of the grey woods of Silverpine. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[6313]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is the south of the Arathi Highlands that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is the south of the Arathi Highlands that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[6314]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIt comes out of Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[6315]={A="{W|18} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the north. {P|Dark Iron dwarves} Only occasionally does one of the Dark Iron dwarves carry it.",H="{W|18} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is carried by the Dark Iron dwarves, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Dark Iron dwarves}"}
L[6316]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Raw Loch Frenzy and Mild Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 50) can attempt it."
L[6317]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nHunters find it most readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Look to the north of the loch country of Loch Modan. Nearly every one of the wild beasts there carries one. It is also fished from the Loch in Loch Modan.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is carried by the beasts, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. It is also fished from waters in Alliance territory."}
L[6318]="{W|10} {Q|3.0} {L|2} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} The rank and file of Shadowfang Keep have it about them."
L[6319]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} The rank and file of Shadowfang Keep have it about them."
L[6320]="{A|6} {Q|3.1} {L|2} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} The rank and file of Shadowfang Keep have it about them."
L[6321]="{J|11} {Q|3.0} {L|2} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} The rank and file of Shadowfang Keep have it about them."
L[6323]="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[6324]="{A|1} {Q|3.0} {L|2} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} {P|spellcasters} It is the spellcasters of Shadowfang Keep who have it about them."
L[6325]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Brilliant Smallfish. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 1) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|fishing suppliers} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the loch country of Loch Modan stock it. The shop is in the south of the land.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Brilliant Smallfish. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 1) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|fishing suppliers} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it."}
L[6326]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Slitherskin Mackerel. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 1 of a cook who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|fishing suppliers} {Z|Westfall} Merchants in the fallow farmland of Westfall and the dwarven city of Ironforge stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Slitherskin Mackerel. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 1 of a cook who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|fishing suppliers} {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Merchants in the blighted glades of Tirisfal and the red desert of Durotar stock it. The shop is in the east of the land."}
L[6327]="{W|5} {Q|3.1} {L|3}\nThe place to look is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Within the Alterac Mountains, they keep to the heart of the land. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them."
L[6328]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Longjaw Mud Snapper. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 50 of a cook who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|fishing suppliers} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the loch country of Loch Modan stock it. The shop is in the south of the land.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Longjaw Mud Snapper. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 50 of a cook who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|fishing suppliers} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it."}
L[6329]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Loch Frenzy Delight. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 50 of a cook who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|fishing suppliers} {Z|Loch Modan} A merchant in the loch country of Loch Modan stocks it.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Loch Frenzy Delight. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 50 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
L[6330]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Bristle Whisker Catfish. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 100) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Merchants in the farmland of Hillsbrad and the savannah of the Barrens stock it.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Bristle Whisker Catfish. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 100) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|cooking suppliers} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land."}
L[6331]="{W|15} {Q|3.0} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} It is the west of the Alterac Mountains that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. A good share of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
L[6332]={A="{J|11} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} Within the stormy coast of Darkshore, they keep to the north. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them. It is also found inside Red Sack of Gems.",H="{J|11} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. It is also found inside Red Sack of Gems."}
L[6333]={A="{W|15} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is the north of the stormy coast of Darkshore that rewards the search. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="{W|15} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[6335]="{A|2} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} Those who have a stake in Shadowfang Keep give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[6336]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. One of the wild beasts there in a score or so carries it."}
L[6337]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. One of the wild beasts there in a score or so carries it."}
L[6338]="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} Its making calls for Silver Bar and Rough Grinding Stone. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it."
L[6339]="{R|16}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|333} Its making calls for Silver Rod, Strange Dust and Greater Magic Essence. An enchanter of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it."
L[6340]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} The rank and file of Shadowfang Keep have it about them."
L[6341]="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts source is Shadowfang Keep, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Shadowfang Keep} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[6342]={A="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Chest - Minor Mana. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 20 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|enchanting suppliers} {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the boughs of Teldrassil stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Chest - Minor Mana. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 20 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|enchanting suppliers} {Z|Silverpine Forest} Merchants in the grey woods of Silverpine and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also sometimes found on beasts of levels 7-19, most plentifully in the Barrens."}
L[6344]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Bracer - Minor Spirit. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 60 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 12-24 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[6346]={A="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Chest - Lesser Mana. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 80) can follow it.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Chest - Lesser Mana. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 80) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|enchanting suppliers} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the grey woods of Silverpine stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[6347]={A="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Bracer - Minor Strength. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 80 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {B|stags} It is a rare find among the stags; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Bracer - Minor Strength. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 80 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the wild beasts there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[6348]={A="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Weapon - Minor Beastslayer. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 90) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Weapon - Minor Beastslayer. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 90) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} One of the wild beasts there in many hundreds carries it."}
L[6349]={A="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant 2H Weapon - Lesser Intellect. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 100) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|enchanting suppliers} {Z|Ironforge} A merchant in the dwarven city of Ironforge stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant 2H Weapon - Lesser Intellect. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 100) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|enchanting suppliers} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[6350]="{A|3} {Q|1.1} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Bronze Bar and Rough Grinding Stone. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 95."
L[6351]={A="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nAnglers know it from the Veiled Sea. It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. Anglers pull it from the waters of the Veiled Sea.",H="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nAnglers know it from the Veiled Sea. It is found as readily in the sands of Silithus. Anglers pull it from the waters of the Veiled Sea."}
L[6352]={A="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nAnglers know it from the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Anglers pull it from the Wetlands marsh and Baradin Bay.",H="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nAnglers know it from the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Anglers pull it from Lake Falathim, the Falfarren River and Mystral Lake."}
L[6353]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nAnglers know it from the Veiled Sea. It is fished from the waters of the Veiled Sea by anyone with a pole and the patience."
L[6354]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of the Wetlands marsh and Baradin Bay. {Z|Wetlands} Anglers pull it from the Wetlands marsh and Baradin Bay.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of Lake Falathim, the Falfarren River and Mystral Lake. {Z|Ashenvale} Anglers pull it from Lake Falathim, the Falfarren River and Mystral Lake."}
L[6355]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of South Seas in Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} The other place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. Anglers pull it from South Seas in Tanaris."
L[6356]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of the lakes and pools of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Anglers pull it from the lakes and pools of Teldrassil.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of the Southfury River and the coast of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} Anglers pull it from the Southfury River and the coast of Durotar."}
L[6357]={A="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nIt is a catch of the Cape of Stranglethorn in Stranglethorn Vale. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} The other place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. It is fished from the Cape of Stranglethorn in Stranglethorn Vale by anyone with a pole and the patience.",H="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nIt is a catch of the Great Sea in Tirisfal Glades. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is fished from the Great Sea in Tirisfal Glades by anyone with a pole and the patience."}
L[6358]={A="{I|Oily Blackmouth}\nIt is a catch of the Wetlands marsh and Baradin Bay. {Z|Wetlands} The other place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. Anglers pull it from the Wetlands marsh and Baradin Bay. It is also taken from Oily Blackmouth School and School of Tastyfish in Stranglethorn Vale and Darkshore.",H="{I|Oily Blackmouth}\nIt is a catch of Zul'Farrak in Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} The other place to look is the Veiled Sea. Anglers pull it from Zul'Farrak in Tanaris. It is also taken from Oily Blackmouth School and School of Tastyfish in Stranglethorn Vale and eastern Tanaris."}
L[6359]={A="{I|Firefin Snapper}\nIt is a catch of the Great Sea in Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. Anglers pull it from the Great Sea in Westfall. It is also taken from Firefin Snapper School and Oil Spill in Stranglethorn Vale and eastern Tanaris.",H="{I|Firefin Snapper}\nIt is a catch of the waters of the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} It is found as readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. Anglers pull it from the waters of the Stonetalon Mountains. It is also taken from Firefin Snapper School and Oil Spill in Stranglethorn Vale and eastern Tanaris."}
L[6360]="{W|4} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is a catch of Western Strand in Hillsbrad Foothills. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Anglers pull it from Western Strand in Hillsbrad Foothills."
L[6361]={A="{K|5}\nAnglers know it from the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. Anglers pull it from the Zoram Strand in Ashenvale. It is also often found on sea creatures of Darkshore and northern Loch Modan.",H="{K|5}\nAnglers know it from the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. Anglers pull it from the Zoram Strand in Ashenvale. It is also often found on beasts of levels 12-16, most plentifully in the central Barrens and Silverpine Forest."}
L[6362]="{K|5}\nIt is a catch of Stromgarde Keep in Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Anglers pull it from Stromgarde Keep in Arathi Highlands. It is also often found on beasts of levels 34-41, most plentifully in northern Dustwallow Marsh."
L[6363]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nAnglers know it from the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is fished from Drywhisker Gorge in Arathi Highlands by anyone with a pole and the patience."
L[6365]={A="{W|20} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|fishing suppliers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="{W|20} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|fishing suppliers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[6366]={A="{W|20} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} {B|wolves} It is a very rare find among the wolves, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{W|20} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} {B|wolves} It is a very rare find among the wolves, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[6367]="The Big Iron Fishing Pole is the heavy pole of the Shimmering Flats' anglers, better than the plain pole and found nowhere in a shop.\nIt turns up in the shellfish traps of the Shimmering Flats in Thousand Needles, and anglers wade the salt flats for it."
L[6368]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Rainbow Fin Albacore. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 50 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|fishermans} {Z|Wetlands} Merchants in the marshes of the Wetlands and the savannah of the Barrens stock it. The shop is in the west of the land.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Rainbow Fin Albacore. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 50 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|fishing suppliers} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the savannah of the Barrens stock it. The shop is in the north-east of the land."}
L[6369]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Rockscale Cod. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|fishermans} {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Merchants in the farmland of Hillsbrad and the jungles of Stranglethorn stock it.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Rockscale Cod. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|fishing suppliers} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land."}
L[6370]="{R|17}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Oily Blackmouth and Empty Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 80) can attempt it."
L[6371]="{R|17}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Firefin Snapper and Empty Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 130) can attempt it."
L[6372]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Swiftthistle, Blackmouth Oil and Empty Vial. An alchemist of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it."
L[6373]="{K|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Fire Oil, Kingsblood and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 140."
L[6375]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Bracer - Lesser Spirit. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 120 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 16-29 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[6377]={A="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Boots - Minor Agility. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 125) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Merchants in the Alterac Mountains and the farmland of Hillsbrad stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Boots - Minor Agility. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 125) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|enchanting suppliers} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[6378]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
