L[6384]="{J|4} {Q|1.0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Woolen Cloth, Blue Dye and Gray Dye. A tailor of middling skill (around 120) can attempt it."
L[6385]="{J|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Woolen Cloth, Green Dye and Gray Dye. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 120."
L[6386]="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
