L[6390]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Stylish Blue Shirt. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 120 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the south of the farmland of Hillsbrad. {P|murlocs} Nearly every one of the murlocs carries one."
L[6391]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Stylish Green Shirt. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 120) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the south-west. {P|murlocs} A good share of the murlocs carry it."
L[6392]="{A|1} {Q|3.1} {L|2} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} {P|spellcasters} Within, it is the spellcasters who carry it."
L[6393]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
