L[6433]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
L[6438]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\n{P|voidwalkers} It is found on almost all of the voidwalkers."
L[6439]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\n{P|voidwalkers} Perhaps one in four of the voidwalkers has one about them."
L[6440]="{J|11} {Q|3.1} {L|4}\nIts source is Zul'Farrak, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Zul'Farrak} The rank and file of Zul'Farrak have it about them."
L[6441]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the north-east of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6442]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the north-west of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. {P|murlocs} The murlocs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6443]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|43}\nIts source is the Wailing Caverns, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Wailing Caverns} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[6444]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} The other place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. Nearly every one of the wild beasts there carries one."
L[6445]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIts source is the Wailing Caverns, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Wailing Caverns} {B|wind serpents} It is the wind serpents and serpents of the Wailing Caverns who have it about them."
L[6446]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt comes out of the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[6447]="{A|6} {L|1}\nIts source is the Wailing Caverns, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Wailing Caverns} {B|turtles} It is the turtles of the Wailing Caverns who have it about them."
L[6448]="{W|15} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts source is the Wailing Caverns, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Wailing Caverns} The rank and file of the Wailing Caverns have it about them."
L[6449]="{A|1} {Q|3.1} {L|1} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[6450]="{K|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|129} Its making calls for Silk Cloth. A field medic of middling skill (around 150) can attempt it."
L[6451]="{K|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|129} This one is worked from Silk Cloth. It is first attempted at a First Aid skill of about 180."
L[6452]="{R|10}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|129} This one is worked from Small Venom Sac. It is first attempted at a First Aid skill of about 80."
L[6453]="{R|10}\nIt is made, not found. {T|129} This one is worked from Large Venom Sac. A field medic of middling skill (around 130) can attempt it."
L[6454]="A manual of the first aid trade, which teaches the making of Strong Anti-Venom. {T|129} Only a field medic of some skill (around 130) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."
L[6455]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nAnglers pull it from the waters of Azeroth, though our correspondents disagree on which.",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIt is a catch of the Southfury River and the Merchant Coast. {Z|The Barrens} It is fished from the Southfury River and the Merchant Coast by anyone with a pole and the patience."}
L[6456]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIt is a catch of the waters of the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Anglers pull it from the waters of the Stonetalon Mountains."
L[6457]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nAnglers know it from the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Anglers pull it from Blackwolf River in Stonetalon Mountains."
L[6458]={A="{K|5}\nIt comes out of Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} It is among the treasures that Hakkar the Soulflayer and his high priests hold there, and only their fall releases it. It is also fished from Blackwolf River in Stonetalon Mountains.",H="{K|5}\nIt comes out of Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} It is among the treasures that Hakkar the Soulflayer and his high priests hold there, and only their fall releases it. It is also fished from the Sludge Fen in the Barrens and Blackwolf River in Stonetalon Mountains."}
L[6459]="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts source is the Wailing Caverns, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Wailing Caverns} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[6460]="{A|3} {Q|3.1} {L|1} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is the Wailing Caverns, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Wailing Caverns} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[6461]="{A|1} {Q|3.1} {L|2} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is the Wailing Caverns, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Wailing Caverns} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[6463]="{J|11} {Q|3.0} {L|2} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[6464]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt comes out of the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThe place to look is the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. The strange creatures there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[6465]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt comes out of the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[6466]="{A|1} {C|43} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Deviate Scale, Cured Light Hide and Fine Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 90) can attempt it."
L[6467]="{A|2} {C|43} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Perfect Deviate Scale, Deviate Scale and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 105."
L[6468]="{A|2} {C|43} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Perfect Deviate Scale, Deviate Scale and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 115."
L[6469]="{W|2} {Q|3.0} {L|1} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is the Wailing Caverns, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Wailing Caverns} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[6470]={A="{I|Deviate Scale}\nIts source is the Wailing Caverns, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Wailing Caverns} The rank and file of the Wailing Caverns have it about them. It is also sometimes found on the beasts of Wailing Caverns.",H="{I|Deviate Scale}\nIt is a skinner's find, chiefly in the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. It is cut from the beasts there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience. It is also sometimes found on beasts of Wailing Caverns and the northern Barrens."}
L[6471]={A="{I|Perfect Deviate Scale}\nIt comes out of the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} The rank and file of the Wailing Caverns have it about them.",H="{I|Perfect Deviate Scale}\nSkinners know it from the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. It is cut from the beasts there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience."}
L[6472]="{W|4} {Q|3.0} {L|1} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is the Wailing Caverns, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Wailing Caverns} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[6473]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts source is the Wailing Caverns, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Wailing Caverns} The rank and file of the Wailing Caverns have it about them."
L[6474]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Deviate Scale Cloak. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 90 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|The Barrens} A merchant in the savannah of the Barrens stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[6475]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Deviate Scale Gloves. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 105) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|The Barrens} A merchant in the savannah of the Barrens stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[6476]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Deviate Scale Belt. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 115) can follow it.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} Those who have a stake in the Wailing Caverns give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[6477]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The folk of the savannah of the Barrens have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[6480]="{A|2} {C|43} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} Those who have a stake in the Wailing Caverns give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[6481]="{A|3} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} Those who have a stake in the Wailing Caverns give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[6482]="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} The folk of the farmland of Hillsbrad have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[6486]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nOur correspondents report it among the basilisks in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|basilisks}",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThe place to look is the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} Look to the north of the red desert of Durotar. {B|basilisks} The basilisks there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[6487]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} Look to the middle of the red desert of Durotar. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[6502]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The folk of the savannah of the Barrens have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[6503]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The folk of the savannah of the Barrens have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[6504]="{W|7} {Q|3.0} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} Those who have a stake in the Wailing Caverns give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[6505]="{W|10} {Q|3.0} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} Those who have a stake in the Wailing Caverns give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[6506]={A="{A|3} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Look to the north of the fallow farmland of Westfall. The other place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|3} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The other place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[6507]={A="{A|3} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|3} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[6508]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it."}
L[6509]={A="{A|3} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|3} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[6510]={A="{A|3} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|3} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is found as readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[6511]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 6-14, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[6512]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. One of the wild beasts there in a score or so carries it."}
