L[6521]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the north of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. The other place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The other place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[6522]={A="{I|Deviate Fish}\nAnglers know it from the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} It is fished from the waters of the Wailing Caverns by anyone with a pole and the patience. It is also taken from School of Deviate Fish.",H="{I|Deviate Fish}\nAnglers know it from the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The other place to look is the Wailing Caverns. Anglers pull it from Lushwater Oasis in the Barrens. It is also taken from School of Deviate Fish in the northern Barrens."}
L[6523]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|1}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land."}
L[6524]={A="{A|2} {L|1}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="{A|2} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land."}
