L[6526]={A="{A|2} {L|3}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="{A|2} {L|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land."}
L[6527]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. It turns up on the wild beasts there now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[6528]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[6529]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[6530]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also commonly carried by ghouls of levels 29-59, most plentifully in southern Western Plaguelands and Stratholme.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also commonly carried by ghouls of levels 43-59, most plentifully in southern Western Plaguelands and Stratholme."}
L[6531]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[6532]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[6533]="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} Its making calls for Bronze Bar, Nightcrawlers and Coarse Blasting Powder. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 150. It is also sold by fishing suppliers in most settlements (limited stock)."
L[6534]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nChests and strongboxes hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the savannah of the Barrens: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[6535]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} Within the red desert of Durotar, the caches keep to the north. Chests and strongboxes in the red desert of Durotar hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
