L[6684]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from Snufflenose Command Sticks.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north-east. It is taken from Snufflenose Command Sticks in the savannah of the Barrens."}
