L[6709]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Light Leather, Cured Light Hide and Coarse Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 90."
L[6710]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Moonglow Vest. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 90) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[6712]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} Its making calls for Bronze Bar, Handful of Copper Bolts and Weak Flux. An engineer of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it."
L[6713]={A="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{A|1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} The folk of the red desert of Durotar have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
L[6714]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} Its making calls for Coarse Blasting Powder and Wool Cloth. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 100."
L[6716]={A="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Ez-Thro Dynamite. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 100 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Ez-Thro Dynamite. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 100 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Only occasionally does one of the wild beasts there carry it."}
L[6717]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nAnglers know it from the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the sands of Silithus. It is fished from the Veiled Sea off Darkshore by anyone with a pole and the patience.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nAnglers know it from the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Anglers pull it from the Veiled Sea in Silithus."}
L[6718]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nAnglers know it from the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is fished from Twilight Shore in Darkshore by anyone with a pole and the patience.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nAnglers know it from the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is fished from the Veiled Sea in Silithus by anyone with a pole and the patience."}
