L[6753]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Look to the south-west of the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {P|trolls} The trolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nOur correspondents report it among the trolls in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|trolls}"}
