L[6767]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the north of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
