L[6775]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is given only by the Alliance's questgivers, in thanks for errands a traveller of the Horde cannot run."}
L[6776]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|52}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
