L[6782]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Within the woods of Elwynn, the caches keep to the south-east. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the woods of Elwynn: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[6783]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the south-east of the woods of Elwynn. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
