L[6808]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} Look to the west of the stormy coast of Darkshore. Chests and strongboxes in the stormy coast of Darkshore hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[6809]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is the west of the stormy coast of Darkshore that rewards the search. {P|ghosts and spirits} The ghosts and spirits there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the ghosts and spirits in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|ghosts and spirits}"}
L[6810]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the south-east of the woods of Elwynn. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[6811]="{K|5}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[6826]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} It is the north of the snows of Winterspring that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the rainforest of Feralas. Nearly every one of the wild beasts there carries one."
L[6827]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} It is given in thanks by those in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is given only by the Alliance's questgivers, in thanks for errands a traveller of the Horde cannot run."}
L[6828]="{A|6} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} The folk of the sodden Swamp of Sorrows have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[6829]="{W|7} {Q|3.1} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} Those who have a stake in the Scarlet Monastery give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[6830]="{W|1} {Q|3.1} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} Those who have a stake in the Scarlet Monastery give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[6831]="{W|15} {Q|3.0} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} Those who have a stake in the Scarlet Monastery give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[6832]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} The folk of the dark woods of Duskwood have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[6833]={A="{J|4}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Look to the south-west of the red hills around Lake Everstill. {P|gnolls} Only occasionally does one of the gnolls carry it.",H="{J|4}\nIt is carried by the gnolls, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|gnolls}"}
L[6835]={A="An accessory of the adventuring trade. {Q|1.1}\nIt is found in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the south of the woods of Elwynn. The other place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. It is taken from a Brightly Colored Egg in the woods of Elwynn.",H="An accessory of the adventuring trade. {Q|1.1}\nIt is found in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} The other place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is taken from a Brightly Colored Egg in the red desert of Durotar."}
L[6838]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the south. {B|spiders} The spiders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nOur correspondents report it among the spiders in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|spiders}"}
L[6839]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Look to the south-west of the Stonetalon Mountains. {B|chimaera} The chimaera there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6840]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Within the Stonetalon Mountains, they keep to the south-west. {B|chimaera} The chimaera there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[6841]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt comes out of Razorfen Kraul. {D|Razorfen Kraul} The rank and file of Razorfen Kraul have it about them."
L[6844]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Look to the east of the dark woods of Duskwood. {P|worgen} The worgen there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north of the jungles of Stranglethorn. {P|worgen} The worgen there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[6845]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Look to the south-east of the dark woods of Duskwood. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[6846]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} {P|Defias brigands} The Defias brigands there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the Defias brigands in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|Defias brigands}"}
L[6847]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|5}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Look to the east of the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {P|Dark Iron dwarves} The Dark Iron dwarves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|5}\nIt is carried by the Dark Iron dwarves, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Dark Iron dwarves}"}
L[6848]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is the south-west of the marshes of the Wetlands that rewards the search. It is taken from an Iron Coral in the marshes of the Wetlands.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is taken from an Iron Coral."}
L[6849]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Within the mesas of Thousand Needles, they keep to the north-west. It is taken from a Sunscorched Shell in the mesas of Thousand Needles."
L[6851]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[6866]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is given only by the Alliance's questgivers, in thanks for errands a traveller of the Horde cannot run."}
L[6887]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} This one is worked from Raw Spotted Yellowtail. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 225."
L[6888]="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} This one is worked from Small Egg and Mild Spices. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 1."
L[6889]={A="{I|Small Egg}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {B|carrion birds} It is found on almost all of the carrion birds and owls.",H="{I|Small Egg}\nThe place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} {B|carrion birds} Nearly every one of the carrion birds carries one."}
L[6890]="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} This one is worked from Bear Meat. A cook of middling skill (around 40) can attempt it."
L[6892]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Smoked Bear Meat. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 40) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Loch Modan} A merchant in the loch country of Loch Modan stocks it. The shop is in the west of the land.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Smoked Bear Meat. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 40) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Silverpine Forest} A merchant in the grey woods of Silverpine stocks it."}
L[6893]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nIts source is Gnomeregan, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Gnomeregan} {P|mechanical constructs} It is the mechanical constructs of Gnomeregan who have it about them."
L[6894]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found on almost all of the elementals."
L[6895]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in Shadowfang Keep. {D|Shadowfang Keep} It is taken from a Jordan's Hammer in Shadowfang Keep."
