L[6927]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nNearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one."
L[6930]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the heart of the land. {P|Dragonmaw orcs} The Dragonmaw orcs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is carried by the Dragonmaw orcs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|Dragonmaw orcs}"}
