L[6948]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is issued to new adventurers as they set out, and most are glad to be rid of it by the second town."
L[6949]="{K|9}\nIt is made, not found. {T|40} Its making calls for Dust of Decay and Leaded Vial. A rogue of middling skill (around 120) can attempt it. It is also sold by a reagent vendor."
