L[6986]="{R|12}\nThe place to look is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} The other place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {P|Syndicate rogues} It turns up on the Syndicate rogues now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[6987]={A="{I|Fish Scale}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. Only occasionally does one of the wild beasts there carry it.",H="{I|Fish Scale}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the north of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. Only occasionally does one of the wild beasts there carry it."}
