L[6992]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nMiners know it from the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Within the loch country of Loch Modan, the veins keep to the north-east. Miners strike it in the bailor's ores in the loch country of Loch Modan. It is also taken from Jordan's Shipment.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nMiners strike it in the bailor's ores. It is also taken from Jordan's Shipment."}
