L[6995]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Within the ancient forest of Ashenvale, they keep to the north-west. The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {P|murlocs} The murlocs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Within the ancient forest of Ashenvale, they keep to the north-west. The other place to look is Blackfathom Deeps. {P|naga} The naga and murlocs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[6997]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} It is the north of the mesas of Thousand Needles that rewards the search. Chests and strongboxes in the mesas of Thousand Needles hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} It is the north of the mesas of Thousand Needles that rewards the search. The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. Chests and strongboxes in the mesas of Thousand Needles hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
