L[7046]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Blue Dye and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 140."
L[7047]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Heavy Leather and Shadow Protection Potion. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 145."
L[7048]="{A|1} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Blue Dye and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 145."
L[7049]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Heavy Leather and Healing Potion. A tailor of middling skill (around 150) can attempt it."
L[7050]="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Silk Cloth and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 160."
L[7051]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Elemental Earth and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 170."
L[7052]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Silk Cloth, Elemental Water and Blue Dye. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 175."
L[7053]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Silk Cloth, Blue Dye and Fine Thread. A tailor of middling skill (around 175) can attempt it."
L[7054]="{A|1} {Q|3.0} {L|3} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Mageweave, Elemental Earth and Elemental Water. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 190."
L[7055]="{A|1} {C|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Iron Buckle and Red Dye. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 175."
L[7056]="{A|1} {C|1} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Silk Cloth, Red Dye and Fire Oil. A tailor of middling skill (around 180) can attempt it."
L[7057]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth and Silken Thread. A tailor of middling skill (around 180) can attempt it."
L[7058]="{A|1} {C|1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Red Dye and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 185."
L[7059]="{A|1} {C|1} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Fire Oil and Red Dye. A tailor of middling skill (around 190) can attempt it."
L[7060]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Silk Cloth, Naga Scale and Blue Dye. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 190."
L[7061]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Elemental Earth and Heavy Leather. A tailor of middling skill (around 195) can attempt it."
L[7062]="{A|1} {C|1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Red Dye and Silken Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 195."
L[7063]="{A|1} {C|1} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Silk Cloth, Elemental Fire and Mana Potion. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 205."
L[7064]="{A|1} {C|1} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Elemental Fire and Fire Oil. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 210."
L[7065]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Silk Cloth, Green Dye and Silken Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 165."
L[7067]="{I|Elemental Earth}\nThe place to look is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} {P|earth elementals} It turns up on the earth elementals now and then, perhaps once in twenty. It is also found inside Bag of Spoils."
L[7068]="{I|Elemental Fire}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Heart of Fire. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it. It is also commonly carried by fire elementals of levels 38-62, most plentifully in central Un'Goro Crater and Molten Core."
L[7069]="{I|Elemental Air}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} {P|air elementals} It is found on almost all of the air elementals. It is also found inside Bag of Spoils."
L[7070]="{I|Elemental Water}\nThe place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Within the rainforest of Feralas, they keep to the heart of the land. The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {P|water elementals} A good share of the water elementals carry it. It is also found inside Bag of Spoils."
L[7071]="{R|11}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Iron Bar. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 150) can attempt it."
L[7072]="{I|Naga Scale}\nThe place to look is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is the south-west of the Arathi Highlands that rewards the search. {P|murlocs} Nearly every one of the murlocs carries one."
L[7073]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {B|wolves} A good share of the wolves carry it.",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} {B|bats} A good share of the bats carry it."}
L[7074]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {B|wolves} Perhaps one in four of the wolves has one about them.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} {B|bats} Perhaps one in four of the bats has one about them."}
L[7075]="{I|Core of Earth}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is Maraudon. It turns up on the elementals now and then, perhaps once in twenty. It is also found inside Sack of Spoils."
L[7076]="{I|Essence of Earth}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Essence of Fire. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 275) can attempt it. It is also commonly carried by the fire elementals of Molten Core."
L[7077]="{I|Heart of Fire}\nHunters find it most readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} Look to the middle of the jungle crater of Un'Goro. It is found as readily in the Molten Core. {P|fire elementals} Nearly every one of the fire elementals carries one."
L[7078]="{I|Essence of Fire}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Essence of Air. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 275) can attempt it. It is also commonly carried by the fire elementals of Molten Core and Blackrock Depths."
L[7079]="{I|Globe of Water}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Within the rainforest of Feralas, they keep to the heart of the land. The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. {P|water elementals} One of the water elementals in a score or so carries it. It is also taken from Patch of Elemental Water in eastern Azshara."
L[7080]="{I|Essence of Water}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Essence of Earth. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 275) can attempt it. It is also commonly carried by elementals of levels 53-63, most plentifully in Eastern Plaguelands and central Winterspring."
L[7081]="{I|Breath of Wind}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Within the sands of Silithus, they keep to the north-west. The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {P|air elementals} It is found on almost all of the air elementals and earth elementals. It is also found inside Sack of Spoils."
L[7082]="{I|Essence of Air}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Essence of Water. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 275. It is also commonly carried by earth elementals of north-western Silithus."
L[7083]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[7084]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Crimson Silk Shoulders. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 190 of a tailor who attempts it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 32-45, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[7085]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Azure Shoulders. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 190) can follow it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 32-45 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[7086]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Earthen Silk Belt. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 195) can follow it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 31-45 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[7087]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Crimson Silk Cloak. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 180 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} A merchant in the jungles of Stranglethorn stocks it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[7088]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Crimson Silk Robe. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 205) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Tanaris} A merchant in the desert of Tanaris stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[7089]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Azure Silk Cloak. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Feralas} Merchants in the rainforest of Feralas and the mesas of Thousand Needles stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Azure Silk Cloak. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Arathi Highlands} A merchant in the Arathi Highlands stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[7090]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Green Silk Armor. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 165) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} {B|scorpids} It turns up on the scorpids now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[7091]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Truefaith Gloves. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 150) can follow it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 21-34 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[7092]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Hands of Darkness. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 145) can follow it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 21-35 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[7094]={A="{W|10} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is the north of the boughs of Teldrassil that rewards the search. It is a rare find among the elementals; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|10} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the elementals in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[7095]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is the north of the boughs of Teldrassil that rewards the search. {P|treants and bog beasts} It is a rare find among the treants and bog beasts; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the treants and bog beasts in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|treants and bog beasts}"}
L[7096]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} {B|owls} Perhaps one in four of the owls has one about them.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nThe place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} {B|plainstriders} It is found on almost all of the plainstriders."}
L[7097]={A="{K|5}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} {B|owls} One of the owls in a score or so carries it.",H="{K|5}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} {B|plainstriders} A good share of the plainstriders carry it."}
L[7098]={A="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nThe place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} It is the south-west of the snowfields of Dun Morogh that rewards the search. The other place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {B|boars} Nearly every one of the boars carries one.",H="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nThe place to look is the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is the south of the red desert of Durotar that rewards the search. The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {B|boars} Nearly every one of the boars carries one."}
L[7099]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nOur correspondents report it among the scorpids in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {B|scorpids}",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nThe place to look is the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} Look to the south of the red desert of Durotar. {B|scorpids} A good share of the scorpids carry it."}
L[7100]={A="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Within the boughs of Teldrassil, they keep to the north. {B|spiders} Perhaps one in four of the spiders has one about them.",H="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Within the blighted glades of Tirisfal, they keep to the west. The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. {B|spiders} Perhaps one in four of the spiders has one about them."}
L[7101]={A="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Within the boughs of Teldrassil, they keep to the north. {B|spiders} A good share of the spiders carry it.",H="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Within the blighted glades of Tirisfal, they keep to the west. It is found as readily in the red desert of Durotar. {B|spiders} Perhaps one in four of the spiders has one about them."}
L[7106]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} It is given in thanks by those in the dark woods of Duskwood whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[7107]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} It is given in thanks by those in the dark woods of Duskwood whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[7108]="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 6-14, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[7109]={A="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it."}
L[7110]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[7111]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[7112]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} It is found as readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
L[7113]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nHunters find it most readily in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} The other place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[7114]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Azure Silk Gloves. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 145 of a tailor who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Wetlands} A merchant in the marshes of the Wetlands stocks it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Azure Silk Gloves. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 145 of a tailor who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Desolace} A merchant in the grey wastes of Desolace stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[7115]="{W|0} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[7116]="{W|15} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[7117]="{W|4} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[7118]="{W|7} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[7119]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Look to the north-west of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {B|scorpids} The scorpids there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the south of the savannah of the Barrens. {B|scorpids} The scorpids there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[7120]="{A|6} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[7126]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} It is the east of the Stonetalon Mountains that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[7127]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the west of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. {P|townsfolk and militia} The townsfolk and militia there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[7128]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is the east of the ancient forest of Ashenvale that rewards the search. {P|satyrs} The satyrs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[7129]="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[7130]="{A|3} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[7131]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Within the marshes of the Wetlands, they keep to the heart of the land. {P|bandits} A good share of the bandits and Dragonmaw orcs carry it.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is carried by the bandits and Dragonmaw orcs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|bandits}"}
L[7132]="{A|3} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[7133]="{A|3} {Q|3.1} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[7146]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other. {C|1}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} Chests and strongboxes in the Scarlet Monastery hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[7148]="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} This one is worked from Iron Bar, Whirring Bronze Gizmo and Flask of Oil. An engineer of middling skill (around 165) can attempt it."
L[7166]="{W|15} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Copper Bar, Weak Flux and Rough Grinding Stone. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 30."
L[7189]="{A|1} {C|3} {Q|2.0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} Its making calls for Black Mageweave Boots, Mithril Tube and Heavy Leather. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 225."
L[7191]="{I|Fused Wiring}\nIt comes out of Gnomeregan. {D|Gnomeregan} {P|mechanical constructs} It is the mechanical constructs of Gnomeregan who have it about them. It is also found inside Scorched Rocket Boots."
L[7206]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is prepared on the spot by the adventurer who needs it, from what the errand provides."
L[7208]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nPickpockets know it from the Horde capital of Orgrimmar. {Z|Orgrimmar} Within the Horde capital of Orgrimmar, they keep to the south. Rogues lift it from the pockets of the humanoid foes there, who seldom notice."}
L[7209]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the east of the savannah of the Barrens. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[7226]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, they keep to the north-west. It is taken from a Bink's Toolbox in the snowfields of Dun Morogh.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from a Bink's Toolbox."}
L[7227]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is found in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Look to the west of the Western Plaguelands. It is taken from Balnir Snapdragons in the Western Plaguelands.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is found in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the east of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is found as readily in the Western Plaguelands. It is taken from Balnir Snapdragons in the blighted glades of Tirisfal."}
L[7228]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Thousand Needles} Merchants in the mesas of Thousand Needles and the city of Stormwind stock it. The shop is in the south-east of the land.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the mesas of Thousand Needles stock it. The shop is in the south of the land."}
L[7229]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is given in thanks by those in the stormy coast of Darkshore whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[7230]="{W|5} {Q|3.1} {L|1} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of the Deadmines. {D|The Deadmines} The rank and file of the Deadmines have it about them."
L[7231]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Look to the north of the grey woods of Silverpine. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[7247]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the city of Stormwind. {Z|Stormwind City} It is the south of the city of Stormwind that rewards the search. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the city of Stormwind: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Undercity. {Z|Undercity} It is the north-east of the Undercity that rewards the search. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the Undercity: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[7249]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is the north-west of the loch country of Loch Modan that rewards the search. It is taken from Miners' League Crates in the loch country of Loch Modan.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is taken from Miners' League Crates."}
L[7266]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is found in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is the east of the red hills around Lake Everstill that rewards the search. It is taken from an Ur's Treatise on Shadow Magic in the red hills around Lake Everstill.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is taken from an Ur's Treatise on Shadow Magic."}
L[7267]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} {B|spiders} The spiders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the spiders, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|spiders}"}
L[7268]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is prepared on the spot by the adventurer who needs it, from what the errand provides."
L[7270]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Within the ancient forest of Ashenvale, they keep to the heart of the land. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[7271]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} {B|kodo beasts} The kodo beasts there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[7272]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Look to the middle of the Arathi Highlands. It is taken from a Bolt Charged Bramble in the Arathi Highlands."
L[7273]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|9}\nThe place to look is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Within the Arathi Highlands, they keep to the south-east. {P|trolls} The trolls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[7274]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} It is taken from a Rituals of Power in the Scarlet Monastery."
L[7276]="{A|1} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Light Leather and Coarse Thread."
L[7277]="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Light Leather and Coarse Thread."
L[7278]="A quiver or ammunition pouch, the leatherworkers' product for the hunters.\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Light Leather and Coarse Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 30."
L[7279]="A quiver or ammunition pouch, the leatherworkers' product for the hunters.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Light Leather and Coarse Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 30) can attempt it."
L[7280]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Light Leather and Coarse Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 35) can attempt it."
L[7281]="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Light Leather and Coarse Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 70."
L[7282]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Light Leather, Cured Light Hide and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 95."
L[7283]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Black Whelp Scale, Medium Leather and Fine Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it."
L[7284]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Red Whelp Scale, Medium Leather and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 120."
L[7285]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Elixir of Minor Agility, Medium Leather and Fine Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 120) can attempt it."
L[7286]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nSkinners know it from the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Within the red hills around Lake Everstill, they keep to the south. {P|whelps} Skinners take it from the carcasses of the whelps there.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nOur correspondents report it among the whelps in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|whelps}"}
L[7287]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nSkinners know it from the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Look to the east of the marshes of the Wetlands. {P|whelps} It is cut from the whelps there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nOur correspondents report it among the whelps in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|whelps}"}
L[7288]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Rugged Leather Pants. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 35) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Rugged Leather Pants. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 35) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. One of the wild beasts there in many hundreds carries it."}
L[7289]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Black Whelp Cloak. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 100 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Redridge Mountains} A merchant in the red hills around Lake Everstill stocks it. The shop is in the south-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Black Whelp Cloak. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 100 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
L[7290]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Red Whelp Gloves. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 120) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Wetlands} A merchant in the marshes of the Wetlands stocks it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Red Whelp Gloves. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 120) can follow it.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
L[7291]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Look to the south-east of the grey wastes of Desolace. {P|cultists} The cultists there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[7292]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nChests and strongboxes hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[7293]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|47}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the north-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad. {P|Dalaran wizards} The Dalaran wizards there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|47}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Look to the south of the grey woods of Silverpine. The other place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {P|Dalaran wizards} The Dalaran wizards there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[7294]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from an Andron's Bookshelf.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the Undercity. {Z|Undercity} Within the Undercity, they keep to the south. It is taken from an Andron's Bookshelf in the Undercity."}
L[7295]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found inside a Tazan's Satchel, and nowhere else in particular."
L[7296]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} Within the Hinterlands, they keep to the heart of the land. The other place to look is the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {P|oozes and slimes} It is found on almost all of the oozes and slimes. It is also found inside containers such as Un'Goro Tested Sample and Corrupt Tested Sample."
L[7298]="{W|15} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[7306]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Look to the north of the grey woods of Silverpine. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[7307]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThe place to look is the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Within the dark woods of Duskwood, they keep to the north-west. A good share of the restless dead carry it.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nOur correspondents report it among the restless dead in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[7308]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the city of Stormwind. {Z|Stormwind City} Within the city of Stormwind, they keep to the south. It is taken from a Cantation of Manifestation in the city of Stormwind.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the Undercity. {Z|Undercity} Within the Undercity, they keep to the north-east. It is taken from a Cantation of Manifestation in the Undercity."}
L[7309]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|47}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the north-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad. Chests and strongboxes in the farmland of Hillsbrad hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|47}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the north-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad. The other place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. Chests and strongboxes in the farmland of Hillsbrad hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
