L[7350]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is found as readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[7351]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is found as readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it."}
L[7352]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Medium Leather, Elemental Earth and Fine Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 135) can attempt it."
