L[7354]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the Arathi Highlands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[7355]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the mesas of Thousand Needles. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[7356]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the mesas of Thousand Needles. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[7357]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[7358]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Medium Leather, Lucky Charm and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 140."
