L[7360]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Dark Leather Gloves. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 120 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 21-34 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[7361]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Herbalist's Gloves. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 135) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Ashenvale} Merchants in the ancient forest of Ashenvale and the Stonetalon Mountains stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Herbalist's Gloves. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 135) can follow it.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
L[7362]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Earthen Leather Shoulders. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 135) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Merchants in the Alterac Mountains and the farmland of Hillsbrad stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[7363]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Pilferer's Gloves. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 140 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 21-34, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[7364]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Heavy Earthen Gloves. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 145) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the south-west. {P|murlocs} It is found on almost all of the murlocs."
L[7365]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts source is the Deadmines, and nowhere in the open world. {D|The Deadmines} {P|mechanical constructs} It is the mechanical constructs of the Deadmines who have it about them."
L[7366]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the Arathi Highlands. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
