L[7371]={A="A quiver or ammunition pouch, the leatherworkers' product for the hunters.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|weapons merchants} {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the dwarven city of Ironforge stock it. It is also stitched by leatherworkers (Leatherworking 150).",H="A quiver or ammunition pouch, the leatherworkers' product for the hunters.\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Heavy Leather and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 150. It is also sold by a weapon merchant in Undercity."}
L[7372]="A quiver or ammunition pouch, the leatherworkers' product for the hunters.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Heavy Leather and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 150."
L[7373]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Heavy Leather, Black Dye and Fine Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 165."
L[7374]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Heavy Leather, Shadow Oil and Fine Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 175) can attempt it."
L[7375]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Green Whelp Scale, Heavy Leather and Fine Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 175) can attempt it."
L[7376]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Look to the north of the loch country of Loch Modan. It is taken from a Bingles's Blastencapper in the loch country of Loch Modan.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from a Bingles's Blastencapper."}
L[7377]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Heavy Leather, Elemental Earth and Elemental Water. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 180."
L[7378]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Heavy Leather, Black Dye and Silken Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 180."
L[7386]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Green Whelp Scale, Heavy Leather and Silken Thread. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 190) can attempt it."
L[7387]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Heavy Leather, Bolt of Silk Cloth and Black Dye. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 195) can attempt it."
L[7389]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|31}\nChests and strongboxes hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|31}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, the caches keep to the north. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the savannah of the Barrens: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[7390]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Heavy Leather, Shadowcat Hide and Shadow Oil. Only a leatherworker of real accomplishment (skill around 200) can attempt it."
L[7391]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Heavy Leather, Swiftness Potion and Thick Spider's Silk. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 200."
L[7392]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a skinner's find, chiefly in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} Within the sodden Swamp of Sorrows, they keep to the south-west. {P|whelps} Skinners take it from the carcasses of the whelps there."
