L[7498]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} {B|plainstriders} The plainstriders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is the north-west of the ancient forest of Ashenvale that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the poisoned forest of Felwood. {B|plainstriders} The plainstriders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[7499]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} {P|murlocs} The murlocs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is carried by the murlocs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|murlocs}"}
L[7500]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} {B|crabs} The crabs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Within the ancient forest of Ashenvale, they keep to the north-west. {B|crabs} The crabs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
