L[7560]={A="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Gnomish Universal Remote. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 125) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|engineering suppliers} {Z|Ironforge} Merchants in the dwarven city of Ironforge and the mesas of Thousand Needles stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Gnomish Universal Remote. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 125) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|engineering suppliers} {Z|Thousand Needles} A merchant in the mesas of Thousand Needles stocks it. The shop is in the south-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[7561]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Goblin Jumper Cables. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 165) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Duskwood} Merchants in the dark woods of Duskwood and the Alterac Mountains stock it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
