L[7613]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Green Leather Armor. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 155) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Wetlands} A merchant in the marshes of the Wetlands stocks it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Green Leather Armor. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 155) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Arathi Highlands} Merchants in the Arathi Highlands and the Hinterlands stock it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[7666]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} Within the loch country of Loch Modan, they keep to the south. The other place to look is the Badlands. {P|Dark Iron dwarves} One of the Dark Iron dwarves in a score or so carries it.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} Within the Badlands, they keep to the north. The other place to look is Uldaman. {P|Dark Iron dwarves} A good share of the Dark Iron dwarves and murlocs carry it."}
L[7667]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} The folk of the Badlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[7669]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in Uldaman. {D|Uldaman} Chests and strongboxes in Uldaman hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[7670]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt comes out of Uldaman. {D|Uldaman} {P|troggs} It is the troggs of Uldaman who have it about them."
L[7671]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in Uldaman. {D|Uldaman} It is taken from a Conspicuous Urn in Uldaman."
L[7672]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt comes out of Uldaman. {D|Uldaman} The rank and file of Uldaman have it about them."
L[7673]="{J|2} {Q|3.1} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} The folk of the Badlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[7675]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|0}\nPickpockets know it from the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Within the woods of Elwynn, they keep to the south. {P|Defias brigands} Rogues lift it from the pockets of the Defias brigands there, who seldom notice.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the Defias brigands in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|Defias brigands}"}
L[7676]="{K|6}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Swiftthistle and Refreshing Spring Water. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 60. It is also awarded for completing a quest."
L[7679]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt comes out of Uldaman. {D|Uldaman} {B|bats} It is the bats of Uldaman who have it about them."
L[7680]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt comes out of Uldaman. {D|Uldaman} {B|basilisks} Within, it is the basilisks who carry it."
L[7682]="{W|15} {Q|3.1} {L|2} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} The rank and file of the Scarlet Monastery have it about them."
L[7683]="{W|13} {Q|1.0} {L|2}\nIts source is the Scarlet Monastery, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Scarlet Monastery} The rank and file of the Scarlet Monastery have it about them."
L[7684]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[7685]="{J|23} {Q|3.1} {L|3} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} The rank and file of the Scarlet Monastery have it about them."
L[7686]="{J|11} {Q|3.0} {L|2} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
