L[7717]="Ravager is the great axe of Herod, the Scarlet Champion, which whirls of its own accord in the hands of a strong enough wielder, as it does in his.\nHerod holds the Armory of the Scarlet Monastery in Tirisfal, and gives up his axe with his life."
L[7718]="{A|3} {Q|3.0} {L|3} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is the Scarlet Monastery, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Scarlet Monastery} The rank and file of the Scarlet Monastery have it about them."
