L[7723]="{W|5} {C|52} {Q|3.1} {L|3} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} Within, it is the Scarlet Crusaders who carry it."
L[7724]="{A|3} {Q|3.0} {L|3} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is the Scarlet Monastery, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} Within, it is the Scarlet Crusaders who carry it."
L[7726]="{A|6} {C|1} {Q|3.1} {L|3} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It is the Scarlet Crusaders of the Scarlet Monastery who have it about them."
L[7727]={A="{A|2} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nIts source is the Scarlet Monastery, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It is the Scarlet Crusaders of the Scarlet Monastery who have it about them.",H="{A|2} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} The other place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It is a very rare find among the Scarlet Crusaders, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[7728]="{A|1} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} Within, it is the Scarlet Crusaders who carry it."
