L[7734]="A bag containing, by the maker's account, six demons: or at least six spells of fire, frost and lightning that it hurls at random when shaken. It is a curio of the Sunken Temple's Atal'ai priests.\nThe Shade of Eranikus and the Atal'ai high priests of the Temple of Atal'Hakkar hold it."
L[7736]="{W|4} {Q|3.1} {L|3}\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It is the Scarlet Crusaders of the Scarlet Monastery who have it about them."
L[7737]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nPickpockets know it from the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Look to the north-west of the boughs of Teldrassil. Rogues lift it from the pockets of the humanoid foes there, who seldom notice.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[7738]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The folk of the stormy coast of Darkshore have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[7739]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The folk of the stormy coast of Darkshore have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[7740]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in Uldaman. {D|Uldaman} Chests and strongboxes in Uldaman hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[7741]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt comes out of Uldaman. {D|Uldaman} The rank and file of Uldaman have it about them."
L[7742]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Gnomish Cloaking Device. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 200) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Merchants in the Alterac Mountains and the Hinterlands stock it. The shop is in the south-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[7746]="{J|2} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} Those who have a stake in the Scarlet Monastery give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[7747]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given only by the Horde's questgivers, in thanks for errands a traveller of the Alliance cannot run.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} Those who have a stake in the Scarlet Monastery give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."}
