L[7806]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is found in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is the south of the woods of Elwynn that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. It is taken from a Brightly Colored Egg in the woods of Elwynn.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is found in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is found as readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is taken from a Brightly Colored Egg in the red desert of Durotar."}
L[7807]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is found in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is the south of the woods of Elwynn that rewards the search. The other place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. It is taken from a Brightly Colored Egg in the woods of Elwynn.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is found in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} The other place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is taken from a Brightly Colored Egg in the red desert of Durotar."}
L[7808]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is found in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the south of the woods of Elwynn. The other place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. It is taken from a Brightly Colored Egg in the woods of Elwynn.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is found in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} The other place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is taken from a Brightly Colored Egg in the red desert of Durotar."}
L[7812]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nOur correspondents report it among the water elementals in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|water elementals}",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} Within the grey woods of Silverpine, they keep to the heart of the land. {P|water elementals} The water elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[7846]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} {B|wolves} The wolves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[7847]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} {B|carrion birds} The carrion birds there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[7848]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} {P|earth elementals} The earth elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[7866]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nLockboxes are the strongboxes of travellers who did not survive to open them, carried off by whatever killed them. Only a rogue's picks or an engineer's seaforium will open one, and this is among what they hold."
L[7871]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} Within the red hills around Lake Everstill, the caches keep to the heart of the land. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the red hills around Lake Everstill: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nChests and strongboxes hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
L[7888]="{J|2} {Q|3.1} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} The folk of the Badlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[7906]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} {P|Blackrock orcs} The Blackrock orcs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Within the ash plains of the Burning Steppes, they keep to the south-east. {P|Blackrock orcs} The Blackrock orcs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[7907]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[7908]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, the caches keep to the south-east. Chests and strongboxes in the fallow farmland of Westfall hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[7909]="{I|Aquamarine}\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the south of the farmland of Hillsbrad. {P|murlocs} It is found on almost all of the murlocs. It is also found inside containers such as Red Sack of Gems and Yellow Sack of Gems."
L[7910]="{I|Star Ruby}\nHunters find it most readily in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} It is found as readily in the rainforest of Feralas. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it. It is also found inside containers such as Thaurissan Family Jewels and Red Sack of Gems."
L[7911]="{I|Truesilver Ore}\nMiners know it from the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is the Hinterlands. Miners strike it in the truesilver deposits in the sands of Silithus."
L[7912]="{I|Solid Stone}\nMiners know it from the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} It is found as readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. Miners strike it in the mithril deposits in the Hinterlands. It is also often found on earth elementals of levels 37-58, most plentifully in Badlands and Azshara."
L[7913]="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Iron Bar, Sharp Claw and Shadowgem. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 160) can attempt it."
L[7914]="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Iron Bar and Heavy Grinding Stone. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 160) can attempt it."
L[7915]="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} This one is worked from Iron Bar, Large Fang and Sharp Claw. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 175) can attempt it."
L[7916]="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} Its making calls for Iron Bar, Large Fang and Tigerseye. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 180."
L[7917]="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} Its making calls for Iron Bar, Heavy Grinding Stone and Large Fang. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 185) can attempt it."
L[7918]="{A|4} {C|14} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} This one is worked from Mithril Bar and Heavy Leather. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 205."
L[7919]="{A|4} {C|14} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} This one is worked from Mithril Bar and Mageweave Cloth. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 205) can attempt it."
L[7920]="{A|3} {C|14} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} This one is worked from Mithril Bar. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 205."
L[7921]="{A|4} {C|14} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} This one is worked from Mithril Bar and Lesser Moonstone. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 210."
L[7922]="{A|4} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Steel Bar and Solid Grinding Stone. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 215) can attempt it."
L[7923]={A="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other. {C|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Look to the south-east of the fallow farmland of Westfall. {P|Defias brigands} The Defias brigands there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other. {C|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the Defias brigands in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|Defias brigands}"}
L[7924]="{A|3} {C|14} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} Its making calls for Mithril Bar and Citrine. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 215."
L[7925]="{A|3} {C|14} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} Its making calls for Mithril Bar, Heavy Leather and Mageweave Cloth. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 220) can attempt it."
