L[7927]="{A|4} {C|14} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Mithril Bar, Mageweave Cloth and Truesilver Bar. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 220."
L[7928]="{A|4} {C|14} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Mithril Bar, Truesilver Bar and Thick Leather. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 225) can attempt it."
L[7929]="{A|3} {C|7} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Mithril Bar and Elemental Earth. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 230) can attempt it."
L[7930]="{A|4} {C|14} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Mithril Bar. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 230) can attempt it."
L[7931]="{A|3} {C|14} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} This one is worked from Mithril Bar and Mageweave Cloth. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 230."
L[7932]="{A|3} {C|14} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Mithril Bar, Thick Leather and Citrine. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 235."
L[7933]="{A|4} {C|14} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} Its making calls for Mithril Bar and Thick Leather. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 235) can attempt it."
L[7934]="{A|4} {C|14} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Mithril Bar and Aquamarine. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 245."
