L[7963]="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Steel Bar and Heavy Grinding Stone. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 200) can attempt it."
