L[8136]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is the south of the boughs of Teldrassil that rewards the search. The elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the elementals, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
