L[8144]="{A|4} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
L[8146]="{I|Wicked Claw}\nThe place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[8150]="{I|Deeprock Salt}\nThe place to look is the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} The other place to look is the fallen coast of Azshara. {P|earth elementals} Perhaps one in four of the earth elementals has one about them."
L[8151]="{I|Flask of Mojo}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, they keep to the heart of the land. The other place to look is Zul'Farrak. {P|trolls} It turns up on the trolls now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[8152]="{I|Flask of Big Mojo}\nHunters find it most readily in the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} Within the Hinterlands, they keep to the south-east. It is found as readily in the Temple of Atal'Hakkar. {P|trolls} One of the trolls in a score or so carries it."
L[8153]="{I|Wildvine}\nHerbalists know it from the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is found as readily in the Hinterlands. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the rainforest of Feralas. It is also commonly carried by trolls of the southern Hinterlands and central Stranglethorn Vale."
L[8154]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a skinner's find, chiefly in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} {B|scorpids} Skinners take it from the carcasses of the scorpids there."
L[8156]="{A|4} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
