L[8161]="{A|4} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
L[8162]="{A|4} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is found as readily in the desert of Tanaris. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[8163]="{A|4} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[8165]="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|22}\nIt is a skinner's find, chiefly in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Look to the north of the rainforest of Feralas. The other place to look is the snows of Winterspring. It is cut from the dragonkin there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience."
L[8167]="{I|Turtle Scale}\nSkinners know it from the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} Look to the east of the desert of Tanaris. The other place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {B|turtles} Skinners take it from the carcasses of the turtles there. It is also often found on turtles of levels 42-54, most plentifully in eastern Tanaris and the eastern Hinterlands."
L[8168]="{I|Jet Black Feather}\nHunters find it most readily in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Within the Blasted Lands, they keep to the north. {B|carrion birds} Nearly every one of the carrion birds carries one."
L[8169]="{I|Thick Hide}\nSkinners know it from the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} The other place to look is Maraudon. It is cut from the beasts there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience."
L[8170]="{I|Rugged Leather}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Thick Leather. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 230. It is also skinned from a variety of creatures of levels 49-60 in Winterspring and Eastern Plaguelands."
L[8171]="{I|Rugged Hide}\nIt is a skinner's find, chiefly in the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. It is cut from a variety of creatures there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience."
L[8172]="{R|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Thick Hide and Deeprock Salt. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 180."
L[8173]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Thick Leather and Silken Thread. Only a leatherworker of real accomplishment (skill around 200) can attempt it. It is also often found on the humanoid foes of Uldaman."
L[8174]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Heavy Leather, Cured Heavy Hide and Silken Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 200."
L[8175]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Thick Leather and Silken Thread. Only a leatherworker of real accomplishment (skill around 205) can attempt it."
L[8176]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Thick Leather and Silken Thread. Only a leatherworker of real accomplishment (skill around 205) can attempt it."
L[8177]={A="{W|8} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it.",H="{W|8} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is found as readily in the red desert of Durotar. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."}
L[8178]={A="{W|8} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. Chests and strongboxes in the woods of Elwynn hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="{W|8} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. Chests and strongboxes in the red desert of Durotar hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
L[8179]="{W|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 6-8 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[8180]="{W|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 6-14 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[8181]={A="{W|3} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is found as readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{W|3} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Within the plains of Mulgore, they keep to the north. The other place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[8182]={A="{W|3} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Look to the south of the boughs of Teldrassil. The other place to look is the snowfields of Dun Morogh. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it.",H="{W|3} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[8183]={A="{W|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} It is the north of the Stonetalon Mountains that rewards the search. The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{W|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the south of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. The other place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
L[8184]="{W|19} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[8185]="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Thick Leather, Turtle Scale and Heavy Silken Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 235."
L[8186]={A="{W|19} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} It is the north of the Stonetalon Mountains that rewards the search. The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{W|19} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the south of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. The other place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
