L[8210]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Thick Leather, Wildvine and Cured Thick Hide. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 220."
L[8211]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Thick Leather, Wildvine and Cured Thick Hide. Only a leatherworker of real accomplishment (skill around 225) can attempt it."
L[8212]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Thick Leather, Wildvine and Cured Thick Hide. Only a leatherworker of real accomplishment (skill around 250) can attempt it."
L[8213]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Thick Leather, Wildvine and Cured Thick Hide. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 245."
L[8214]="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Thick Leather, Wildvine and Cured Thick Hide. Only a leatherworker of real accomplishment (skill around 225) can attempt it."
L[8215]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Thick Leather, Wildvine and Cured Thick Hide. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 250."
L[8216]="{A|1} {C|8} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Thick Leather, Flask of Big Mojo and Heavy Silken Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 240."
L[8217]="A quiver or ammunition pouch, the leatherworkers' product for the hunters.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Thick Leather, Cured Thick Hide and Elixir of Agility. Only a leatherworker of real accomplishment (skill around 225) can attempt it."
L[8218]="A quiver or ammunition pouch, the leatherworkers' product for the hunters.\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Thick Leather, Cured Thick Hide and Elixir of Greater Defense. Only a leatherworker of real accomplishment (skill around 225) can attempt it."
L[8223]="{W|7} {Q|3.0} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} It is the south-east of the mesas of Thousand Needles that rewards the search. It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."
L[8224]="{W|7} {C|21} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Within the mesas of Thousand Needles, they keep to the south-east. {P|insects} Perhaps one in four of the insects has one about them."
L[8225]="{W|7} {Q|3.1} {L|3}\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It is the Scarlet Crusaders of the Scarlet Monastery who have it about them."
L[8226]="{W|7} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nIts source is the Scarlet Monastery, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It is the Scarlet Crusaders of the Scarlet Monastery who have it about them."
L[8244]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Look to the middle of the Blasted Lands. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the Blasted Lands, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[8245]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|5}\nHunters find it most readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} The other place to look is the sands of Silithus. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[8246]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nThe place to look is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} It is found as readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[8247]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
