L[8343]={A="{I|Heavy Silken Thread}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{I|Heavy Silken Thread}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[8344]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Within the boughs of Teldrassil, they keep to the north. {B|spiders} The spiders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the spiders, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|spiders}"}
L[8345]="{A|2} {Q|3.1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Thick Leather, Thick Wolfhide and Wicked Claw. Only a leatherworker of real accomplishment (skill around 225) can attempt it."
L[8346]="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Thick Leather, Globe of Water and Core of Earth. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 230."
L[8347]="{A|3} {C|22} {Q|3.1} {L|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Thick Leather, Worn Dragonscale and Heavy Silken Thread. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 225."
L[8348]="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Thick Leather, Heart of Fire and Core of Earth. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 250."
L[8349]="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Thick Leather, Jet Black Feather and Black Pearl. Only a leatherworker of real accomplishment (skill around 250) can attempt it."
L[8350]={A="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nAnglers know it from the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is fished from Cliffspring River in Darkshore by anyone with a pole and the patience.",H="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nAnglers know it from the Undercity. {Z|Undercity} It is found as readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. It is fished from the waters of the Undercity by anyone with a pole and the patience."}
L[8363]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|8}\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is the south of the boughs of Teldrassil that rewards the search. {P|furbolg} The furbolg there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|8}\nOur correspondents report it among the furbolg in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|furbolg}"}
L[8364]={A="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} This one is worked from Raw Mithril Head Trout. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 175. It is also sometimes found on a variety of creatures of levels 17-43, most plentifully in northern Darkshore and Stranglethorn Vale.",H="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} This one is worked from Raw Mithril Head Trout. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 175."}
L[8365]="{K|5}\nIt is a catch of Kal'ai Ruins in Stranglethorn Vale. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} The other place to look is the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. It is fished from Kal'ai Ruins in Stranglethorn Vale by anyone with a pole and the patience."
L[8366]="{K|5}\nIt is a catch of the waters of the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Anglers pull it from the waters of the Arathi Highlands."
L[8367]="{A|3} {C|22} {Q|3.0} {L|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Thick Leather, Worn Dragonscale and Heavy Silken Thread. Only a leatherworker of real accomplishment (skill around 255) can attempt it."
L[8368]="{I|Thick Wolfhide}\nSkinners know it from the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} It is found as readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {B|wolves} It is cut from the wolves there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience."
L[8384]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Comfortable Leather Hat. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 200 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} It is found as readily in the desert of Tanaris. {P|pirates} It is a very rare find among the pirates and Scarlet Crusaders, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[8385]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Turtle Scale Gloves. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 205) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Feralas} A merchant in the rainforest of Feralas stocks it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Turtle Scale Gloves. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 205) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Feralas} A merchant in the rainforest of Feralas stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[8386]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Big Voodoo Robe. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 215 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 37-50 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[8387]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Big Voodoo Mask. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 220) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it."
L[8389]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Big Voodoo Pants. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 240 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 43-55 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[8390]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Big Voodoo Cloak. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 240 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} The other place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[8391]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Within the Blasted Lands, they keep to the north. {B|hyenas} It is found on almost all of the hyenas."
L[8392]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Look to the middle of the Blasted Lands. Nearly every one of the demons carries one."
L[8393]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Within the Blasted Lands, they keep to the north. {B|scorpids} Nearly every one of the scorpids carries one."
L[8394]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Look to the middle of the Blasted Lands. Nearly every one of the wild beasts there carries one."
L[8395]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Tough Scorpid Breastplate. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 220 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} Look to the north-east of the desert of Tanaris. {P|bandits} One of the bandits in a score or so carries it."
L[8396]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Within the Blasted Lands, they keep to the north. {B|carrion birds} Nearly every one of the carrion birds carries one."
L[8397]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Tough Scorpid Bracers. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 220) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} Look to the north-east of the desert of Tanaris. {P|Wastewander nomads} It turns up on the Wastewander nomads now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[8398]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Tough Scorpid Gloves. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 225) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is the north-east of the desert of Tanaris that rewards the search. {P|bandits} One of the bandits in a score or so carries it."
L[8399]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Tough Scorpid Boots. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 235) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is the north of the desert of Tanaris that rewards the search. {P|bandits} It turns up on the bandits now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[8400]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Tough Scorpid Shoulders. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 240 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is the north-east of the desert of Tanaris that rewards the search. {P|Wastewander nomads} One of the Wastewander nomads in a score or so carries it."
L[8401]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Tough Scorpid Leggings. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 245 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} Within the desert of Tanaris, they keep to the north. {P|bandits} It turns up on the bandits now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[8402]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Tough Scorpid Helm. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 250 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} Look to the north-east of the desert of Tanaris. {P|Wastewander nomads} It turns up on the Wastewander nomads now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[8403]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Wild Leather Shoulders. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 220 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[8404]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Wild Leather Vest. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 225 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[8405]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Wild Leather Helmet. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 225) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[8406]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Wild Leather Boots. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 245) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[8407]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Wild Leather Leggings. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 250 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[8408]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Wild Leather Cloak. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 250) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[8409]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Nightscape Shoulders. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 210 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|The Hinterlands} Merchants in the Hinterlands and the farmland of Hillsbrad stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Nightscape Shoulders. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 210 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Feralas} A merchant in the rainforest of Feralas stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[8410]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} The folk of the Blasted Lands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[8411]="{K|6}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} It is given in thanks by those in the Blasted Lands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[8412]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} The folk of the Blasted Lands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[8423]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} It is given in thanks by those in the Blasted Lands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[8424]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} It is given in thanks by those in the Blasted Lands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[8428]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} Look to the south-west of the desert of Tanaris. The elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[8429]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is the south-west of the desert of Tanaris that rewards the search. A good share of the elementals carry it."
L[8430]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nThe place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} Look to the south-west of the desert of Tanaris. A good share of the elementals carry it."
L[8431]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the city of Stormwind. {Z|Stormwind City} Look to the middle of the city of Stormwind. It is taken from a Spool of Light Chartreuse Silk Thread in the city of Stormwind.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from a Spool of Light Chartreuse Silk Thread."}
L[8432]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[8443]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is taken from a Gahz'ridian in the desert of Tanaris."
L[8444]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt comes out of Zul'Farrak. {D|Zul'Farrak} {P|trolls} It is the trolls of Zul'Farrak who have it about them."
L[8463]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Within the Blasted Lands, they keep to the north-east. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[8483]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nThe place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} Within the desert of Tanaris, they keep to the north-east. {P|bandits} Perhaps one in four of the bandits and Wastewander nomads has one about them."
L[8484]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is given in thanks by those in the desert of Tanaris whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[8485]={A="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Elwynn Forest} A merchant in the woods of Elwynn stocks it.",H="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
