L[8490]="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nIts source is the Deadmines, and nowhere in the open world. {D|The Deadmines} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[8491]={A="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the north-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. {P|Dalaran wizards} A good share of the Dalaran wizards carry it.",H="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the north-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. {P|Dalaran wizards} A good share of the Dalaran wizards carry it."}
L[8492]="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nIts source is the Deadmines, and nowhere in the open world. {D|The Deadmines} {P|Defias brigands} It is the Defias brigands of the Deadmines who have it about them."
L[8493]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
L[8494]="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, they keep to the south-west. {P|pirates} It is a very rare find among the pirates, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[8495]="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} A merchant in the jungles of Stranglethorn stocks it. The shop is in the south-west of the land."
L[8496]="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} A merchant in the jungles of Stranglethorn stocks it. The shop is in the south-west of the land."
L[8497]={A="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|merchants} {Z|Dun Morogh} A merchant in the snowfields of Dun Morogh stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land. It is also awarded for a quest in Elwynn Forest.",H="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[8498]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nHunters find it most readily in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} It is the west of the sodden Swamp of Sorrows that rewards the search. {P|whelps} One of the whelps in many hundreds carries it."
L[8499]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|1}\nThe place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Look to the east of the marshes of the Wetlands. {P|whelps} One of the whelps in many hundreds carries it.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|1}\nOur correspondents report it among the whelps in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|whelps}"}
