L[8508]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the east. {B|sea creatures} Nearly every one of the sea creatures carries one."
L[8523]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Undercity} A merchant in the Undercity stocks it."}
L[8524]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} The folk of the desert of Tanaris have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[8526]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} Within the Hinterlands, they keep to the heart of the land. It is taken from a Violet Tragan in the Hinterlands."
L[8529]="Noggenfogger Elixir is the brew of Marin Noggenfogger of Gadgetzan, who promised it would make the drinker light as a feather and could not say exactly what else. It shrinks some, makes skeletons of others, and lets the rest drift gently to the ground.\nMarin sells it in Gadgetzan to anyone who has fetched him the ingredients for his first batch: the spring water of a Tanaris oasis, the dust of a Caverns of Time dragon and the sacred candle of a Zul'Farrak troll."
L[8544]="{K|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|129} Its making calls for Mageweave Cloth. Only a field medic of real accomplishment (skill around 210) can attempt it."
L[8545]="{K|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|129} Its making calls for Mageweave Cloth."
L[8546]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is made, not found. {T|129} This one is worked from Deeprock Salt. Only a field medic of real accomplishment (skill around 250) can attempt it."
L[8548]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt comes out of Zul'Farrak. {D|Zul'Farrak} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders. It is also taken from Divino-matic Rod."
