L[8643]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found inside an Egg Crate, and nowhere else in particular."
L[8644]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found inside an Egg Crate, and nowhere else in particular."
L[8645]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found inside an Egg Crate, and nowhere else in particular."
L[8646]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found inside an Egg Crate, and nowhere else in particular."
L[8647]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} The folk of the desert of Tanaris have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[8683]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Look to the west of the woods of Elwynn. It is taken from Clara's Fresh Apples in the woods of Elwynn.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from Clara's Fresh Apples."}
L[8684]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} Within the Hinterlands, the caches keep to the heart of the land. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the Hinterlands: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
L[8703]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[8704]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[8705]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[8707]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts source is Zul'Farrak, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Zul'Farrak} {P|hydras} Within, it is the hydras who carry it."
L[8723]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} Within the desert of Tanaris, they keep to the heart of the land. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[8746]="{A|1} {Q|0.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it."
L[8747]="{A|2} {Q|0.1} {L|2}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 31-40, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[8748]="{A|3} {Q|0.0} {L|2}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 25-40 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[8749]="{A|1} {Q|0.1} {L|3}\nThe place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is found as readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[8750]="{A|2} {Q|0.1} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is found as readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[8751]="{A|3} {Q|0.1} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the fallen coast of Azshara. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[8752]="{A|3} {Q|0.0} {L|4}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 51-61 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[8753]="{A|2} {Q|0.1} {L|5}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 51-61 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[8754]="{A|1} {Q|0.1} {L|5}\nThe place to look is Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} It is found as readily in the Western Plaguelands. A good share of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
L[8755]="{A|4} {Q|0.0} {L|4}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 51-61, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[8766]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also sometimes found on the restless dead of levels 51-61, most plentifully in Western Plaguelands and Eastern Plaguelands.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins. It is also sometimes found on the restless dead of levels 51-61, most plentifully in Western Plaguelands and Eastern Plaguelands."}
L[8827]="{K|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Blackmouth Oil, Liferoot and Leaded Vial."
L[8831]="{I|Purple Lotus}\nHerbalists know it from the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the Hinterlands. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the rainforest of Feralas."
L[8836]="{I|Arthas' Tears}\nHerbalists know it from the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. Herbalists gather it in the Western Plaguelands, where it grows thickest."
L[8838]="{I|Sungrass}\nHerbalists know it from the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is found as readily in the Hinterlands. Herbalists gather it in the rainforest of Feralas, where it grows thickest."
L[8839]="{I|Blindweed}\nHerbalists know it from the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} It is the herbalists who bring it in in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. It is also sometimes found on elementals of Un'Goro Crater and Dire Maul."
L[8845]="{I|Ghost Mushroom}\nHerbalists know it from the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} It is found as readily in Maraudon. Herbalists gather it in the Hinterlands, where it grows thickest. It is also sold by a Darkmoon Faire vendor in western Mulgore (limited stock)."
L[8846]="{I|Gromsblood}\nHerbalists know it from the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} It is found as readily in the poisoned forest of Felwood. Herbalists gather it in the Blasted Lands, where it grows thickest. It is also sold by a reagent vendor in southern Winterspring (limited stock)."
L[8923]={A="{I|Essence of Agony}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also found inside containers such as Sturdy Junkbox and Worn Junkbox.",H="{I|Essence of Agony}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|poison vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides. It is also found inside containers such as Sturdy Junkbox and Worn Junkbox."}
