L[9255]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Within the rainforest of Feralas, they keep to the north-west. It is taken from a Flame of Lahassa in the rainforest of Feralas."
L[9256]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Look to the north of the rainforest of Feralas. It is taken from a Flame of Imbel in the rainforest of Feralas."
L[9257]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Look to the north of the rainforest of Feralas. It is taken from a Flame of Samha in the rainforest of Feralas."
L[9258]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Within the rainforest of Feralas, they keep to the north. It is taken from a Flame of Byltan in the rainforest of Feralas."
L[9259]="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|8}\nHunters find it most readily in the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} Within the Hinterlands, they keep to the south. {P|trolls} It is found on almost all of the trolls."
L[9260]="{K|6}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Dire Maul} A merchant in the ruins of Dire Maul stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also sometimes found on pirates of south-western Stranglethorn Vale and eastern Tanaris."
L[9261]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts source is Gnomeregan, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Gnomeregan} The rank and file of Gnomeregan have it about them."
L[9262]="{I|Black Vitriol}\nMiners know it from the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} The other place to look is the smoking Searing Gorge. Miners strike it in the mithril deposits in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes."
L[9264]="{K|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Ghost Mushroom and Crystal Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 250. It is also found inside containers such as Cenarion Circle Cache and Sturdy Junkbox."
L[9265]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[9275]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\n{P|pirates} Nearly every one of the pirates carries one."
L[9276]="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|29}\nThe place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} Within the desert of Tanaris, they keep to the east. {P|pirates} It turns up on the pirates now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[9277]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Look to the north-west of the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {P|mechanical constructs} The mechanical constructs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the mechanical constructs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|mechanical constructs}"}
L[9278]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in Gnomeregan. {D|Gnomeregan} It is taken from an Artificial Extrapolator in Gnomeregan."
L[9279]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, they keep to the north-west. {P|leper gnomes} Perhaps one in four of the leper gnomes has one about them.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is carried by the leper gnomes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {P|leper gnomes}"}
L[9285]="{A|4} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
L[9286]="{A|4} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThe place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is found as readily in the desert of Tanaris. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[9287]="{A|4} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is found as readily in the desert of Tanaris. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
