L[9304]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Gold Bar. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 225) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Tanaris} A merchant in the desert of Tanaris stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land."
L[9305]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Truesilver Bar. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 225 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Tanaris} A merchant in the desert of Tanaris stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
