L[9589]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is the north of the rainforest of Feralas that rewards the search. A variety of creatures there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
