L[9591]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} Look to the middle of the Hinterlands. The other place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
