L[9719]="A material of the crafting trades.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the north-west of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the Scarlet Monastery. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it."
L[9738]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts source is the Wailing Caverns, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Wailing Caverns} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[9739]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt comes out of the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} The rank and file of the Wailing Caverns have it about them."
