L[9741]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt comes out of the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} The rank and file of the Wailing Caverns have it about them."
L[9742]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} The other place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} The other place to look is the grey woods of Silverpine. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[9743]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the north of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} It is found as readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[9744]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the north of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. The other place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} The other place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."}
L[9745]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} Within the fallow farmland of Westfall, they keep to the north. It is found as readily in the loch country of Loch Modan. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Within the plains of Mulgore, they keep to the north. It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {P|Venture Company workers} It turns up on the Venture Company workers now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
