L[10285]="{I|Shadow Silk}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {B|spiders} A good share of the spiders carry it. It is also found inside containers such as Kovic's Trading Satchel and Cenarion Circle Cache."
L[10286]="{I|Heart of the Wild}\nThe place to look is the ruins of Dire Maul. {Z|Dire Maul} The other place to look is the jungle crater of Un'Goro. Perhaps one in four of the elementals has one about them."
L[10287]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Within the Stonetalon Mountains, they keep to the north. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the south. It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
L[10288]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the mesas of Thousand Needles. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[10289]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the Arathi Highlands. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[10290]={A="{I|Pink Dye}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{I|Pink Dye}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[10298]="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIt is found inside a Sparklematic-Wrapped Box, and nowhere else in particular."
L[10299]="{J|2} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIt is found inside a Sparklematic-Wrapped Box, and nowhere else in particular."
L[10300]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Red Mageweave Vest. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 215 of a tailor who attempts it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 36-50, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[10301]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of White Bandit Mask. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 215) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it."
L[10302]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Red Mageweave Pants. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 215) can follow it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 37-50 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[10305]="{K|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. A good share of the creatures of the region carry it. It is also sold by a Darkmoon Faire vendor in western Mulgore (limited stock)."
L[10306]="{K|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. Perhaps one in four of the creatures of the region has one about them. It is also sold by a Darkmoon Faire vendor in western Mulgore (limited stock)."
L[10307]="{K|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|Darkmoon Faire vendors} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also sometimes found on strange creatures of levels 56-62, most plentifully in Silithus."
L[10308]="{K|3}\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Perhaps one in four of the strange creatures has one about them. It is also sold by a Darkmoon Faire vendor in western Mulgore (limited stock)."
L[10309]="{K|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|Darkmoon Faire vendors} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also sometimes found on strange creatures of levels 56-62, most plentifully in Silithus."
L[10310]="{K|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Look to the south-west of the sands of Silithus. Perhaps one in four of the strange creatures has one about them. It is also sold by a Darkmoon Faire vendor in western Mulgore (limited stock)."
L[10311]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Orange Martial Shirt. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 220) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the night elf city of Darnassus stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Orange Martial Shirt. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 220) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[10312]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Red Mageweave Gloves. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 225 of a tailor who attempts it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 37-50, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[10314]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Lavender Mageweave Shirt. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 230) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Ironforge} A merchant in the dwarven city of Ironforge stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Lavender Mageweave Shirt. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 230) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[10315]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Red Mageweave Shoulders. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 235) can follow it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 42-55 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[10316]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Colorful Kilt. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 120) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the south of the farmland of Hillsbrad. {P|murlocs} It is found on almost all of the murlocs."
L[10317]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Pink Mageweave Shirt. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 235) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Ironforge} A merchant in the dwarven city of Ironforge stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Pink Mageweave Shirt. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 235) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[10318]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Admiral's Hat. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 240) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} A merchant in the jungles of Stranglethorn stocks it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[10320]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Red Mageweave Headband. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 240 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is found as readily in the rainforest of Feralas. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[10321]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Tuxedo Shirt. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 240) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Ironforge} A merchant in the dwarven city of Ironforge stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Tuxedo Shirt. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 240) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Undercity} A merchant in the Undercity stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[10323]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Tuxedo Pants. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 245) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Ironforge} A merchant in the dwarven city of Ironforge stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Tuxedo Pants. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 245) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Undercity} A merchant in the Undercity stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[10325]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of White Wedding Dress. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 250) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Stormwind City} A merchant in the city of Stormwind stocks it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of White Wedding Dress. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 250) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[10326]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Tuxedo Jacket. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 250) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Ironforge} A merchant in the dwarven city of Ironforge stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Tuxedo Jacket. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 250) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Undercity} A merchant in the Undercity stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[10328]="{A|3} {C|1} {Q|3.1} {L|3}\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} Within, it is the Scarlet Crusaders who carry it."
L[10329]="{A|3} {C|1} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It is the Scarlet Crusaders of the Scarlet Monastery who have it about them."
L[10330]="{A|3} {C|1} {Q|3.1} {L|3} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} The rank and file of the Scarlet Monastery have it about them."
L[10331]="{A|3} {C|1} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIts source is the Scarlet Monastery, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} Within, it is the Scarlet Crusaders who carry it."
L[10332]="{A|3} {C|1} {Q|3.0} {L|2}\nIts source is the Scarlet Monastery, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It is the Scarlet Crusaders of the Scarlet Monastery who have it about them."
L[10333]="{A|3} {C|1} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt comes out of the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} Within, it is the Scarlet Crusaders who carry it."
L[10338]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Within the Stonetalon Mountains, they keep to the south-east. {B|zhevra} The zhevra there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. {B|zhevra} The zhevra there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[10358]="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} The folk of the Badlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[10359]="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} The folk of the Badlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[10360]={A="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Durotar} Merchants in the red desert of Durotar and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the north of the land."}
