L[10511]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} {P|stone constructs} The stone constructs and fire elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[10512]="Ammunition for the hunters' bows and guns, sold by every bowyer and gunsmith and made by the engineers.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} This one is worked from Mithril Bar and Solid Blasting Powder. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 210."
