L[10515]="An accessory of the adventuring trade.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} The folk of the smoking Searing Gorge have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[10518]="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} This one is worked from Bolt of Mageweave, Shadow Silk and Unstable Trigger. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 225) can attempt it."
