L[10556]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the east of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the savannah of the Barrens: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
