L[10573]={A="{W|8} {Q|3.1} {L|3}\nThe place to look is Razorfen Downs. {D|Razorfen Downs} The other place to look is the mesas of Thousand Needles. It is a very rare find among the restless dead, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{W|8} {Q|3.1} {L|3}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the south of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. The other place to look is Razorfen Downs. {P|quilboar} It is a very rare find among the quilboar, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
