L[10639]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Within the boughs of Teldrassil, they keep to the heart of the land. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest. It is also taken from Hyacinth Mushroom in central Teldrassil.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the demons in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. It is also taken from Hyacinth Mushroom."}
L[10640]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is the north of the boughs of Teldrassil that rewards the search. {B|spiders} The spiders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is carried by the spiders, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|spiders}"}
L[10641]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is the north of the boughs of Teldrassil that rewards the search. It is taken from a Moonpetal Lily in the boughs of Teldrassil.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from a Moonpetal Lily."}
L[10644]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Goblin Rocket Fuel. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 210) can follow it.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} Its making calls for Blank Parchment and Engineer's Ink. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 205) can attempt it."
L[10645]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} This one is worked from Mithril Tube, Unstable Trigger and Essence of Undeath. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 240."
L[10646]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} Its making calls for Mageweave Cloth, Solid Blasting Powder and Unstable Trigger. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 205."
L[10647]={A="{I|Engineer's Ink}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|engineering suppliers} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{I|Engineer's Ink}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|engineering suppliers} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
