L[10858]={A="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Solid Iron Maul. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 155 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Merchants in the Arathi Highlands and the Badlands stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Solid Iron Maul. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 155 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Desolace} Merchants in the grey wastes of Desolace and the Badlands stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[10918]="{K|9}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|40} Its making calls for Essence of Pain, Deathweed and Leaded Vial. A rogue of middling skill (around 140) can attempt it. It is also sold by a reagent vendor."
L[10919]="{A|1} {C|10} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Wailing Caverns. {D|Wailing Caverns} Those who have a stake in the Wailing Caverns give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[10920]="{K|9}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|40} Its making calls for Essence of Pain, Deathweed and Leaded Vial. A rogue of middling skill (around 180) can attempt it. It is also sold by a reagent vendor."
L[10921]="{K|9}\nIt is made, not found. {T|40} Its making calls for Essence of Agony, Deathweed and Crystal Vial. It is first attempted at a Poisons skill of about 220. It is also sold by a reagent vendor."
L[10922]="{K|9}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|reagent vendors} It is also mixed by rogues (Poisons 260)."
L[10938]={A="{I|Lesser Magic Essence}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|333} It is also sold by enchanting suppliers in Darnassus, Ironforge and elsewhere (limited stock).",H="{I|Lesser Magic Essence}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|333} It is also sold by enchanting suppliers in southern Silverpine Forest, Thunder Bluff and elsewhere (limited stock)."}
L[10939]="{R|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|333} This one is worked from Lesser Magic Essence. It is also distilled by enchanters from uncommon items of levels 16-20."
L[10940]={A="{I|Strange Dust}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|enchanting suppliers} {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the boughs of Teldrassil stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also distilled by enchanters from uncommon items of levels 5-25.",H="{I|Strange Dust}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|enchanting suppliers} {Z|Silverpine Forest} Merchants in the grey woods of Silverpine and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also distilled by enchanters from uncommon items of levels 5-25."}
L[10958]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the red hills around Lake Everstill. {Z|Redridge Mountains} It is the west of the red hills around Lake Everstill that rewards the search. It is taken from a Glinting Mud in the red hills around Lake Everstill.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is taken from a Glinting Mud."}
L[10959]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} It is given in thanks by those in the Blasted Lands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[10978]="{R|5}\nIt is distilled, not found. {T|333} This is drawn from uncommon and rare items of levels 16-25."
L[10998]="{R|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|333} It is also distilled by enchanters from uncommon items of levels 21-25."
L[10999]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[11000]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other. {C|5}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[11018]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nThe place to look is the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} It is found on almost all of the creatures of the region. It is also taken from Un'Goro Dirt Pile in Un'Goro Crater."
L[11020]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the night elf city of Darnassus stock it. The shop is in the west of the land.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land."}
L[11022]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the night elf city of Darnassus stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. It is also awarded by quests in Darnassus and Feralas.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. It is also awarded by quests in Thunder Bluff and Feralas."}
L[11023]="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|merchants} {Z|Thousand Needles} A merchant in the mesas of Thousand Needles stocks it. The shop is in the south-east of the land."
L[11026]="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|merchants} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the south of the land."
L[11027]="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|merchants} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[11038]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant 2H Weapon - Lesser Spirit. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 110) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} It is the south-west of the farmland of Hillsbrad that rewards the search. {P|murlocs} Nearly every one of the murlocs carries one."
L[11039]={A="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Cloak - Minor Agility. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 110) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Ashenvale} A merchant in the ancient forest of Ashenvale stocks it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Cloak - Minor Agility. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 110) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} A merchant in the Stonetalon Mountains stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[11040]="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is found inside an Evergreen Herb Casing, and nowhere else in particular."
L[11058]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Within the ash plains of the Burning Steppes, they keep to the east. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[11078]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nIts source is Blackrock Depths, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Depths} {P|Dark Iron dwarves} Within, it is the Dark Iron dwarves who carry it."
L[11080]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Look to the middle of the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[11081]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Shield - Lesser Protection. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 115 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 16-29, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[11082]="{R|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|333} Its making calls for Lesser Astral Essence. It is also distilled by enchanters from uncommon items of levels 26-30."
L[11083]="{I|Soul Dust}\nIt is distilled, not found. {T|333} This is drawn from uncommon items of levels 26-35."
L[11084]="{R|5}\nIt is distilled, not found. {T|333} This is drawn from uncommon and rare items of levels 26-30."
L[11086]="{W|7} {Q|3.0} {L|4} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of Zul'Farrak. {D|Zul'Farrak} The rank and file of Zul'Farrak have it about them."
L[11098]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Cloak - Lesser Shadow Resistance. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 135) can follow it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 21-34 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[11101]={A="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Bracer - Lesser Strength. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 140) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Ashenvale} A merchant in the ancient forest of Ashenvale stocks it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Bracer - Lesser Strength. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 140) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} A merchant in the Stonetalon Mountains stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[11104]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found inside A Small Pack, and nowhere else in particular."
L[11105]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found inside A Small Pack, and nowhere else in particular."
L[11106]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found inside A Small Pack, and nowhere else in particular."
L[11108]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} The beasts there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest. It is also found inside A Small Pack."
L[11109]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {Z|Westfall} A merchant in the fallow farmland of Westfall stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
L[11110]="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nIt is taken from a Farm Chicken Egg."
L[11112]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} Within the jungle crater of Un'Goro, they keep to the south. It is taken from a Research Equipment in the jungle crater of Un'Goro."
L[11113]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from a Research Equipment."
L[11114]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} {B|primordial beasts} The primordial beasts there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest. It is also taken from Dinosaur Bone in south-western Un'Goro Crater."
L[11116]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nThe place to look is the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} It turns up on the wild beasts there now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[11118]="{J|11} {Q|3.0} {L|4} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Uldaman. {D|Uldaman} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[11119]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Within the woods of Elwynn, they keep to the heart of the land. It is taken from a Milly's Harvest in the woods of Elwynn.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from a Milly's Harvest."}
L[11120]={A="{W|4} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{W|4} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar. {Z|Orgrimmar} It is given in thanks by those in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
L[11121]="{W|7} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts source is Blackfathom Deeps, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[11122]="A carrot on a stick, the goblins' time-honoured method of persuading a mount to go faster. It works on horses, rams, wolves, raptors and kodo alike, which tells you something about mounts.\nIt is a prize of the Shimmering Flats' Mirage Raceway in Thousand Needles, given for a chain of errands on behalf of the gnome and goblin racers."
L[11123]="{A|1} {Q|3.0} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Temple of Atal'Hakkar. {D|Sunken Temple} Those who have a stake in the Temple of Atal'Hakkar give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[11124]="{A|3} {Q|3.1} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Temple of Atal'Hakkar. {D|Sunken Temple} Those who have a stake in the Temple of Atal'Hakkar give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[11126]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} The rank and file of Blackrock Depths have it about them."
L[11127]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is taken from Equipment Boxes.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the south-west of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is taken from Equipment Boxes in the blighted glades of Tirisfal."}
L[11128]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Gold Bar and Coarse Grinding Stone. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 150) can attempt it."
L[11129]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|45}\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} {P|fire elementals} It is the fire elementals of Blackrock Depths who have it about them."
L[11130]="{R|16}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|333} This one is worked from Golden Rod, Iridescent Pearl and Greater Astral Essence. An enchanter of middling skill (around 150) can attempt it."
L[11134]="{R|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|333} It is also distilled by enchanters from uncommon items of levels 31-35."
L[11135]="{R|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|333} This one is worked from Lesser Mystic Essence. It is also distilled by enchanters from uncommon items of levels 36-40."
L[11137]="{I|Vision Dust}\nIt is distilled, not found. {T|333} This is drawn from uncommon items of levels 36-45."
L[11138]="{R|5}\nIt is distilled, not found. {T|333} This is drawn from uncommon and rare items of levels 31-35."
L[11139]="{R|5}\nIt is distilled, not found. {T|333} This is drawn from uncommon and rare items of levels 36-40."
L[11140]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nIts source is Blackrock Depths, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Depths} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[11141]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {Z|Feralas} A merchant in the rainforest of Feralas stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land."
L[11143]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is taken from a Tool Bucket.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It is taken from a Tool Bucket in the savannah of the Barrens."}
L[11144]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Truesilver Bar and Heavy Grinding Stone. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 200."
L[11145]="{R|16}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|333} Its making calls for Truesilver Rod, Black Pearl and Greater Mystic Essence. Only an enchanter of real accomplishment (skill around 200) can attempt it."
L[11147]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the south-east of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the south-east of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[11148]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is the south-east of the ancient forest of Ashenvale that rewards the search. {P|Venture Company workers} The Venture Company workers there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {P|Venture Company workers} The Venture Company workers there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[11150]={A="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Gloves - Mining. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 145) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} Look to the north of the marshes of the Wetlands. {P|Dark Iron dwarves} Only occasionally does one of the Dark Iron dwarves carry it.",H="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Gloves - Mining. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 145) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Look to the south of the Arathi Highlands. {P|Dark Iron dwarves} Only occasionally does one of the Dark Iron dwarves carry it."}
L[11151]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Gloves - Herbalism. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 145) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the north of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is found as readily in the poisoned forest of Felwood. {P|treants and bog beasts} It is a rare find among the treants and bog beasts; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[11152]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Gloves - Fishing. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 145) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the south-west. {P|murlocs} Only occasionally does one of the murlocs carry it."
L[11163]={A="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Bracer - Lesser Deflection. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 170) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} A merchant in the farmland of Hillsbrad stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Bracer - Lesser Deflection. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 170) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Arathi Highlands} A merchant in the Arathi Highlands stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[11164]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Weapon - Lesser Beastslayer. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 26-39, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[11165]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Weapon - Lesser Elemental Slayer. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."
L[11166]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Gloves - Skinning. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 200) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the Arathi Highlands. {Z|Arathi Highlands} Look to the south-east of the Arathi Highlands. {P|trolls} It is a rare find among the trolls; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[11167]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Boots - Lesser Spirit. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 190 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 31-45 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[11168]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Shield - Lesser Block. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 195 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 33-45 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[11169]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found inside Eridan's Supplies, and nowhere else in particular."
L[11172]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} {B|bears} The bears and wolves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest. It is also found inside Eridan's Supplies."
L[11173]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} Look to the north of the poisoned forest of Felwood. The elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest. It is also found inside Eridan's Supplies."
L[11174]="{R|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|333} It is also distilled by enchanters from uncommon items of levels 41-45."
L[11175]="{R|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|333} This one is worked from Lesser Nether Essence. It is also distilled by enchanters from uncommon items of levels 46-50."
L[11176]="{I|Dream Dust}\nIt is distilled, not found. {T|333} This is drawn from uncommon items of levels 46-55."
L[11177]="{R|5}\nIt is distilled, not found. {T|333} This is drawn from uncommon, rare and epic items of levels 40-45."
L[11178]="{R|5}\nIt is distilled, not found. {T|333} This is drawn from uncommon, rare and epic items of levels 46-50."
L[11179]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} Within the jungle crater of Un'Goro, the caches keep to the heart of the land. Chests and strongboxes in the jungle crater of Un'Goro hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[11184]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is found in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} It is taken from a Blue Power Crystal in the jungle crater of Un'Goro."
L[11185]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is found in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} It is taken from a Green Power Crystal in the jungle crater of Un'Goro."
L[11186]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is found in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} It is taken from a Red Power Crystal in the jungle crater of Un'Goro."
L[11187]={A="{A|1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The folk of the boughs of Teldrassil have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[11188]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is found in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} It is taken from a Yellow Power Crystal in the jungle crater of Un'Goro."
L[11189]={A="{A|1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The folk of the boughs of Teldrassil have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[11190]={A="{A|1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The folk of the boughs of Teldrassil have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[11191]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} The folk of the woods of Elwynn have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[11192]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is given in thanks by those in the woods of Elwynn whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[11193]="{A|2} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} It is given in thanks by those in the Badlands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[11194]="{A|3} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} It is given in thanks by those in the Badlands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[11195]="{A|4} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} It is given in thanks by those in the Badlands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[11196]="{J|2} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Badlands. {Z|Badlands} The folk of the Badlands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[11197]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} The rank and file of Blackrock Depths have it about them."
L[11202]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Shield - Stamina. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 210 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 37-50 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[11203]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Gloves - Advanced Mining. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 215) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the middle of the jungles of Stranglethorn. {P|Venture Company workers} One of the Venture Company workers in a score or so carries it."
L[11204]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Bracer - Greater Spirit. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 220) can follow it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 37-50, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[11205]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Gloves - Advanced Herbalism. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 225 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} It is a rare find among the elementals; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[11206]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Cloak - Lesser Agility. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 225) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is the north of the desert of Tanaris that rewards the search. {P|Wastewander nomads} Only occasionally does one of the Wastewander nomads carry it."
L[11207]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Weapon - Fiery Weapon. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 265 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} The rank and file of Blackrock Depths have it about them."
L[11208]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Weapon - Demonslaying. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 230 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 43-55 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[11222]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\n{P|soldiers and mercenaries} Nearly every one of the soldiers and mercenaries carries one."
L[11223]={A="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Bracer - Deflection. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 235 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the night elf city of Darnassus stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Bracer - Deflection. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 235 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} A merchant in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[11224]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Shield - Frost Resistance. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 235) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} It is found as readily in the rainforest of Feralas. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[11225]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Bracer - Greater Stamina. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 245 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nIt is found inside a Lard's Special Picnic Basket, and nowhere else in particular."
L[11226]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Gloves - Riding Skill. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 250 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is found as readily in Maraudon. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[11227]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from a Krom'zar's Banner."
L[11229]="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is given in thanks by those in the ancient forest of Ashenvale whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[11230]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is prepared on the spot by the adventurer who needs it, from what the errand provides."
L[11242]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Look to the north of the rainforest of Feralas. It is taken from an Evoroot in the rainforest of Feralas."
L[11243]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The folk of the rainforest of Feralas have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[11262]="{J|23} {Q|3.0} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} Those who have a stake in the Scarlet Monastery give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[11263]="{W|19} {Q|3.0} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[11265]={A="{W|5} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} It is given in thanks by those in the dark woods of Duskwood whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{W|5} {Q|2.1}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[11266]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} The elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[11268]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} The rank and file of Blackrock Depths have it about them."
L[11269]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[11284]={A="Ammunition for the hunters' bows and guns, sold by every bowyer and gunsmith and made by the engineers.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="Ammunition for the hunters' bows and guns, sold by every bowyer and gunsmith and made by the engineers.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[11285]={A="Ammunition for the hunters' bows and guns, sold by every bowyer and gunsmith and made by the engineers.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="Ammunition for the hunters' bows and guns, sold by every bowyer and gunsmith and made by the engineers.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[11287]="{W|19} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|333} This one is worked from Simple Wood and Lesser Magic Essence. An enchanter of middling skill (around 10) can attempt it."
L[11288]="{W|19} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|333} Its making calls for Simple Wood and Greater Magic Essence. An enchanter of middling skill (around 70) can attempt it."
L[11289]="{W|19} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|333} This one is worked from Star Wood, Lesser Mystic Essence and Soul Dust. It is first attempted at a Enchanting skill of about 155."
L[11290]="{W|19} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|333} This one is worked from Star Wood, Greater Mystic Essence and Vision Dust. An enchanter of middling skill (around 175) can attempt it."
L[11291]={A="{I|Star Wood}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|enchanting suppliers} {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the boughs of Teldrassil stock it. The shop is in the south of the land.",H="{I|Star Wood}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|enchanting suppliers} {Z|Silverpine Forest} Merchants in the grey woods of Silverpine and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the south of the land."}
L[11302]="{J|12} {Q|3.0} {L|4}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is the west of the sands of Silithus that rewards the search. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the sands of Silithus, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[11303]={A="{W|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|bow merchants} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the boughs of Teldrassil stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="{W|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|bow merchants} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[11304]={A="{W|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|bowyers} {Z|Duskwood} Merchants in the dark woods of Duskwood and the marshes of the Wetlands stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="{W|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|bowyers} {Z|Silverpine Forest} Merchants in the grey woods of Silverpine and the savannah of the Barrens stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[11305]={A="{W|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|bowyers} {Z|Ashenvale} Merchants in the ancient forest of Ashenvale and the mists of Dustwallow Marsh stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="{W|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|bowyers} {Z|Thousand Needles} Merchants in the mesas of Thousand Needles and the woods of Elwynn stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[11306]={A="{W|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|bow merchants} {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the night elf city of Darnassus stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="{W|2} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[11307]={A="{W|2} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|bow merchants} {Z|Ironforge} Merchants in the dwarven city of Ironforge and the city of Stormwind stock it. The shop is in the south-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="{W|2} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
