L[11309]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} It is taken from a Heart of the Mountain in Blackrock Depths."
L[11310]="{A|1} {Q|3.0} {L|4} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Uldaman, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Uldaman} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[11311]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nIts source is Uldaman, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Uldaman} The rank and file of Uldaman have it about them."
L[11312]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} The rank and file of Blackrock Depths have it about them."
L[11313]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts source is Blackrock Depths, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Depths} The rank and file of Blackrock Depths have it about them."
L[11315]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} It is taken from a Bloodpetal Sprout in the jungle crater of Un'Goro."
L[11316]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} {P|carnivorous plants} The carnivorous plants there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[11318]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|41}\nIts source is the Temple of Atal'Hakkar, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Sunken Temple} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
