L[11324]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is given in thanks by those in the jungles of Stranglethorn whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[11325]="{K|6}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it. It is also taken from Dark Iron Ale Mug within Blackrock Depths."
L[11362]={A="A quiver or ammunition pouch, the leatherworkers' product for the hunters.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|bowyers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="A quiver or ammunition pouch, the leatherworkers' product for the hunters.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|bowyers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[11370]="{I|Dark Iron Ore}\nMiners know it from the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} It is found as readily in the smoking Searing Gorge. It comes out of the dark iron deposits in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes, under the miner's pick. It is also often found on the elementals of Blackrock Depths."
L[11371]="{I|Dark Iron Bar}\nIt is made, not found. {T|186} This one is worked from Dark Iron Ore."
L[11382]="{I|Blood of the Mountain}\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[11384]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} It is the south-west of the Stonetalon Mountains that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {B|basilisks} A good share of the basilisks carry it."
