L[11387]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} Perhaps one in four of the wild beasts there has one about them."
L[11388]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Within the Blasted Lands, they keep to the heart of the land. It turns up on the wild beasts there now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
