L[11668]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} It is the north of the poisoned forest of Felwood that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is found on almost all of the demons.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} It is the north of the poisoned forest of Felwood that rewards the search. Nearly every one of the demons carries one."}
