L[11674]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} {P|satyrs} The satyrs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
