L[11684]="Ironfoe is a hammer of the Dark Iron dwarves' Shadowforge, so well-balanced that it strikes again of itself. It was the pride of the Shadowforge smiths.\nEmperor Dagran Thaurissan holds it in the Iron Hall of Blackrock Depths, and it is accounted one of the rarest prizes of that city."
L[11685]="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|4} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} The rank and file of Blackrock Depths have it about them."
