L[11723]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} Within the sodden Swamp of Sorrows, they keep to the east. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[11724]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Look to the middle of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
L[11725]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} Within the smoking Searing Gorge, they keep to the east. {B|spiders} The spiders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[11726]="{A|3} {Q|4.0} {L|5} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Blackrock Depths, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Depths} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[11727]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} Look to the south-east of the smoking Searing Gorge. It is taken from a Goodsteel Ledger in the smoking Searing Gorge."
L[11728]="{A|3} {Q|3.0} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
