L[11731]="{A|3} {Q|3.0} {L|5} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Blackrock Depths, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Depths} The rank and file of Blackrock Depths have it about them."
L[11732]="A book.\nThe place to look is Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} It is found as readily in the Western Plaguelands. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
L[11733]="A book.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 50-56 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[11734]="A book.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 50-56, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[11735]="{A|2} {Q|3.1} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[11736]="A book.\nThe place to look is Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} The other place to look is the Western Plaguelands. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[11737]="A book.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} It is found as readily in the Western Plaguelands. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[11742]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} The rank and file of Blackrock Depths have it about them."
L[11744]="{W|13} {Q|3.0} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
