L[11751]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Chests and strongboxes in Blackrock Depths hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
