L[11815]="The Hand of Justice is a trinket of the Dark Iron senate, a gavel-charm that lends its holder a second blow when the first lands.\nEmperor Dagran Thaurissan keeps it in the Iron Hall of Blackrock Depths."
L[11816]="{W|1} {Q|3.1} {L|5} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
