L[11818]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} {P|Dark Iron dwarves} One of the Dark Iron dwarves in a score or so carries it."
