L[11825]="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} Its making calls for Big Iron Bomb, Heart of Fire and Fused Wiring. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 205) can attempt it."
L[11826]="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} This one is worked from Core of Earth, Gyrochronatom and Fused Wiring. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 205) can attempt it."
L[11827]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Lil' Smoky. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 205) can follow it.\nIt comes wrapped in a Gnome Engineer's Renewal Gift, a festival present."
L[11828]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Pet Bombling. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 205) can follow it.\nIt comes wrapped in a Goblin Engineer's Renewal Gift, a festival present."
L[11829]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} Within the jungle crater of Un'Goro, they keep to the heart of the land. {P|fire elementals} The fire elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[11830]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} {B|primordial beasts} The primordial beasts there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[11831]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} {B|primordial beasts} The primordial beasts there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
