L[11835]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} It is the south of the jungle crater of Un'Goro that rewards the search. {P|insects} The insects there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[11837]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} It is the south of the jungle crater of Un'Goro that rewards the search. {P|insects} The insects there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
