L[12054]={A="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[12055]="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} It is found as readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[12056]="{J|11} {Q|2.1} {L|5}\nHunters find it most readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} The other place to look is the sands of Silithus. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[12057]="{J|11} {C|22} {Q|2.1} {L|5}\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is Zul'Gurub. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[12058]="{J|11} {Q|2.0} {L|5}\nLockboxes are the strongboxes of travellers who did not survive to open them, carried off by whatever killed them. Only a rogue's picks or an engineer's seaforium will open one, and this is among what they hold."
L[12059]="{J|2} {Q|3.0} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12061]="{W|7} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12062]="{W|15} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12065]="{J|12} {C|45} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12066]="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12082]="{A|2} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12083]="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12102]={A="{J|11} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the dwarven city of Ironforge. {Z|Ironforge} It is given in thanks by those in the dwarven city of Ironforge whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{J|11} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[12103]="{J|2} {Q|3.1} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Stratholme. {D|Stratholme} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[12108]="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12109]="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12110]="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12111]="{A|4} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12112]="{A|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12113]="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12114]="{A|2} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12115]="{A|4} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12122]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} It is given in thanks by those in the Blasted Lands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[12144]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Spire give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12162]={A="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Hardened Iron Shortsword. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 160 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|blacksmithing suppliers} {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the jungles of Stranglethorn stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Hardened Iron Shortsword. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 160 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|blacksmithing suppliers} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the jungles of Stranglethorn stock it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[12163]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Moonsteel Broadsword. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 180) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} A merchant in the jungles of Stranglethorn stocks it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[12164]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Massive Iron Axe. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 185) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} A merchant in the jungles of Stranglethorn stocks it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[12184]="{I|Raptor Flesh}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is found as readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {B|raptors} It is found on almost all of the raptors."
L[12185]="{A|1} {C|29} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is given in thanks by those in the jungles of Stranglethorn whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[12190]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Purple Lotus and Crystal Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 230."
L[12191]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} Look to the north of the stormy coast of Darkshore. Chests and strongboxes in the stormy coast of Darkshore hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nChests and strongboxes hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
L[12192]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} Look to the north of the stormy coast of Darkshore. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the stormy coast of Darkshore: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nChests and strongboxes hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
L[12202]="{I|Tiger Meat}\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the north of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. The other place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {B|great cats} It is found on almost all of the great cats."
L[12203]="{I|Red Wolf Meat}\nHunters find it most readily in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. {B|hyenas} Nearly every one of the hyenas and felhounds carries one."
L[12204]="{I|Heavy Kodo Meat}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} {B|kodo beasts} Nearly every one of the kodo beasts carries one."
L[12205]="{I|White Spider Meat}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {B|spiders} Nearly every one of the spiders carries one."
L[12206]="{I|Tender Crab Meat}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sodden Swamp of Sorrows. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {B|crabs} Perhaps one in four of the crabs has one about them."
L[12207]="{I|Giant Egg}\nThe place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Look to the north of the snows of Winterspring. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one."
L[12208]="{I|Tender Wolf Meat}\nHunters find it most readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {P|felhounds} It is found on almost all of the felhounds and hyenas."
L[12209]="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} Its making calls for Lean Wolf Flank and Mild Spices. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 125."
L[12210]="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} Its making calls for Raptor Flesh and Hot Spices. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 175."
L[12212]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Tiger Meat, Refreshing Spring Water and Shiny Red Apple. A cook of middling skill (around 175) can attempt it."
L[12213]="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} This one is worked from Mystery Meat and Hot Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 175) can attempt it."
L[12214]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Mystery Meat and Skin of Dwarven Stout. A cook of middling skill (around 175) can attempt it."
L[12215]="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} Its making calls for Heavy Kodo Meat, Soothing Spices and Refreshing Spring Water. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 200."
L[12216]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Tender Crab Meat and Hot Spices. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 225."
L[12217]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} This one is worked from Mystery Meat, Small Flame Sac and Hot Spices. Only a cook of real accomplishment (skill around 200) can attempt it."
L[12218]="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} Its making calls for Giant Egg and Soothing Spices. Only a cook of real accomplishment (skill around 225) can attempt it."
L[12219]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} The rank and file of Blackrock Spire have it about them."
L[12220]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the south of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {P|water elementals} The water elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[12223]={A="{I|Meaty Bat Wing}\nHunters find it most readily in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Look to the west of the Western Plaguelands. {B|bats} Nearly every one of the bats carries one.",H="{I|Meaty Bat Wing}\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the east of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {B|bats} Nearly every one of the bats carries one."}
L[12224]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} This one is worked from Meaty Bat Wing and Mild Spices. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 1."
L[12225]={A="{W|20}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The folk of the stormy coast of Darkshore have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{W|20}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[12226]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Crispy Bat Wing. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 1) can follow it.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Crispy Bat Wing. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 1) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Tirisfal Glades} A merchant in the blighted glades of Tirisfal stocks it."}
L[12227]="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Lean Wolf Steak. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 125) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {Z|Desolace} A merchant in the grey wastes of Desolace stocks it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[12228]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Roast Raptor. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the Arathi Highlands stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Roast Raptor. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the Arathi Highlands stock it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[12229]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Hot Wolf Ribs. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Feralas} Merchants in the rainforest of Feralas and the grey wastes of Desolace stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Hot Wolf Ribs. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Feralas} Merchants in the rainforest of Feralas and the grey wastes of Desolace stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[12230]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} Within the poisoned forest of Felwood, they keep to the heart of the land. {P|oozes and slimes} The oozes and slimes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[12231]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Jungle Stew. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 175 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|camp traders} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the grey wastes of Desolace stock it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Jungle Stew. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 175 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the grey wastes of Desolace stock it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[12232]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Carrion Surprise. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 175 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {Z|Desolace} A merchant in the grey wastes of Desolace stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Carrion Surprise. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 175 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Desolace} Merchants in the grey wastes of Desolace and the sodden Swamp of Sorrows stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[12233]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Mystery Stew. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Desolace} Merchants in the grey wastes of Desolace and the mists of Dustwallow Marsh stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Mystery Stew. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {Z|Desolace} A merchant in the grey wastes of Desolace stocks it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[12234]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found inside a Corrupt Tested Sample, and nowhere else in particular."
L[12235]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} {P|oozes and slimes} The oozes and slimes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[12236]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found inside an Un'Goro Tested Sample, and nowhere else in particular."
L[12237]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} {B|crabs} The crabs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the crabs, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it. {B|crabs}"}
L[12238]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is a catch of the Master's Glaive in Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} Anglers pull it from the Master's Glaive in Darkshore.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is a catch of the Veiled Sea in Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Anglers pull it from the Veiled Sea in Silithus."}
L[12239]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Dragonbreath Chili. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 200) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Merchants in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh and the grey wastes of Desolace stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Dragonbreath Chili. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 200) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Merchants in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh and the savannah of the Barrens stock it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[12240]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Heavy Kodo Stew. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 200) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Desolace} Merchants in the grey wastes of Desolace and the Stonetalon Mountains stock it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Heavy Kodo Stew. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 200) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Desolace} A merchant in the grey wastes of Desolace stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[12242]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is the west of the stormy coast of Darkshore that rewards the search. It is taken from a Beached Sea Creature in the stormy coast of Darkshore.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from a Beached Sea Creature."}
L[12243]="{W|6} {Q|3.0} {L|4} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is the Temple of Atal'Hakkar, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Sunken Temple} The rank and file of the Temple of Atal'Hakkar have it about them."
