L[12248]={A="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|weapon smiths} {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Merchants in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh and the woods of Elwynn stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="{W|15} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|Darkmoon Faire vendors} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the woods of Elwynn stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
