L[12251]={A="{W|10} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the woods of Elwynn stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="{W|10} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the mists of Dustwallow Marsh stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[12252]="{W|10} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} A merchant in the jungles of Stranglethorn stocks it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[12253]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} A merchant in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows stocks it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|light armor merchants} {Z|Feralas} Merchants in the rainforest of Feralas and the sodden Swamp of Sorrows stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[12254]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} Merchants in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows and the sanctuary of Moonglade stock it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|light armor merchants} {Z|Feralas} Merchants in the rainforest of Feralas and the sodden Swamp of Sorrows stock it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[12255]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|cloth & leather armor merchants} {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} Merchants in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[12256]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|cloth armor merchants} {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the night elf city of Darnassus stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|cloth & leather armor merchants} {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} Merchants in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[12257]="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} A merchant in the jungles of Stranglethorn stocks it. The shop is in the south-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[12259]="{W|15} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Steel Bar, Strong Flux and Moss Agate. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 180) can attempt it."
L[12260]="{W|15} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Steel Bar, Gold Bar and Elemental Fire. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 190) can attempt it."
L[12261]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Searing Golden Blade. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 190) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the south. {P|murlocs} The murlocs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[12264]="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Spire give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12282]="{W|1} {L|0}\nIt is issued to new adventurers as they set out, and most are glad to be rid of it by the second town."
L[12283]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is taken from a Broodling Essence."
L[12289]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} Look to the west of the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is taken from a Skeletal Sea Turtle in the stormy coast of Darkshore.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from a Skeletal Sea Turtle."}
L[12291]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\n{P|oozes and slimes} Nearly every one of the oozes and slimes carries one."
L[12293]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[12295]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is given in thanks by those in the fallow farmland of Westfall whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
