L[12334]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, they keep to the south. The giants there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest. It is also taken from Frostmaul Shards in southern Winterspring."
