L[12355]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from a Xabraxxis' Demon Bag."
L[12356]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Within the mesas of Thousand Needles, they keep to the north-west. It is taken from a Highperch Wyvern Egg in the mesas of Thousand Needles."
L[12358]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} It is taken from a Darkstone Tablet in Blackrock Spire."
L[12359]="{I|Thorium Bar}\nIt is made, not found. {T|186} Its making calls for Thorium Ore. It is first attempted at a Mining skill of about 250."
L[12360]="{I|Arcanite Bar}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Thorium Bar and Arcane Crystal. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 275) can attempt it."
L[12361]="{I|Blue Sapphire}\nIt is found inside Blue Sack of Gems, and nowhere else in particular."
L[12363]="{I|Arcane Crystal}\nMiners know it from the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the snows of Winterspring. Miners strike it in the thorium veins in the sands of Silithus. It is also found inside Yellow Sack of Gems."
L[12364]="{I|Huge Emerald}\nIt is found inside Green Sack of Gems, and nowhere else in particular."
L[12365]="{I|Dense Stone}\nMiners know it from the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is the jungle crater of Un'Goro. It comes out of the thorium veins in the sands of Silithus, under the miner's pick."
L[12366]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is a skinner's find, chiefly in the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, they keep to the heart of the land. Skinners take it from the carcasses of the humanoid foes there."
L[12367]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, they keep to the east. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[12382]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nIt comes out of Stratholme. {D|Stratholme} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[12383]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} It is taken from a Moontouched Feather in the snows of Winterspring."
L[12384]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} It is given in thanks by those in the snows of Winterspring whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
