L[12522]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the loch country of Loch Modan. {Z|Loch Modan} It is given in thanks by those in the loch country of Loch Modan whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[12524]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} It is the north-east of the snows of Winterspring that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[12525]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, the caches keep to the heart of the land. Chests and strongboxes in the snows of Winterspring hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[12527]="{W|0} {Q|3.1} {L|4}\nIts source is Blackrock Depths, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Depths} The rank and file of Blackrock Depths have it about them."
L[12528]="{W|5} {Q|3.1} {L|4}\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} {P|Dark Iron dwarves} Within, it is the Dark Iron dwarves who carry it."
L[12529]="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Spire give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12530]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} It is taken from a Spire Spider Egg in Blackrock Spire."
L[12531]="{W|15} {Q|3.1} {L|4}\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} {P|Dark Iron dwarves} Within, it is the Dark Iron dwarves who carry it."
L[12532]="{W|10} {Q|3.0} {L|5}\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} {P|Dark Iron dwarves} Within, it is the Dark Iron dwarves and fire elementals who carry it."
L[12533]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is found in Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} It is taken from a Roughshod Pike in Blackrock Spire."
