L[12606]="{A|2} {Q|3.1} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} The rank and file of Blackrock Spire have it about them."
L[12607]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts source is Blackwing Lair, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackwing Lair} The great prizes of Blackwing Lair are kept by Nefarian and the lords of the black dragonflight, and this is one of them. It is also often found on the dragonkin of Blackrock Spire."
L[12608]="{A|1} {Q|3.0} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} {P|trolls} It is the trolls of Blackrock Spire who have it about them."
L[12609]="{A|1} {Q|3.1} {L|5} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[12610]="{A|4} {C|17} {Q|2.1} {L|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Thorium Bar, Arcanite Bar and Gold Bar. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
