L[12628]="{A|4} {Q|3.1} {L|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Thorium Bar, Demonic Rune and Blue Sapphire. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 285."
L[12630]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} It is among the treasures that Rend Blackhand, General Drakkisath and the Spire's warlords hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[12631]="{A|4} {Q|3.0} {L|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} This one is worked from Thorium Bar, Enchanted Thorium Bar and Essence of Fire. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 290) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest in Winterspring."
L[12632]="{A|3} {Q|3.0} {L|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Thorium Bar, Enchanted Thorium Bar and Essence of Water. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 295."
