L[12634]="{A|3} {Q|3.0} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[12636]="{A|3} {Q|3.1} {L|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} Its making calls for Thorium Bar, Enchanted Thorium Bar and Jet Black Feather. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[12637]="{A|4} {Q|3.0} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[12638]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} It is the south of the Western Plaguelands that rewards the search. Chests and strongboxes in the Western Plaguelands hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[12639]="{A|4} {Q|4.1} {L|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} This one is worked from Arcanite Bar, Enchanted Thorium Bar and Essence of Earth. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[12640]="{A|4} {Q|4.0} {L|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Thorium Bar, Arcanite Bar and Wicked Claw. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[12641]="{A|3} {Q|4.1} {L|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Arcanite Bar, Enchanted Thorium Bar and Huge Emerald. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[12642]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[12643]="{R|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} Its making calls for Dense Stone and Runecloth. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 250."
L[12644]="{R|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} Its making calls for Dense Stone. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 250) can attempt it."
L[12645]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Thorium Bar, Dense Grinding Stone and Essence of Earth. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 275."
L[12650]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} The folk of the Western Plaguelands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[12651]="{W|18} {Q|3.0} {L|5} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} {P|soldiers and mercenaries} It is the soldiers and mercenaries of Blackrock Spire who have it about them."
L[12653]="{W|2} {Q|3.0} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} {P|soldiers and mercenaries} Within, it is the soldiers and mercenaries who carry it."
L[12654]="Ammunition for the hunters' bows and guns, sold by every bowyer and gunsmith and made by the engineers.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} {P|soldiers and mercenaries} It is the soldiers and mercenaries of Blackrock Spire who have it about them."
L[12655]="{R|3}\nIt is made, not found. {T|333} This one is worked from Thorium Bar and Dream Dust. Only an enchanter of real accomplishment (skill around 250) can attempt it."
L[12662]="{I|Demonic Rune}\nThe place to look is the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Within the Blasted Lands, they keep to the heart of the land. It is found as readily in the poisoned forest of Felwood. {P|greater demons} It is found on almost all of the greater demons and satyrs."
L[12682]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Thorium Armor. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 250 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[12683]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Thorium Belt. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 250) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[12684]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Thorium Bracers. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 255 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[12685]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Radiant Belt. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 260 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} The other place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[12687]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Imperial Plate Shoulders. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 265) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[12688]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Imperial Plate Belt. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 265) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[12689]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Radiant Breastplate. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 270) can follow it.\nIt is among the prizes of the Darkmoon Faire, won with tickets at Silas Darkmoon's carnival."
L[12690]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Imperial Plate Bracers. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 270 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[12691]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Wildthorn Mail. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 270) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} The other place to look is the sands of Silithus. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[12692]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Thorium Shield Spike. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 275 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} It is found as readily in the Western Plaguelands. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[12693]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Thorium Boots. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 280 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[12694]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Thorium Helm. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 280) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in Naxxramas. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[12695]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Radiant Gloves. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 285 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[12696]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Demon Forged Breastplate. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 285 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Spire give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[12697]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Radiant Boots. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 290 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."
L[12698]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Dawnbringer Shoulders. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 290 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIts source is the Molten Core, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[12699]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Fiery Plate Gauntlets. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 290 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} It is given in thanks by those in the snows of Winterspring whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[12700]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Imperial Plate Boots. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 295 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[12701]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Imperial Plate Helm. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 295 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[12702]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Radiant Circlet. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 295 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nThe place to look is Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} The other place to look is the sands of Silithus. Only occasionally does one of the wild beasts there carry it."
L[12703]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Storm Gauntlets. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 295) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {Z|Western Plaguelands} A merchant in the Western Plaguelands stocks it. The shop is in the south-east of the land."
L[12704]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Thorium Leggings. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[12705]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Imperial Plate Chest. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 300 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[12706]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Runic Plate Shoulders. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 300 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the north-east. {P|townsfolk and militia} One of the townsfolk and militia in a score or so carries it."
L[12707]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Runic Plate Boots. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Within the Western Plaguelands, they keep to the north. {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It turns up on the Scarlet Crusaders now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[12708]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is taken from Crossroads' Supply Crates.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It is taken from Crossroads' Supply Crates in the savannah of the Barrens."}
L[12709]="{W|15} {Q|3.0} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} It is among the treasures that Rend Blackhand, General Drakkisath and the Spire's warlords hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[12711]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Whitesoul Helm. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is the snows of Winterspring. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."
L[12712]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[12713]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Radiant Leggings. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 300 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the sands of Silithus. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[12714]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Runic Plate Helm. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 300 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the north-east. {P|soldiers and mercenaries} It turns up on the soldiers and mercenaries now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[12715]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Imperial Plate Leggings. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[12716]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Helm of the Great Chief. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."
L[12717]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Lionheart Helm. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[12718]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Runic Breastplate. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the north-east. {P|naga} It turns up on the naga now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[12719]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Runic Plate Leggings. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 300 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Look to the north of the Western Plaguelands. {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It is found on almost all of the Scarlet Crusaders."
L[12720]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Stronghold Gauntlets. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIts source is Naxxramas, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Naxxramas} {P|ghouls} It is the ghouls of Naxxramas who have it about them."
L[12722]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Look to the west of the Western Plaguelands. {P|ghouls} The ghouls there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[12725]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Enchanted Thorium Helm. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 300 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[12726]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Enchanted Thorium Leggings. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 300 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[12727]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Enchanted Thorium Breastplate. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[12728]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Invulnerable Mail. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 300 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[12731]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} The great prizes of Blackrock Spire are kept by Rend Blackhand, General Drakkisath and the Spire's warlords, and this is one of them."
L[12732]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} It is the north-west of the mesas of Thousand Needles that rewards the search. It is taken from an Incendia Agave in the mesas of Thousand Needles.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} It is the north-west of the mesas of Thousand Needles that rewards the search. The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. It is taken from an Incendia Agave in the mesas of Thousand Needles."}
L[12733]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, they keep to the north. {B|great cats} It turns up on the great cats now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[12734]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|1}\nIt is found in Stratholme. {D|Stratholme} It is taken from an Enchanted Scarlet Thread in Stratholme."
