L[12737]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from a Gloom Weed.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the middle of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is taken from a Gloom Weed in the blighted glades of Tirisfal."}
L[12738]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Within the Western Plaguelands, they keep to the heart of the land. {P|skeletons} Nearly every one of the skeletons carries one."
L[12739]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nNearly every one of the restless dead carries one."
