L[12752]="{A|1} {C|1} {Q|4.1} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} It is given in thanks by those in the snows of Winterspring whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[12753]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts source is Scholomance, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Scholomance} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders. It is also taken from Skin of Shadow."
