L[12764]="{W|8} {C|13} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Thorium Bar, Dense Grinding Stone and Rugged Leather. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 260) can attempt it."
L[12765]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Within the mesas of Thousand Needles, the caches keep to the west. Chests and strongboxes in the mesas of Thousand Needles hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[12766]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Look to the west of the mesas of Thousand Needles. Chests and strongboxes in the mesas of Thousand Needles hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[12768]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Within the mesas of Thousand Needles, the caches keep to the west. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the mesas of Thousand Needles: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
