L[12953]="{A|3} {Q|3.0} {L|5} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} The rank and file of Blackrock Spire have it about them."
L[12954]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} It is the north of the Western Plaguelands that rewards the search. It is taken from a Davil's Libram in the Western Plaguelands."
L[12955]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} It is the east of the Western Plaguelands that rewards the search. It is taken from a Redpath's Shield in the Western Plaguelands."
L[12956]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} Within the Eastern Plaguelands, they keep to the heart of the land. It is taken from a Horgus' Skull in the Eastern Plaguelands."
L[12957]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} It is the south of the Eastern Plaguelands that rewards the search. It is taken from a Shattered Sword of Marduk in the Eastern Plaguelands."
L[12958]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Arcanite Bar. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 275 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Tanaris} A merchant in the desert of Tanaris stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land."
