L[12973]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other. {C|1}\nIt is found in Stratholme. {D|Stratholme} It is taken from a Cannonball Stack in Stratholme."
L[12974]="{W|7} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 26-34, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[12975]="{W|1} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 19-24, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[12976]="{W|7} {Q|3.1} {L|1}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 19-24 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
