L[12988]={A="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the south of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
