L[13000]="{W|10} {Q|3.0} {L|5}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Look to the west of the sands of Silithus. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the sands of Silithus, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[13001]="{J|11} {Q|3.1} {L|5}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is the north of the rainforest of Feralas that rewards the search. It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."
