L[13209]="The Seal of the Dawn is the Argent Dawn's badge of service, given to those who fight the Scourge in its name. It lends strength against the undead in the Plaguelands, Stratholme and Scholomance.\nThe Argent Dawn's quartermasters at Light's Hope Chapel give it to those who have earned the Dawn's trust."
