L[13287]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Raptor Hide Harness. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 165 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Raptor Hide Harness. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 165 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Arathi Highlands} A merchant in the Arathi Highlands stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
