L[13362]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIt is found in Stratholme. {D|Stratholme} It is taken from a Postbox Parcel in Stratholme."
L[13363]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nIt is found in Stratholme. {D|Stratholme} It is taken from a Postbox Parcel in Stratholme."
