L[13382]="The Cannonball Runner is a goblin cannon on wheels that deploys itself, fires at anything hostile for a few seconds and then falls apart, as goblin devices do.\nIt is held by Cannon Master Willey of the Scarlet Crusade in the Bastion of Stratholme, who uses the real thing."
