L[13422]="{I|Stonescale Eel}\nAnglers know it from the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is found as readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. It is fished from the Veiled Sea in Feralas by anyone with a pole and the patience. It is also taken from Stonescale Eel Swarm and School of Tastyfish in western Stranglethorn Vale and eastern Tanaris."
L[13423]="{R|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Stonescale Eel and Leaded Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 250."
L[13442]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Gromsblood and Crystal Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 255."
L[13443]="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Sungrass, Blindweed and Crystal Vial. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 260) can attempt it. It is also sold by a Darkmoon Faire vendor in western Mulgore (limited stock)."
L[13444]="The major mana potion is the greatest of the alchemists' mana draughts, brewed from dreamfoil and icecap, and the staple of every spellcaster who faces the great foes.\nAlchemists brew it, the Argent Dawn's and the war effort's quartermasters sell it, and the creatures of the Plaguelands, Silithus and the great dungeons carry it."
L[13445]="{K|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Stonescale Oil, Sungrass and Crystal Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 265."
L[13446]="The major healing potion is the greatest of the alchemists' healing draughts, brewed from golden sansam and mountain silversage, carried by every adventurer who means to come home.\nAlchemists brew it, and the creatures of the far country and the great dungeons carry it."
L[13447]="{K|1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Dreamfoil, Plaguebloom and Crystal Vial. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 270) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest in Silithus."
L[13448]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in Scholomance. {D|Scholomance} It is taken from The Deed to Caer Darrow in Scholomance."
L[13450]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in Scholomance. {D|Scholomance} It is taken from The Deed to Southshore in Scholomance."
L[13451]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in Scholomance. {D|Scholomance} It is taken from The Deed to Tarren Mill in Scholomance."
L[13452]="{K|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Mountain Silversage, Plaguebloom and Crystal Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 280. It is also awarded for a quest in Silithus."
L[13453]="{K|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Gromsblood, Plaguebloom and Crystal Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 275."
L[13454]="{K|1}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Dreamfoil, Mountain Silversage and Crystal Vial. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 285) can attempt it. It is also found inside Chest of Spoils."
L[13455]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Stonescale Oil, Thorium Ore and Crystal Vial. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 280) can attempt it."
L[13456]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Elemental Water, Dreamfoil and Crystal Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 290. It is also found inside Chest of Spoils."
L[13457]="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Elemental Fire, Dreamfoil and Crystal Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 290. It is also found inside Chest of Spoils."
L[13458]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} This one is worked from Elemental Earth, Dreamfoil and Crystal Vial. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 290) can attempt it. It is also found inside Chest of Spoils."
L[13459]="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Shadow Oil, Dreamfoil and Crystal Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 290. It is also found inside Chest of Spoils."
L[13460]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Elemental Air, Dreamfoil and Crystal Vial. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 290) can attempt it."
L[13461]="{K|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Dream Dust, Dreamfoil and Crystal Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 290. It is also found inside Chest of Spoils."
L[13462]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Icecap, Plaguebloom and Crystal Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 285."
L[13463]="{I|Dreamfoil}\nHerbalists know it from the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} The other place to look is the fallen coast of Azshara. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. It is also sold by a Darkmoon Faire vendor in western Mulgore (limited stock)."
L[13464]="{I|Golden Sansam}\nHerbalists know it from the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} It is found as readily in the jungle crater of Un'Goro. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the fallen coast of Azshara. It is also sold by a Darkmoon Faire vendor in western Mulgore (limited stock)."
L[13465]="{I|Mountain Silversage}\nHerbalists know it from the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} The other place to look is the jungle crater of Un'Goro. Herbalists gather it in the snows of Winterspring, where it grows thickest."
L[13466]="{I|Plaguebloom}\nHerbalists know it from the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} The other place to look is the Western Plaguelands. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the Eastern Plaguelands."
L[13467]="{I|Icecap}\nHerbalists know it from the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Herbalists gather it in the snows of Winterspring, where it grows thickest."
L[13468]="{I|Black Lotus}\nHerbalists know it from the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. It is the herbalists who bring it in in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes."
L[13469]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Look to the south of the Western Plaguelands. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[13470]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Within the Western Plaguelands, they keep to the west. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Within the blighted glades of Tirisfal, they keep to the south-east. The other place to look is the Western Plaguelands. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[13471]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in Scholomance. {D|Scholomance} It is taken from The Deed to Brill in Scholomance."
L[13473]="{J|2} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} It is given in thanks by those in the Western Plaguelands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[13474]="{W|3} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} The folk of the Western Plaguelands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[13475]="{J|11} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} The folk of the Western Plaguelands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[13476]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Mighty Rage Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 255) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Within the ash plains of the Burning Steppes, they keep to the heart of the land. {P|Blackrock orcs} It turns up on the Blackrock orcs now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[13477]={A="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Superior Mana Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 260) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the night elf city of Darnassus stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Superior Mana Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 260) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Silverpine Forest} Merchants in the grey woods of Silverpine and the Undercity stock it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[13478]={A="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Elixir of Superior Defense. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 265) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Ironforge} A merchant in the dwarven city of Ironforge stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Elixir of Superior Defense. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 265) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[13479]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Elixir of the Sages. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 270) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} Within the Eastern Plaguelands, they keep to the south-east. {P|Scarlet Crusaders} One of the Scarlet Crusaders in a score or so carries it."
L[13480]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Major Healing Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 275) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|alchemy suppliers} {Z|Winterspring} A merchant in the snows of Winterspring stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[13481]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Elixir of Brute Force. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 275 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIt is found inside a Small Brown-wrapped Package, and nowhere else in particular."
L[13482]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Essence of Fire. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 275 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[13483]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Essence of Earth. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 275 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|merchants} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it."
L[13484]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Essence of Water. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 275 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[13485]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Essence of Air. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 275 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|merchants} {Z|Western Plaguelands} A merchant in the Western Plaguelands stocks it. The shop is in the south-east of the land."
L[13486]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Essence of Water. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 275 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} It is found as readily in the Western Plaguelands. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[13487]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Essence of Undeath. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 275 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} The other place to look is Blackrock Depths. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[13488]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Essence of Earth. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 275) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} The other place to look is Blackrock Depths. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."
L[13489]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Living Essence. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 275 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} It is found as readily in Blackrock Depths. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."
L[13490]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Greater Stoneshield Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 280) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[13491]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Elixir of the Mongoose. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 280) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Look to the north of the fallen coast of Azshara. The other place to look is the poisoned forest of Felwood. {P|satyrs} Only occasionally does one of the satyrs carry it."
L[13492]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Purification Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 285 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[13493]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Greater Arcane Elixir. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 285 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 53-60, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[13494]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Greater Fire Protection Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 290 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} {P|Blackrock orcs} It is the Blackrock orcs of Blackrock Spire who have it about them."
L[13495]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Greater Frost Protection Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 290) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, they keep to the south. It is a rare find among the giants; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[13496]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Greater Nature Protection Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 290) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Within the Western Plaguelands, they keep to the north-east. {P|oozes and slimes} It is a rare find among the oozes and slimes; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[13497]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Greater Arcane Protection Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 290 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, they keep to the heart of the land. It is a rare find among the dragonkin; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[13498]="{A|4} {Q|3.1} {L|5} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[13499]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Greater Shadow Protection Potion. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 290 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[13501]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Major Mana Potion. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 295) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|merchants} {Z|Western Plaguelands} A merchant in the Western Plaguelands stocks it. The shop is in the south-east of the land. It is also sometimes found on the humanoid foes of Scholomance."
L[13502]="{A|4} {Q|3.1} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[13503]="{R|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Essence of Fire, Essence of Earth and Essence of Air. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 300."
L[13505]="The runeblade of Baron Rivendare, the nobleman of Stratholme who gave his city to the Scourge and rose as a death knight to rule its eastern half. Runeblades are forged by the Scourge for its knights alone and carry a rune of the Lich King's own.\nThe Baron keeps it in the Slaughter Square of Stratholme, and gives it up only with his unlife."
L[13506]="{K|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Stonescale Oil, Mountain Silversage and Black Lotus. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 300."
L[13508]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt comes out of Stratholme. {D|Stratholme} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[13509]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt comes out of Stratholme. {D|Stratholme} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[13510]="{K|2}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Gromsblood, Stonescale Oil and Black Lotus. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[13511]="{K|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} Its making calls for Dreamfoil, Icecap and Black Lotus. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 300."
