L[13513]="{K|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|171} This one is worked from Icecap, Mountain Silversage and Black Lotus. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[13514]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt comes out of Stratholme. {D|Stratholme} The rank and file of Stratholme have it about them."
