L[13518]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Flask of Petrification. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 300 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 54-60 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[13519]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Flask of the Titans. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 300 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} It is among the treasures that Rend Blackhand, General Drakkisath and the Spire's warlords hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[13520]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Flask of Distilled Wisdom. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIts source is Stratholme, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Stratholme} The rank and file of Stratholme have it about them."
L[13521]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Flask of Supreme Power. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIts source is Scholomance, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Scholomance} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[13522]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Flask of Chromatic Resistance. {T|171} Only an alchemist of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
