L[13536]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is the south of the stormy coast of Darkshore that rewards the search. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the stormy coast of Darkshore: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nChests and strongboxes hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
