L[13702]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from a Doom Weed.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Look to the middle of the blighted glades of Tirisfal. It is taken from a Doom Weed in the blighted glades of Tirisfal."}
L[13703]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is found in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Look to the middle of the grey wastes of Desolace. It is taken from Kodo Bones in the grey wastes of Desolace."
L[13704]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} The folk of the Western Plaguelands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[13724]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[13725]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts source is Scholomance, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Scholomance} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[13754]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nAnglers know it from the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the fallen coast of Azshara. It is fished from the Veiled Sea in Feralas by anyone with a pole and the patience."
L[13755]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nAnglers know it from the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Anglers pull it from Temple of Arkkoran in Azshara."
L[13756]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nAnglers know it from the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} It is fished from Temple of Arkkoran in Azshara by anyone with a pole and the patience."
L[13757]="{I|Lightning Eel}\nIt is a catch of Plaguewood in Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} It is fished from Plaguewood in Eastern Plaguelands by anyone with a pole and the patience."
L[13758]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nAnglers know it from the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} The other place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. Anglers pull it from Fire Plume Ridge in Un'Goro Crater."
L[13759]="{K|5}\nIt is a catch of Deadwind Ravine in Deadwind Pass. {Z|Deadwind Pass} It is found as readily in the rainforest of Feralas. Anglers pull it from Deadwind Ravine in Deadwind Pass."
L[13760]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nAnglers know it from Zul'Farrak. {D|Zul'Farrak} It is found as readily in the Hinterlands. It is fished from the waters of Zul'Farrak by anyone with a pole and the patience."
