L[13813]="{K|6}\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[13815]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} {P|naga} The naga there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
