L[13824]="{W|2} {Q|0.0} {L|4}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The other place to look is the fallen coast of Azshara. It is a very rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[13825]="{W|3} {Q|0.1} {L|5}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 51-61 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[13850]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. {Z|Dun Morogh} Within the snowfields of Dun Morogh, the caches keep to the heart of the land. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the snowfields of Dun Morogh: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[13851]="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} This one is worked from Red Wolf Meat and Hot Spices. A cook of middling skill (around 175) can attempt it."
L[13852]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found inside a Nathanos' Chest, and nowhere else in particular."
L[13853]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} {B|worms and grubs} The worms and grubs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[13856]="{A|1} {C|17} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Runecloth and Rune Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 255."
L[13857]="{A|1} {C|17} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Runecloth, Ironweb Spider Silk and Rune Thread. Only a tailor of real accomplishment (skill around 260) can attempt it."
