L[13872]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is the east of the woods of Elwynn that rewards the search. It is taken from a Bundle of Wood in the woods of Elwynn.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from a Bundle of Wood."}
L[13873]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nIts source is Scholomance, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Scholomance} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[13874]="A companion creature, kept by adventurers for company on the long roads and sold by the pet dealers of the capitals or found in the far places.\nIt comes out of Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} It is among the treasures that Hakkar the Soulflayer and his high priests hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[13875]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nAnglers know it from the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is found as readily in the rainforest of Feralas. It is fished from the Tanaris coast and the oases of the Noonshade by anyone with a pole and the patience."
L[13876]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nAnglers know it from the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is found as readily in the rainforest of Feralas. It is fished from Southbreak Shore in Tanaris by anyone with a pole and the patience."
