L[14025]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[14042]="{A|1} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Runecloth, Heart of Fire and Rune Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 260."
L[14043]="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Runecloth, Heart of Fire and Rune Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 270."
