L[14046]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them. {C|17}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Runecloth, Rugged Leather and Rune Thread. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 260."
L[14047]="{I|Runecloth}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. It is found on almost all of the restless dead."
L[14048]="{I|Bolt of Runecloth}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Runecloth. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 250. It is also found inside a Mithril Bound Trunk."
L[14062]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|mount vendors}"
L[14086]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. It is found as readily in the plains of Mulgore. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[14087]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Look to the north of the plains of Mulgore. The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. It is a very rare find among the wild beasts there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[14088]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is the north of the plains of Mulgore that rewards the search. The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. It is a rare find among the wild beasts there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
