L[14152]="{A|1} {Q|4.0} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Runecloth, Essence of Fire and Essence of Air. Only a tailor of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[14153]="{A|1} {Q|4.1} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Runecloth, Demonic Rune and Felcloth. Only a tailor of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[14154]="{A|1} {Q|4.1} {L|5} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Bolt of Runecloth, Mooncloth and Righteous Orb. Only a tailor of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[14155]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them. {C|18}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Runecloth, Mooncloth and Rune Thread. Only a tailor of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[14156]="Bags are the most practical product of the tailors' and leatherworkers' trades, and every adventurer wants more of them.\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Bolt of Runecloth, Mooncloth and Large Brilliant Shard. Only a tailor of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[14157]="{A|1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[14158]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Within the Stonetalon Mountains, they keep to the north. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the south. It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
