L[14340]="{A|1} {C|24} {Q|3.1} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Scholomance. {D|Scholomance} The rank and file of Scholomance have it about them."
L[14341]={A="{I|Rune Thread}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|tailoring suppliers} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{I|Rune Thread}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|tailoring suppliers} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
