L[14364]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
