L[14466]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Frostweave Tunic. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 255) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} The other place to look is the sands of Silithus. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
