L[14468]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Runecloth Bag. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 260 of a tailor who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Winterspring} A merchant in the snows of Winterspring stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
