L[14544]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nOur correspondents report it among the cultists in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|cultists}",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} Within the red desert of Durotar, they keep to the north. {P|cultists} The cultists there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
