L[14549]="{A|4} {Q|4.1} {L|3}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 41-47 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[14551]="{A|3} {Q|4.0} {L|4}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 45-52, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[14552]="{A|4} {Q|4.1} {L|4}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 51-58, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[14553]="{A|2} {Q|4.0} {L|5}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 57-61 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[14554]="{A|4} {Q|4.0} {L|5}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Within the sands of Silithus, they keep to the west. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the sands of Silithus, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[14555]="{W|15} {Q|4.1} {L|5}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is the west of the sands of Silithus that rewards the search. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the sands of Silithus, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[14557]="{J|12} {C|11} {Q|4.0} {L|5}\nIt comes out of Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[14558]="{J|2} {Q|4.1} {L|5}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Look to the middle of the sands of Silithus. It is found as readily in the desert of Tanaris. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the sands of Silithus, not by the common run of its creatures."
