L[14627]={A="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Bright Yellow Shirt. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 135 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|tailoring suppliers} {Z|Duskwood} A merchant in the dark woods of Duskwood stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Bright Yellow Shirt. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 135 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
