L[14639]={A="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Minor Recombobulator. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 140 of an engineer who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|engineering suppliers} {Z|Wetlands} Merchants in the marshes of the Wetlands and the snowfields of Dun Morogh stock it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Minor Recombobulator. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 140 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
