L[14975]="{A|4} {Q|2.1} {L|6}\nIt comes out of Naxxramas. {D|Naxxramas} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[14976]="{A|4} {Q|2.1} {L|5}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in Zul'Gurub. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
