L[14979]="{A|4} {Q|2.0} {L|5}\nIts source is Naxxramas, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Naxxramas} The rank and file of Naxxramas have it about them."
L[14980]="{A|4} {Q|2.0} {L|5}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in Zul'Gurub. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
