L[14982]="{A|6} {Q|2.1} {L|6}\nIts source is Naxxramas, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Naxxramas} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[14983]="{A|4} {Q|2.1} {L|5}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[15003]={A="{A|2} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} One of the raiders and tribesmen there in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|2} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is the north of the plains of Mulgore that rewards the search. The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. It turns up on the wild beasts there now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
L[15004]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} It is the north of the plains of Mulgore that rewards the search. The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. Only occasionally does one of the wild beasts there carry it."}
L[15005]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Look to the north of the plains of Mulgore. The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. It is a rare find among the wild beasts there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[15006]={A="{A|6} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|6} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} Within the red desert of Durotar, they keep to the north. The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. It is a very rare find among the wild beasts there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[15007]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the plains of Mulgore. {Z|Mulgore} Within the plains of Mulgore, they keep to the north. It is found as readily in the red desert of Durotar. One of the wild beasts there in a score or so carries it."}
L[15008]="{A|2} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 8-11 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[15009]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 6-14 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[15010]="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 6-14, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[15011]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[15012]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[15013]="{A|2} {L|0}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 11-16, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[15014]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[15015]={A="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is a very rare find among the wild beasts there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|1} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. Only occasionally does one of the wild beasts there carry it."}
L[15016]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[15017]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[15018]={A="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{A|2} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."}
L[15019]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|1}\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. Only occasionally does one of the wild beasts there carry it."}
L[15043]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} Within the Eastern Plaguelands, they keep to the north-west. It is taken from a Large Termite Mound in the Eastern Plaguelands."
