L[15407]="{R|0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Rugged Hide and Refined Deeprock Salt. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 230."
L[15408]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nSkinners know it from the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} {B|scorpids} It is cut from the scorpids there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience."
L[15410]="{I|Scale of Onyxia}\nIts source is Onyxia's Lair, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Onyxia's Lair} It is among the treasures that Onyxia, Broodmother of the black dragonflight hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[15411]="{J|2} {Q|3.0} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} It is given in thanks by those in the Western Plaguelands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[15412]="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|22}\nIt is a skinner's find, chiefly in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Within the rainforest of Feralas, they keep to the north. The other place to look is the Hinterlands. It is cut from the dragonkin there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience."
L[15413]="{A|4} {Q|3.1} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} It is given in thanks by those in the Western Plaguelands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[15414]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|22}\nSkinners know it from the marshes of the Wetlands. {Z|Wetlands} It is the east of the marshes of the Wetlands that rewards the search. {P|dragonspawn} Skinners take it from the carcasses of the dragonspawn there.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|22}\nIt comes out of Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."}
L[15415]="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|22}\nSkinners know it from the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, they keep to the heart of the land. The other place to look is the fallen coast of Azshara. {P|dragonspawn} Skinners take it from the carcasses of the dragonspawn there."
L[15416]="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|22}\nIt is a skinner's find, chiefly in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} It is found as readily in Blackwing Lair. {P|dragonspawn} It is cut from the dragonspawn there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience."
L[15417]="{I|Devilsaur Leather}\nSkinners know it from the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} {B|primordial beasts} Skinners take it from the carcasses of the primordial beasts there."
L[15418]="{W|5} {Q|3.0} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} The folk of the Western Plaguelands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[15419]="{I|Warbear Leather}\nSkinners know it from the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} The other place to look is the Western Plaguelands. {B|bears} It is cut from the bears there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience."
L[15420]="{I|Ironfeather}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, they keep to the north. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one."
L[15421]="{A|1} {Q|3.0} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} The folk of the Western Plaguelands have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
