L[15476]="{A|3} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 8-11 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[15477]="{A|3} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 6-14, and no two finders agree where to look."
