L[15479]="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 6-14, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[15480]="{A|3} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 9-15 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[15481]={A="{A|3} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is a very rare find among the wild beasts there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them.",H="{A|3} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. It is a very rare find among the wild beasts there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[15482]="{A|3} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 8-12 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[15483]={A="{A|1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the boughs of Teldrassil. Only occasionally does one of the wild beasts there carry it.",H="{A|1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the north. The other place to look is the red desert of Durotar. It is a very rare find among the wild beasts there, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."}
L[15484]="{A|3} {L|0}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 8-14 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[15485]={A="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|3} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[15486]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. It turns up on the creatures of the region now and then, perhaps once in twenty.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. One of the wild beasts there in a score or so carries it."}
