L[15696]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Look to the south of the Western Plaguelands. It is taken from a Musty Tome in the Western Plaguelands."
