L[15724]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Heavy Scorpid Bracers. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 255) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Un'Goro Crater} Merchants in the jungle crater of Un'Goro and the sands of Silithus stock it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[15725]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Wicked Leather Gauntlets. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 260) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Western Plaguelands} A merchant in the Western Plaguelands stocks it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Wicked Leather Gauntlets. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 260) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Western Plaguelands} Merchants in the Western Plaguelands and the blighted glades of Tirisfal stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[15726]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Green Dragonscale Breastplate. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 260) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} A merchant in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows stocks it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[15727]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Heavy Scorpid Vest. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 265) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Within the Blasted Lands, they keep to the north. It turns up on the raiders and tribesmen there now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[15728]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Wicked Leather Bracers. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 265 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Look to the north of the fallen coast of Azshara. {P|satyrs} One of the satyrs in a score or so carries it."
L[15729]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Chimeric Gloves. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 265) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Azshara} A merchant in the fallen coast of Azshara stocks it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[15730]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Red Dragonscale Breastplate. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 300 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} The great prizes of Blackrock Spire are kept by Rend Blackhand, General Drakkisath and the Spire's warlords, and this is one of them."
L[15731]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Runic Leather Gauntlets. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 270 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[15732]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Volcanic Leggings. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 270) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Within the ash plains of the Burning Steppes, they keep to the east. {P|ogres} One of the ogres in a score or so carries it."
L[15733]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Green Dragonscale Leggings. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 270) can follow it.\nIt comes out of the Temple of Atal'Hakkar. {D|Sunken Temple} {B|worms and grubs} It is the worms and grubs of the Temple of Atal'Hakkar who have it about them."
L[15734]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Living Shoulders. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 270 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Feralas} A merchant in the rainforest of Feralas stocks it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Living Shoulders. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 270 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Feralas} A merchant in the rainforest of Feralas stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[15735]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Ironfeather Shoulders. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 270 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|The Hinterlands} A merchant in the Hinterlands stocks it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[15737]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Chimeric Boots. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 275) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Within the Blasted Lands, they keep to the north. It is found as readily in the sands of Silithus. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[15738]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Heavy Scorpid Gauntlet. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 275) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Within the ash plains of the Burning Steppes, they keep to the heart of the land. {P|Blackrock orcs} It turns up on the Blackrock orcs now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[15739]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Runic Leather Bracers. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 275 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} Look to the west of the poisoned forest of Felwood. {P|cultists} It turns up on the cultists now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[15740]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Frostsaber Boots. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 275 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Winterspring} A merchant in the snows of Winterspring stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[15741]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Stormshroud Pants. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 275 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Western Plaguelands} A merchant in the Western Plaguelands stocks it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Stormshroud Pants. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 275 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Western Plaguelands} Merchants in the Western Plaguelands and the blighted glades of Tirisfal stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[15742]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Warbear Harness. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 275 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Look to the north-east of the rainforest of Feralas. It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."
L[15743]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Heavy Scorpid Belt. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 280 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[15744]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Wicked Leather Headband. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 280 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} Within the poisoned forest of Felwood, they keep to the north. {P|satyrs} Only occasionally does one of the satyrs carry it."
L[15745]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Runic Leather Belt. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 280) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."
L[15746]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Chimeric Leggings. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 280) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[15747]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Frostsaber Leggings. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 285) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Look to the north of the snows of Winterspring. {P|furbolg} It turns up on the furbolg now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[15748]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Heavy Scorpid Leggings. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 285 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Look to the middle of the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {P|Blackrock orcs} It turns up on the Blackrock orcs now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[15749]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Volcanic Breastplate. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 285 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} {P|Blackrock orcs} It is the Blackrock orcs of Blackrock Spire who have it about them."
L[15750]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Within the grey wastes of Desolace, they keep to the north. {P|cultists} The cultists there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[15751]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Blue Dragonscale Breastplate. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 285 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Azshara} A merchant in the fallen coast of Azshara stocks it. The shop is in the south of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[15752]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Living Leggings. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 285 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} Within the poisoned forest of Felwood, they keep to the north-east. {P|furbolg} Only occasionally does one of the furbolg carry it."
L[15753]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Stormshroud Armor. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 285 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Within the fallen coast of Azshara, they keep to the east. {P|murlocs} It is a rare find among the murlocs; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[15754]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Warbear Woolies. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 285 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nLockboxes are the strongboxes of travellers who did not survive to open them, carried off by whatever killed them. Only a rogue's picks or an engineer's seaforium will open one, and this is among what they hold."
L[15755]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Chimeric Vest. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 290) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is the ruins of Dire Maul. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."
L[15756]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Runic Leather Headband. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 290 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} A merchant in the Eastern Plaguelands stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[15757]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Wicked Leather Pants. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 290) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[15758]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Devilsaur Gauntlets. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 290) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|general goods merchants} {Z|Un'Goro Crater} A merchant in the jungle crater of Un'Goro stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
