L[15760]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Ironfeather Breastplate. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 290 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} Look to the south-east of the Hinterlands. {P|trolls} One of the trolls in a score or so carries it."
L[15761]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Frostsaber Gloves. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 295 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Look to the west of the snows of Winterspring. {P|furbolg} One of the furbolg in a score or so carries it."
L[15762]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Heavy Scorpid Helm. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 295 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Un'Goro Crater} Merchants in the jungle crater of Un'Goro and the sands of Silithus stock it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[15763]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Blue Dragonscale Shoulders. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 295 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Perhaps one in four of the giants has one about them."
L[15764]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Stormshroud Shoulders. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 295 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nHunters find it most readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Look to the middle of the fallen coast of Azshara. It turns up on the giants now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
