L[15864]="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is given in thanks by those in the grey wastes of Desolace whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[15865]="{A|6} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The folk of the grey wastes of Desolace have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[15866]="{J|23} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[15867]="{J|12} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Spire give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[15868]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} Look to the middle of the Eastern Plaguelands. {P|Scarlet Crusaders} The Scarlet Crusaders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[15869]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Silver Bar and Rough Grinding Stone. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 100) can attempt it."
L[15870]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Gold Bar and Heavy Grinding Stone. A blacksmith of middling skill (around 150) can attempt it."
L[15871]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Truesilver Bar and Solid Grinding Stone. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 200."
L[15872]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Arcanite Bar and Dense Grinding Stone. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 275) can attempt it."
L[15873]="{J|12} {Q|3.1} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Spire give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[15874]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Within the grey wastes of Desolace, they keep to the north-west. {B|crabs} Perhaps one in four of the crabs has one about them."
L[15875]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is found inside a Nathanos' Chest, and nowhere else in particular."
L[15877]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the sanctuary of Moonglade. {Z|Moonglade} Within the sanctuary of Moonglade, they keep to the heart of the land. It is taken from a Bauble Container in the sanctuary of Moonglade."
L[15878]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[15879]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} Within the poisoned forest of Felwood, they keep to the south. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[15880]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt comes out of Stratholme. {D|Stratholme} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[15881]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is the north-west of the grey wastes of Desolace that rewards the search. {P|naga} The naga there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[15882]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} It is the north-west of the fallow farmland of Westfall that rewards the search. Chests and strongboxes in the fallow farmland of Westfall hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} It is the north-west of the grey woods of Silverpine that rewards the search. Chests and strongboxes in the grey woods of Silverpine hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
L[15883]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} Within the stormy coast of Darkshore, the caches keep to the north. Chests and strongboxes in the stormy coast of Darkshore hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, the caches keep to the north. Chests and strongboxes in the savannah of the Barrens hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."}
L[15884]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} Look to the north-west of the Eastern Plaguelands. It is taken from an Augustus' Receipt Book in the Eastern Plaguelands."
L[15887]="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|5}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in Zul'Gurub. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[15890]="{A|6} {Q|2.1} {L|5}\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[15891]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} It is the north of the Stonetalon Mountains that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the south of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
L[15892]="{A|6} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} The other place to look is the Arathi Highlands. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[15893]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nHunters find it most readily in the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[15894]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the marshes of the Wetlands. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.1} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[15895]="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 8-11, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[15902]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|merchants} {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} A merchant in the Eastern Plaguelands stocks it. The shop is in the north-west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[15903]={A="{W|13} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|weapon merchants} {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the night elf city of Darnassus stock it. The shop is in the west of the land.",H="{W|13} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|weapon vendors} {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land."}
L[15904]={A="{W|13} {L|2}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|weapon merchants} {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the night elf city of Darnassus stock it. The shop is in the west of the land.",H="{W|13} {L|2}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|weapon vendors} {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land."}
