L[15912]={A="{J|23} {C|29} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it.",H="{J|23} {C|29} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} The other place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."}
L[15918]="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[15924]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the clams of the coasts, pried open by whoever gathers them from the shallows and the murlocs."
L[15925]={A="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is found as readily in the snowfields of Dun Morogh. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the woods of Elwynn: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|0}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is found as readily in the plains of Mulgore. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the red desert of Durotar: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[15926]={A="{J|23} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} The other place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. It is a rare find among the raiders and tribesmen there; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{J|23} {Q|2.0} {L|1}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Look to the north of the savannah of the Barrens. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."}
L[15927]={A="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Within the Stonetalon Mountains, they keep to the north. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling.",H="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} Within the savannah of the Barrens, they keep to the south. It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {P|tauren} It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."}
L[15928]="{J|23} {Q|2.0} {L|2}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} It is found as readily in the mesas of Thousand Needles. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
