L[15931]="{J|23} {Q|2.0} {L|5}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is Zul'Gurub. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[15932]={A="{J|23} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the fallow farmland of Westfall. {Z|Westfall} The other place to look is the stormy coast of Darkshore. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it.",H="{J|23} {Q|2.0} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. It turns up on the wild beasts there now and then, perhaps once in twenty."}
