L[15978]="{J|23} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is Razorfen Downs. {D|Razorfen Downs} It is found as readily in the Arathi Highlands. A good share of the restless dead carry it."
L[15979]="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThe place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is found as readily in the desert of Tanaris. Only occasionally does one of the raiders and tribesmen there carry it."
L[15980]="{J|23} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nThe place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is found as readily in the rainforest of Feralas. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[15981]="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} It is found as readily in the rainforest of Feralas. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[15982]="{J|23} {Q|2.0} {L|4}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[15983]="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nThe place to look is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} The other place to look is the jungle crater of Un'Goro. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[15984]="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|5}\nThe place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} The other place to look is the sands of Silithus. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[15985]="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|5}\nThe place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} It is found as readily in the sands of Silithus. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[15986]="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|5}\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is Zul'Gurub. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[15987]="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|5}\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is Zul'Gurub. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[15988]="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|5}\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in Zul'Gurub. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[15989]="{J|23} {Q|2.0} {L|6}\nIts source is Naxxramas, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Naxxramas} The rank and file of Naxxramas have it about them."
L[15990]="{A|6} {Q|2.1} {L|3}\nThe place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} The other place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is a rare find among the creatures of the region; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[15991]="{A|6} {Q|2.0} {L|5}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in Zul'Gurub. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[15992]="{I|Dense Blasting Powder}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} This one is worked from Dense Stone. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 250) can attempt it."
L[15993]="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} This one is worked from Thorium Widget, Thorium Bar and Dense Blasting Powder. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 260."
L[15994]="{I|Thorium Widget}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} This one is worked from Thorium Bar and Runecloth. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 260) can attempt it."
L[15995]="{W|3} {C|13} {Q|2.1} {L|4}\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} This one is worked from Mithril Tube, Mithril Casing and Thorium Widget. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 260) can attempt it."
L[15996]="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} Its making calls for Living Essence, Thorium Widget and Gold Power Core. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 265."
L[15997]="Ammunition for the hunters' bows and guns, sold by every bowyer and gunsmith and made by the engineers.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} This one is worked from Thorium Bar and Dense Blasting Powder. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 285) can attempt it. It is also sold by a cool guy."
L[15999]="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} This one is worked from Spellpower Goggles Xtreme, Star Ruby and Enchanted Leather. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 270."
L[16000]="{I|Thorium Tube}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} This one is worked from Thorium Bar. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 275) can attempt it."
L[16001]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} Within the Eastern Plaguelands, they keep to the south-west. It is taken from Mangled Human Remains in the Eastern Plaguelands."
L[16002]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} Look to the south-west of the Eastern Plaguelands. It is taken from Mangled Human Remains in the Eastern Plaguelands."
L[16003]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} It is the south-west of the Eastern Plaguelands that rewards the search. It is taken from Mangled Human Remains in the Eastern Plaguelands."
L[16004]="{W|3} {C|5} {Q|3.1} {L|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} Its making calls for Thorium Tube, Dark Iron Bar and Deadly Scope. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 275."
L[16005]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} This one is worked from Thorium Widget, Dark Iron Bar and Dense Blasting Powder. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 285."
L[16006]="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} Its making calls for Arcanite Bar and Ironweb Spider Silk. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 285) can attempt it."
L[16007]="{W|3} {C|16} {Q|3.1} {L|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} This one is worked from Arcanite Bar, Thorium Tube and Essence of Fire. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[16008]="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} Its making calls for Fire Goggles, Huge Emerald and Enchanted Leather. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 290) can attempt it."
L[16009]="{J|2} {Q|2.1}\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} This one is worked from Delicate Arcanite Converter, Gold Power Core and Thorium Widget. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 290."
L[16022]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} This one is worked from Mithril Mechanical Dragonling, Delicate Arcanite Converter and Enchanted Thorium Bar. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 300."
L[16023]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} This one is worked from Mithril Casing, Thorium Tube and Thorium Widget. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 275) can attempt it."
L[16025]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in Stratholme. {D|Stratholme} Those who have a stake in Stratholme give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[16039]="{W|8} {Q|3.1} {L|5}\nThe place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} Look to the north-west of the Eastern Plaguelands. Nearly every one of the restless dead carries one."
L[16040]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} This one is worked from Delicate Arcanite Converter, Thorium Bar and Runecloth. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 300."
L[16041]={A="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Thorium Grenade. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 260) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|engineering suppliers} {Z|Ironforge} A merchant in the dwarven city of Ironforge stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Thorium Grenade. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 260) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|engineering suppliers} {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[16042]={A="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Thorium Widget. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 260 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|engineering suppliers} {Z|Ironforge} A merchant in the dwarven city of Ironforge stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Thorium Widget. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 260 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|engineering suppliers} {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. The shop is in the north-east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[16043]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Thorium Rifle. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 260 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIt is found inside a Lard's Special Picnic Basket, and nowhere else in particular."
L[16044]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Lifelike Mechanical Toad. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 265) can follow it.\nThe place to look is the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Look to the south of the Western Plaguelands. The other place to look is Blackrock Depths. Only occasionally does one of the creatures of the region carry it."
L[16045]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Spellpower Goggles Xtreme Plus. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 270) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Within the fallen coast of Azshara, they keep to the heart of the land. {P|naga} Only occasionally does one of the naga carry it."
L[16046]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Masterwork Target Dummy. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 275 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|engineering suppliers} {Z|Winterspring} A merchant in the snows of Winterspring stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[16047]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Thorium Tube. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 275 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|engineering suppliers} {Z|Winterspring} A merchant in the snows of Winterspring stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[16048]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Dark Iron Rifle. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 275) can follow it.\nIts source is Blackrock Depths, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Depths} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[16049]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Dark Iron Bomb. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 285) can follow it.\nIts source is Blackrock Depths, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Depths} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[16050]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Delicate Arcanite Converter. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 285 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|engineering suppliers} {Z|Winterspring} A merchant in the snows of Winterspring stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[16051]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Thorium Shells. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 285) can follow it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. It is a very rare find among the creatures of the region, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[16052]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Voice Amplification Modulator. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 290 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIts source is Stratholme, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Stratholme} {P|Scarlet Crusaders} It is the Scarlet Crusaders of Stratholme who have it about them."
L[16053]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Master Engineer's Goggles. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 290 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIts source is Blackrock Depths, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Depths} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[16054]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Arcanite Dragonling. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 300 of an engineer who attempts it.\nThe place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, they keep to the heart of the land. Only occasionally does one of the dragonkin carry it."
L[16055]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Arcane Bomb. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 300 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. One of the creatures of the region in many hundreds carries it."
L[16056]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Flawless Arcanite Rifle. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nHunters find it most readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} It is the north-east of the Eastern Plaguelands that rewards the search. {P|soldiers and mercenaries} It is a rare find among the soldiers and mercenaries; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[16058]="{J|11} {Q|3.1} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} It is given in thanks by those in the Western Plaguelands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
