L[16332]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from a Thazz'ril's Pick.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} Within the red desert of Durotar, they keep to the heart of the land. It is taken from a Thazz'ril's Pick in the red desert of Durotar."}
L[16333]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is carried by the restless dead, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Within the blighted glades of Tirisfal, they keep to the west. The restless dead there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[16335]={A="{J|2} {Q|3.1} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="{J|2} {Q|3.1} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|quartermasters} {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. The shop is in the south of the land."}
L[16338]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is bought, not hunted."
L[16339]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nThis is a thing one buys."
L[16341]={A="{A|1} {Q|3.0} {L|4} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="{A|1} {Q|3.0} {L|4} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|quartermasters} {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. The shop is in the south of the land."}
