L[16581]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Within the Stonetalon Mountains, they keep to the south. The other place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. It is taken from a Resonite Crystal in the Stonetalon Mountains."
L[16583]={A="{I|Demonic Figurine}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|reagent vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{I|Demonic Figurine}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|reagent vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[16602]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|8}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the north of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is found as readily in the poisoned forest of Felwood. Chests and strongboxes in the ancient forest of Ashenvale hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[16604]={A="{A|1} {C|6} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{A|1} {C|6} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given only by the Alliance's questgivers, in thanks for errands a traveller of the Horde cannot run."}
L[16605]={A="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="{A|1} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given only by the Alliance's questgivers, in thanks for errands a traveller of the Horde cannot run."}
