L[16663]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|22}\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} The great prizes of Blackrock Spire are kept by Rend Blackhand, General Drakkisath and the Spire's warlords, and this is one of them."
L[16665]="A book.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them. It is also sold by a cool guy."
L[16666]="{A|3} {C|45} {Q|3.1} {L|5} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} It is among the treasures that Rend Blackhand, General Drakkisath and the Spire's warlords hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[16667]="{A|3} {C|45} {Q|3.1} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Scholomance. {D|Scholomance} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
