L[16862]="{A|4} {C|52} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[16863]="{A|4} {C|52} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[16864]="{A|4} {C|52} {Q|4.0} {L|6}\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} {P|fire elementals} It is the fire elementals of the Molten Core who have it about them."
L[16865]="{A|4} {C|52} {Q|4.1} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is the Molten Core, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
