L[16999]="{J|11} {Q|3.1} {L|5}\nHunters find it most readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} It is the north of the Eastern Plaguelands that rewards the search. Nearly every one of the restless dead carries one."
