L[17007]="{A|3} {Q|4.1} {L|4}\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 47-54 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[17008]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts source is Razorfen Kraul, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Razorfen Kraul} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[17009]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Within the mesas of Thousand Needles, they keep to the north. The restless dead there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the mesas of Thousand Needles. {Z|Thousand Needles} Within the mesas of Thousand Needles, they keep to the north. It is found as readily in the savannah of the Barrens. The restless dead there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[17010]="{I|Fiery Core}\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} {P|fire elementals} It is the fire elementals of the Molten Core who have it about them."
L[17011]="{I|Lava Core}\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} {P|fire elementals} It is the fire elementals of the Molten Core who have it about them."
L[17012]="{I|Core Leather}\nIts source is the Molten Core, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Molten Core} {B|hounds} It is the hounds of the Molten Core who have it about them."
