L[17016]="{W|0} {C|5} {Q|3.0} {L|6}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Dark Iron Bar, Lava Core and Blood of the Mountain. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 300."
L[17017]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Flarecore Mantle. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
