L[17019]={A="{I|Arcane Dust}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|reagent vendors} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="{I|Arcane Dust}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|reagent vendors} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
