L[17049]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Fiery Chain Girdle. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 295) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[17050]="{A|1} {Q|3.1} {L|4}\nHunters find it most readily in the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} Look to the south-east of the Hinterlands. It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."
L[17051]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Dark Iron Bracers. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 295 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[17052]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Dark Iron Leggings. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 300 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it."
L[17053]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Fiery Chain Shoulders. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 300 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it."
L[17054]="{W|7} {Q|3.0} {L|4}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Look to the middle of the fallen coast of Azshara. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them."
L[17055]="{W|4} {Q|3.1} {L|4}\nThe place to look is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} Within the desert of Tanaris, they keep to the heart of the land. Perhaps one in four of the raiders and tribesmen there has one about them."
L[17056]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the stormy coast of Darkshore. {Z|Darkshore} It is found as readily in the Stonetalon Mountains. {B|plainstriders} Nearly every one of the plainstriders and harpies carries one.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the savannah of the Barrens. {Z|The Barrens} It is the north of the savannah of the Barrens that rewards the search. {B|plainstriders} Nearly every one of the plainstriders carries one."}
L[17057]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} Within the mists of Dustwallow Marsh, they keep to the north. It is found as readily in the stormy coast of Darkshore. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one. It is also skinned from beasts of levels 12-32 in Darkshore and northern Loch Modan.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a skinner's find, chiefly in the grey woods of Silverpine. {Z|Silverpine Forest} It is found as readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. Skinners take it from the carcasses of the beasts there. It is also often found on humanoid foes of levels 20-39, most plentifully in northern Dustwallow Marsh and Desolace."}
L[17058]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Look to the west of the rainforest of Feralas. It is found as readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {P|naga} Perhaps one in four of the naga has one about them."
L[17059]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Dark Iron Reaver. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 300 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[17060]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Dark Iron Destroyer. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 300 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[17061]="{A|1} {Q|3.1} {L|5}\nIts source is Stratholme, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Stratholme} The rank and file of Stratholme have it about them."
L[17062]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Mithril Head Trout. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|fishermans} {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Merchants in the farmland of Hillsbrad and the jungles of Stranglethorn stock it.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Mithril Head Trout. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 175) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|fishing suppliers} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land."}
L[17063]="{J|11} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is the Molten Core, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[17064]="{J|12} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is Onyxia's Lair, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Onyxia's Lair} The great prizes of Onyxia's Lair are kept by Onyxia, Broodmother of the black dragonflight, and this is one of them."
L[17065]="{J|2} {C|52} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[17066]="{A|6} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[17067]="{J|23} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of Onyxia's Lair. {D|Onyxia's Lair} It is among the treasures that Onyxia, Broodmother of the black dragonflight hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[17068]="{W|0} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Onyxia's Lair, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Onyxia's Lair} The great prizes of Onyxia's Lair are kept by Onyxia, Broodmother of the black dragonflight, and this is one of them."
L[17069]="{W|2} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is the Molten Core, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[17070]="{W|15} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nHunters find it most readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Look to the south of the fallen coast of Azshara. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the fallen coast of Azshara, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[17071]="{W|15} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[17072]="{W|3} {Q|4.1} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[17073]="Earthshaker is a great hammer of the elemental lords, so heavy that each blow shakes the ground and staggers everything nearby. It was wielded in the elementals' own wars long before the Dark Irons woke Ragnaros.\nIt lies in the Molten Core with Garr, the lord of the lava elementals and keeper of one of the Windseeker's bindings."
L[17074]="{W|6} {Q|4.0} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[17075]="{W|7} {Q|4.1} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is Onyxia's Lair, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Onyxia's Lair} The great prizes of Onyxia's Lair are kept by Onyxia, Broodmother of the black dragonflight, and this is one of them."
L[17076]="Bonereaver's Edge is a greatsword of the Molten Core, forged by the Firelord's flamewaker smiths from Sulfuron steel. It bites through armour as if it were cloth.\nRagnaros holds it in his court at the heart of Blackrock Mountain, and warriors of the Horde and the Alliance alike have made the Core's deadliest descent for it."
L[17077]="{W|19} {C|1} {Q|4.0} {L|5} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[17078]="{A|1} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is Onyxia's Lair, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Onyxia's Lair} It is among the treasures that Onyxia, Broodmother of the black dragonflight hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[17082]="{J|12} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[17102]="{A|1} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is the Molten Core, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[17103]="The Azuresong Mageblade is a sword that hums with the blue dragonflight's arcane song, carried into the Molten Core by some mage who did not come out. It is now in the keeping of the Firelord's giants.\nGolemagg the Incinerator, the fire giant who guards the Core's inner reaches with his core hounds, holds it."
L[17104]="{W|1} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[17105]="{W|4} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[17106]="{A|6} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[17107]="{A|1} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is the Molten Core, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[17109]="{J|2} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[17110]="{J|11} {Q|4.1} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is the Molten Core, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[17111]="{J|2} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, they keep to the north-east. It is found as readily in the Blasted Lands. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the jungles of Stranglethorn, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[17112]="{W|4} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north-east of the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is found as readily in the Blasted Lands. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the jungles of Stranglethorn, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[17113]="{W|10} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north-east of the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is found as readily in the Blasted Lands. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the jungles of Stranglethorn, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[17114]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is taken from an Araj's Phylactery."
L[17119]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {Z|Deeprun Tram} A merchant in the Deeprun Tram stocks it. It is also awarded for a quest within Deeprun Tram.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Deeprun Tram. {Z|Deeprun Tram} It is given in thanks by those in the Deeprun Tram whose troubles an adventurer takes on."}
L[17124]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|30}\nPickpockets know it from the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} It is found as readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {P|Syndicate rogues} Rogues lift it from the pockets of the Syndicate rogues there, who seldom notice."
L[17183]={A="{A|6} {L|0}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="{A|6} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Merchants in the blighted glades of Tirisfal and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land."}
L[17184]={A="{A|6} {L|0}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|armorer & shield crafters} {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the snowfields of Dun Morogh stock it.",H="{A|6} {L|0}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
L[17185]={A="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Merchants in the blighted glades of Tirisfal and the plains of Mulgore stock it."}
L[17186]={A="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|armorer & shield crafters} {Z|Elwynn Forest} Merchants in the woods of Elwynn and the boughs of Teldrassil stock it. The shop is in the south-west of the land.",H="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
L[17187]={A="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Darkshore} Merchants in the stormy coast of Darkshore and the dwarven city of Ironforge stock it. The shop is in the west of the land.",H="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|0}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|mail armor merchants} {Z|Undercity} Merchants in the Undercity and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the east of the land."}
L[17188]={A="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|shield merchants} {Z|Redridge Mountains} Merchants in the red hills around Lake Everstill and the city of Stormwind stock it. The shop is in the west of the land.",H="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|mail armor merchants} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the savannah of the Barrens stock it. The shop is in the south of the land."}
L[17189]={A="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|2}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|mail armor merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|2}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|heavy armor merchants} {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Merchants in the jungles of Stranglethorn and the plains of Mulgore stock it."}
L[17190]={A="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|4}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|shield merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{A|6} {Q|1.0} {L|4}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|heavy armor merchants} {Z|Swamp of Sorrows} Merchants in the sodden Swamp of Sorrows and the plains of Mulgore stock it."}
L[17191]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Maraudon. {D|Maraudon} Those who have a stake in Maraudon give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[17192]={A="{A|6} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|shield merchants} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{A|6} {L|1}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|heavy armor merchants} {Z|Mulgore} Merchants in the plains of Mulgore and the mesa city of Thunder Bluff stock it. The shop is in the north of the land."}
L[17193]="{W|5} {C|23} {Q|4.0} {L|6}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} This one is worked from Sulfuron Ingot, Dark Iron Bar and Arcanite Bar. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 300."
L[17194]="{I|Holiday Spices}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|smokywood pastures} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the Undercity stock it. The shop is in the south of the land."
L[17195]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|smokywood pastures} {Z|Undercity} Merchants in the Undercity and the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stock it. The shop is in the east of the land."
L[17196]="{K|6}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|smokywood pastures} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the Undercity stock it. The shop is in the south of the land."
L[17197]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} This one is worked from Small Egg and Holiday Spices. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 1."
L[17198]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} This one is worked from Small Egg, Ice Cold Milk and Holiday Spirits. A cook of middling skill (around 35) can attempt it."
L[17200]="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Gingerbread Cookie. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 1 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|smokywood pastures} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the Undercity stock it. The shop is in the south of the land."
L[17201]="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Egg Nog. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 35 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|smokywood pastures} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the Undercity stock it. The shop is in the south of the land."
L[17202]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|smokywood pastures} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the Undercity stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. It is also taken from Holiday Snow in central Alterac Mountains."
L[17203]="{I|Sulfuron Ingot}\nIts source is the Molten Core, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[17204]="The Eye of Sulfuras is the fiery core of the Firelord's hammer, all that remains of Sulfuras when Ragnaros is banished back into the Molten Core. It burns without fuel and cannot be quenched.\nA smith who can forge the Sulfuron Hammer, a secret the Thorium Brotherhood sells only to its most trusted friends and which demands dark iron, Sulfuron ingots, fiery cores and the Black Anvil itself, may set the Eye into it and remake the Hand of Ragnaros."
L[17222]="{K|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} Its making calls for White Spider Meat. Only a cook of real accomplishment (skill around 200) can attempt it."
L[17242]={A="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} Within the Western Plaguelands, the caches keep to the north-west. Chests and strongboxes in the Western Plaguelands hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them.",H="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the blighted glades of Tirisfal. {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Within the blighted glades of Tirisfal, the caches keep to the east. The other place to look is the Western Plaguelands. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the blighted glades of Tirisfal: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[17262]={A="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} Within the woods of Elwynn, the caches keep to the east. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the woods of Elwynn: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned.",H="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."}
L[17303]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|smokywood pastures} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the Undercity stock it. The shop is in the south of the land."
L[17304]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|smokywood pastures} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the Undercity stock it. The shop is in the south of the land."
L[17306]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Look to the north of the farmland of Hillsbrad. The other place to look is the Alterac Mountains. {P|townsfolk and militia} Nearly every one of the townsfolk and militia carries one."
L[17307]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|smokywood pastures} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the Undercity stock it. The shop is in the south of the land."
L[17309]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nNearly every one of the elementals carries one."
L[17322]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} It is among the treasures that Rend Blackhand, General Drakkisath and the Spire's warlords hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[17326]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[17327]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the townsfolk and militia in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|townsfolk and militia}",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the townsfolk and militia in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by. {P|townsfolk and militia}"}
L[17328]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Horde lands, where travellers of the Alliance are not welcome; it will be hard to come by.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[17329]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[17330]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|23}\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[17331]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts source is the Molten Core, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
