L[17344]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|smokywood pastures} {Z|Orgrimmar} Merchants in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar and the Undercity stock it. The shop is in the south of the land. It is also found inside a Smokywood Pastures Sampler."
L[17345]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|21}\nIt is found in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Within the sands of Silithus, they keep to the heart of the land. It is taken from a Hive'Ashi Pod in the sands of Silithus."
L[17346]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|21}\n{P|insects} It is found on almost all of the insects."
