L[17410]={A="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run.",H="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is given only by the Alliance's questgivers, in thanks for errands a traveller of the Horde cannot run."}
L[17411]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from a Steamsaw."
L[17413]="A book, which teaches Prayer of Fortitude.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} {P|Dark Iron dwarves} It is the Dark Iron dwarves of Blackrock Depths who have it about them."
L[17414]="A book, which teaches Prayer of Fortitude II.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[17422]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} Look to the east of the Alterac Mountains. {P|townsfolk and militia} It is found on almost all of the townsfolk and militia."
L[17423]={A="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Horde, and a traveller of the Alliance must go armed or trade for it.",H="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is carried by the humanoid foes, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
