L[17508]={A="{A|6} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given only by the Horde's questgivers, in thanks for errands a traveller of the Alliance cannot run.",H="{A|6} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Scarlet Monastery. {D|Scarlet Monastery} Those who have a stake in the Scarlet Monastery give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."}
L[17522]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
L[17523]="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} It is given in thanks by those in the Eastern Plaguelands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[17542]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nChests and strongboxes hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
