L[17662]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the Alterac Mountains. {Z|Alterac Mountains} It is the south-west of the Alterac Mountains that rewards the search. It is found as readily in the farmland of Hillsbrad. The beasts there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[17682]="A book, which teaches Gift of the Wild.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} {P|Dark Iron dwarves} It is the Dark Iron dwarves of Blackrock Depths who have it about them."
L[17683]="A book, which teaches Gift of the Wild II.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} The rank and file of Blackrock Spire have it about them."
L[17684]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt comes out of Maraudon. {D|Maraudon} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[17686]="{W|2} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is given in thanks by those in the jungles of Stranglethorn whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[17687]="{W|3} {Q|2.0}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} The folk of the jungles of Stranglethorn have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
