L[17692]="{J|11} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} It is given in thanks by those in the ancient forest of Ashenvale whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[17694]="{J|11} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Blackfathom Deeps. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} Those who have a stake in Blackfathom Deeps give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[17695]="{A|1} {Q|2.1}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in Blackfathom Deeps. {D|Blackfathom Deeps} Those who have a stake in Blackfathom Deeps give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
