L[17704]="{W|0} {Q|2.0} {L|3}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Steel Bar, Frost Oil and Elemental Water. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 190."
L[17705]="{W|7} {Q|3.0} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Maraudon. {D|Maraudon} Those who have a stake in Maraudon give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[17706]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Edge of Winter. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 190 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt comes wrapped in a Smokywood Pastures Special Gift, a festival present."
