L[18264]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Elemental Sharpening Stone. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[18265]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Flarecore Wraps. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 300 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[18266]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other. {C|35}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the ruins of Dire Maul. {Z|Dire Maul} It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the ruins of Dire Maul: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
