L[18348]="Quel'Serrar, the High Blade, is a sword of the night elves' ancient wars, its unfinished blade found in the Shen'dralar libraries of Dire Maul in the pages of a foreign tome. It can only be finished in dragonfire.\nThe warrior who finds the tome must carry the unfired blade into Onyxia's Lair, lay it before the Broodmother's breath to temper it, and drive it into her corpse to quench it."
