L[18512]="{I|Larval Acid}\nHunters find it most readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} It is found as readily in the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj. Perhaps one in four of the wild beasts there has one about them."
L[18514]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Girdle of Insight. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIts source is the ruins of Dire Maul, and nowhere in the open world. {Z|Dire Maul} {P|ogres} It is the ogres of the ruins of Dire Maul who have it about them."
L[18515]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Mongoose Boots. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 300 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
L[18516]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Swift Flight Bracers. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 300 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIts source is the ruins of Dire Maul, and nowhere in the open world. {Z|Dire Maul} {P|ogres} It is the ogres of the ruins of Dire Maul who have it about them."
L[18517]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Chromatic Cloak. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the ruins of Dire Maul. {Z|Dire Maul} Chests and strongboxes in the ruins of Dire Maul hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[18518]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Hide of the Wild. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 300 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIts source is the ruins of Dire Maul, and nowhere in the open world. {Z|Dire Maul} {P|ogres} It is the ogres of the ruins of Dire Maul who have it about them."
