L[18540]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is prepared on the spot by the adventurer who needs it, from what the errand provides."
L[18541]="{A|1} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Within the fallen coast of Azshara, they keep to the south. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the fallen coast of Azshara, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[18542]="{W|8} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Within the fallen coast of Azshara, they keep to the south. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the fallen coast of Azshara, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[18543]="{J|11} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north-east of the jungles of Stranglethorn. The other place to look is the Blasted Lands. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the jungles of Stranglethorn, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[18544]="{A|2} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north-east of the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is found as readily in the Blasted Lands. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the jungles of Stranglethorn, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[18545]="{A|1} {Q|4.1} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Within the fallen coast of Azshara, they keep to the south. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the fallen coast of Azshara, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[18546]="{A|3} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the north-east of the jungles of Stranglethorn. It is found as readily in the Blasted Lands. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the jungles of Stranglethorn, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[18547]="{A|4} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Look to the south of the fallen coast of Azshara. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the fallen coast of Azshara, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[18562]="{I|Elementium Ore}\nIts source is Blackwing Lair, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackwing Lair} The rank and file of Blackwing Lair have it about them."
L[18563]="When Ragnaros devoured Prince Thunderaan, the Windseeker, he could not consume the prince entire. He bound what was left into two talismans and gave one each to his lieutenants to keep apart, so that the prince could never be whole again.\nGarr, the lord of the lava elementals, holds this binding in the Molten Core. Only those who recover both and carry them to Silithus, where the prince's last servant waits, can begin the reforging of Thunderfury."
L[18564]="When Ragnaros devoured Prince Thunderaan, the Windseeker, he could not consume the prince entire. He bound what was left into two talismans and gave one each to his lieutenants to keep apart, so that the prince could never be whole again.\nBaron Geddon, the Firelord's lieutenant, holds this binding in the Molten Core. Only those who recover both and carry them to Silithus, where the prince's last servant waits, can begin the reforging of Thunderfury."
L[18567]={A="{I|Elemental Flux}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|blacksmithing suppliers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{I|Elemental Flux}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|blacksmithing suppliers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[18585]="{J|11} {Q|3.0} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} The folk of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[18586]="{J|11} {Q|3.1} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} The folk of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[18587]="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} This one is worked from Thorium Widget, Truesilver Transformer and Fused Wiring. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 265) can attempt it."
L[18588]="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} This one is worked from Solid Blasting Powder and Mageweave Cloth. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 200. It is also found inside Mux's Quality Goods."
L[18590]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, they keep to the north. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18592]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Sulfuron Hammer. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in Blackrock Depths. {D|Blackrock Depths} Those who have a stake in Blackrock Depths give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[18594]="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} This one is worked from Thorium Widget, Dense Blasting Powder and Rugged Leather. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 275) can attempt it."
L[18600]="A book.\nIt comes out of Naxxramas. {D|Naxxramas} {P|ghouls} It is the ghouls of Naxxramas who have it about them."
L[18602]="{J|23} {Q|3.0} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[18603]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt comes out of the ruins of Dire Maul. {Z|Dire Maul} The rank and file of the ruins of Dire Maul have it about them."
L[18604]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Look to the south of the snows of Winterspring. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18605]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt is taken from an Imprisoned Doomguard."
L[18606]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|quartermasters} A merchant in Champions' Hall stocks it."
L[18607]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|quartermasters} A merchant in Hall of Legends stocks it."
L[18610]={A="{W|7} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Look to the middle of the boughs of Teldrassil. It is found on almost all of the demons.",H="{W|7} {L|0}\nIt is carried by the demons, but only in the territory of the Alliance, and a traveller of the Horde must go armed or trade for it."}
L[18611]={A="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nThe place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} Look to the east of the boughs of Teldrassil. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there.",H="{A|2} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[18612]={A="{A|3} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is the north-west of the boughs of Teldrassil that rewards the search. Nearly every one of the raiders and tribesmen there carries one.",H="{A|3} {Q|1.1} {L|0}\nOur correspondents report it among the humanoid foes in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
L[18622]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|19}\nThe place to look is the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} Look to the west of the poisoned forest of Felwood. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18623]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|19}\nThe place to look is the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Within the Blasted Lands, they keep to the heart of the land. {P|greater demons} The greater demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18624]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|19}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Look to the north of the fallen coast of Azshara. {P|satyrs} The satyrs there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18625]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the poisoned forest of Felwood. {Z|Felwood} Within the poisoned forest of Felwood, they keep to the north. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18629]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {Z|Burning Steppes} A merchant in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes stocks it. The shop is in the north-west of the land."
L[18631]="{I|Truesilver Transformer}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} This one is worked from Truesilver Bar, Elemental Earth and Elemental Air. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 260."
L[18632]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Stormwind City} Merchants in the city of Stormwind and the dwarven city of Ironforge stock it. The shop is in the south of the land.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Orgrimmar} A merchant in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar stocks it. The shop is in the south of the land."}
