L[18670]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|merchants} {Z|Burning Steppes} A merchant in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes stocks it. The shop is in the north-west of the land."
L[18671]="{W|4} {Q|3.0} {L|5}\nThe place to look is the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} Within the jungle crater of Un'Goro, they keep to the heart of the land. Perhaps one in four of the elementals has one about them."
L[18672]="{J|23} {Q|2.1} {L|5}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} Look to the middle of the jungle crater of Un'Goro. It is found on almost all of the elementals."
L[18673]="{A|6} {Q|3.0} {L|5}\nHunters find it most readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} It is the north-east of the fallen coast of Azshara that rewards the search. Perhaps one in four of the elementals has one about them."
