L[18703]="A leaf fallen from one of the ancients, the tree-spirits of the night elves, turned to stone with age, and carried into the Molten Core by someone who never left. The ancients of Felwood will know it for their own.\nMajordomo Executus holds it in his cache in the Firelord's court, and a hunter who carries it to the Irontree Woods of Felwood begins the trials that end with Rhok'delar."
L[18704]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Look to the south of the fallen coast of Azshara. It is found as readily in the snows of Winterspring. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the fallen coast of Azshara, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[18705]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|22}\nIts source is Onyxia's Lair, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Onyxia's Lair} The great prizes of Onyxia's Lair are kept by Onyxia, Broodmother of the black dragonflight, and this is one of them."
L[18706]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the west of the jungles of Stranglethorn. Chests and strongboxes in the jungles of Stranglethorn hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[18707]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[18709]="{A|1} {Q|3.1} {L|4}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Look to the west of the jungles of Stranglethorn. It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the jungles of Stranglethorn: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
L[18710]="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|4}\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the west of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. Chests and strongboxes in the jungles of Stranglethorn hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
