L[18714]="A quiver or ammunition pouch, the leatherworkers' product for the hunters.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[18716]="{A|2} {Q|3.1} {L|5} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Stratholme, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Stratholme} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
