L[18766]={A="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the night elf city of Darnassus stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. It is also awarded by quests in Darnassus.",H="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
