L[18880]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt comes out of Scholomance. {D|Scholomance} {P|the Scourge} It is the Scourge of Scholomance who have it about them."
L[18902]={A="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nThis is a thing one buys. {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the night elf city of Darnassus stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. It is also awarded by quests in Darnassus.",H="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
L[18922]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found in the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} It is the north of the smoking Searing Gorge that rewards the search. It is taken from a Secret Plans: Fiery Flux in the smoking Searing Gorge."
L[18943]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|5}\nIt is found in the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} It is the north of the smoking Searing Gorge that rewards the search. It is taken from a Dark Iron Pillow in the smoking Searing Gorge."
L[18944]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} Within the smoking Searing Gorge, they keep to the north. {B|primordial beasts} Nearly every one of the primordial beasts carries one."
L[18945]="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|5}\nIts source is Blackrock Depths, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Depths} {P|Dark Iron dwarves} Within, it is the Dark Iron dwarves who carry it."
L[18946]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} Within the smoking Searing Gorge, they keep to the north. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18947]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nSkinners know it from the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Within the rainforest of Feralas, they keep to the north. It is cut from the humanoid foes there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience."
L[18948]="{A|2} {Q|3.1} {L|2}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} Its making calls for Heavy Leather, Cured Heavy Hide and Small Lustrous Pearl. A leatherworker of middling skill (around 155) can attempt it."
L[18949]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Barbaric Bracers. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 155) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the night elf city of Darnassus stock it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Barbaric Bracers. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 155) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|leatherworking suppliers} {Z|Undercity} A merchant in the Undercity stocks it. The shop is in the east of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."}
L[18950]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is taken from a Pillaclencher's Ornate Pillow."
L[18951]="{J|12} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} The folk of the smoking Searing Gorge have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
L[18952]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the jungle crater of Un'Goro. {Z|Un'Goro Crater} It is the west of the jungle crater of Un'Goro that rewards the search. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18953]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Within the ash plains of the Burning Steppes, they keep to the south-west. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18954]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Look to the south-west of the sands of Silithus. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18955]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} It is the north of the snows of Winterspring that rewards the search. The demons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18956]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nNearly every one of the giants carries one."
L[18957]={A="{W|7} {Q|2.0}\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the boughs of Teldrassil. {Z|Teldrassil} It is given in thanks by those in the boughs of Teldrassil whose troubles an adventurer takes on.",H="{W|7} {Q|2.0}\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."}
L[18958]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Look to the middle of the rainforest of Feralas. {P|water elementals} The water elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18959]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} Look to the middle of the smoking Searing Gorge. {P|Dark Iron dwarves} The Dark Iron dwarves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18960]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} Look to the middle of the smoking Searing Gorge. {P|Dark Iron dwarves} The Dark Iron dwarves there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18961]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is the south-east of the rainforest of Feralas that rewards the search. {P|insects} The insects there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18962]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is the east of the rainforest of Feralas that rewards the search. {P|carnivorous plants} The carnivorous plants there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[18969]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Within the rainforest of Feralas, they keep to the north. It turns up on the raiders and tribesmen there now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[18972]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Look to the north of the rainforest of Feralas. One of the raiders and tribesmen there in a score or so carries it."
L[18984]="{J|12} {Q|2.0}\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} Its making calls for Mithril Bar, Truesilver Transformer and Heart of Fire. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 260."
L[18986]="{J|12} {Q|2.0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} Its making calls for Mithril Bar, Truesilver Transformer and Core of Earth. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 260."
L[18987]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} Within the smoking Searing Gorge, they keep to the south. The other place to look is the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."
L[19002]="The head of Nefarian, Lord of Blackwing Lair, son of Deathwing and master of the Blackrock orcs, who bred the chromatic dragonflight from the stolen eggs of the other flights.\nIt is carried from the peak of Blackrock Spire to Stormwind, where it is raised over the city and the Light's blessing falls on all who see it."
L[19003]="The head of Nefarian, Lord of Blackwing Lair, son of Deathwing and master of the Blackrock orcs, whose warchief Rend Blackhand claimed the Horde's name for a generation.\nIt is carried from the peak of Blackrock Spire to Orgrimmar, where Thrall raises it over the Valley of Strength and the spirits bless all who gather."
L[19004]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is created by warlocks from the stuff of the Nether, and lasts only so long as its maker does."
L[19005]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is created by warlocks from the stuff of the Nether, and lasts only so long as its maker does."
