L[19033]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} It is the east of the Hinterlands that rewards the search. It is taken from Slagtree's Lost Tools in the Hinterlands."
L[19034]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\n{P|trolls} Nearly every one of the trolls carries one."
L[19035]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} It is given in thanks by those in the Hinterlands whose troubles an adventurer takes on."
L[19037]="{A|4} {Q|2.1}\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} The folk of the rainforest of Feralas have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
