L[19130]="{W|19} {Q|4.1} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nThe place to look is the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Within the fallen coast of Azshara, they keep to the south. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the fallen coast of Azshara, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[19131]="{A|1} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nHunters find it most readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Look to the south of the fallen coast of Azshara. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the fallen coast of Azshara, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[19132]="{A|1} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nHunters find it most readily in the fallen coast of Azshara. {Z|Azshara} Within the fallen coast of Azshara, they keep to the south. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the fallen coast of Azshara, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[19133]="{A|1} {C|19} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nThe place to look is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the north-east of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. The other place to look is the Blasted Lands. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the jungles of Stranglethorn, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[19134]="{A|2} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nHunters find it most readily in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, they keep to the north-east. It is found as readily in the Blasted Lands. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the jungles of Stranglethorn, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[19135]="{A|1} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} Within the jungles of Stranglethorn, they keep to the north-east. It is found as readily in the Blasted Lands. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the jungles of Stranglethorn, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[19136]="{A|1} {Q|4.1} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is the Molten Core, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[19137]="{A|4} {Q|4.1} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[19138]="{J|11} {Q|4.1} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIts source is the Molten Core, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[19139]="{A|2} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} Chests and strongboxes in the Molten Core hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
L[19140]="{J|11} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} It turns up in the chests and caches that adventurers find in the Molten Core: the lost baggage of the dead, the stashes of bandits and the strongboxes of camps long abandoned."
