L[19183]="Hourglass sand is the sand of the Caverns of Time, carried by the brood of Nozdormu's children; a pinch of it breaks the brood affliction that Nefarian's chromatic dragons lay on their foes.\nIt is gathered from the brood of the Caverns of Time in Tanaris, in whose hourglass the sands of all time run."
L[19202]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Heavy Timbermaw Belt. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 290 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[19203]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Girdle of the Dawn. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 290) can follow it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
