L[19206]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Dark Iron Helm. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
