L[19271]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nThe place to look is the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} The other place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. One of the restless dead in many hundreds carries it."
L[19272]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} {P|trolls} Within, it is the trolls who carry it."
L[19273]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} {P|trolls} It is the trolls of Blackrock Spire who have it about them."
L[19274]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is what the trade calls a world drop: no tribe, beast or master carries it in particular, and it surfaces wherever adventurers of levels 52-61 fight, from one end of the continents to the other."
L[19275]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 52-61, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[19276]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt comes out of Scholomance. {D|Scholomance} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[19278]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. One of the restless dead in many hundreds carries it."
L[19279]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} The other place to look is the Western Plaguelands. It is a rare find among the restless dead; a patient hunter may see one in a long day's culling."
L[19280]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nHunters find it most readily in the Western Plaguelands. {Z|Western Plaguelands} It is found as readily in the Eastern Plaguelands. It is a very rare find among the restless dead, the kind of thing found once in a lifetime of hunting them."
L[19281]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt comes out of Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} {P|trolls} Within, it is the trolls who carry it."
L[19282]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[19283]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nNo one owner can be named for it. It turns up in the hoards and pockets of foes across Azeroth, most often among creatures of levels 52-61, and no two finders agree where to look."
L[19284]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts source is Zul'Gurub, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Zul'Gurub} {P|trolls} Within, it is the trolls who carry it."
