L[19326]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Might of the Timbermaw. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 290) can follow it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[19327]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Timbermaw Brawlers. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 300 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[19328]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Dawn Treaders. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 290) can follow it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[19329]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Golden Mantle of the Dawn. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 300 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[19330]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Lava Belt. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 300 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[19331]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Chromatic Gauntlets. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it."
L[19332]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Corehound Belt. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it."
L[19333]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Molten Belt. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 300 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it."
L[19334]="{W|8} {Q|4.1} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Blackwing Lair. {D|Blackwing Lair} The great prizes of Blackwing Lair are kept by Nefarian and the lords of the black dragonflight, and this is one of them."
L[19335]="Spineshatter is a mace of the black dragonflight's dragonspawn champions, heavy enough to break a knight's back through his plate.\nBroodlord Lashlayer, the dragonspawn who commands Blackwing Lair's lower halls, carries it."
L[19336]="{J|12} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Blackwing Lair. {D|Blackwing Lair} It is among the treasures that Nefarian and the lords of the black dragonflight hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[19337]="{J|12} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Blackwing Lair, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackwing Lair} The great prizes of Blackwing Lair are kept by Nefarian and the lords of the black dragonflight, and this is one of them."
