L[19346]="A dagger ground from the fang of a black dragon, the Dragonfang Blade is one of the prizes of Blackwing Lair.\nIt is held by Vaelastrasz the Corrupt, the red dragon whom Nefarian broke and turned, who begs his slayers to free him from his torment."
