L[19352]="A sword tempered in the breath of Chromaggus, Nefarian's two-headed chromatic hound, which breathes the fire, frost, lightning, poison and shadow of every dragonflight. The tempering left it iridescent and nearly unbreakable.\nChromaggus guards it in the laboratories of Blackwing Lair."
