L[19364]="Ashkandi is a greatsword of the Brotherhood of the Horse, the knightly order of old Stormwind, its blade worked with the Brotherhood's device. How it came into the hoard of Nefarian at the top of Blackrock Spire no bard has agreed on.\nThe son of Deathwing keeps it in Blackwing Lair, and only those who break the chromatic flight and the black dragon himself have carried it out."
L[19365]="{W|13} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Blackwing Lair, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackwing Lair} It is among the treasures that Nefarian and the lords of the black dragonflight hold there, and only their fall releases it."
