L[19440]="{R|10}\nIt is made, not found. {T|129} This one is worked from Huge Venom Sac. It is first attempted at a First Aid skill of about 300."
L[19441]="{I|Huge Venom Sac}\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is found as readily in the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj. {P|insects} Perhaps one in four of the insects and scorpids has one about them."
L[19442]="A manual of the first aid trade, which teaches the making of Powerful Anti-Venom. {T|129} Only a field medic of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[19443]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is among the prizes of the Darkmoon Faire, won with tickets at Silas Darkmoon's carnival."
L[19444]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Weapon - Strength. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 290) can follow it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[19445]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Weapon - Agility. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 290) can follow it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[19446]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Bracer - Mana Regeneration. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 290) can follow it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[19447]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Bracer - Healing. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[19448]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Weapon - Mighty Spirit. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
L[19449]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant Weapon - Mighty Intellect. {T|333} It asks a skill of about 300 of an enchanter who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|the thorium brotherhoods} {D|Blackrock Depths} A merchant in Blackrock Depths stocks it. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it."
