L[19683]="{A|1} {Q|3.0} {L|6}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} This one is worked from Mooncloth, Bloodvine and Powerful Mojo. Only a tailor of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[19684]="{A|1} {Q|3.1} {L|6}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Mooncloth, Bloodvine and Enchanted Leather. Only a tailor of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
