L[19726]="{I|Bloodvine}\nHerbalists know it from Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} Herbalists gather it in Zul'Gurub, where it grows thickest."
L[19727]="A material of the crafting trades.\nIt is found in Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} It is taken from a Jinxed Hoodoo Pile in Zul'Gurub."
L[19764]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Bloodvine Vest. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 300 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[19765]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Bloodvine Leggings. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[19766]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Bloodvine Boots. {T|197} It asks a skill of about 300 of a tailor who attempts it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[19767]="{I|Primal Bat Leather}\nIt comes out of Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} The great prizes of Zul'Gurub are kept by Hakkar the Soulflayer and his high priests, and this is one of them. It is also skinned from bats within Zul'Gurub."
L[19768]="{I|Primal Tiger Leather}\nIts source is Zul'Gurub, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Zul'Gurub} It is among the treasures that Hakkar the Soulflayer and his high priests hold there, and only their fall releases it. It is also skinned from great cats within Zul'Gurub."
