L[19773]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Blood Tiger Shoulders. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
