L[19902]="The Swift Zulian Tiger is one of the great tigers of Zul'Gurub, bred by the Gurubashi as the mounts of their high priests and ridden out by the rare hero who can master one.\nHigh Priest Thekal, whose aspect is the tiger god Shirvallah, keeps the tigers in Zul'Gurub, and seldom gives one up."
