L[19933]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} {B|scorpids} A good share of the scorpids carry it."
L[19934]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} {B|scorpids} It is found on almost all of the scorpids."
L[19935]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nHunters find it most readily in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} {B|scorpids} Nearly every one of the scorpids carries one."
L[19936]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nHunters find it most readily in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} {B|scorpids} A good share of the scorpids carry it."
L[19937]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} Within the desert of Tanaris, they keep to the north. The other place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {B|scorpids} A good share of the scorpids carry it."
L[19938]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nThe place to look is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} {B|scorpids} A good share of the scorpids carry it."
