L[19998]="{A|2} {Q|3.1} {L|6}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} Its making calls for Bloodvine, Souldarite and Delicate Arcanite Converter. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[19999]="{A|1} {Q|3.1} {L|6}\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} This one is worked from Bloodvine, Souldarite and Delicate Arcanite Converter. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 300."
L[20000]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Bloodvine Goggles. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 300 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[20001]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Bloodvine Lens. {T|202} It asks a skill of about 300 of an engineer who attempts it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[20002]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Dreamfoil, Golden Sansam and Crystal Vial. Only an alchemist of real accomplishment (skill around 275) can attempt it."
L[20004]="{K|0}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|171} Its making calls for Gromsblood, Plaguebloom and Crystal Vial. It is first attempted at a Alchemy skill of about 290."
L[20006]="{J|11} {Q|3.0} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
