L[20253]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Warbear Harness. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 275) can follow it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[20254]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Warbear Woolies. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 285 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[20255]="{A|2} {Q|3.0} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[20257]="{A|3} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} The great prizes of Zul'Gurub are kept by Hakkar the Soulflayer and his high priests, and this is one of them."
L[20258]="{W|10} {Q|3.1} {L|6}\nIt comes out of Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} {P|trolls} It is the trolls of Zul'Gurub who have it about them."
L[20259]="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|6}\nIts source is Zul'Gurub, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Zul'Gurub} {P|trolls} It is the trolls of Zul'Gurub who have it about them."
L[20260]="{A|3} {Q|3.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Zul'Gurub, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Zul'Gurub} The great prizes of Zul'Gurub are kept by Hakkar the Soulflayer and his high priests, and this is one of them."
L[20261]="{A|2} {Q|3.0} {L|6}\nIts source is Zul'Gurub, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Zul'Gurub} {P|trolls} It is the trolls of Zul'Gurub who have it about them."
L[20262]="{A|3} {Q|3.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Zul'Gurub, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Zul'Gurub} The great prizes of Zul'Gurub are kept by Hakkar the Soulflayer and his high priests, and this is one of them."
L[20263]="{A|4} {C|8} {Q|3.1} {L|6}\nIts source is Zul'Gurub, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Zul'Gurub} {P|trolls} It is the trolls of Zul'Gurub who have it about them."
L[20264]="{A|4} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} The great prizes of Zul'Gurub are kept by Hakkar the Soulflayer and his high priests, and this is one of them."
L[20265]="{A|4} {Q|3.1} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} The great prizes of Zul'Gurub are kept by Hakkar the Soulflayer and his high priests, and this is one of them."
L[20266]="{A|4} {Q|3.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of Zul'Gurub. {D|Zul'Gurub} It is among the treasures that Hakkar the Soulflayer and his high priests hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[20295]="{A|3} {C|22} {Q|3.1} {L|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|165} This one is worked from Rugged Leather, Blue Dragonscale and Cured Rugged Hide. Only a leatherworker of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[20296]="{A|3} {C|22} {Q|3.0} {L|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} This one is worked from Rugged Leather, Green Dragonscale and Cured Rugged Hide. It is first attempted at a Leatherworking skill of about 280."
L[20310]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the grey wastes of Desolace. {Z|Desolace} Look to the north of the grey wastes of Desolace. {P|cultists} One of the cultists in a score or so carries it."
L[20369]="{A|3} {Q|3.1} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[20373]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is the north of the sands of Silithus that rewards the search. {B|scorpids} The scorpids there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[20374]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} {B|scorpids} The scorpids there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[20375]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is the south of the sands of Silithus that rewards the search. {B|scorpids} The scorpids there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[20376]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is the north of the sands of Silithus that rewards the search. {B|spiders} The spiders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[20377]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is the south of the sands of Silithus that rewards the search. {B|spiders} The spiders there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[20378]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|42}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is the north-west of the sands of Silithus that rewards the search. {P|earth elementals} The earth elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest. It is also taken from Twilight Tablet Fragment in north-western Silithus and southern Feralas."
L[20379]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is found in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Look to the south of the sands of Silithus. It is taken from a Noggle's Satchel in the sands of Silithus."
L[20380]="{A|3} {Q|4.1} {L|6}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|165} Its making calls for Enchanted Leather, Dreamscale and Living Essence. Only a leatherworker of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[20381]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a skinner's find, chiefly in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Within the rainforest of Feralas, they keep to the north. The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is cut from the dragonkin there by anyone with a skinning knife and the patience."
L[20382]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Dreamscale Breastplate. {T|165} Only a leatherworker of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[20383]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt comes out of Blackwing Lair. {D|Blackwing Lair} The great prizes of Blackwing Lair are kept by Nefarian and the lords of the black dragonflight, and this is one of them."
L[20384]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|21}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} {P|insects} Nearly every one of the insects carries one."
L[20385]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is the south of the sands of Silithus that rewards the search. The beasts there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[20387]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|10}\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|10}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|merchants} {Z|Tirisfal Glades} Merchants in the blighted glades of Tirisfal and the Undercity stock it. The shop is in the south of the land."}
