L[20457]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|21}\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} It is the north of the sands of Silithus that rewards the search. {P|insects} The insects there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
