L[20576]={A="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Black Whelp Tunic. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 100 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {Z|Redridge Mountains} A merchant in the red hills around Lake Everstill stocks it. The shop is in the west of the land. Stock is limited, and whoever gets there first takes it.",H="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Black Whelp Tunic. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 100 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Alliance; a traveller of the Horde must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without."}
L[20577]="{W|7} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nThe place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. {Z|Ashenvale} Look to the north-east of the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the ancient forest of Ashenvale, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[20578]="{W|15} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nHunters find it most readily in the Hinterlands. {Z|The Hinterlands} Look to the north-east of the Hinterlands. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the Hinterlands, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[20579]="{A|1} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nThe place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Within the rainforest of Feralas, they keep to the north. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the rainforest of Feralas, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[20580]="{W|4} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nThe place to look is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Look to the north of the rainforest of Feralas. It is found as readily in the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the rainforest of Feralas, not by the common run of its creatures."
