L[20582]="{J|23} {Q|4.1} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is the north of the rainforest of Feralas that rewards the search. The other place to look is the ancient forest of Ashenvale. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the rainforest of Feralas, not by the common run of its creatures."
L[20599]={A="{W|18} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the dark woods of Duskwood. {Z|Duskwood} Within the dark woods of Duskwood, they keep to the heart of the land. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the dark woods of Duskwood, not by the common run of its creatures.",H="{W|18} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nOur correspondents report it among the dragonkin in Alliance lands, where travellers of the Horde are not welcome; it will be hard to come by."}
