L[21023]="{K|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for Hot Spices, Goblin Rocket Fuel and Deeprock Salt. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 300. It is also awarded for a quest in Tanaris."
L[21024]="{I|Chimaerok Tenderloin}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is the south-west of the rainforest of Feralas that rewards the search. It is found on almost all of the wild beasts there."
L[21025]="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Dirge's Kickin' Chimaerok Chops. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 300 of a cook who attempts it.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the desert of Tanaris. {Z|Tanaris} The folk of the desert of Tanaris have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."
