L[21030]={A="{K|5}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="{K|5}\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|food and drink vendors} {Z|Moonglade} A merchant in the sanctuary of Moonglade stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land."}
