L[21044]="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|mount vendors}"
L[21071]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is a catch of the waters of the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} The other place to look is the loch country of Loch Modan. It is fished from the waters of the Stonetalon Mountains by anyone with a pole and the patience. It is also taken from Sagefish School in Loch Modan and Ashenvale.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is a catch of Lordamere Lake and the Silverpine coast. {Z|Silverpine Forest} The other place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. It is fished from Lordamere Lake and the Silverpine coast by anyone with a pole and the patience. It is also taken from Sagefish School in Ashenvale and northern Silverpine Forest."}
L[21072]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is made, not found. {T|185} This one is worked from Raw Sagefish and Mild Spices. It is first attempted at a Cooking skill of about 80."
L[21099]={A="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Smoked Sagefish. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 80 of a cook who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|cooking suppliers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Smoked Sagefish. {T|185} It asks a skill of about 80 of a cook who attempts it.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|cooking suppliers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[21100]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[21103]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nThe place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} It is the south-east of the snows of Winterspring that rewards the search. The other place to look is the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. It is found on almost all of the raiders and tribesmen there."
L[21104]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the Blasted Lands. {Z|Blasted Lands} Look to the south of the Blasted Lands. {P|greater demons} It turns up on the greater demons now and then, perhaps once in twenty."
L[21105]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, they keep to the south. One of the demons in a score or so carries it."
L[21108]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt comes out of Onyxia's Lair. {D|Onyxia's Lair} It is among the treasures that Onyxia, Broodmother of the black dragonflight hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[21110]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIts source is the Molten Core, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[21113]={A="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of the waters of the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Anglers pull it from the waters of the Stonetalon Mountains. It is also taken from Floating Wreckage and Sagefish School in north-western Wetlands and southern Hillsbrad Foothills.",H="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is a catch of the waters of the Stonetalon Mountains. {Z|Stonetalon Mountains} Anglers pull it from the waters of the Stonetalon Mountains. It is also taken from Floating Wreckage and Sagefish School in southern Hillsbrad Foothills and eastern Stonetalon Mountains."}
L[21114]={A="{K|6}\nIt is found in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the south. The other place to look is the marshes of the Wetlands. It is taken from a Floating Wreckage in the farmland of Hillsbrad.",H="{K|6}\nIt is found in the farmland of Hillsbrad. {Z|Hillsbrad Foothills} Within the farmland of Hillsbrad, they keep to the south. The other place to look is the Stonetalon Mountains. It is taken from a Floating Wreckage in the farmland of Hillsbrad."}
L[21115]={A="{J|12} {Q|3.0} {L|4} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="{J|12} {Q|3.0} {L|4} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."}
