L[21228]="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|14}\nIt is found in the jungles of Stranglethorn. {Z|Stranglethorn Vale} It is the west of the jungles of Stranglethorn that rewards the search. The other place to look is the desert of Tanaris. It is taken from a Floating Wreckage in the jungles of Stranglethorn."
