L[21436]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[21438]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[21452]="{W|10} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj} The great prizes of the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj are kept by Ossirian the Unscarred and the qiraji generals, and this is one of them."
