L[21492]="{W|8} {C|21} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nThe place to look is the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj. {D|Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj} It is found as readily in the sands of Silithus. It is held by one of the mighty foes of the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj, not by the common run of its creatures."
