L[21547]="A recipe of the alchemy trade, which teaches the making of Elixir of Greater Firepower. {T|171} It asks a skill of about 250 of an alchemist who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the smoking Searing Gorge. {Z|Searing Gorge} {P|Dark Iron dwarves} Only occasionally does one of the Dark Iron dwarves carry it."
L[21548]="A pattern of the leatherworking trade, which teaches the making of Stormshroud Gloves. {T|165} It asks a skill of about 300 of a leatherworker who attempts it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Look to the north-west of the sands of Silithus. The other place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {P|air elementals} A good share of the air elementals carry it."
