L[21709]="{J|11} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj. {D|Ahn'Qiraj} Those who have a stake in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[21710]="{A|1} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is a reward for service rendered in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj. {D|Ahn'Qiraj} Those who have a stake in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj give it to the adventurers who serve their cause there."
L[21711]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
