L[21714]="{K|10}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} This one is worked from Dense Blasting Powder and Rugged Leather. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 275."
L[21715]="{W|4} {Q|4.0} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj. {D|Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj} It is among the treasures that Ossirian the Unscarred and the qiraji generals hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[21716]="{K|10}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} Its making calls for Dense Blasting Powder and Rugged Leather. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 275) can attempt it."
L[21718]="{K|10}\nIt is made, not found. {T|202} Its making calls for Dense Blasting Powder and Rugged Leather. Only an engineer of real accomplishment (skill around 275) can attempt it."
L[21721]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|merchants} {Z|Teldrassil} Merchants in the boughs of Teldrassil and the plains of Mulgore stock it. The shop is in the west of the land."
L[21722]="A pattern of the tailoring trade, which teaches the making of Festival Dress. {T|197} Only a tailor of some skill (around 250) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
