L[21751]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIt is found inside a Tactical Assignment, and nowhere else in particular."
L[21761]="A key, which opens one door in Azeroth and no other. {C|21}\nIt comes out of the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj. {D|Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
