L[21812]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run. It is also found inside containers such as Pledge of Adoration: Stormwind and Gift of Adoration: Darnassus."
L[21813]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is found inside a Pledge of Adoration: Stormwind, and nowhere else in particular."
L[21814]="{A|4} {Q|4.1} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj. {D|Ahn'Qiraj} It is among the treasures that the Twin Emperors and C'Thun itself hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[21815]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|innkeepers} Travellers of the Alliance will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|innkeepers} Travellers of the Horde will find it on the shelves of most towns and outposts, and in the neutral markets of the goblins."}
L[21829]={A="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|innkeepers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Alliance lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides.",H="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|innkeepers} It is as common as bread: nearly every settlement in Horde lands stocks it, and the goblin ports besides."}
L[21830]="A curio of the adventuring trade.\nIt is found inside Box of Chocolates, and nowhere else in particular."
