L[21928]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nThe place to look is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Within the snows of Winterspring, they keep to the north. {B|bears} The bears there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[21935]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nThe place to look is the Eastern Plaguelands. {Z|Eastern Plaguelands} Nearly every one of the restless dead carries one."
L[21936]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the snows of Winterspring. {Z|Winterspring} Look to the middle of the snows of Winterspring. It is found on almost all of the restless dead."
L[21937]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Within the sands of Silithus, they keep to the east. Nearly every one of the restless dead carries one."
L[21938]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nHunters find it most readily in the ash plains of the Burning Steppes. {Z|Burning Steppes} Within the ash plains of the Burning Steppes, they keep to the west. {P|fire elementals} The fire elementals there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[21939]="A curio of the adventuring trade. {C|19}\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|reagent vendors} {Z|Winterspring} A merchant in the snows of Winterspring stocks it. The shop is in the south of the land."
L[21960]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt comes wrapped in Gift of Friendship: Darnassus, a festival present."
L[21982]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|35}\nHunters find it most readily in the ruins of Dire Maul. {Z|Dire Maul} It is found as readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {P|ogres} The ogres there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[21984]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt comes out of Stratholme. {D|Stratholme} The rank and file of Stratholme have it about them."
L[21987]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIts source is Blackrock Depths, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Depths} The rank and file of Blackrock Depths have it about them."
L[21988]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} The great prizes of Blackrock Spire are kept by Rend Blackhand, General Drakkisath and the Spire's warlords, and this is one of them."
L[21989]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nThe place to look is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[21994]={A="{A|4} {Q|3.0} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the dwarven city of Ironforge. {Z|Ironforge} The folk of the dwarven city of Ironforge have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks.",H="{A|4} {Q|3.0} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is earned, not found: a reward for service in the Horde capital of Orgrimmar. {Z|Orgrimmar} The folk of the Horde capital of Orgrimmar have reason to be grateful to adventurers, and this is among what they give in thanks."}
