L[22094]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else.\nHunters find it most readily in the mists of Dustwallow Marsh. {Z|Dustwallow Marsh} It is the north-east of the mists of Dustwallow Marsh that rewards the search. The humanoid foes there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest. It is also taken from Basket of Bloodkelp in north-eastern Dustwallow Marsh."
