L[22381]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} {B|scorpids} The scorpids there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."
L[22383]="{W|7} {Q|4.1} {L|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} Its making calls for Arcanite Bar, Nexus Crystal and Flask of Supreme Power. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[22384]="{W|4} {Q|4.1} {L|5}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|164} Its making calls for Arcanite Bar, Dark Iron Bar and Essence of Undeath. Only a blacksmith of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[22385]="{A|4} {C|33} {Q|4.0} {L|5}\nIt is made, not found. {T|164} This one is worked from Arcanite Bar, Enchanted Thorium Bar and Essence of Earth. It is first attempted at a Blacksmithing skill of about 300."
L[22388]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Titanic Leggings. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 300 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIts source is the Molten Core, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[22389]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Sageblade. {T|164} Only a blacksmith of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} The great prizes of the Molten Core are kept by Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants, and this is one of them."
L[22390]="A plans of the blacksmithing trade, which teaches the making of Persuader. {T|164} It asks a skill of about 300 of a blacksmith who attempts it.\nIt comes out of the Molten Core. {D|Molten Core} It is among the treasures that Ragnaros and his flamewaker lieutenants hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[22392]="A formula of the enchanting trade, which teaches Enchant 2H Weapon - Agility. {T|333} Only an enchanter of some skill (around 290) can follow it.\nIt is issued by a quartermaster, and only to those who have earned their faction's trust through long service."
L[22393]="A book, which teaches Prayer of Shadow Protection.\nIts source is Blackrock Spire, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Blackrock Spire} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
