L[22651]={A="{A|4} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt is stocked only by merchants of the Horde; a traveller of the Alliance must trade for it at the neutral ports or do without.",H="{A|4} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nThis is a thing one buys. {V|warsong supply officers} {Z|The Barrens} A merchant in the savannah of the Barrens stocks it. The shop is in the north of the land."}
L[22652]="{A|1} {Q|4.0} {L|6}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Frozen Rune, Bolt of Runecloth and Essence of Water. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 300. It is also awarded for a quest within Naxxramas."
L[22654]="{A|1} {Q|4.1} {L|6}\nIt is made, not found. {T|197} Its making calls for Frozen Rune, Bolt of Runecloth and Essence of Water. Only a tailor of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it. It is also awarded for a quest within Naxxramas."
L[22655]="{A|1} {Q|4.0} {L|6}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|197} Its making calls for Frozen Rune, Bolt of Runecloth and Essence of Water. It is first attempted at a Tailoring skill of about 300. It is also awarded for a quest within Naxxramas."
