L[22691]="{W|8} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt is a finder's prize, chiefly in Naxxramas. {D|Naxxramas} Chests and strongboxes in Naxxramas hold it now and then, left by whoever did not live to open them."
