L[22708]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it.\nIts source is Naxxramas, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Naxxramas} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
L[22711]="{A|1} {C|8} {Q|3.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is Zul'Gurub, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Zul'Gurub} The great prizes of Zul'Gurub are kept by Hakkar the Soulflayer and his high priests, and this is one of them."
