L[22728]="A material of the crafting trades.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|202} Its making calls for Thorium Widget, Mithril Casing and Gold Power Core. It is first attempted at a Engineering skill of about 275."
L[22729]="A schematic of the engineering trade, which teaches the making of Steam Tonk Controller. {T|202} Only an engineer of some skill (around 275) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
