L[22731]="{A|1} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIt comes out of the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj. {D|Ahn'Qiraj} The great prizes of the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj are kept by the Twin Emperors and C'Thun itself, and this is one of them."
