L[22734]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself.\nIt comes out of the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj. {D|Ahn'Qiraj} It is among the treasures that the Twin Emperors and C'Thun itself hold there, and only their fall releases it."
