L[22890]="A book.\nIts source is Naxxramas, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Naxxramas} The rank and file of Naxxramas have it about them."
L[22891]="A book.\nIt comes out of Blackrock Spire. {D|Blackrock Spire} The rank and file of Blackrock Spire have it about them."
L[22892]={A="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|24}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the woods of Elwynn. {Z|Elwynn Forest} It is the west of the woods of Elwynn that rewards the search. The other place to look is the boughs of Teldrassil. {P|skeletons} The skeletons and ghosts and spirits there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest.",H="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|24}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the red desert of Durotar. {Z|Durotar} It is the north of the red desert of Durotar that rewards the search. The other place to look is the plains of Mulgore. The ghosts and spirits and skeletons there surrender it only to those on the business of a quest."}
L[22895]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|cool guys} It is also conjured by mages."
L[22897]="A book, which teaches the making of Conjured Cinnamon Roll.\nIts source is Stratholme, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Stratholme} Within, it is carried by the common run of the place's defenders."
