L[23193]="A mount, the pride of its rider, bred by the stables of its people or won from the great foes.\nIt is bought, not hunted. {V|mount vendors}"
L[23197]="{A|8} {Q|3.0} {L|6}\nIts home, so far as it has one, is the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} It is the north-east of the rainforest of Feralas that rewards the search. The other place to look is Zul'Gurub. It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."
