L[23199]="{A|9} {C|9} {Q|3.1} {L|6}\nHunters find it most readily in the rainforest of Feralas. {Z|Feralas} Look to the north-east of the rainforest of Feralas. It is found as readily in Zul'Gurub. It is carried by one of the rare, named creatures that roam there and are seen only now and then, and nowhere else."
