L[23545]="A token, proof or ingredient of somebody's errand, worth nothing to anyone else. {C|24}\nIt comes out of Naxxramas. {D|Naxxramas} It is among the treasures that Kel'Thuzad and the Four Horsemen hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[23547]="An object of significance to someone in Azeroth, wanted for a task rather than for itself. {C|24}\nIts source is Naxxramas, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Naxxramas} It is among the treasures that Kel'Thuzad and the Four Horsemen hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[23548]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|24}\nIt comes out of Naxxramas. {D|Naxxramas} The great prizes of Naxxramas are kept by Kel'Thuzad and the Four Horsemen, and this is one of them."
L[23549]="A thing wanted not for its own sake but because someone, somewhere, has asked for it. {C|24}\nIts source is Naxxramas, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Naxxramas} It is among the treasures that Kel'Thuzad and the Four Horsemen hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[23557]="{W|3} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Ahn'Qiraj} It is among the treasures that the Twin Emperors and C'Thun itself hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[23558]="{J|12} {Q|4.1} {L|6} Once taken up it will serve no other hand.\nIts source is the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj, and nowhere in the open world. {D|Ahn'Qiraj} It is among the treasures that the Twin Emperors and C'Thun itself hold there, and only their fall releases it."
L[23570]="{J|12} {Q|4.0} {L|6} It binds itself to whoever first takes it up, and cannot be sold or given away.\nIt comes out of the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj. {D|Ahn'Qiraj} It is among the treasures that the Twin Emperors and C'Thun itself hold there, and only their fall releases it."
