L[23683]="A consumable of the road, used once and gone.\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|185} Its making calls for [PH] Silithus PvP Dust [DEP] and Deeprock Salt. Only a cook of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[23684]="{K|4}\nThis is the work of a craftsman's hands. {T|129} This one is worked from [PH] Silithus PvP Dust [DEP] and Runecloth. Only a field medic of real accomplishment (skill around 300) can attempt it."
L[23689]="A manual of the first aid trade, which teaches the making of Crystal Infused Bandage. {T|129} It asks a skill of about 300 of a field medic who attempts it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
L[23690]="A recipe of the cooking trade, which teaches the making of Crystal Flake Throat Lozenge. {T|185} Only a cook of some skill (around 300) can follow it.\nIt is given in thanks by a questgiver somewhere in Azeroth, for an errand run."
