L[24222]="{W|15} {Q|3.0} {L|5}\nHunters find it most readily in the sands of Silithus. {Z|Silithus} Look to the west of the sands of Silithus. It is found as readily in the rainforest of Feralas. One of the creatures of the region in a score or so carries it."
L[24231]="A trifle carried for no good reason by whoever it was taken from, and sold at the first shop.\nJunkboxes are the pocket-hoards that rogues lift from the unwary, and this is the sort of thing they contain."
L[24232]="Junk, in a word: the sort of thing that fills the pockets of the dead and the sacks of adventurers.\nJunkboxes are the pocket-hoards that rogues lift from the unwary, and this is the sort of thing they contain."
L[24281]="A curio of no use beyond the coin a merchant will give for it.\nJunkboxes are the pocket-hoards that rogues lift from the unwary, and this is the sort of thing they contain."
